/* QCF eight-language release 2026-11-14. Additional languages are machine translations of published English content. */
const TRANSLATIONS={"de":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · Due Diligence","02 · Independent review":"02 · Unabhängige Rezension","03 · Pilot design":"03 · Pilotentwurf","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · Fortschrittsberichte","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"1530-nm-Atom-Photonen-Verschränkung und 50-km-Glasfaser-QKD für fortschrittliche Telekommunikationsband-Quantenvernetzung.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"180-Qubit-Neutralatomsimulation: Nature berichtete über Experimente zur Nichtgleichgewichtsquantendynamik.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997–1998: Wissenschaftlicher Fortschritt und Menschenwürde","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"Vorbereitungsinitiative 2026 · Informationen sind jetzt verfügbar. Diese Website sammelt keine DNA und akzeptiert keine Genomdateien.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6 % ist die Gesamtsumme der vier Dienste. Aufteilung, Sorgerecht und AML-Prozess müssen vor der Registrierung von einem Schweizer Anwalt bestätigt werden.","72,000,000+":"72.000.000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"Ein Civilization Envoy-Name","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"Eine Civilization ID ist eine Beitragsidentität innerhalb von QCF, kein Reisepass, keine Staatsbürgerschaft oder ein Dokument zur rechtlichen Identität.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"Ein wissenschaftliches Unterfangen über Grenzen hinweg","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"In einer separaten Studie wurde ein COVID-19-Peptidimpfstoff in Kombination mit einem Tetanusimpfstoff bei Pferden untersucht. Es weist weder einen Strahlenimpfstoff noch eine Wirksamkeit beim Menschen nach.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"Ein freiwilliger Plan zur Verknüpfung persönlicher Genomdaten mit einer Civilization-ID","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H1N1)-Grippepandemie · global","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H2N2)-Grippepandemie · global","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H3N2)-Grippepandemie · global","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"Abdel-Mageed et al., mit Weiwen Deng als Co-Autor. Thema: genetisch veränderte mesenchymale Stammzellen und Überleben bestrahlter Mäuse. Beweise: Tierversuche; Zeitschriftenteil: Korrespondenz.","About":"Über uns","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"Akzeptierte Beiträge können gemäß den veröffentlichten Beitragsregeln anerkannt werden. Testpunkte werden nicht automatisch zu offiziellen Belohnungen. Geben Sie ohne Zustimmung keine persönlichen Gesundheits- oder Genominformationen an.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"Annahme durch einen in der Schweiz konzessionierten Anbieter, Umrechnung in CHF zum Kurs bei Erhalt, mit Ausstellung einer Spendenquittung.","Account":"Konto","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"Gemeinnützige Forschung, kommerzielle Arzneimittelübersetzung und Infrastrukturinvestitionen werden separat ausgewiesen. Offenlegung von Transaktionen mit verbundenen Parteien, IP-Vereinbarungen und Konflikten mit Ablehnung und unabhängiger Prüfung.","Alipay":"Alipay","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"Alle verfügbaren Website-Funktionen können kostenlos getestet werden, bevor die Stiftung offiziell registriert wird. Abonnementdienste beginnen nach der Registrierung; Der aktuelle Plan beträgt 20 CHF / USD / EUR pro Monat, wobei die Leistungen und Zahlungsbedingungen vor dem Abonnement deutlich angezeigt werden.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"Alle Bezahlschaltflächen sind vorerst deaktiviert. Sie ermöglichen nach formeller Registrierung die Eröffnung eines Bankkontos und das Onboarding der Zahlungsschiene. Für Spenden sind möglicherweise entsprechende AML/KYC-Prüfungen erforderlich. Es wird keine steuerliche Behandlung oder Abzugsfähigkeit beansprucht.","All publications":"Alle Veröffentlichungen","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"Ein IonQ-Team berichtete über heterogene Verschränkung im Kilohertz-Maßstab.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"Jeder Mitentwickler mit einer Civilization-ID kann eine Initiative zu jedem Thema starten.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"Jeder kann eine Zivilisationsinitiative starten","Apple Pay":"Apple Pay","Apply to become a payment partner":"Bewerben Sie sich als Zahlungspartner","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"Zum Zeitpunkt der öffentlichen Überprüfung am 10. November 2026 wurde für diese von EC-SOD entwickelte MSC-Strahlungsindikation keine Registrierung am Menschen oder keine behördliche Genehmigung festgestellt. Es sind weiterhin überprüfbare Registerkennungen und Autorisierungsdokumente erforderlich. Versuche mit anderen SOD-Formulierungen, Mimetika oder Zellen für andere Krankheiten validieren diesen Kandidaten nicht.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"Bewerten Sie mögliche Ansätze zur Prävention oder Behandlung von Strahlenschäden zum Schutz der Zivilbevölkerung und zur Vorbereitung auf die öffentliche Gesundheit. Dokumentation und wissenschaftliche Begutachtung stehen noch aus; Sicherheit und Wirksamkeit sind nicht nachgewiesen.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"Bei dieser Überprüfung hat QCF keine Registrierungsnummer für Versuche am Menschen, keine behördliche Genehmigung oder keinen Nachweis über die Marktzulassung für diesen Kandidaten erhalten. Der aktualisierte experimentelle Fortschritt, die unabhängige Replikation, die Herstellungsqualität und der klinische Entwicklungspfad müssen noch dokumentiert werden.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"Atombombenabwurf auf Hiroshima · Japan","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"BTQ × Kaia kündigte eine quantensichere Stablecoin-Netzwerk-Zusammenarbeit an.","Back to Civilization ID":"Zurück zur Civilization-ID","Back to Life Sciences":"Zurück zu den Biowissenschaften","Back to population figures":"Zurück zu den Bevölkerungszahlen","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"Werden Sie Mitgestalter der Zivilisation","Become a co-builder":"Werden Sie Mitentwickler","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"Werden Sie der nächste Mitgestalter der Zivilisation","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"Erklären Sie vor der Einwilligung den Zweck, den Empfänger, den Forschungsumfang, die Aufbewahrungsfrist und die Risiken. Bewerten Sie neue Verwendungszwecke separat, einschließlich jeglicher Verwendung für KI-Training.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"Hinter jeder Zahl steht ein Mensch, ein Leben und eine Familie. Die Erinnerung an verlorene Leben macht Frieden, öffentliche Gesundheit und den Schutz des Lebens zu einer gemeinsamen Verantwortung.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"Hinter jeder Zahl steckte ein Name, eine Familie und ein Leben, das noch nicht abgeschlossen war. Wir erfassen Verluste, um das Leben heute zu schätzen, und unterstützen die Wissenschaft, um das Leben von morgen zu schützen.","Bilingual PDF":"Zweisprachiges PDF","Bitcoin BTC":"Bitcoin BTC","Black Death · Europe":"Schwarzer Tod · Europa","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"Begrenzt durch von Experten überprüfte und überprüfbare Beweise","Browse published briefs":"Durchsuchen Sie veröffentlichte Kurzberichte","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"Von Civilization Architect Jessica Sage<br>Veröffentlicht am 5. November 2026 · Naturnachrichtenbericht: 4. November 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"CIVILISATION CO-BUILDER · PDF-ARCHIVZUGRIFF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"ZIVILISATIONS-ID × NU-SCHLÜSSEL","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"CIVILISATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBALE FORSCHUNGSINITIATIVE","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"COVID-19-assoziierte Übersterblichkeit · global","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"Überblick über das Canadian War Museum; Nur Militär-/Dienstpersonal, nicht alle zivilen Todesfälle. Die folgenden nationalen Einträge überschneiden sich.","Cards & wallets":"Karten und Geldbörsen","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"Zellen als antioxidative Proteinfabriken: Weiwen Dengs Forschung zu Strahlenschäden","Check in":"Einchecken","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"Wählen Sie einen neuen Civilization Envoy-Namen. Ihre ursprüngliche Identität kann verborgen bleiben – zeigen Sie nur Ihre ID-Nummer oder Ihren neuen Namen.","Choose an amount":"Wählen Sie einen Betrag","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"Schätzung der Stadt bis Ende 1945; kombinierte Explosions-, Wärme- und Strahlungseffekte, nicht nur Todesfälle durch Strahlung oder die volle langfristige Zahl.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"Zivilisationsarchitektin Jessica Sage | 10. November 2026 | Forschungskommentar","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"Name des Civilization Envoy (optional)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"Civilization Envoys sind eingeladen, Originalartikel, Forschungserkenntnisse und Berichte über gemeinnützige Aktionen beizusteuern. Akzeptierte Arbeiten können als Beitrag erfasst werden, der mit einer Civilization-ID und Quantum-Q-Punkten verknüpft ist.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"Civilization Envoys sind eingeladen, einen Beitrag zu leisten. Teilen Sie Arbeit, die wahrheitsgetreu, klar und überprüfbar ist – Wissen im Dienste des Lebens und Handeln, das Menschen verbindet.","Civilization ID":"Zivilisations-ID","Civilization ID and privacy":"Zivilisations-ID und Datenschutz","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"Civilization ID bleibt derzeit ein kostenloser Testdatensatz für einen lokalen Browser, es handelt sich also eher um ein Testtor als um eine zentral verifizierte Identität. Sobald das zentrale Civilization ID-System online ist, wird der PDF-Zugriff auf eine serverseitige vertrauenswürdige Autorisierung aktualisiert.","Civilization ID goal":"Zivilisations-ID-Ziel","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Civilization ID ist derzeit eine Front-End-Demonstration. Die Speicherung klinischer Gesundheitsdaten und die hier beschriebenen vollständigen Governance-Funktionen werden nicht eingesetzt. Diese Website sammelt keine personenbezogenen Genomdaten.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"Civilization ID ist als Verbindung zwischen freiwilligen Beiträgen und expliziten Genehmigungen gedacht. Identität, Teilnahmedaten und sensible Gesundheitsdaten sollten getrennt werden; Für die Teilnahme ist keine DNA erforderlich. Die Verschlüsselung muss mit Zweckbeschränkungen, Zugriffsprüfungen, unabhängiger Governance und dem Entzug künftiger Berechtigungen einhergehen. Ein Ausweis allein kann die Privatsphäre nicht garantieren.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"Civilization ID unterstützt freiwillige Teilnahme- und Beitragsaufzeichnungen; es handelt sich nicht um eine rechtliche Identität. Für die Ausweiserteilung sind keine DNA- oder Gesundheitsdaten erforderlich. Die derzeitigen kostenlosen Tests stellen keinen zentralen Live-Identitätsdienst dar.","Civilization ID · free testing":"Civilization ID · kostenloser Test","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"Zivilisations-ID: Teilnahme und Erlaubnis","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"Civilization IDs und Q verwenden derzeit zum Testen in diesem Browser gespeicherte Datensätze. Zentrale Registrierung, Einreichungsaufnahme und geprüfte Prämien werden miteinander verbunden. Das Testen ist kostenlos und es wird nie automatisch ein Abonnement gestartet.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"Die Zivilisation beginnt mit jedem, der sich dazu entscheidet","Claim my Civilization ID":"Fordern Sie meine Civilization-ID an","Claim your Civilization ID":"Fordern Sie Ihre Civilization-ID an","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"Cluster-State-Übertragung über 29 km teilweise bereitgestellter Glasfaser-Advanced-Network-Engineering.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"Co-Building Civilization Brief","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"Co-Builder-Abstimmung · Stiftungsleistungen","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"Die Zivilisation mitgestalten.<br>Leben schützen.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"Mitgestaltung der Zivilisation. Ich schätze jedes Leben.","Coming soon":"Demnächst verfügbar","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"Vollständige präklinische Sicherheitsbewertung der Bioverteilung, Persistenz, Immunantworten, Thromboserisiko, Restvektor und abnormales Gewebewachstum. Strahlentherapieanwendungen erfordern auch eine Bewertung der Auswirkungen auf die Tumorkontrolle.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"Verknüpfen Sie jeden bestätigten Beitrag über Quantum Q mit Ihrer ID. Während des kostenlosen Tests bleiben die Browser-Testpunkte von den offiziellen Beitragsdatensätzen getrennt.","Contact":"Kontakt","Contact the preparatory team":"Kontaktieren Sie das Vorbereitungsteam","Contribute to civilization":"Zur Zivilisation beitragen","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"Tragen Sie zu unserem gemeinsamen Gedenken bei →","Contribution history":"Beitragshistorie","Contribution points Q":"Beitragspunkte Q","Contributions return to your ID":"Beiträge werden an Ihre ID zurückgegeben","Controller":"Controller","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"Könnten Zellen, die ein antioxidatives Protein absondern, dazu beitragen, Gewebeschäden nach der Bestrahlung zu mildern? Die veröffentlichte Arbeit von Weiwen Deng und Kollegen liefert Beweise aus Mäusen und menschlichen Zellen in vitro. Es handelt sich um einen präklinischen Ansatz, der weitere Tests erfordert. Es handelt sich nicht um eine zugelassene Behandlung für den Menschen.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"Die Berichterstattung wird auf der Grundlage nachvollziehbarer Originalforschung aktualisiert, wobei die Grenzen der Beweise deutlich gemacht werden.","Create a local test ID":"Erstellen Sie eine lokale Test-ID","Create an ID · free testing":"Erstellen Sie eine ID · kostenloses Testen","Crypto":"Krypto","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"Aktueller Stand: Vorbereitung, Partner-Due-Diligence und wissenschaftliche Prüfung. Klinische Studien, öffentliche Screenings und Spendensammlungen im Rahmen dieses Programms haben noch nicht begonnen.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"DARPA QBI Stufe C fortgeschrittene unabhängige technische Validierung.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"DNA identifiziert nicht direkt die Sprache, die jemand gesprochen hat. Genetische Muster müssen zusammen mit Archäologie und Linguistik interpretiert werden, und Sprachveränderungen müssen nicht mit einem Bevölkerungsaustausch einhergehen. Diese Erkenntnisse helfen, historische Hypothesen zu testen; Sie entschlüsseln keine antike Sprache.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"ENTWURF · ausstehende rechtliche Prüfung","Daily births · estimate":"Tägliche Geburten · Schätzung","Daily check-in":"Täglicher Check-in","Daily deaths · estimate":"Tägliche Todesfälle · Schätzung","Dates / reporting period":"Daten/Berichtszeitraum","Dates, lives lost and source records":"Daten, verlorene Leben und Quellenaufzeichnungen","Deaths / fatality records":"Aufzeichnungen über Todesfälle/Todesfälle","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"Todesfälle in der Wahrscheinlichkeitsfallzusammenfassung der WHO; Die Daten beziehen sich auf den Zeitraum des Krankheitsbeginns.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"Definieren Sie ein reproduzierbares Produkt menschlicher Zellen: Quelle, Identität, EC-SOD-Aktivität und Expressionsdauer, Spendervariation, Chargenkonsistenz, Kryokonservierung und skalierbare Produktion.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"Definieren Sie Begünstigte, Bereitstellungsinstitutionen, Budgets, Meilensteine ​​und messbare Ergebnisse.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"Definieren Sie Protokolle und geltende Genehmigungen und Ethikanforderungen, bevor die Forschung beginnt. Unterscheiden Sie zwischen explorativer Arbeit, validierten Erkenntnissen und Marketing; über Unsicherheit und negative Ergebnisse berichten.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"Demo: Tippen Sie hier, um eine Initiative zu starten und 100 Q zu erhalten.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"Demo: Ihre E-Mail bleibt in diesem Browser; Es wird keine echte E-Mail gesendet.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"Deng et al.: Linderung von Strahlenschäden bei Mäusen unter Verwendung von ECSOD-sekretierenden modifizierten mesenchymalen Stammzellen. Weiwen Deng ist als erster und korrespondierender Autor aufgeführt. Beweis: präklinische Forschung.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"Entwickeln Sie gezielte gemeinnützige Forschungs- und Screening-Pilotprojekte mit definierten Bedingungen, Populationen und Nachsorge. Der Umfang wird nach der Autorisierung des Partners, der Ethikprüfung und der Protokollüberprüfung festgelegt.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"Die Entwicklung für akute Strahlenschäden könnte anwendbare Wege wie die FDA-Tierregel untersuchen. Unter bestimmten Bedingungen ermöglicht es angemessene, kontrollierte Wirksamkeitsstudien an Tieren, um die Zulassung zu unterstützen und gleichzeitig die Anforderungen an die Sicherheit des Menschen und die Produktqualität zu wahren. Berechtigung und Genehmigung sind nicht gewährleistet. Bestehende Medikamente gegen Strahlenschäden sollten den ungedeckten Bedarf und die Vergleichsstrategie beeinflussen.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"Krankheitsprävention, NAD⁺ und Alterungsmechanismen, Einzelzell- und regenerative Forschung, KI-Genomik und Epigenetik sind Bereiche, die weiterhin behandelt werden müssen. QCF-Briefpapiere werden Zell- und Tierstudien von Studien am Menschen und klinischen Beweisen unterscheiden. Eine Veränderung eines biologischen Altersmarkers ist kein Beweis für eine längere Lebensdauer.","Disease remembrance":"Krankheitserinnerung","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"Spendensammlungen und automatische Abonnements sind nicht möglich. 100 Millionen CHF sind der vorgeschlagene Phase-1-Antrag, keine eingeworbenen, zugesagten oder genehmigten Mittel. Detaillierte Budgets und Gebühren erfordern eine sorgfältige Prüfung und eine entsprechende Governance-Überprüfung.","Donations":"Spenden","Donations received":"Eingegangene Spenden","Download bilingual PDF":"Zweisprachiges PDF herunterladen","Download submission template":"Einreichungsvorlage herunterladen","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"Redaktioneller Hinweis: Dies ist eine unabhängig verfasste QCF-Zusammenfassung und ein Kommentar, keine Reproduktion oder offizielle Übersetzung des Artikels von Nature. Der ursprüngliche Nachrichtenautor ist Ewen Callaway; Der Forschungskredit liegt bei den Autoren und Institutionen der Arbeiten. Für den Zugriff auf den vollständigen Nature-Nachrichtenartikel ist möglicherweise ein Abonnement erforderlich.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"Redaktionelle Überprüfung: 2. November 2026. Diese Organisationen werden als Quellen angegeben; Es ist keine Partnerschaft, Genehmigung oder Billigung von QCF impliziert.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"E-Mail: [noch einzurichten, z.B. contact@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"Verschlüsselte Identität","Encryption and key control":"Verschlüsselung und Schlüsselkontrolle","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"Beauftragen Sie Regulierungsbehörden und Ethikkommissionen mit der Festlegung der Produktklassifizierung, der Qualitätsstandards, des Entwicklungspfads und der Voraussetzungen für die Forschung am Menschen. Erst nach erforderlichen Genehmigungen könnten frühe Humanstudien mit Schwerpunkt auf Sicherheit, Verträglichkeit und messbarer biologischer Aktivität in Betracht gezogen werden.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"Schätzbereich im historischen Rückblick der WHO.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"Schätzbereich im historischen Bericht der WHO; Schätzungen variieren je nach Veröffentlichung.","Ethereum ETH":"Ethereum ETH","Event and population":"Ereignis und Bevölkerung","Every action is remembered by civilization":"Die Zivilisation erinnert sich an jede Handlung","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"Jeden Tag loggen wir uns ein. Bei unseren Telefonen, E-Mails, Banken, Gesundheitsdiensten, Regierungsportalen und Cloud-Konten. Über Grenzen hinweg wiederholen wir Passwörter, Codes und Identitätsprüfungen. Unser Leben ist in Hunderte von digitalen Türen zersplittert.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"Jedes Leben verdient Würde und Erinnerung.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"Jedes Leben verdient Respekt. Jede Verwendung personenbezogener Daten erfordert klare Grenzen.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"Jedes neue Leben verdient einen sanften Empfang.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"Über jede Ausgabe der 94 % wird durch die Abstimmung des Co-Builders entschieden.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"Beweisüberprüfung: 2. November 2026 | Programmvorbereitung und Due Diligence","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"Entdecken Sie NU-Key und digitales Erbe","Explore Phase One →":"Erkunden Sie Phase Eins →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"Entdecken Sie die Zusammenarbeit zwischen chinesischen Arzneimittelinnovatoren und europäischen Forschungs-, Klinik- und Industriepartnern. Gemeinnützige Forschung, Patientenzugang und kommerzielle Übersetzung erfordern unterschiedliche Ziele, Budgets und Rechte.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"Erkunden Sie Krankheitserinnerungen und -quellen →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"Erkunden Sie die Genomgeschichte und die Phase-1-Vision","Explore the life-sciences programme":"Entdecken Sie das Life-Sciences-Programm","Explore the phase-one programme":"Entdecken Sie das Phase-1-Programm","Explore the principles":"Entdecken Sie die Prinzipien","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"Erkunden Sie Kriegserinnerungen und Quellen →","First World War · Australia":"Erster Weltkrieg · Australien","First World War · British military":"Erster Weltkrieg · Britisches Militär","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Erster Weltkrieg · Kanada und Neufundland","First World War · global military":"Erster Weltkrieg · globales Militär","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"Erstausgabe des Datensatzes · Überprüft und Repository aktualisiert: 2. November 2026 · Keine Live-Statistik","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"Für mich liegt der Wert dieser Forschung in der Verbindung von Disziplinen. Die Biowissenschaften rücken vergangene Bewegungen in den Blick; Archäologie und Linguistik helfen uns, diese Begegnungen zu interpretieren. Die Sprachen und Kulturen, die wir heute kennen, verdienen es, im Rahmen einer längeren Geschichte menschlichen Austauschs verstanden zu werden.","Founder":"Gründer","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"Vier ausgewählte historische Pandemien · Summe der unteren Schätzungen","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"Vor vierzehn Milliarden Jahren begann das Universum an einem einzigen Punkt. Vor vier Milliarden Jahren kopierte sich das Leben erstmals im Ozean. Heute teilen sich acht Milliarden Menschen einen blauen Planeten – immer noch getrennt durch Grenzen, Hautfarbe, Sprache und Glauben.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"Die NV-Diamant-Magnetometrie-Arbeit von Fraunhofer wurde zu einem Kandidaten für einen Energieüberwachungs-PoC.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"Kostenlose Tests · Datensätze bleiben derzeit in diesem Browser. Hierbei handelt es sich nicht um eine zentrale Ausweisausstellung oder E-Mail-Verifizierung. Echte Konten und geräteübergreifende Datensätze werden geöffnet, wenn der Registrierungsdienst verbunden ist.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"Von 1990 bis 2003 schuf das Human Genome Project eine Grundlage für das menschliche Referenzgenom. NIH und das Energieministerium unterstützten die US-Bemühungen; Sequenzierungsinstitutionen kamen aus den USA, Großbritannien, Frankreich, Deutschland, Japan und China. Es demonstrierte die Kraft internationaler Zusammenarbeit und geteilten Wissens.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"Von HeLas Lektion zur Verantwortung von Civilization ID","From first login to a lasting legacy":"Vom ersten Login bis zu einem bleibenden Vermächtnis","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"Vom Labor in die Klinik: die nächsten Forschungsfragen","From one idea to a civilization in action":"Von einer Idee zu einer Zivilisation in Aktion","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"Vom Lesen des Genoms bis zum Schutz von Leben","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"Von Forschungsergebnissen zum Schutz von Leben","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"Vom Verständnis der Genome bis zum Schutz jedes Menschen","From vision to verifiable action":"Von der Vision zum nachweisbaren Handeln","Fund management":"Fondsmanagement","Funding and oversight":"Finanzierung und Aufsicht","Funding during preparation":"Finanzierung während der Vorbereitung","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"Versammeln Sie Mitbegründer der Zivilisation weltweit, um die menschliche Zivilisation mit aufzubauen, aufzuzeichnen, weiterzugeben und zu schützen.","Genomic health research":"Genomische Gesundheitsforschung","Get Civilization ID":"Zivilisations-ID erstellen","Get your ID":"Holen Sie sich Ihren Ausweis","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Vorbereitungsphase","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs","Google Pay":"Google Pay","Governance":"Governance","Governance and funding principles":"Governance- und Finanzierungsgrundsätze","Governance service":"Governance-Dienst","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"HIV-bedingte Todesfälle · weltweit kumulativ","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"HeLa erinnert uns daran, dass die Bewahrung von Wissen auch Respekt gegenüber jeder Person erfordert, die dahinter steht. Civilization ID ist als Einstiegspunkt für freiwillige Teilnahme- und Erlaubnisdatensätze vorgesehen, ohne dass DNA, Krankenakten oder Familienbeziehungen offengelegt werden. Der Schutz erfordert Verschlüsselung, Trennung von Identität und Daten, zweckspezifische Berechtigungen und Zugriffsüberwachung.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"Helfen Sie beim Aufbau einer auf den Menschen ausgerichteten digitalen Zivilisation","Help safeguard life":"Helfen Sie, Leben zu schützen","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"Hier können Sie einen neuen Namen annehmen: den Namen Ihres Civilization Envoy. Sie können die Vergangenheit verborgen lassen und nur als Ihr Ausweis oder neuer Name erscheinen. Sie treten aus freiem Willen bei und kommen durch freiwillige Beiträge voran. Jede Freigabe, jede Initiative, jede Aktion wird zu einem goldenen Quanten-Q und kehrt zu Ihrer ID zurück.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"Meine ursprüngliche Identität verbergen; zeige nur meinen Ausweis oder den Namen meines Gesandten","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"Historische kumulative Gesamtzahl: keine verlässliche weltweite Zahl","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"Von der WHO zitierte historische Schätzung, nur Europa; keine zeitgemäße Fallregistrierung. In dieser Quelle gibt es keine genauen Start-/Enddaten.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"Historische Figur im Forschungsleitfaden des UK National Archives; keine weltweite Summe.","History and our genomic-health vision":"Geschichte und unsere Vision der genomischen Gesundheit","Home":"Startseite","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"Wie antike Genome dabei helfen, die Verbreitung germanischer und keltischer Sprachen zu verfolgen","How initiatives work":"Wie Initiativen funktionieren","Human research and regulatory evidence":"Humanforschung und regulatorische Beweise","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"Ich habe die <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Datenschutz</a> und <a class=gold href=terms.html>Bedingungen</a> gelesen und verstehe, dass es sich hierbei um eine Demo handelt; Gebühren nach Anmeldung möglich","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"IBM × ORNL × AMD startete eine Co-Design-Plattform zur Fehlerkorrektur; Chicago System Two unterstützt auch die Netzoptimierungsforschung.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"Ausweisinhaber können zu jedem Thema Initiativen starten; Unterstützer geben freiwillig. 94 % der Mittel werden durch Abstimmung der Mitbauer vergeben; QCF erhebt eine Plattform- und Governance-Gebühr von 6 %.","IDs registered":"IDs registriert","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 hat ML-DSA in die sichere Geräteidentität integriert.","Impressum":"Impressum","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"Eine verbesserte klassische Emulation verstärkt den Bedarf an aktuellen klassischen Basislinien.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"Im Jahr 1951 wurden Tumorproben von Henrietta Lacks, die wegen Gebärmutterhalskrebs behandelt wurde, ohne ihr Wissen oder ihre Zustimmung für Forschungszwecke verwendet. Die daraus resultierende HeLa-Zelllinie leistete wichtige Beiträge zur Medizin und warf gleichzeitig anhaltende Fragen zu Einwilligung, Privatsphäre und gerechter Vorteilsverteilung auf.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"Im Jahr 2013 einigten sich das NIH und die Familie Lacks auf einen kontrollierten Zugang zu relevanten HeLa-Genomdaten. „Unsterblich“ beschreibt die Fähigkeit der Zelllinie, sich unter geeigneten Laborbedingungen weiter zu teilen, nicht die Unsterblichkeit von Henrietta Lacks selbst.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"Im Jahr 2026 plant QCF die Entwicklung einer Initiative für einen gerechteren Zugang zur Genomsequenzierung. Gemeinsam mit Spezialisten aus den Bereichen Forschung, Gesundheitswesen und Ethik möchten wir Menschen durch fundierte Entscheidungen und angemessene professionelle Unterstützung dabei helfen, ihre genomischen Informationen zu verstehen. In einem künftigen sicheren System könnten sich Einzelpersonen dafür entscheiden, genomische Datensätze mit einer unabhängig ausgestellten Civilization-ID zu verknüpfen.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"Im Forschungsartikel des Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy aus dem Jahr 2015 ist Deng erster und korrespondierender Autor. Es greift das frühere Überlebensergebnis auf und berichtet über die Nachbeobachtung bei überlebenden Mäusen: eine gemeldete Verlängerung der Lebensspanne um 207 Tage und eine Verzögerung der Kataraktbildung um 39 Tage. In der behandelten Gruppe wurde kein Tumor beobachtet, während in der Kochsalzgruppe ein Bauchtumor beobachtet wurde. Kohortengröße, Überlebensauswahl, Tumorpathologie und unabhängige Replikation erfordern eine genaue Prüfung. Diese Beobachtungen belegen weder eine allgemeine Krebsprävention noch eine Verlängerung der Lebensspanne. Die Papiere beschreiben verwandte Arbeiten, nicht zwei unabhängige Replikationen.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative","Initiatives":"Initiativen","Initiator":"Initiator","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"Initiatoren veröffentlichen Kosten und Ausgaben, während sie handeln.","International drug-research collaboration":"Internationale Zusammenarbeit in der Arzneimittelforschung","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"Sein öffentlicher Wert liegt in einem überprüfbaren Ansatz für die Strahlennotfallmedizin. Es handelt sich weder um eine abgeschlossene Strahlenbehandlung noch um einen validierten Impfstoff. Reproduzierbare Experimente müssen das Konzept mit einem künftigen Patientennutzen verbinden.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"Jessica Sage (Gründerin). Adresse: [wird hinzugefügt]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"Nehmen Sie an kostenlosen Tests teil: Probieren Sie Registrierung, Check-in und Teilen aus. Offizielle Beitragsprämien hängen von überprüften, bestätigten Aufzeichnungen ab.","LATEST ISSUED":"NEUESTE AUSGABE","Launch":"Start","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"Starten Sie eine Zivilisationsinitiative","Launch initiative":"Initiative starten","Launch initiative (demo)":"Initiative starten (Demo)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"Starten Sie mit Ihrer ID: Ziel, Budget, Meilensteine. +100 Q","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"Das 1990 ins Leben gerufene Human Genome Project brachte Forschungseinrichtungen über das International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium zusammen. Im Jahr 2003 lieferte es seine menschliche Referenzgenomsequenz – eine Grundlage für das Verständnis des Lebens, anstatt jeden Menschen zu sequenzieren.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"Lernen aus der Geschichte von HeLa","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"Lassen Sie Ihren Beitrag Teil unserer gemeinsamen Geschichte werden","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"Lizenzierte Zahlungsinstitute, Wallets und konforme Kryptoanbieter sind eingeladen, Civilization Co-building-Partner zu werden und beim Aufbau globaler Spendenschienen mitzuhelfen.","Life Sciences":"Lebenswissenschaften","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"Biowissenschaften und Lebensschutz","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"Lebenswissenschaften | Nature berichtet über neue antike DNA-Forschung ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Lebenswissenschaften | Das Ein-Personen-Biotech-Experiment: KI, Robotik und Wirkstoffforschung ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"Das Leben hat ein Ende. Die Zivilisation muss weitergehen.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"Biowissenschaften sind unsere erste Priorität. Energie und Informatik bleiben neben zivilisatorischer Bildung langfristige Forschungs- und Kooperationsrichtungen.","Life-science directions we will follow":"Biowissenschaftliche Richtungen, denen wir folgen werden","Life-sciences news":"Nachrichten aus den Biowissenschaften","Life-sciences programme":"Life-Sciences-Programm","Link my DNA":"Verknüpfe meine DNA","Live version (planned)":"Live-Version (geplant)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"Im Krieg verlorene Leben · Schätzung","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"Todesfälle durch Epidemien und Krankheiten · Schätzung","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"Langfristiges Ziel: 1.000.000 Zivilisations-IDs. Vorgeschlagener Phase-1-Antrag im Bereich Biowissenschaften: CHF 100.000.000; keine gesammelten oder verpfändeten Mittel.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"Bewusstlosigkeit ist kein Tod. Ein Atemsignal oder ein biometrisches Ereignis darf niemals selbstständig eine unumkehrbare Vermögensübertragung auslösen. Für die Delegation im Notfall und für die Vererbung sind gesonderte Schutzmaßnahmen, eine dokumentierte Einwilligung, eine unabhängige Überprüfung und eine rechtliche Prüfung erforderlich. Civilization ID ersetzt nicht Reisepässe, nationale E-IDs oder Bank-KYC.","Manage future permissions":"Zukünftige Berechtigungen verwalten","Mastercard":"Mastercard","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"Methode: 2026 Projektionen; Geburten und Sterbefälle sind gerundete jährliche Tagesdurchschnitte, keine Lebendzahlen für heute.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"Methode: Diese Zusammenfassungen ausgewählter Datensätze wurden von QCF zusammengestellt und nicht als kombinierte Gesamtzahlen von den Quellorganisationen veröffentlicht. Es handelt sich nicht um Lebendzählungen. Die beiden Kategorien können sich überschneiden und dürfen nicht addiert werden. Verifiziert und Repository aktualisiert: 02.11.2026.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"Migrationshinweise, interpretiert zusammen mit sprachlichen Beweisen","Mission":"Mission","My ID":"Meine ID","My contribution":"Mein Beitrag","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"NARA-Auszug vom 29. April 2008. Die aufgezeichneten Vorfall-/Todesdaten umfassen die Jahre 1956–2006, nicht die Dauer des Krieges. Feindliche und nicht feindselige Todesfälle; nicht der gesamte Kriegszoll.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"NIST IR 8547 legt eine Roadmap für den Übergang zur Post-Quantenkryptographie fest.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"NIST PQC war bereit für die Implementierung; Sensorik und Messtechnik wurden zu langfristigen Kandidaten für vertrauenswürdige Daten.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"Die optische Frequenzkammarbeit im Chip-Maßstab des NIST deutet auf eine kompakte Präzisionsmesstechnik hin.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"Nanjing-Massaker · China","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"Nature berichtet über neue antike DNA-Forschung","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"Die Thorium-229-Kernuhr von Nature untersucht fortgeschrittene Quantenmetrologie und präzises Timing.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"Die Spin-Photonen-Schnittstelle einzelner Moleküle in der Natur und die Koexistenz von Quanten- und klassischen Fasern gelangten in das Forschungsradar.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"Der am 4. November 2026 veröffentlichte Nature-Nachrichtenbericht von Ewen Callaway untersucht neue genetische Beweise, die für die europäische Sprachgeschichte relevant sind. Dieses QCF-Briefing basiert auf diesem Bericht, einer Forschungszusammenfassung und der Ankündigung der teilnehmenden Universität.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"Nächste auszustellende Zivilisations-ID","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"Eine Zugehörigkeit zu den Vereinten Nationen oder eine Billigung durch diese ist nicht impliziert.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"Es wird keine E-Mail gesendet und der E-Mail-Eigentümer wird nicht überprüft.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"Keine globale Mortalitätsreihe deckt alle Krankheiten seit der Entstehung der Zivilisation ab. Diese Ausgabe enthält zehn von der WHO stammende historische Ausbrüche, kumulative und jährliche Aufzeichnungen, hauptsächlich Infektionskrankheiten. Es ist nicht erschöpfend. Bei den Zahlen vor der WHO handelt es sich um historische Schätzungen, die von der WHO zitiert werden.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"Kein harmonisiertes Register deckt jeden Krieg und jedes Land seit der Entstehung der Zivilisation ab. Diese Ausgabe enthält neun Quellen aus Kriegs-, Landes- und Ereignisaufzeichnungen, die sich auf die moderne Geschichte konzentrieren. Antike und mittelalterliche Konflikte sowie viele Regionen werden noch nicht abgedeckt. Fehlende Einträge bedeuten nicht, dass es keine Todesfälle gibt.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"Es sind keine Angaben zu Nationalität, Rasse oder Glauben erforderlich. Nutzen Sie eine Beispiel-E-Mail zum kostenlosen Testen; Echte Identitätsdaten sind nicht erforderlich.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"Über die steuerliche Behandlung einer Spende wird keine Aussage gemacht.","No tax claims":"Keine Steueransprüche","No use without clear authorization":"Keine Verwendung ohne eindeutige Genehmigung","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"Kernuhren, heterogene Verschränkung und unabhängiges Benchmarking bestimmen die Woche","Of every 100 donated":"Von jeweils 100 gespendeten","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"Ein Mensch. Eine Zivilisations-ID. Ein digitales Erbe. Entdecken Sie ein universelles Identitätsportal und eine Zukunft, in der digitale Vermögenswerte, Fußabdrücke und Erinnerungen nach eigenem Ermessen aufbewahrt, gelöscht oder rechtmäßig weitergegeben werden können.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"Ein Spendeneintrag. Beträge sind in Schweizer Franken (CHF) angegeben. Zahlungen werden erst nach der offiziellen Registrierung der Stiftung und dem Abschluss des Compliance-Onboardings möglich.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"Eine Person. Eine Zivilisations-ID.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"Öffnen Sie das QCF-E-Kurzarchiv →","Open my ID":"Öffne meinen Ausweis","Opens after formal registration":"Öffnet nach formeller Registrierung","Operator":"Betreiber","Optional DNA linking":"Optionale DNA-Verknüpfung","Original papers and further reading":"Originalarbeiten und weiterführende Literatur","Original work and sources":"Originalarbeit und Quellen","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"Unsere langfristige Mission · Drei Säulen","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"Oxford demonstrierte die Fernverschränkung gemischter Spezies und eine Quantenspeicherung von etwa 10 Sekunden.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"PQC tritt in die digitale Asset-Infrastruktur ein, während die Vernetzung in die bereitgestellte Glasfaser übergeht","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"PQC geht von Algorithmusstandards zu Migration und Geräteidentität über","Participation without DNA":"Teilnahme ohne DNA","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"Partnerinstitutionen und wissenschaftliche Berater werden nach Autorisierung und Überprüfung veröffentlicht.","Partner seat open":"Partnersitz offen","Patent publications and rights verification":"Patentveröffentlichungen und Rechteüberprüfung","PayPal":"PayPal","Payment Partners":"Zahlungspartner","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"Menschen können eine ID erstellen, Artikel beisteuern und eine Beitragsanerkennung erhalten, ohne DNA bereitzustellen. Beitragsprämien und Sonderleistungen dürfen nicht von der Bereitstellung genomischer Daten oder der Zustimmung zur Genomforschung abhängen.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"Phase-1-Ziel: CHF 100.000.000. Spätere Phasen werden auf dieser Seite nicht angezeigt.","Phase-1 goals":"Phase-1-Ziele","Phase-one funding ambition":"Finanzierungsambitionen für die erste Phase","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"Planen Sie separate Projektbudgets und -aufzeichnungen mit Meilensteinüberprüfungen. Verwaltungskosten, Mittelverwendung und Aufsicht offenlegen; Sobald Sie bereit sind, veröffentlichen Sie die empfangende Entität und das Konto.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"Geplantes zentrales System: eine 10-stellige Zivilisations-ID (4-stelliges Wellenpräfix + 6-stellige Sequenz): Die Genesis-Welle 2026 gibt 2026000001 nacheinander aus; nach 999999 beginnt die Welle 2029 bei 2029000001 mit Verifizierungscode und Identitätsschlüssel, digital von der Stiftung signiert und öffentlich verifizierbar.","Platform use":"Plattformnutzung","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"Bitte geben Sie das Ereignis, die Daten, den Ort, die Bevölkerung, die Sterblichkeitsschätzung und den Link zur Originalquelle an. Beiträge werden vor der Aufnahme überprüft. Geben Sie keine persönlichen Gesundheits- oder Identitätsdaten ohne Genehmigung weiter.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"Präzisionsmesstechnik, heterogene Netzwerke und klassische Benchmarks schreiten gemeinsam voran","Preparatory stage":"Vorbereitungsphase","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"Website im Vorbereitungsstadium. Die Stiftung soll in Zug, Schweiz, gegründet werden und ist noch nicht registriert; Verfügbare Website-Funktionen können vor der Registrierung kostenlos getestet werden. Abonnements und Spenden sind nach formeller Anmeldung möglich; Tests werden nie automatisch in einen kostenpflichtigen Plan umgewandelt. Q ist ein nicht übertragbarer Beitragspunkt – keine Kryptowährung, ohne Geldwert und nicht handelbar. Eine steuerliche Absetzbarkeit wird nicht in Anspruch genommen.","Prepare a contribution":"Bereiten Sie einen Beitrag vor","Prepare a reviewable submission":"Bereiten Sie eine überprüfbare Einreichung vor","Privacy":"Privatsphäre","Privacy Policy":"Datenschutzrichtlinie","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"Gehen Sie schrittweise vor, sobald die Voraussetzungen erfüllt sind. Offenlegung von Ergebnissen, Einschränkungen und Verwendung der Mittel.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"Vorgeschlagene Spendenanfrage · Keine Spenden eingeworben · Keine Finanzierungszusage","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"Schützen Sie die Privatsphäre beim Erwachsenwerden. Navigieren Sie mit der Identität über Grenzen hinweg. Steuern Sie den Zugriff von Unternehmen und KI-Agenten. Bereiten Sie vertrauenswürdige Delegierte vor, wenn wir älter werden. Bewahren, löschen oder geben Sie ausgewählte digitale Vermögenswerte gemäß unseren Wünschen und dem geltenden Recht weiter.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"Geben Sie den Namen eines Autors oder Gesandten und Links zu Originalpapieren, institutionellen Ankündigungen oder überprüfbaren Quellen an. Sichern Sie sich bei Bedarf die Genehmigung für zitiertes Material, Bilder und die Mitautorenschaft.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"Gemeinwohl und kommerzielle Interessen","Publications and journal records":"Veröffentlichungen und Zeitschriftenaufzeichnungen","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"Q ist ein Beitragspunkt, der unter einer Zivilisations-ID erfasst wird. Es ist nicht übertragbar, nicht handelbar, keine Kryptowährung oder ein Finanzinstrument, hat keinen Geldwert und kann nicht gegen Geld eingetauscht werden.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q ist ein nicht übertragbarer Beitragspunkt – keine Kryptowährung, kein Geldwert, nicht handelbar.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"Q ist eine Aufzeichnung des Beitrags, nicht des Geldes.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q ist der Anfangsbuchstabe von Quantum und von QCF. Der goldene Ring enthält ein Feld aus Sternen: Jeder Lichtpunkt darin ist ein Mitgestalter der Zivilisation, angeordnet in einer Spirale mit goldenem Winkel – der natürlichen Ordnung, die Sonnenblumen und Galaxien teilen, jeder Punkt einzigartig und doch Teil eines Ganzen. Das hellste Licht in der Mitte ist das Genesis-Licht, der erste Co-Builder. Der Schwanz ist ein Teilchen im Übergang: die einzelne Aktion, die bei einer Person beginnt und das Ganze verändert.","Q issued today":"Q wurde heute herausgegeben","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"Q bleibt bei Ihrer Civilization-ID: nicht übertragbar, nicht handelbar, kein Geldwert. Demodaten leben nur in diesem Browser.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF LIFE SCIENCES · FORSCHUNGSÜBERSICHT","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"QCF zielt darauf ab, die zivile medizinische Bereitschaft durch reproduzierbare Aufzeichnungen, unabhängige Überprüfung und schrittweise Entwicklung vorbehaltlich ethischer, regulatorischer und Qualitätsanforderungen zu unterstützen. Der Schutz der Zivilisation beginnt mit Respekt vor dem Leben, den Forschungsteilnehmern und wissenschaftlichen Erkenntnissen.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"QCF-Bewertung: Quantensichere Energieinfrastruktur priorisieren.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"QCF bringt Menschen zusammen, um die menschliche Zivilisation aufzubauen, zu bewahren und zu schützen. Unsere erste Phase konzentriert sich auf die internationale Zusammenarbeit im Bereich der Biowissenschaften: überprüfbare Forschung, verantwortungsvolle Innovation und gemeinsames Wissen, um die Widerstandsfähigkeit gegenüber großen Gesundheits- und Gesundheitskrisen zu stärken.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"QCF verfolgt kontinuierlich wichtige Entwicklungen in den Bereichen Quantencomputing, Sensorik, Kommunikation, Post-Quantenkryptographie, Vernetzung und Metrologie und bewertet die praktische Relevanz für Energiemessung, vertrauenswürdige Daten, sichere Kommunikation, RWA und Infrastruktur. Diese Seite enthält nur Schlagzeilen und prägnante Zusammenfassungen; Zweisprachige chinesisch-englische PDFs werden als langfristige QCF-Forschungsarchive aufbewahrt.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"QCF-Einsatzbasis: Computer, Sensorik, Kommunikation, PQC und Messtechnik","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"Redaktionelle Bewertung des QCF: Eine stufenweise wissenschaftliche Bewertung ist gerechtfertigt. Relevante Spezialisten sollten Originaldaten, statistische Methoden und unabhängige Replikation sowie Wirksamkeit, Sicherheit und Herstellungsqualität menschlicher Zellen prüfen, bevor sie die klinische Machbarkeit beurteilen. Für weitere Forschung sind außerdem klare Eigentumsverhältnisse, Datennutzungsberechtigungen und Verantwortlichkeiten erforderlich.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"QCF etabliert: vertrauenswürdige Messung → sichere Kommunikation → Oracle-Verifizierung → RWA/Ledger-Abrechnung.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"QCF lädt Historiker, Gesundheitsexperten, Archive und alle Mitgestalter der Zivilisation ein, überprüfbare Aufzeichnungen über verlorene Leben beizutragen. Gemeinsam können wir übersehene Geschichten ans Licht bringen, verlässliches Wissen bewahren und Pflege und Unterstützung in die Tat umsetzen, um Leben zu schützen.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"QCF soll in Zug, Schweiz, gegründet werden und befindet sich derzeit in Vorbereitung, noch nicht registriert. Auf dieser Seite werden vorgeschlagene Grundsätze beschrieben. Dies bedeutet nicht, dass alle Mechanismen funktionsfähig sind.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"QCF-Perspektive: eine gemeinsame Aufzeichnung des menschlichen Lebens","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"QCF schlägt Civilization ID × NU-Key vor: eine offene Forschungsvision für selbstkontrollierte digitale Identität, überprüfbare Anmeldeinformationen, sicheren Zugriff, eine Bestandsaufnahme digitaler Vermögenswerte und rechtmäßige digitale Vererbung. Ein Universalschlüssel ist kein Master-Passwort, das jede Plattform umgeht. Es handelt sich um ein benutzergesteuertes Gateway, das separate Anmeldeinformationen und Berechtigungen koordiniert.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"QCF versucht, überprüfbares Wissen zugänglicher zu machen, indem es die Neugier auf die menschliche Herkunft weckt und sich um die kulturelle Vielfalt kümmert. Die Erforschung unserer gemeinsamen Vergangenheit sollte niemals dazu dienen, heutige Gemeinschaften einzustufen oder ihre Identität vorzuschreiben. Die Bewahrung von Wissen ist eine Möglichkeit, für die nachfolgenden Generationen zu sorgen.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"QCF-Vision: gerechterer Zugang zur genomischen Gesundheit","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E befürwortet keine unbestätigten „Quantenenergie“-Behauptungen. Es werden Experimente, Prototypen, Firmenankündigungen und Spekulationen unterschieden; Quantentechnologien gehen erst nach reproduzierbarer Validierung in einem definierten Anwendungsfall in QCF-Fähigkeitsaussagen ein.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"Der nächste Schritt von QCF: eine stufenweise wissenschaftliche Due Diligence","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"Quantinuum Helios berichtete über Fortschritte bei der Fehlerkorrektur im logischen Speicher.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"Quantum Civilization Foundation (in Gründung). Gründung im Kanton Zug, Schweiz; noch nicht im Handelsregister eingetragen und ohne Rechtspersönlichkeit.","Quantum Civilization University":"Quantum Civilization University","Quantum Q · free testing":"Quantum Q · kostenloses Testen","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"Quantentechnologie für die Energie der Erde ⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"Quantencomputing konvergiert mit HPC; Fortschritt in der Kommunikation und Geräteherstellung","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"Quantensensorik wird zu einem vorrangigen Kandidaten für die QCF-Energievalidierung","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"Quantengetriebene Lebenswissenschaften","RMB stablecoin":"RMB-Stablecoin","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"Medizinische Vorbereitung auf Strahlenschäden","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"Lesen Sie mehr über HeLa und Gesundheitsdatenschutz","Read our life-sciences brief":"Lesen Sie unseren Kurzbericht zu den Biowissenschaften","Read our mission":"Lesen Sie unsere Mission","Read the civilization brief":"Lesen Sie den Zivilisationsbrief","Reading and extending this record":"Lesen und Erweitern dieses Datensatzes","Ready to launch yours?":"Sind Sie bereit, Ihres zu starten?","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"Zivilisation aufzeichnen · Leben schützen · Gemeinsam Zivilisation aufbauen","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"Gemeinsam Zivilisation aufzeichnen, schützen und aufbauen","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"Zivilisation aufzuzeichnen bedeutet, Wissen, Beiträge und nachvollziehbare Forschung zu bewahren. Der Schutz der Zivilisation bedeutet, das Leben und die individuellen Entscheidungen zu schützen. Gemeinsam die Zivilisation aufbauen bedeutet, die Vorteile der internationalen Zusammenarbeit zu teilen.","Register a Civilization ID":"Registrieren Sie eine Zivilisations-ID","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"Verbleibend bis Phase-1-Ziel (CHF)","Remembering lives lost in war":"Gedenken an im Krieg verlorene Leben","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"Gedenken an Leben, die durch Epidemien und Krankheiten verloren gegangen sind","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"Reproduzieren Sie die Wirksamkeit bei Tieren unabhängig voneinander, indem Sie geeignete Kontrollen, Randomisierung und Blindbewertung verwenden, um Überleben, Dosis-Wirkung und das Behandlungsfenster nach der Exposition zu untersuchen.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"Berichterstattung von Civilization Architect Jessica Sage · Wöchentlich aktualisiert","Research approach and evidence status":"Forschungsansatz und Evidenzstatus","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"Nur Forschungskonzept: NU-Key, plattformübergreifende Anmeldung und automatische digitale Vererbung sind derzeit keine operativen Dienste. Es wird kein Kontozugriff Dritter oder eine Vermögensübertragung angeboten.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"Forschungseinrichtungen, klinische Spezialisten, Ethik- und Data-Governance-Experten sowie philanthropische Unterstützer sind herzlich willkommen, ein Gespräch zu beginnen. Bitte teilen Sie uns eine institutionelle Einführung und eine nicht vertrauliche Zusammenfassung mit. Senden Sie keine persönlichen Genomdaten, Krankenakten oder unveröffentlichten Patentdetails per E-Mail.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"Forscher und wissenschaftliche Stiftung","Reset demo":"Demo zurücksetzen","Responsible person":"Verantwortliche Person","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"Die Menschheit neu denken: Souveränität über menschliche Gesundheitsdaten und gerechter Vorteilsausgleich ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"Die Menschheit neu denken: Die Quantenphysik definiert unser Verständnis der Realität neu","Review and recognition":"Überprüfung und Anerkennung","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"Ehrentafel bis 31. März 1921; Die engere Zahl vom 4. August 1914 bis 11. November 1918 beträgt 59.357. Fügen Sie sie nicht hinzu.","SARS · global":"SARS · global","Sample initiative":"Probeninitiative","Science and ethics":"Wissenschaft und Ethik","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"Wissenschaft im Dienst des Lebens.<br>Zusammenarbeit über Grenzen hinweg.","Scope and limitations":"Umfang und Einschränkungen","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"Scrollen Sie horizontal für die vollständige Tabelle. Öffnen Sie jede Quelle für den Originaldatensatz. Lesen Sie Daten und Zahlen sowie deren Umfang.","Seat 1":"Sitzplatz 1","Seat 2":"Sitzplatz 2","Seat 3":"Sitzplatz 3","Seat 4":"Sitzplatz 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"Sitzplätze sind Platzhalter. Formelle Partnerschaften erfordern eine sorgfältige Prüfung und eine schriftliche Vereinbarung. Kontaktieren Sie uns per E-Mail, bis die Stiftung live geht.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Zweiter Weltkrieg · Kanada und Neufundland","Second World War · global estimate":"Zweiter Weltkrieg · globale Schätzung","Security verification":"Sicherheitsüberprüfung","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"Siehe Impressum. Gestützt auf das Bundesgesetz über den Datenschutz (nDSG) und ggf. die DSGVO.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"Suchen Sie nach relevantem unabhängigem Fachwissen, um Beweise, Ethik und Forschungsdurchführbarkeit zu überprüfen.","Selected":"Ausgewählt","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"Ausgewählte Aufzeichnungen aus zwei Weltkriegen · Teilpopulationen","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"Todesfälle im Dienst, einschließlich Verwundungen und Krankheiten; Die Gedenkfrist erstreckt sich bis zum 31. August 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"Teilen Sie einen Link (maximal 10/Tag)","Share link":"Link teilen","Source":"Quelle","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"Quellenpriorität: Nationalarchive, amtliche Statistiken und öffentliche Gedenkeinrichtungen; WHO für Krankheitsdaten. Offizielle historische Zusammenfassungen können selbst Schätzungen verwenden. Zusätze müssen den Zeitraum, die Geographie, die Bevölkerung, den Figurentyp und die Quellenversion angeben; Widersprüchliche Definitionen werden erläutert und nicht zu einer präzisen Gesamtsumme zusammengefasst.","Sources and further reading":"Quellen und weiterführende Literatur","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"Quellen dokumentieren Geschichte und Forschung; Eine Zitierung bedeutet keine Partnerschaft, Finanzierung oder Billigung von QCF.","Stablecoins":"Stablecoins","Start free testing":"Kostenlose Tests starten","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"Als Institut beginnen und Kurse eröffnen (Vision): Zivilisation aufzeichnen, studieren, weitergeben und mitgestalten. Für Abschlüsse ist die entsprechende Akkreditierung erforderlich.","Status":"Status","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"Status: Vorbereitung und Due Diligence | Aktualisiert: 2. November 2026","Support":"Unterstützung","Support (opening soon)":"Support (bald eröffnet)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Unterstützen Sie die Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"Unterstützer spenden freiwillig (öffnet sich nach der Registrierung).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"Unterstützung des Einsatzes von Quantencomputing, Quantensensorik und KI in der Arzneimittelforschung, Präzisionsmedizin und Forschung zu gesunder Langlebigkeit im Rahmen der von Experten begutachteten Wissenschaft. Keine medizinischen Ratschläge oder gesundheitsbezogenen Angaben.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"Unterstützung überprüfbarer Anwendungen von Quantencomputern, Sensorik, Kommunikation, PQC und Metrologie in der Energieforschung. Wöchentliche Schlagzeilen und Zusammenfassungen werden offen veröffentlicht; Zweisprachige PDFs werden dauerhaft für den Zugriff durch Civilization Co-builders/Civilization ID archiviert.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"Schweizer Franken-Stablecoin","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"Die Schweizer Quanteninfrastruktur, die Quantengitterplanung des DOE und EuroQCI bildeten die erste Beobachtungsliste.","TWINT":"TWINT","Terms":"Bedingungen","Terms of Use":"Nutzungsbedingungen","Test email:":"Test-E-Mail:","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"Das Testen ist vor der formellen Registrierung kostenlos. Abonnementdienste und besondere Vorteile für frühe Envoys unterliegen den zu diesem Zeitpunkt bekannt gegebenen Regeln. Durch Tests werden niemals automatische Gebühren ausgelöst.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"Die Blutkorrespondenz von Abdel-Mageed und Kollegen aus dem Jahr 2009 führt Deng als korrespondierenden Autor auf. Ein adenoviraler Vektor wurde verwendet, um extrazelluläre Superoxiddismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mesenchymalen Stroma-/Stammzellen (MSCs) des Knochenmarks der Maus zu exprimieren. Mäuse erhielten 24 Stunden nach der Ganzkörperbestrahlung mit 9 Gy intravenös 500.000 manipulierte Zellen. Die berichtete 35-Tage-Überlebensrate betrug 52 %, verglichen mit 10 % für Kochsalzlösung und 9 % für Reportergen-modifizierte Zellen. Diese Ergebnisse beziehen sich auf ein bestimmtes Mausmodell und können nicht in den erwarteten Nutzen für den Menschen umgewandelt werden.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"Die Arbeit von 2015 zeigt auch die adenovirale Transduktion und Sekretion von biologisch aktivem EC-SOD durch menschliche Knochenmarks-MSCs in vitro. Experimente mit menschlichen Zellen sind keine klinischen Versuche am Menschen. Die Zeitschrift heißt Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy und sollte nicht mit gleichnamigen Zeitschriften verwechselt werden.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"Im CV 2023 sind US7.547.545 und Anmeldung 18/199.975 bezüglich der Zelldifferenzierung und der Verstärkung der Impfstoff-Immunantwort separat aufgeführt. Sie begründen weder die Patenterteilung noch die Wirksamkeit für den Strahlungskandidaten.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"Bei den auf der Seite „Initiativen“ beschriebenen 6 % handelt es sich um einen bestehenden Vorschlag für Plattformdienste. Das Life-Science-Programm wird über ein eigenes offengelegtes Budget verfügen. Beitragspunkte oder öffentliche Abstimmungen ersetzen kein wissenschaftliches oder ethisches Urteil.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"Im Lebenslauf ist eine Position als Zytogenetik-Direktor bei LabCorp Integrated Oncology ab 2017 aufgeführt; Dies ist keine Bestätigung einer aktuellen Ernennung für 2026. Aktuelle Rollen, institutionelle Autorisierung und QCF-Verantwortlichkeiten erfordern eine aktualisierte Überprüfung. Die folgenden Veröffentlichungen und Patentaufzeichnungen können unabhängig eingesehen werden.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"Die Genesis Civilization ID","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Das Ein-Personen-Biotech-Experiment: KI, Robotik und Arzneimittelentwicklung ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"Die Quantum Civilization Foundation glaubt, dass unsere wahrste gemeinsame Identität einfach darin besteht: ein Mitglied der menschlichen Zivilisation. Für jeden, der dies möchte, stellen wir einen Zivilisationsausweis aus. Dabei wird nie gefragt, woher Sie kommen, sondern es wird nur erfasst, was Sie in die Zivilisation mitbringen.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"Die Staatsarchivverwaltung legt eine Archivuntersuchung in Nanjing vom Februar 1946 vor, in der über 300.000 Personen verzeichnet sind. Historische Untersuchung; eine Untergruppe der Todesfälle während des Krieges in China.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"Die Universität Göteborg berichtet über die Analyse der DNA von mehr als 4.500 alten Individuen, darunter 712 neu sequenzierte Genome. Die Forscher vermuten, dass Migranten, die vor etwa 4.000 Jahren nach Skandinavien kamen, möglicherweise einen frühen Vorfahren germanischer Sprachen in sich trugen. Eine spätere Migration, mehrere Jahrhunderte vor der Wikingerzeit, fiel mit der Entstehung des Altnordischen zusammen.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"Der Antrag und das Stufenbudget sind in Vorbereitung. Die Verwendung der Mittel, die Verwaltungskosten, die Projektauswahl und die Überwachung werden nach einer Due-Diligence-Prüfung festgelegt. Auf dieser Seite werden keine Zahlungen eingezogen.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"Die Byline kennzeichnet den redaktionellen Kommentar von QCF. Die ursprüngliche Forschung gehört ihren Autoren und relevanten Rechteinhabern. Das Zitieren impliziert keine institutionelle Billigung oder Technologielizenz.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"Die begleitende keltische Studie analysiert genomweite Daten von 4.587 alten Individuen. Beim Vergleich von Migrationsmodellen favorisieren die Autoren eine Westexpansion von Ostmitteleuropa vor etwa 3.000 Jahren als sparsamste Erklärung für die keltische Ausbreitung. Die Stichprobenzahlen aus den Studien sollten nicht so addiert werden, als ob sie einzelne Personen darstellen würden.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"Die Ergebnisse bieten einen Ausgangspunkt für die translationale Forschung. Bei der Entwicklung muss zunächst zwischen der Notfallbehandlung akuter Strahlenschäden und dem Schutz vor strahlentherapiebedingten Verletzungen des normalen Gewebes unterschieden werden. Diese Einstellungen umfassen unterschiedliche Populationen, Behandlungsfenster, Endpunkte und Nutzen-Risiko-Überlegungen. Das Folgende ist die Analyse von QCF, kein initiiertes oder autorisiertes klinisches Protokoll.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"Die erste Civilization-ID, 2026000001, gehört der Gründerin Jessica Sage. Hier beginnt die Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative.","The golden Q: a quantum":"Das goldene Q: ein Quantum","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"Die Live-Version sammelt E-Mails nur, um Civilization-IDs auszustellen und zu überprüfen; Keine Nationalität, Rasse, Religion oder andere sensible Daten. Sie können Zugriff, Berichtigung und Löschung verlangen.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"Der Plan umfasst Einblick in Zwecke, Empfänger und Zugriffsdatensätze sowie eine Möglichkeit, zukünftige Berechtigungen zu entziehen. Die Grenzen in Bezug auf abgeschlossene Analysen, veröffentlichte Ergebnisse und die erforderliche Aufbewahrung müssen bei der Einwilligung erläutert werden.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"Die vorstehende QCF-Perspektive ist ein redaktioneller Kommentar von Jessica Sage, getrennt von den Forschungsergebnissen.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"Das Projektteam beabsichtigt, die Zusammenarbeit mit potenziellen Partnern, einschließlich Beijing Nuosai Gene, zu erkunden. Juristische Personen, Genehmigungen, Protokolle und Ethikvereinbarungen werden nach sorgfältiger Prüfung veröffentlicht; Dies bedeutet weder eine unterzeichnete Partnerschaft noch einen weltweiten Sampling-Start.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"Das vorgeschlagene Design kombiniert etablierte Kryptographie, Schlüsselverwaltung, bereichsbezogenen Zugriff und Prüfaufzeichnungen. KI kann die Forschung und die Erkennung von Anomalien unterstützen; es ersetzt nicht die Verschlüsselung, die Einwilligung nach Aufklärung oder die Prüfung durch einen Experten.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"Der öffentliche Aggregator kennzeichnet beide US-Anmeldungen als „Abgebrochen“. Dies ist kein Rechtsgutachten. Der aktuelle Status, andere nationale Familienrechte, Eigentumsrechte und etwaige Lizenzen für QCF erfordern eine Überprüfung durch offizielle Aufzeichnungen und eine schriftliche Vereinbarung. Die Benennung eines Erfinders begründet nicht den Besitz von QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"Die veröffentlichte Arbeit untersucht mesenchymale Stammzellen, die extrazelluläre Superoxiddismutase (ECSOD) exprimieren. Die aufgeführten Zell- und Mausstudien bieten eine Grundlage für weitere Bewertungen, ohne die Sicherheit, Wirksamkeit oder den Schutz vor allen Verletzungen in einem nuklearen Konflikt für den Menschen zu belegen.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"Die strahlenbezogenen Patentveröffentlichungen betreffen modifizierte mesenchymale Stammzellen. Zu den genannten Erfindern zählen Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed und Anthony J. Senagore. Hierbei handelt es sich um Anwendungs-/Veröffentlichungskennungen, nicht um den Nachweis eines erteilten, durchsetzbaren Patents.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"Die Referenzsequenz kombinierte DNA von mehreren Spendern. Forscher in Buffalo rekrutierten Freiwillige über öffentliche Anzeigen und sammelten nach Einverständniserklärung Blut. Hierbei handelte es sich weder um eine bevölkerungsweite Untersuchung noch um einen Beweis für ein globales Probenahmeprogramm der Vereinten Nationen oder aller fünf ständigen Mitglieder des Sicherheitsrats.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"Der Submission-Einlasskanal wird angeschlossen. Laden Sie jetzt die Vorlage herunter, um Ihren Text und Ihre Quellen vorzubereiten. Durch das Herunterladen einer Vorlage werden weder ein Beitrag eingereicht noch Punkte vergeben.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"Die Vorlage verlangt keine DNA, Ausweisnummern oder Krankenakten. Eine Zivilisations-ID kann hinzugefügt werden, nachdem eine formelle Nummer vergeben wurde.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"Der eindeutige Identifikator ist die unabhängig registrierte Civilization-ID mit einem freiwilligen Autorisierungslink. DNA ist keine öffentliche ID-Nummer oder ein Login-Passwort. Identität kann nicht auf Genetik reduziert werden; Eineiige Zwillinge zeigen auch, warum DNA allein nicht für jeden Menschen eine eindeutige Identität herstellen kann.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Dies sind Design- und Governance-Ziele. Bei der aktuellen Civilization ID handelt es sich um eine Front-End-Demonstration, bei der kein vollständiges Gesundheitsdatensystem implementiert ist. Diese Website sammelt keine personenbezogenen Genomdaten.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"Diese Aufzeichnungen werden nicht summiert: Die kriegsweiten Gesamtwerte überschneiden sich mit nationalen und städtischen Teilmengen; Die kumulative, jährliche und übermäßige Sterblichkeit misst unterschiedliche Werte, und Kriegs- und Krankheitstodesfälle können sich überschneiden. Näherungswerte, Bereiche und „Mehr als“-Qualifizierer bleiben erhalten.","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"Diese Designvorschau sendet keine Daten an einen Server. E-Mail-Adresse, Name des Gesandten und Beitragsverlauf bleiben im lokalen Speicher Ihres Browsers und können jederzeit gelöscht werden. Keine Cookies, Analysen oder Ressourcen Dritter.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"Diese erste Ausgabe enthält neun Kriegs-, Länder- und Ereignisaufzeichnungen. Die gerundete Zahl kombiniert über 9 Millionen militärische Todesfälle im Ersten Weltkrieg und etwa 60 Millionen weltweite Todesfälle im Zweiten Weltkrieg. Nationale und städtische Teilmengen werden nicht erneut hinzugefügt. Es handelt sich nicht um eine Summe, die sich ausschließlich auf den Krieg oder die gesamte Geschichte bezieht.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"Diese erste Ausgabe enthält zehn von der WHO stammende Aufzeichnungen. Die Zahl fasst die niedrigeren historischen Schätzungen für den Schwarzen Tod in Europa und die Grippepandemien von 1918, 1957 und 1968 zusammen. Es handelt sich nicht um eine Allzeit-Summe für Epidemien und Krankheiten.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"Diese Geschichte impliziert weder eine UN-Genehmigung oder -Unterstützung für QCF noch eine offizielle Nachfolge des Humangenomprojekts.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"Dies ist eine Website im Vorbereitungsstadium. Die Stiftung ist noch nicht eingetragen; Alle verfügbaren Website-Funktionen können kostenlos getestet werden. Abonnements und Spenden sind nach formeller Registrierung und Eröffnung des Bankkontos möglich. Bei einem Abonnement muss der Benutzer den Preis und die Bedingungen auswählen und bestätigen. Testen wird nie automatisch zu einem kostenpflichtigen Plan.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"Dies ist das Prinzip, das wir durch validierte Technologie, verantwortungsvolle Abläufe und fortlaufende Aufsicht in die Praxis umsetzen wollen.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"Auf dieser Seite wird eine mögliche medizinische Gegenmaßnahme bei Strahlenschäden beschrieben. Der veröffentlichte Ansatz ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit einem Impfstoff. Handelt es sich bei dem vorgeschlagenen „Strahlenimpfstoff“ um einen anderen Kandidaten, müssen seine technische Definition und sein Nachweisdossier gesondert dokumentiert werden.","This preview":"Diese Vorschau","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"Drei-Benutzer-QKD mit passiver Glasfaser erforschte einfachere Architekturen mit mehreren Knoten.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"Gründung in Zug, Schweiz; derzeit in Vorbereitung und noch nicht registriert. Gründerin: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"Zu den Themen gehören Zivilisation und Geisteswissenschaften, Lebenswissenschaften, Quanten- und Energieforschung, KI und Technologie, gemeinnütziges Handeln und internationale Zusammenarbeit.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"Vertrauen durch Beweise.<br>Verwaltung durch Transparenz.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"Versuchen Sie, eine Civilization-ID zu erstellen","Try the Civilization ID flow":"Probieren Sie den Civilization ID-Ablauf aus","Tuberculosis · global annual":"Tuberkulose · globales Jahrbuch","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"Die UNESCO hat am 11. November 1997 die Allgemeine Erklärung zum menschlichen Genom und zu den Menschenrechten angenommen. die UN-Generalversammlung hat es am 9. Dezember 1998 mit der Resolution 53/152 gebilligt. Diese Geschichte bietet einen ethischen Bezug: Wissenschaft soll dem menschlichen Wohlergehen dienen, und Menschen dürfen nicht auf ihre genetischen Eigenschaften reduziert werden.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"Historischer Bericht des US-Energieministeriums für die Jahre 1931–1945; eine Schätzung, kein einheitliches Register. Andere Institutionen unterscheiden sich. Die folgenden Länder-/Ereigniseinträge aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg dürfen nicht erneut hinzugefügt werden.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"Verifizierte IDs","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"Überprüfen Sie Partnerunternehmen, Mandate, geistiges Eigentum und Forschungsnachweise.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"Veterans Affairs Canada-Zahl für Militärpersonal; schließt andere Länder aus.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"Vietnamkriegsbezogene · US-Militärunterlagen","View all civilization briefs →":"Alle Zivilisationsbriefe anzeigen →","View all publications →":"Alle Veröffentlichungen anzeigen →","Visa":"Visum","Vote":"Abstimmung","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"Jahresschätzung der WHO für 2024, einschließlich 150.000 Menschen mit HIV; nicht kumulativ und überlappt den HIV-Eintrag.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"WHO-Daten 2024: Schätzintervall 37,6–53,4 Millionen. Langfristige kumulierte Zahl; Überschneidungen mit Erkrankungen wie Tuberkulose.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"Bericht der WHO für Europa: Schätzung für das erste Jahr; andere Modelle/Abschnitte weichen davon ab. Keine Allzeitsumme.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"WHO-Schätzungsintervall 13,3–16,6 Millionen; direkte und indirekte Pandemieeffekte, nicht bestätigte Todesfälle oder alle Pandemiejahre.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"Historische Schätzung der WHO, nicht einzelne gemeldete Todesfälle.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"Auf der Ausbruchsseite der WHO wurde die Gesamtzahl gemeldet, einschließlich betroffener Länder außerhalb Westafrikas; Der Ausbruch endete im Juni 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"Kriegsopfer sind nicht automatisch Todesfälle; Krankheitsfälle und Sterblichkeitsraten sind keine Todeszahlen. Der Wert eines Lebens wird nicht durch Nationalität, ethnische Zugehörigkeit oder Identität bestimmt.","War remembrance":"Kriegserinnerung","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"Wir befürworten Forschung, die eine Wiederholung der Nutzung ohne angemessene Einwilligung nach Aufklärung verhindert, die individuelle Entscheidung respektiert und Beiträge zur Wissenschaft anerkennt. Lassen Sie uns gemeinsam das Wohlergehen der Menschen sichern.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"Unser Ziel ist es, wissenschaftliche Erkenntnisse in Gesundheitschancen umzuwandeln, die Menschen verstehen, wählen und von denen sie profitieren können. Unsere langfristige Vision ist ein gleichberechtigter Zugang zur genomischen Gesundheit; Der erste Schritt besteht aus gezielter gemeinnütziger Forschung und freiwilligen Screening-Piloten mit interpretierbaren Ergebnissen und Nachsorge.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"Wir sind keine Zuschauer. Wir sind Mitbauer. Mitaufbau und Mitgestaltung der Zivilisation – um der nächsten Generation eine bessere Welt zu hinterlassen.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"Wir laden Bürger, Kryptografen, Identitätsingenieure, Rechtsexperten, Entwickler und philanthropische Familien ein, gemeinsam eine Zukunft zu gestalten, in der Menschen ihre digitale Identität kontrollieren und entscheiden, was sie zurücklassen.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"Wir bewahren die Geschichte der Wissenschaft und übernehmen Verantwortung für die Zukunft des Lebens. Wir streben nach grenzüberschreitender Forschung, die den Menschen dient, einer Datennutzung, die die individuellen Entscheidungen respektiert, und einer Zivilisation, die durch Zusammenarbeit und Fürsorge getragen wird.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"Wir erinnern uns, damit noch mehr Leben eine Zukunft haben.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"Wir teilen eine Erde und die Verantwortung für die Zukunft der Zivilisation. Lassen Sie Technologie dem Leben dienen, Wissen zwischen Generationen weitergeben und jeder freundliche Akt zum Aufbau unserer gemeinsamen Zivilisation beitragen.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"Wir verbringen ein Leben lang damit, digitale Vermögenswerte, Fußabdrücke, Wissen, Erinnerungen und Geschäfte zu erstellen. Wenn wir alt werden, unsere Leistungsfähigkeit verlieren oder sterben, wissen unsere Lieben dann überhaupt, was existiert? Sollte alles, was wir aufgebaut haben, einfach verschwinden?","WeChat Pay":"WeChat-Bezahlung","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"Die Funktionen der Website können kostenlos getestet werden, bevor die Stiftung offiziell registriert wird. Die Abonnementdienste beginnen nach der Registrierung, wobei besondere Vorteile für frühe Civilization-Gesandte geplant sind; Teilnahmeberechtigung und Einzelheiten werden noch bekannt gegeben.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"Weiwen Deng und Strahlenverletzungsforschung","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, hat in den Bereichen Zytogenetik, Stammzellen und Gentherapie gearbeitet. Der an QCF übermittelte Lebenslauf 2023 dokumentiert einen medizinischen Abschluss im Jahr 1990, einen Master-Abschluss in Mikrobiologie und Immunologie im Jahr 1993 und einen Tulane-Doktortitel in Molekular- und Zellbiologie im Jahr 2004 sowie frühere Forschungsarbeiten und die Leitung eines Labors für mesenchymale Stammzellen am Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng: Veröffentlichungen, Patente und Status","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"Willkommen, Miterbauer der Zivilisation","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"Westafrikanischer Ebola-Ausbruch und betroffene Länder","What did the studies find?":"Was haben die Studien herausgefunden?","What do the two papers establish?":"Was stellen die beiden Papiere dar?","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"Wenn das Leben endet, verschwindet unsere digitale Welt – oder lebt sie weiter?","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"Warum Civilization ID und Gesundheitsdatenschutz wichtig sind","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"Weltbevölkerung · Schätzung Mitte 2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"Sie haben noch keine Civilization-ID","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"Ihre Identität. Deine Souveränität. Dein Vermächtnis.","Your informed choice":"Ihre informierte Entscheidung","next":"als nächstes","opens after registration":"öffnet sich nach der Registrierung","spent by co-builder vote":"ausgegeben durch Co-Builder-Abstimmung","← Life sciences":"← Lebenswissenschaften","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69.000.000"},"fr":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · Diligences diligentes","02 · Independent review":"02 · Examen indépendant","03 · Pilot design":"03 · Conception pilote","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · Rapport d'avancement","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"Intrication atome-photon à 1 530 nm et réseau quantique avancé de bande de télécommunications QKD à fibre de 50 km.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"Simulation d'atomes neutres de 180 qubits : Nature a rapporté des expériences de dynamique quantique hors équilibre.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997-1998 : progrès scientifique et dignité humaine","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"Initiative préparatoire 2026 · Les informations sont disponibles dès maintenant. Ce site Web ne collecte pas d’ADN et n’accepte pas de fichiers génomiques.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6% est le total combiné des quatre services. Les processus de séparation, de garde et de LBC doivent être confirmés par un avocat suisse avant l'enregistrement.","72,000,000+":"72 000 000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"Un nom d'envoyé de civilisation","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"Un identifiant de civilisation est une identité de contribution au sein de QCF, et non un passeport, un document de citoyenneté ou d'identité légale.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"Une démarche scientifique au-delà des frontières","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"Une étude distincte a examiné un vaccin peptidique COVID-19 associé au vaccin contre le tétanos chez les chevaux. Il ne démontre pas un vaccin radioactif ni une efficacité humaine.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"Un plan volontaire pour lier les données génomiques personnelles à un Civilization ID","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandémie de grippe A(H1N1) · mondiale","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandémie de grippe A(H2N2) · mondiale","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandémie de grippe A(H3N2) · mondiale","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"Abdel-Mageed et al., avec Weiwen Deng comme co-auteur. Thème : cellules souches mésenchymateuses génétiquement modifiées et survie des souris irradiées. Preuve : recherche sur les animaux ; section du journal : Correspondance.","About":"À propos","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"Les soumissions acceptées peuvent être reconnues selon les règles de contribution publiées. Les points de test ne deviennent pas automatiquement des récompenses officielles. N’incluez pas d’informations personnelles sur la santé ou génomiques sans consentement.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"Accepté via un prestataire agréé en Suisse, converti en CHF au taux à réception, avec reçu de don délivré.","Account":"Compte","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"Comptabilisez séparément la recherche d’intérêt public, la traduction commerciale des médicaments et les investissements dans les infrastructures. Divulguer les transactions entre parties liées, les accords de propriété intellectuelle et les conflits, avec récusation et examen indépendant.","Alipay":"Alipay","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"Toutes les fonctionnalités disponibles du site Web peuvent être testées gratuitement avant que la fondation ne soit officiellement enregistrée. Les services d'abonnement commencent après l'inscription ; le forfait actuel est de 20 CHF / USD / EUR par mois, avec des services et des conditions de paiement clairement indiqués avant la souscription.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"Tous les boutons de paiement sont désactivés pour le moment. Ils permettent après l'enregistrement formel, l'ouverture du compte bancaire et l'intégration du rail de paiement. Les dons peuvent nécessiter des contrôles AML/KYC applicables. Aucun traitement fiscal ni déductibilité n’est réclamé.","All publications":"Toutes les publications","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"Une équipe IonQ a signalé un enchevêtrement hétérogène à l’échelle du kilohertz.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"Tout co-constructeur disposant d'un Civilization ID peut lancer une initiative sur n'importe quel sujet.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"N’importe qui peut lancer une initiative de civilisation","Apple Pay":"Apple Payer","Apply to become a payment partner":"Postulez pour devenir partenaire de paiement","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"À la date de l'examen de source publique du 10 novembre 2026, aucun enregistrement d'essai sur l'homme ou approbation réglementaire n'a été identifié pour cette indication de rayonnement MSC conçue par EC-SOD. Des identifiants de registre vérifiables et des documents d’autorisation restent nécessaires. Les essais d'autres formulations de SOD, de mimétiques ou de cellules pour d'autres maladies ne valident pas ce candidat.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"Évaluer les approches possibles pour prévenir ou traiter les radiolésions aux fins de la protection des civils et de la préparation de la santé publique. La documentation et l'examen scientifique sont en attente ; la sécurité et l’efficacité ne sont pas établies.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"Lors de cet examen, QCF n'a pas reçu de numéro d'enregistrement d'essai chez l'homme, d'autorisation réglementaire ou de preuve d'approbation de commercialisation pour ce candidat. Les progrès expérimentaux mis à jour, la réplication indépendante, la qualité de fabrication et le parcours de développement clinique restent à documenter.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"Bombardement atomique d'Hiroshima · Japon","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"BTQ × Kaia a annoncé une collaboration sur un réseau stablecoin à sécurité quantique.","Back to Civilization ID":"Retour à l'ID de civilisation","Back to Life Sciences":"Retour aux Sciences de la vie","Back to population figures":"Retour aux chiffres de population","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"Devenez un co-constructeur de civilisation","Become a co-builder":"Devenez co-constructeur","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"Devenez le prochain co-constructeur de civilisation","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"Avant de donner votre consentement, expliquez le but, le destinataire, la portée de la recherche, la durée de conservation et les risques. Évaluez les nouvelles utilisations séparément, y compris toute utilisation pour la formation en IA.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"Derrière chaque chiffre se cache une personne, une vie et une famille. Se souvenir des vies perdues fait de la paix, de la santé publique et de la sauvegarde de la vie une responsabilité partagée.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"Derrière chaque numéro se cachait un nom, une famille et une vie inachevée. Nous enregistrons les pertes pour chérir la vie aujourd’hui et soutenons la science pour protéger la vie de demain.","Bilingual PDF":"PDF bilingue","Bitcoin BTC":"BitcoinBTC","Black Death · Europe":"Peste noire · Europe","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"Limité par des preuves évaluées par des pairs et vérifiables","Browse published briefs":"Parcourir les mémoires publiés","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"Par l'architecte des civilisations Jessica Sage<br>Publié le 5 novembre 2026 · Reportage sur l'actualité nature : 4 novembre 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"CO-CONSTRUCTEUR DE CIVILISATION · ACCÈS AUX ARCHIVES PDF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"ID DE CIVILISATION × NU-KEY","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"CIVILISATION ID × NU-KEY · INITIATIVE MONDIALE DE RECHERCHE","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"Surmortalité associée au COVID-19 · monde","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"Aperçu du Musée canadien de la guerre ; personnel militaire/service uniquement, pas tous les décès de civils. Les entrées nationales ci-dessous se chevauchent.","Cards & wallets":"Cartes et portefeuilles","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"Les cellules comme usines de protéines antioxydantes : les recherches de Weiwen Deng sur les radiolésions","Check in":"Enregistrement","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"Choisissez un nouveau nom d'envoyé de civilisation. Votre identité d'origine peut rester cachée : affichez uniquement votre numéro d'identification ou votre nouveau nom.","Choose an amount":"Choisissez un montant","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"Estimation de la ville jusqu'à fin 1945 ; les effets combinés des explosions, des effets thermiques et des radiations, et non les décès dus aux radiations uniquement ou le bilan complet à long terme.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"Architecte de civilisation Jessica Sage | 10 novembre 2026 | Commentaire de recherche","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"Nom de l'envoyé de la civilisation (facultatif)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"Les envoyés de la civilisation sont invités à contribuer à des articles originaux, à des idées de recherche et à des comptes rendus d'actions d'intérêt public. Le travail accepté peut être enregistré comme une contribution liée à un Civilization ID et à des points Quantum Q.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"Les envoyés de la civilisation sont invités à contribuer. Partagez un travail véridique, clair et vérifiable : des connaissances au service de la vie et des actions qui connectent les gens.","Civilization ID":"ID de civilisation","Civilization ID and privacy":"Civilisation ID et confidentialité","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"Civilization ID reste actuellement un enregistrement de test gratuit sur navigateur local, il s'agit donc d'une porte de test plutôt que d'une identité vérifiée centrale. Une fois le système central Civilization ID en ligne, l'accès aux PDF sera mis à niveau vers une autorisation fiable côté serveur.","Civilization ID goal":"Objectif d'identification de civilisation","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Civilization ID est actuellement une démonstration frontale. Le stockage des données de santé clinique et les fonctions de gouvernance complètes décrites ici ne sont pas déployées. Ce site Web ne collecte pas de données génomiques personnelles.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"Civilization ID est envisagé comme un lien entre les contributions volontaires et les autorisations explicites. Les dossiers d’identité, de participation et les données sensibles sur la santé doivent être séparés ; L’ADN n’est pas obligé de participer. Le chiffrement doit fonctionner parallèlement aux limites d’objectifs, aux audits d’accès, à une gouvernance indépendante et au retrait des autorisations futures. Une pièce d’identité ne peut à elle seule garantir la confidentialité.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"Civilization ID prend en charge les enregistrements de participation et de contribution volontaires ; ce n'est pas une identité juridique. Les données ADN ou de santé ne sont pas nécessaires pour obtenir une pièce d’identité. Les tests gratuits actuels ne constituent pas un service d’identité central en direct.","Civilization ID · free testing":"Civilization ID · tests gratuits","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"Civilization ID : participation et autorisation","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"Civilization IDs et Q utilisent actuellement les enregistrements stockés dans ce navigateur à des fins de tests. L'inscription centrale, la réception des soumissions et les récompenses examinées sont en cours de connexion. Les tests sont gratuits et ne démarrent jamais automatiquement un abonnement.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"La civilisation commence avec tous ceux qui choisissent de commencer","Claim my Civilization ID":"Réclamez mon identifiant de civilisation","Claim your Civilization ID":"Réclamez votre identifiant de civilisation","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"Transmission à l'état de cluster sur 29 km d'ingénierie de réseau avancée en fibre partiellement déployée.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"Résumé de la civilisation de co-construction","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"Vote co-constructeur · Services de fondation","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"Co-construire la civilisation.<br>Sauvegarder la vie.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"Co-créer une civilisation. Chérir chaque vie.","Coming soon":"À venir","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"Évaluation préclinique complète de la sécurité de la biodistribution, de la persistance, des réponses immunitaires, du risque thrombotique, du vecteur résiduel et de la croissance tissulaire anormale. Les applications de la radiothérapie nécessitent également une évaluation des effets sur le contrôle des tumeurs.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"Connectez chaque contribution confirmée à votre identifiant via Quantum Q. Pendant les tests gratuits, les points de test du navigateur restent séparés des enregistrements de contribution officiels.","Contact":"Contact","Contact the preparatory team":"Contacter l'équipe préparatoire","Contribute to civilization":"Contribuer à la civilisation","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"Contribuez à notre mémoire commune →","Contribution history":"Historique des contributions","Contribution points Q":"Points de contribution Q","Contributions return to your ID":"Les cotisations reviennent sur votre identifiant","Controller":"Contrôleur","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"Les cellules qui sécrètent une protéine antioxydante pourraient-elles aider à atténuer les dommages tissulaires après une radiothérapie ? Les travaux publiés par Weiwen Deng et ses collègues fournissent des preuves provenant de souris et de cellules humaines in vitro. Il s'agit d'une approche préclinique qui mérite des tests plus approfondis ; ce n'est pas un traitement humain approuvé.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"La couverture sera mise à jour à partir de recherches originales traçables, les limites des preuves étant clairement précisées.","Create a local test ID":"Créer un identifiant de test local","Create an ID · free testing":"Créer un identifiant · tests gratuits","Crypto":"Cryptomonnaie","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"Étape actuelle : préparation, due diligence des partenaires et revue scientifique. Les essais cliniques, le dépistage public et la collecte de dons dans le cadre de ce programme n'ont pas encore commencé.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"Validation technique indépendante avancée DARPA QBI Stage C.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"L’ADN n’identifie pas directement la langue parlée par une personne. Les modèles génétiques doivent être interprétés parallèlement à l’archéologie et à la linguistique, et le changement linguistique ne doit pas nécessairement accompagner le remplacement de la population. Ces résultats aident à tester des hypothèses historiques ; ils ne décodent pas le discours ancien.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"PROJET · en attente d'examen juridique","Daily births · estimate":"Naissances quotidiennes · estimation","Daily check-in":"Enregistrement quotidien","Daily deaths · estimate":"Décès quotidiens · estimation","Dates / reporting period":"Dates / période de déclaration","Dates, lives lost and source records":"Dates, vies perdues et enregistrements sources","Deaths / fatality records":"Décès / dossiers de fatalité","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"Décès dans le résumé des cas probables de l’OMS ; les dates font référence à la période de début de la maladie.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"Définir un produit cellulaire humain reproductible : source, identité, activité EC-SOD et durée d'expression, variation du donneur, cohérence du lot, cryoconservation et production évolutive.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"Définir les bénéficiaires, les institutions de prestation, les budgets, les jalons et les résultats mesurables.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"Définir les protocoles, les approbations applicables et les exigences éthiques avant le début de la recherche. Distinguer les travaux exploratoires, les résultats validés et la commercialisation ; signaler l’incertitude et les résultats négatifs.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"Démo : appuyez pour essayer de lancer une initiative et recevoir 100 Q.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"Démo : votre email reste dans ce navigateur ; aucun véritable e-mail n’est envoyé.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"Deng et al. : atténuation des lésions radiologiques chez la souris à l’aide de cellules souches mésenchymateuses modifiées sécrétant de l’ECSOD. Weiwen Deng est répertorié comme premier auteur correspondant. Preuve : recherche préclinique.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"Développer des projets pilotes de recherche et de dépistage ciblés d’intérêt public avec des conditions, des populations et des soins de suivi définis. La portée sera définie après l'autorisation du partenaire, l'examen éthique et la vérification du protocole.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"Le développement des lésions radiologiques aiguës peut explorer des voies applicables telles que la FDA Animal Rule. Dans des conditions spécifiques, il permet des études d'efficacité animales contrôlées et adéquates pour étayer l'approbation, tout en conservant les exigences de sécurité humaine et de qualité des produits. L'éligibilité et l'approbation ne sont pas assurées. Les médicaments existants contre les lésions radiologiques devraient éclairer les besoins non satisfaits et la stratégie de comparaison.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"La prévention des maladies, le NAD⁺ et les mécanismes du vieillissement, la recherche unicellulaire et régénérative, la génomique de l’IA et l’épigénétique sont des domaines qui feront l’objet d’une couverture continue. Les mémoires QCF distingueront les études cellulaires et animales des essais sur l'homme et des preuves cliniques. Un changement dans un marqueur d’âge biologique ne constitue pas une preuve d’une vie plus longue.","Disease remembrance":"Souvenir de la maladie","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"La collecte des dons et les souscriptions automatiques ne sont pas ouvertes. 100 millions de CHF constituent la demande proposée pour la première phase, et non les fonds collectés, promis ou approuvés. Les budgets et les frais détaillés nécessitent une diligence raisonnable et un examen de la gouvernance applicable.","Donations":"Dons","Donations received":"Dons reçus","Download bilingual PDF":"Télécharger le PDF bilingue","Download submission template":"Télécharger le modèle de soumission","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"Note éditoriale : il s’agit d’un résumé et d’un commentaire QCF rédigés indépendamment, et non d’une reproduction ou d’une traduction officielle de l’article de Nature. L'auteur original de la nouvelle est Ewen Callaway ; le crédit de recherche appartient aux auteurs et aux institutions des articles. L’accès à l’article complet de l’actualité Nature peut nécessiter un abonnement.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"Revue éditoriale : 2 novembre 2026. Ces organisations sont citées comme sources ; aucun partenariat, autorisation ou approbation de QCF n’est implicite.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"Email : [à configurer, par ex. contact@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"Identité cryptée","Encryption and key control":"Chiffrement et contrôle des clés","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"Engager les régulateurs et les comités d’éthique pour établir la classification des produits, les normes de qualité, le parcours de développement et les conditions préalables à la recherche humaine. Ce n'est qu'après les autorisations nécessaires que les premières études humaines axées sur la sécurité, la tolérabilité et l'activité biologique mesurable pourraient être envisagées.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"Fourchette d’estimation dans la revue historique de l’OMS.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"Fourchette d’estimation dans la revue historique de l’OMS ; les estimations varient selon les publications.","Ethereum ETH":"Ethereum ETH","Event and population":"Événement et population","Every action is remembered by civilization":"Chaque action est mémorisée par la civilisation","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"Chaque jour, nous nous connectons. À nos téléphones, à nos e-mails, à nos banques, à nos services de santé, à nos portails gouvernementaux et à nos comptes cloud. Au-delà des frontières, nous répétons les mots de passe, les codes et les contrôles d’identité. Nos vies sont fragmentées entre des centaines de portes numériques.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"Chaque vie mérite dignité et souvenir.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"Chaque vie mérite le respect. Chaque utilisation de données personnelles nécessite des limites claires.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"Chaque nouvelle vie mérite un accueil doux.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"Chaque dépense parmi les 94 % est décidée par le vote des co-constructeurs.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"Preuves examinées : 2 novembre 2026 | Préparation du programme et diligence raisonnable","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"Explorez NU-Key et l'héritage numérique","Explore Phase One →":"Explorez la première phase →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"Explorez la collaboration entre les innovateurs chinois en matière de médicaments et les partenaires européens de recherche, cliniques et industriels. La recherche d’intérêt public, l’accès des patients et la traduction commerciale nécessitent des objectifs, des budgets et des droits distincts.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"Explorez la mémoire et les sources de la maladie →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"Explorez l'histoire génomique et la vision de la première phase","Explore the life-sciences programme":"Découvrez le programme Sciences de la vie","Explore the phase-one programme":"Explorez le programme de la première phase","Explore the principles":"Découvrez les principes","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"Explorez les souvenirs et les sources de la guerre →","First World War · Australia":"Première Guerre mondiale · Australie","First World War · British military":"Première Guerre mondiale · Militaire britannique","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Première Guerre mondiale · Le Canada et Terre-Neuve","First World War · global military":"Première Guerre mondiale · armée mondiale","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"Ensemble de données de première édition · Révisé et référentiel mis à jour : 2 novembre 2026 · Statistiques non actuelles","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"Pour moi, la valeur de cette recherche réside dans le rapprochement des disciplines. Les sciences de la vie mettent en lumière les mouvements passés ; l'archéologie et la linguistique nous aident à interpréter ces rencontres. Les langues et les cultures que nous connaissons aujourd’hui méritent d’être comprises dans le cadre d’une histoire plus longue d’échanges humains.","Founder":"Fondateur","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"Quatre pandémies historiques sélectionnées · Somme des estimations inférieures","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"Il y a quatorze milliards d’années, l’univers commençait à partir d’un seul point. Il y a quatre milliards d’années, la vie s’est copiée pour la première fois dans l’océan. Aujourd’hui, huit milliards de personnes partagent une planète bleue – toujours divisées par les frontières, la couleur, la langue et les croyances.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"Les travaux de magnétométrie NV-diamant de Fraunhofer sont devenus candidats pour un PoC de surveillance de l'énergie.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"Tests gratuits · Les enregistrements restent actuellement dans ce navigateur. Il ne s’agit pas d’une émission centrale d’identité ou d’une vérification par courrier électronique. Les comptes réels et les enregistrements multi-appareils s'ouvriront lorsque le service d'enregistrement sera connecté.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"De 1990 à 2003, le Projet Génome Humain a établi les bases du génome humain de référence. Le NIH et le ministère de l'Énergie ont soutenu l'effort américain ; les institutions de séquençage venaient des États-Unis, du Royaume-Uni, de France, d’Allemagne, du Japon et de Chine. Cela a démontré la puissance de la collaboration internationale et du partage des connaissances.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"De la leçon de HeLa à la responsabilité de Civilization ID","From first login to a lasting legacy":"De la première connexion à un héritage durable","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"Du laboratoire à la clinique : les prochaines questions de recherche","From one idea to a civilization in action":"D'une idée à une civilisation en action","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"De la lecture du génome à la sauvegarde de la vie","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"Des données probantes issues de la recherche à la sauvegarde de la vie","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"De la compréhension des génomes à la protection de chaque personne","From vision to verifiable action":"De la vision à l’action vérifiable","Fund management":"Gestion de fonds","Funding and oversight":"Financement et surveillance","Funding during preparation":"Financement pendant la préparation","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"Rassemblez les co-constructeurs de civilisation du monde entier pour co-construire, enregistrer, transmettre et sauvegarder la civilisation humaine.","Genomic health research":"Recherche en santé génomique","Get Civilization ID":"Créer un identifiant de civilisation","Get your ID":"Obtenez votre pièce d'identité","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Initiative des co-constructeurs de la civilisation mondiale","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"Initiative des co-constructeurs de la civilisation mondiale · Phase préparatoire","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"Résumés mondiaux de la technologie quantique et de l’écosystème énergétique","Google Pay":"Google Payer","Governance":"Gouvernance","Governance and funding principles":"Principes de gouvernance et de financement","Governance service":"Service de gouvernance","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"Décès liés au VIH · cumulatif mondial","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"HeLa nous rappelle que préserver les savoirs passe aussi par le respect de chaque personne qui les porte. Civilization ID est envisagé comme un point d'entrée pour les enregistrements de participation volontaire et d'autorisation, sans exposer l'ADN, les dossiers médicaux ou les relations familiales. La protection nécessite le cryptage, la séparation de l’identité et des données, une autorisation spécifique à un objectif précis et un audit des accès.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"Contribuez à construire une civilisation numérique centrée sur l’humain","Help safeguard life":"Aidez à sauvegarder la vie","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"Ici, vous pouvez prendre un nouveau nom : votre nom d'Envoyé de Civilisation. Vous pouvez laisser le passé caché et apparaître uniquement comme votre identifiant ou votre nouveau nom. Vous adhérez par libre arbitre et avancez par contribution volontaire. Chaque partage, chaque initiative, chaque action devient un Q quantique doré, revenant à votre ID.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"Cacher mon identité d'origine ; afficher uniquement ma pièce d'identité ou mon nom d'envoyé","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"Total cumulé historique : pas de chiffre mondial fiable","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"Estimation historique citée par l'OMS, Europe uniquement ; pas l'enregistrement des cas contemporains. Aucune date de début/fin exacte dans cette source.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"Personnage historique dans le guide de recherche des Archives nationales du Royaume-Uni ; pas un total mondial.","History and our genomic-health vision":"Histoire et notre vision génomique-santé","Home":"Accueil","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"Comment les génomes anciens aident à retracer la propagation des langues germaniques et celtiques","How initiatives work":"Comment fonctionnent les initiatives","Human research and regulatory evidence":"Recherche humaine et preuves réglementaires","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"J'ai lu les <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Confidentialité</a> et les <a class=gold href=terms.html>Conditions</a> et je comprends qu'il s'agit d'une démo ; les frais sont ouverts après inscription","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"IBM × ORNL × AMD a lancé une plateforme de co-conception pour la correction des erreurs ; Chicago System Two soutient également la recherche sur l'optimisation du réseau.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"Les détenteurs d'une carte d'identité peuvent lancer des initiatives sur n'importe quel sujet ; les supporters donnent volontairement. 94 % des fonds sont alloués par le vote des co-constructeurs ; QCF facture des frais de plateforme et de gouvernance de 6 %.","IDs registered":"Pièces d'identité enregistrées","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 a intégré ML-DSA dans l'identité sécurisée de l'appareil.","Impressum":"Mentions légales","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"L’émulation classique améliorée renforce le besoin de lignes de base classiques actuelles.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"En 1951, des échantillons de tumeurs d'Henrietta Lacks, qui recevait un traitement pour un cancer du col de l'utérus, ont été utilisés à des fins de recherche à son insu et sans son consentement. La lignée cellulaire HeLa qui en résulte a apporté des contributions majeures à la médecine, tout en soulevant des questions persistantes sur le consentement, la confidentialité et le partage équitable des bénéfices.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"En 2013, le NIH et la famille Lacks sont parvenus à un accord sur l’accès contrôlé aux données pertinentes du génome entier HeLa. « Immortel » décrit la capacité de la lignée cellulaire à continuer à se diviser dans des conditions de laboratoire appropriées, et non l'immortalité d'Henrietta Lacks elle-même.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"En 2026, QCF prévoit de développer une initiative pour un accès plus équitable au séquençage du génome. En collaboration avec des spécialistes de la recherche, des soins de santé et de l’éthique, nous visons à aider les gens à comprendre leurs informations génomiques grâce à des choix éclairés et à un soutien professionnel approprié. Dans un futur système sécurisé, les individus pourraient choisir de lier les enregistrements génomiques à un identifiant de civilisation émis de manière indépendante.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"Dans l’article de recherche du Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy de 2015, Deng est le premier auteur correspondant. Il revisite les résultats de survie antérieurs et rapporte un suivi parmi les souris survivantes : une prolongation de la durée de vie signalée de 207 jours et un retard de 39 jours dans la formation de la cataracte. Aucune tumeur n'a été observée dans le groupe traité, alors qu'une tumeur abdominale a été observée dans le groupe salin. La taille de la cohorte, la sélection des survivants, la pathologie tumorale et la réplication indépendante nécessitent un examen minutieux. Ces observations n’établissent pas une prévention générale du cancer ou une prolongation de la durée de vie. Les articles décrivent des travaux connexes, et non deux réplications indépendantes.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Initiative des co-constructeurs de la civilisation mondiale","Initiatives":"Initiatives","Initiator":"Initiateur","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"Les initiateurs publient les coûts et les dépenses au fur et à mesure de leur action.","International drug-research collaboration":"Collaboration internationale en matière de recherche sur les médicaments","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"Sa valeur publique réside dans une approche testable de la médecine d’urgence radiologique. Il ne s’agit ni d’une radiothérapie complète ni d’un vaccin validé. Des expériences reproductibles doivent relier le concept à tout bénéfice futur pour le patient.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"Jessica Sage (fondatrice). Adresse : [à ajouter]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"Participez aux tests gratuits : essayez l'inscription, l'enregistrement et le partage. Les récompenses officielles des contributions dépendent de dossiers examinés et confirmés.","LATEST ISSUED":"DERNIÈRE ÉMISSION","Launch":"Lancement","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"Lancer une initiative de civilisation","Launch initiative":"Initiative de lancement","Launch initiative (demo)":"Initiative de lancement (démo)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"Lancez-vous avec votre identifiant : objectif, budget, jalons. +100 Q","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"Lancé en 1990, le Projet Génome Humain a rassemblé des institutions de recherche par le biais du Consortium international de séquençage du génome humain. En 2003, elle a livré sa séquence du génome humain de référence, une base pour comprendre la vie, plutôt que de séquencer chaque personne.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"Apprendre de l’histoire de HeLa","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"Laissez votre contribution faire partie de notre histoire commune","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"Les établissements de paiement agréés, les portefeuilles et les fournisseurs de cryptographie conformes sont invités à devenir des partenaires de co-construction de civilisation et à contribuer à la création de rails de dons mondiaux.","Life Sciences":"Sciences de la vie","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"Sciences de la vie et sauvegarde de la vie","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"Sciences de la vie | Nature rapporte de nouvelles recherches sur l’ADN ancien ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Sciences de la vie | L'expérience biotechnologique d'une seule personne : IA, robotique et découverte de médicaments ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"La vie a une fin. La civilisation doit continuer.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"Les sciences de la vie constituent notre priorité de première phase. L’énergie et l’informatique, ainsi que l’éducation à la civilisation, restent des axes de recherche et de collaboration à long terme.","Life-science directions we will follow":"Orientations des sciences de la vie que nous suivrons","Life-sciences news":"Actualités des sciences de la vie","Life-sciences programme":"Programme de sciences de la vie","Link my DNA":"Lier mon ADN","Live version (planned)":"Version live (prévue)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"Vies perdues à la guerre · Estimation","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"Vies perdues à cause des épidémies et des maladies · Estimation","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"Objectif à long terme : 1 000 000 d’identifiants de civilisation. Demande proposée pour la première phase dans le domaine des sciences de la vie : 100 000 000 CHF ; pas les fonds collectés ou promis.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"La perte de conscience n'est pas la mort. Un signal respiratoire ou un événement biométrique ne doit jamais déclencher de manière indépendante un transfert d’actifs irréversible. La délégation d’urgence et l’héritage nécessitent des garanties distinctes, un consentement documenté, une vérification indépendante et un examen juridique. Civilization ID ne remplace pas les passeports, l'identité électronique nationale ou le KYC bancaire.","Manage future permissions":"Gérer les futures autorisations","Mastercard":"MasterCard","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"Méthode : projections 2026 ; les naissances et les décès sont des moyennes quotidiennes annuelles arrondies et non des décomptes vivants pour aujourd’hui.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"Méthode : ces résumés d'enregistrements sélectionnés ont été compilés par QCF et non publiés sous forme de totaux combinés par les organisations sources. Ce ne sont pas des décomptes en direct. Les deux catégories peuvent se chevaucher et ne doivent pas être additionnées. Vérifié et référentiel mis à jour : 2026-11-02.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"Des indices de migration, interprétés aux côtés de preuves linguistiques","Mission":"Mission","My ID":"Mon identifiant","My contribution":"Ma contribution","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"Extrait de NARA du 29 avril 2008. Les dates d’incidents/décès enregistrés s’étendent sur la période 1956-2006, et non sur la durée de la guerre. Décès hostiles et non hostiles ; pas tout le bilan de la guerre.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"Le NIST IR 8547 a défini une feuille de route pour la transition de la cryptographie post-quantique.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"Le NIST PQC était prêt à être mis en œuvre ; la détection et la métrologie sont devenues des candidats fiables à long terme.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"Le travail du peigne de fréquence optique à l'échelle d'une puce du NIST pointe vers une métrologie de précision compacte.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"Massacre de Nankin · Chine","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"Nature rapporte de nouvelles recherches sur l’ADN ancien","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"L'horloge nucléaire Nature Thorium-229 étudie la métrologie quantique avancée et la synchronisation de précision.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"L'interface spin-photon d'une molécule unique de la nature et la coexistence de fibres quantiques et classiques sont entrées dans le radar de la recherche.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"Le reportage d’Ewen Callaway sur Nature’s News, publié le 4 novembre 2026, examine de nouvelles preuves génétiques pertinentes pour l’histoire des langues européennes. Cette note du QCF s'appuie sur ce rapport, un résumé de recherche et l'annonce de l'université participante.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"Prochaine identification de civilisation à émettre","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"Aucune affiliation ou approbation par les Nations Unies n’est implicite.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"Aucun e-mail n'est envoyé et la propriété de l'e-mail n'est pas vérifiée.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"Aucune série mondiale de mortalité ne couvre toutes les maladies depuis l’émergence de la civilisation. Cette édition contient dix enregistrements historiques d'épidémies, cumulatifs et annuels provenant de l'OMS, principalement des maladies infectieuses. Ce n’est pas exhaustif. Les chiffres antérieurs à l'OMS sont des estimations historiques citées par l'OMS.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"Aucun registre harmonisé ne couvre toutes les guerres et tous les pays depuis l’émergence de la civilisation. Cette édition contient neuf documents de guerre, nationaux et événementiels, concentrés dans l'histoire moderne. Les conflits antiques et médiévaux et de nombreuses régions ne sont pas encore couverts. Les entrées manquantes ne signifient pas zéro décès.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"Aucune information sur la nationalité, la race ou les croyances n’est nécessaire. Utilisez un exemple d'e-mail pour des tests gratuits ; les véritables détails d’identité ne sont pas requis.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"Aucune déclaration n'est faite sur le traitement fiscal d'un don.","No tax claims":"Aucune réclamation fiscale","No use without clear authorization":"Aucune utilisation sans autorisation claire","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"Horloges nucléaires, intrication hétérogène et analyse comparative indépendante en tête de la semaine","Of every 100 donated":"Sur 100 donnés","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"Un humain. Un identifiant de civilisation. Un héritage numérique. Explorez une passerelle d'identité universelle et un avenir où les actifs numériques, les empreintes et les souvenirs pourront être préservés, supprimés ou transmis légalement par choix.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"Une entrée de don. Les montants sont en francs suisses (CHF). Les paiements sont ouverts une fois que la fondation est officiellement enregistrée et que l’intégration de la conformité est terminée.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"Une personne. Un identifiant de civilisation.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"Ouvrir les brèves archives QCF-E →","Open my ID":"Ouvrir ma carte d'identité","Opens after formal registration":"Ouverture après inscription formelle","Operator":"Opérateur","Optional DNA linking":"Liaison ADN facultative","Original papers and further reading":"Articles originaux et lectures complémentaires","Original work and sources":"Œuvre originale et sources","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"Notre mission à long terme · Trois piliers","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"Oxford a démontré l'intrication à distance d'espèces mixtes et le stockage quantique d'environ 10 secondes.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"Le PQC entre dans l'infrastructure des actifs numériques tandis que le réseau passe à la fibre déployée","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"PQC passe des normes d'algorithme à la migration et à l'identité des appareils","Participation without DNA":"Participation sans ADN","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"Les institutions partenaires et les conseillers scientifiques seront publiés après autorisation et vérification.","Partner seat open":"Siège partenaire ouvert","Patent publications and rights verification":"Publications de brevets et vérification des droits","PayPal":"Paypal","Payment Partners":"Partenaires de paiement","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"Les gens peuvent créer une pièce d'identité, rédiger des articles et obtenir une reconnaissance de leur contribution sans fournir d'ADN. Les récompenses de contribution et les avantages spéciaux ne doivent pas dépendre de la fourniture de données génomiques ou du consentement à la recherche génomique.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"Objectif phase 1 : 100 000 000 CHF. Les phases ultérieures ne sont pas affichées sur cette page.","Phase-1 goals":"Objectifs de la phase 1","Phase-one funding ambition":"Ambition de financement de la première phase","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"Planifiez des budgets et des enregistrements de projet distincts avec des revues d'étapes. Divulguer les coûts administratifs, l'utilisation des fonds et la surveillance ; publiez l'entité réceptrice et le compte une fois prêts.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"Système central prévu : un identifiant de civilisation à 10 chiffres (préfixe de vague à 4 chiffres + séquence à 6 chiffres) : la vague Genesis 2026 émet les numéros 2026000001 un par un ; après 999999, la vague 2029 commence à 2029000001 avec code de vérification et clé d'identité, signés numériquement par la fondation et vérifiables publiquement.","Platform use":"Utilisation de la plateforme","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"Veuillez inclure l'événement, les dates, le lieu, la population, l'estimation de la mortalité et le lien source d'origine. Les contributions seront examinées avant leur inclusion. Ne soumettez pas de données personnelles de santé ou d’identité sans autorisation.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"Métrologie de précision, réseaux hétérogènes et benchmarks classiques avancent ensemble","Preparatory stage":"Étape préparatoire","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"Site Web de la phase préparatoire. La fondation doit être créée à Zoug, en Suisse, et n'est pas encore enregistrée ; Les fonctionnalités disponibles du site Web peuvent être testées gratuitement avant l’inscription. Les souscriptions et les dons sont ouverts après inscription formelle ; les tests ne se convertissent jamais automatiquement en un forfait payant. Q est un point de contribution non transférable – pas une crypto-monnaie, sans valeur monétaire et non négociable. Aucune déductibilité fiscale n'est demandée.","Prepare a contribution":"Préparer une contribution","Prepare a reviewable submission":"Préparer une soumission révisable","Privacy":"Confidentialité","Privacy Policy":"politique de confidentialité","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"Procéder par étapes une fois les prérequis remplis ; divulguer les résultats, les limites et l’utilisation des fonds.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"Demande de don proposée · Pas de fonds collectés · Pas un engagement de financement","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"Protégez la vie privée tout en grandissant. Naviguez dans l’identité au-delà des frontières. Gouvernez l’accès des entreprises et des agents IA. Préparez des délégués de confiance à mesure que nous vieillissons. Conserver, supprimer ou transmettre des actifs numériques sélectionnés selon nos souhaits et la loi applicable.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"Fournissez le nom d’un auteur ou d’un envoyé et des liens vers des articles originaux, des annonces institutionnelles ou des sources vérifiables. Autorisation sécurisée pour le matériel cité, les images et la coauteur si nécessaire.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"Bénéfice public et intérêts commerciaux","Publications and journal records":"Publications et archives de revues","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"Q est un point de contribution enregistré sous un identifiant de civilisation. Il n’est ni transférable, ni négociable, ni une cryptomonnaie ou un instrument financier, n’a aucune valeur monétaire et ne peut être échangé contre de l’argent.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q est un point de contribution non transférable – pas une crypto-monnaie, aucune valeur monétaire, non négociable.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"Q est un enregistrement de contribution, pas d'argent.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q est l'initiale de Quantum et de QCF. L'anneau doré contient un champ d'étoiles : chaque point de lumière à l'intérieur est un co-constructeur de civilisation, disposé dans une spirale à angle doré – l'ordre naturel partagé par les tournesols et les galaxies, chaque point étant unique mais faisant partie d'un tout. La lumière la plus brillante au centre est la lumière de la genèse, le premier co-constructeur. La queue est une particule en transition : l'action unique qui commence avec une personne et change le tout.","Q issued today":"Q publié aujourd'hui","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"Q reste avec votre identifiant de civilisation : non transférable, non échangeable, sans valeur monétaire. Les données de démonstration ne résident que dans ce navigateur.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF SCIENCES DE LA VIE · BREF DE RECHERCHE","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"QCF vise à soutenir la préparation médicale civile grâce à des dossiers reproductibles, un examen indépendant et un développement par étapes soumis aux exigences éthiques, réglementaires et de qualité. La sauvegarde de la civilisation commence par le respect de la vie, des participants à la recherche et des preuves scientifiques.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"Évaluation QCF : donner la priorité aux infrastructures énergétiques à sécurité quantique.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"QCF rassemble les gens pour construire, préserver et sauvegarder la civilisation humaine. Notre première phase se concentre sur la collaboration internationale dans les sciences de la vie : recherche vérifiable, innovation responsable et connaissances partagées pour renforcer la résilience aux crises sanitaires et de santé publique majeures.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"QCF suit en permanence les développements majeurs dans les domaines de l'informatique quantique, de la détection, des communications, de la cryptographie post-quantique, des réseaux et de la métrologie, en évaluant la pertinence pratique pour la mesure de l'énergie, les données fiables, les communications sécurisées, le RWA et l'infrastructure. Cette page ne contient que des titres et des résumés concis ; Les PDF bilingues chinois-anglais sont conservés en tant qu'archives de recherche QCF à long terme.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"Base de déploiement QCF : calcul, détection, communications, PQC et métrologie","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"Évaluation éditoriale du QCF : une évaluation scientifique par étapes est justifiée. Les spécialistes concernés doivent examiner les données originales, les méthodes statistiques et la réplication indépendante, ainsi que la puissance, la sécurité et la qualité de fabrication des cellules humaines, avant de juger de la faisabilité clinique. Des recherches plus approfondies nécessitent également une propriété claire, des autorisations d'utilisation des données et des responsabilités.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"QCF établi : mesure fiable → communication sécurisée → vérification Oracle → règlement RWA / grand livre.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"QCF invite les historiens, les professionnels de la santé, les archives et tous les co-bâtisseurs de civilisation à contribuer aux enregistrements vérifiables des vies perdues. Ensemble, nous pouvons mettre en lumière des histoires négligées, préserver des connaissances fiables et transformer les soins et le soutien en actions pour sauvegarder la vie.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"QCF devrait être établi à Zoug, en Suisse et est actuellement en préparation, pas encore enregistré. Cette page décrit les principes proposés ; cela ne signifie pas que tous les mécanismes soient opérationnels.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"Perspective QCF : un enregistrement partagé de la vie humaine","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"QCF propose Civilization ID × NU-Key : une vision de recherche ouverte pour une identité numérique auto-contrôlée, des informations d'identification vérifiables, un accès sécurisé, un inventaire des actifs numériques et un héritage numérique licite. Une clé universelle n’est pas un mot de passe principal qui contourne toutes les plateformes. Il s'agit d'une passerelle contrôlée par l'utilisateur qui coordonne les informations d'identification et les autorisations distinctes.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"QCF cherche à rendre les connaissances vérifiables plus accessibles, en encourageant la curiosité sur les origines humaines et le souci de la diversité culturelle. La recherche sur notre passé commun ne devrait jamais être utilisée pour classer les communautés actuelles ou prescrire leurs identités. Préserver les connaissances est une façon de prendre soin des générations suivantes.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"Vision QCF : un accès plus équitable à la santé génomique","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E ne fait pas la promotion d’allégations non vérifiées sur « l’énergie quantique ». On distingue les expériences, les prototypes, les annonces d'entreprises et les spéculations ; les technologies quantiques n'entrent les déclarations de capacité QCF qu'après une validation reproductible dans un cas d'utilisation défini.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"Prochaine étape du QCF : due diligence scientifique par étapes","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"Quantinuum Helios a signalé des progrès dans la correction des erreurs de mémoire logique.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"Fondation Civilisation Quantique (en formation). À établir dans le canton de Zoug, Suisse ; non encore inscrite au registre du commerce et sans personnalité juridique.","Quantum Civilization University":"Université de civilisation quantique","Quantum Q · free testing":"Quantum Q · tests gratuits","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"Technologie quantique pour l'énergie terrestre ⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"L'informatique quantique converge avec le HPC ; progrès dans la fabrication des communications et des appareils","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"La détection quantique devient un candidat prioritaire pour la validation énergétique QCF","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"Sciences de la vie axées sur le quantum","RMB stablecoin":"Stablecoin RMB","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"Préparation médicale aux radiolésions","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"Découvrez HeLa et la protection des données de santé","Read our life-sciences brief":"Lire notre dossier sur les sciences de la vie","Read our mission":"Lire notre mission","Read the civilization brief":"Lire la brève civilisation","Reading and extending this record":"Lecture et extension de ce disque","Ready to launch yours?":"Prêt à lancer le vôtre ?","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"Enregistrer la civilisation · Sauvegarder la vie · Construire la civilisation ensemble","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"Enregistrer, sauvegarder et construire ensemble la civilisation","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"Enregistrer la civilisation, c'est préserver les connaissances, les contributions et les recherches traçables. Sauvegarder la civilisation signifie protéger la vie et les choix individuels. Construire la civilisation ensemble signifie partager les bénéfices de la coopération internationale.","Register a Civilization ID":"Enregistrez un identifiant de civilisation","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"Reste à l'objectif de la Phase 1 (CHF)","Remembering lives lost in war":"En souvenir des vies perdues pendant la guerre","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"En souvenir des vies perdues à cause des épidémies et des maladies","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"Reproduisez l'efficacité des animaux de manière indépendante, en utilisant des contrôles appropriés, une randomisation et une évaluation en aveugle pour examiner la survie, la réponse à la dose et la fenêtre de traitement post-exposition.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"Rapport de l'architecte des civilisations Jessica Sage · Mis à jour chaque semaine","Research approach and evidence status":"Approche de recherche et état des preuves","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"Concept de recherche uniquement : NU-Key, la connexion multiplateforme et l'héritage numérique automatique ne sont pas actuellement des services opérationnels. Aucun accès à un compte tiers ni aucun transfert d'actifs n'est proposé.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"Les institutions de recherche, les spécialistes cliniques, les experts en éthique et en gouvernance des données, ainsi que les sympathisants philanthropiques sont invités à entamer une conversation. Veuillez partager une introduction institutionnelle et un résumé non confidentiel ; n’envoyez pas par courrier électronique des données génomiques personnelles, des dossiers médicaux ou des détails de brevet non publiés.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"Chercheur et fondation scientifique","Reset demo":"Réinitialiser la démo","Responsible person":"Personne responsable","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"Repenser l'humanité : souveraineté des données sur la santé humaine et partage équitable des bénéfices ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"Repenser l'humanité : la physique quantique redéfinit notre compréhension de la réalité","Review and recognition":"Bilan et reconnaissance","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"Tableau d'honneur jusqu'au 31 mars 1921 ; le chiffre le plus étroit pour la période du 4 août 1914 au 11 novembre 1918 est de 59 357. Ne les ajoutez pas.","SARS · global":"SRAS · mondial","Sample initiative":"Exemple d'initiative","Science and ethics":"Science et éthique","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"La science au service de la vie.<br>Collaboration au-delà des frontières.","Scope and limitations":"Portée et limites","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"Faites défiler horizontalement pour le tableau complet. Ouvrez chaque source pour l'enregistrement original ; lire les dates et les chiffres ainsi que leur portée.","Seat 1":"Siège 1","Seat 2":"Siège 2","Seat 3":"Siège 3","Seat 4":"Siège 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"Les sièges sont des espaces réservés. Les partenariats formels nécessitent une diligence raisonnable et un accord écrit. Contactez-nous par e-mail en attendant la mise en ligne de la fondation.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Seconde Guerre mondiale · Canada et Terre-Neuve","Second World War · global estimate":"Seconde Guerre mondiale · estimation globale","Security verification":"Vérification de sécurité","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"Voir Mentions légales. En vertu de la loi fédérale suisse sur la protection des données (nDSG) et du RGPD le cas échéant.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"Recherchez une expertise indépendante pertinente pour examiner les preuves, l'éthique et la faisabilité de la recherche.","Selected":"Sélectionné","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"Documents sélectionnés sur deux guerres mondiales · Populations partielles","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"Décès militaires, y compris les blessures et les maladies ; la date limite commémorative s'étend jusqu'au 31 août 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"Partager un lien (max 10/jour)","Share link":"Partager le lien","Source":"Source","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"Source prioritaire : archives nationales, statistiques officielles et institutions publiques de mémoire ; OMS pour les données sur les maladies. Les résumés historiques officiels peuvent eux-mêmes utiliser des estimations. Les ajouts doivent identifier la période, la géographie, la population, le type de figure et la version source ; les définitions contradictoires sont expliquées plutôt que combinées en un total précis.","Sources and further reading":"Sources et lectures complémentaires","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"Les sources documentent l'histoire et les recherches ; la citation n’implique pas de partenariat, de financement ou d’approbation du QCF.","Stablecoins":"Pièces stables","Start free testing":"Commencez les tests gratuits","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"Démarrage en institut et cours ouverts (vision) : enregistrer, étudier, transmettre et co-construire la civilisation. Les diplômes nécessitent l’accréditation applicable.","Status":"Statut","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"Statut : préparation et due diligence | Mise à jour : 2 novembre 2026","Support":"Assistance","Support (opening soon)":"Support (ouverture prochaine)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Soutenez l'Initiative des co-constructeurs de la civilisation mondiale","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"Les supporters donnent volontairement (ouvre après inscription).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"Soutenir l'utilisation de l'informatique quantique, de la détection quantique et de l'IA dans la découverte de médicaments, la médecine de précision et la recherche sur la longévité en bonne santé, dans les limites de la science évaluée par les pairs. Aucun avis médical ni allégation de santé.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"Soutenir les applications vérifiables de l'informatique quantique, de la détection, des communications, du PQC et de la métrologie dans la recherche énergétique. Les titres et résumés hebdomadaires sont publiés ouvertement ; Les PDF bilingues sont archivés en permanence pour l'accès à Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"Stablecoin en franc suisse","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"L'infrastructure quantique suisse, la planification du réseau quantique du DOE et EuroQCI formaient la liste de surveillance initiale.","TWINT":"TWINT","Terms":"Conditions","Terms of Use":"Conditions d'utilisation","Test email:":"E-mail test :","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"Les tests sont gratuits avant l'inscription formelle. Les services d'abonnement et les avantages spéciaux pour les premiers Envoyés suivront les règles annoncées à ce moment-là. Les tests ne déclenchent jamais de frais automatiques.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"La correspondance sanguine de 2009 d'Abdel-Mageed et ses collègues répertorie Deng comme auteur correspondant. Un vecteur adénoviral a été utilisé pour exprimer la superoxyde dismutase extracellulaire, EC-SOD (SOD3), dans les cellules stromales/souches mésenchymateuses (CSM) de la moelle osseuse de souris. Les souris ont reçu 500 000 cellules modifiées par voie intraveineuse 24 heures après une irradiation corporelle totale de 9 Gy. La survie rapportée à 35 jours était de 52 %, contre 10 % pour la solution saline et 9 % pour les cellules modifiées par un gène rapporteur. Ces résultats concernent un modèle de souris spécifique et ne peuvent être convertis en bénéfice attendu pour l’homme.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"L'article de 2015 démontre également la transduction et la sécrétion adénovirales d'EC-SOD biologiquement active par les CSM de la moelle osseuse humaine in vitro. Les expériences sur des cellules humaines ne sont pas des essais cliniques sur des humains. La revue est Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, qui ne doit pas être confondue avec des revues portant le même nom.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"Le CV 2023 répertorie séparément US7 547 545 et la demande 18/199 975 concernant la différenciation cellulaire et l'amélioration de la réponse immunitaire vaccinale. Ils n’établissent pas l’octroi d’un brevet ou l’efficacité du candidat radioactif.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"Les 6% décrits sur la page des initiatives sont une proposition de plateforme-services existante. Le programme des sciences de la vie disposera de son propre budget divulgué. Les points de contribution ou les votes du public ne remplacent pas le jugement scientifique ou éthique.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"Le CV mentionne un poste de directeur de cytogénétique chez LabCorp Integrated Oncology à partir de 2017 ; il ne s’agit pas d’une confirmation d’une nomination en cours pour 2026. Les rôles actuels, l’autorisation institutionnelle et les responsabilités QCF nécessitent une vérification mise à jour. Les publications et dossiers de brevets ci-dessous peuvent être consultés indépendamment.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"L'identifiant de la civilisation Genesis","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"L'expérience biotechnologique d'une seule personne : IA, robotique et découverte de médicaments ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"La Quantum Civilization Foundation croit que notre véritable identité commune est simplement celle-ci : un membre de la civilisation humaine. À tous ceux qui le souhaitent, nous délivrons une carte d'identité de civilisation : elle ne demande jamais d'où vous venez, mais enregistre uniquement ce que vous apportez à la civilisation.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"L'Administration des archives de l'État présente une enquête archivistique de Nanjing datant de février 1946, enregistrant plus de 300 000 personnes. Enquête historique ; un sous-ensemble de décès pendant la guerre en Chine.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"L'Université de Göteborg rapporte l'analyse de l'ADN de plus de 4 500 individus anciens, dont 712 génomes nouvellement séquencés. Les chercheurs suggèrent que les migrants entrés en Scandinavie il y a environ 4 000 ans pourraient avoir transporté un ancêtre précoce des langues germaniques. Une migration ultérieure, plusieurs siècles avant l'ère viking, a coïncidé avec l'émergence du vieux norrois.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"Le dossier de candidature et le budget échelonné sont en préparation. L'utilisation des fonds, les coûts administratifs, la sélection et la surveillance des projets seront définis après une diligence raisonnable. Cette page ne collecte pas de paiements.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"La signature identifie le commentaire éditorial de QCF. La recherche originale appartient à ses auteurs et aux titulaires de droits concernés. La citation n’implique aucune approbation institutionnelle ou licence technologique.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"L'étude complémentaire celtique analyse les données pangénomiques de 4 587 individus anciens. En comparant les modèles de migration, ses auteurs privilégient une expansion vers l’ouest à partir de l’Europe centrale et orientale il y a environ 3 000 ans comme explication la plus parcimonieuse de la dispersion celtique. Les décomptes d'échantillons dans les études ne doivent pas être additionnés comme s'ils représentaient des individus distincts.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"Les résultats constituent un point de départ pour la recherche translationnelle. Le développement doit d’abord distinguer le traitement d’urgence des lésions radiologiques aiguës de la protection contre les lésions des tissus normaux liées à la radiothérapie. Ces contextes impliquent différentes populations, fenêtres de traitement, critères d’évaluation et considérations bénéfice-risque. Ce qui suit est l’analyse de QCF, et non un protocole clinique initié ou autorisé.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"Le premier identifiant de civilisation, 2026000001, appartient à la fondatrice, Jessica Sage. L’Initiative des co-constructeurs de la civilisation mondiale commence ici.","The golden Q: a quantum":"Le Q d'or : un quantique","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"La version live collectera les e-mails uniquement pour émettre et vérifier les identifiants de civilisation ; aucune nationalité, race, religion ou autre donnée sensible. Vous pouvez demander l'accès, la rectification et la suppression.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"Le plan comprend une visibilité sur les objectifs, les destinataires et les enregistrements d'accès, ainsi qu'un moyen de retirer les autorisations futures. Les limites relatives aux analyses réalisées, aux résultats publiés et à la conservation requise doivent être expliquées lors du consentement.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"La perspective QCF précédente est un commentaire éditorial de Jessica Sage, distinct des résultats de la recherche.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"L'équipe du projet a l'intention d'explorer une collaboration avec des partenaires potentiels, dont Beijing Nuosai Gene. Les entités juridiques, les autorisations, les protocoles et les dispositions éthiques seront publiés après vérification préalable ; cela n’indique pas un partenariat signé ou un lancement d’échantillonnage mondial.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"La conception proposée combine une cryptographie établie, une gestion des clés, un accès limité et des enregistrements d'audit. L’IA peut soutenir la recherche et la détection d’anomalies ; il ne remplace pas le cryptage, le consentement éclairé ou l’examen par un expert.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"L'agrégateur public étiquette les deux applications américaines Abandonnées. Ceci n’est pas un avis juridique. Le statut actuel, les autres droits familiaux nationaux, la propriété et toute licence accordée à QCF nécessitent une vérification par un dossier officiel et un accord écrit. Nommer un inventeur n’établit pas la propriété de QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"Les travaux publiés explorent les cellules souches mésenchymateuses exprimant la superoxyde dismutase extracellulaire (ECSOD). Les études répertoriées sur les cellules et les souris fournissent une base pour une évaluation plus approfondie, sans établir la sécurité humaine, l'efficacité ou la protection contre toutes les blessures lors d'un conflit nucléaire.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"Les publications de brevets liées aux radiations concernent les cellules souches mésenchymateuses modifiées. Les inventeurs nommés incluent Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed et Anthony J. Senagore. Il s’agit d’identifiants d’application/publication, et non de preuve d’un brevet délivré et exécutoire.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"La séquence de référence combinait l'ADN de plusieurs donneurs. Des chercheurs de Buffalo ont recruté des volontaires par le biais d'annonces publiques et ont collecté du sang après consentement éclairé. Il ne s’agissait pas d’un dépistage à l’échelle de la population, ni de la preuve d’un programme mondial d’échantillonnage géré par l’ONU ou par l’ensemble des cinq membres permanents du Conseil de sécurité.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"Le canal de réception des soumissions est en cours de connexion. Téléchargez le modèle maintenant pour préparer votre texte et vos sources. Le téléchargement d'un modèle ne soumet pas de contribution ni n'attribue de points.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"Le modèle ne demande pas d'ADN, de numéros de pièce d'identité ou de dossier médical. Un identifiant de civilisation peut être ajouté après l'émission d'un numéro formel.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"L'identifiant unique est l'ID de civilisation enregistré de manière indépendante, avec un lien d'autorisation volontaire. L'ADN n'est pas un numéro d'identification public ni un mot de passe de connexion. L’identité ne peut être réduite à la génétique ; les vrais jumeaux montrent également pourquoi l’ADN à lui seul ne peut pas établir une identité unique pour chaque personne.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Ce sont des objectifs de conception et de gouvernance. Le Civilization ID actuel est une démonstration frontale, sans système complet de données de santé déployé ; ce site Web ne collecte pas de données génomiques personnelles.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"Ces enregistrements ne sont pas additionnés : les totaux à l'échelle de la guerre chevauchent les sous-ensembles nationaux et municipaux ; La mortalité cumulée, annuelle et la surmortalité mesurent différentes choses, et les décès dus à la guerre et aux maladies peuvent se chevaucher. Les valeurs approximatives, les plages et les qualificatifs « plus que » sont conservés.","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"Cet aperçu de conception n'envoie aucune donnée à aucun serveur. L’e-mail, le nom de l’envoyé et l’historique des contributions restent dans le stockage local de votre navigateur et peuvent être effacés à tout moment. Pas de cookies, d'analyses ou de ressources tierces.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"Cette première édition comprend neuf records de guerre, nationaux et événementiels. Le chiffre arrondi combine plus de 9 millions de morts militaires pendant la Première Guerre mondiale et environ 60 millions de morts dans le monde pendant la Seconde Guerre mondiale. Les sous-ensembles nationaux et municipaux ne sont pas ajoutés à nouveau. Il ne s’agit pas d’un total de toutes les guerres ou de toute l’histoire.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"Cette première édition comprend dix documents provenant de l'OMS. Le chiffre résume les estimations historiques les plus basses pour la peste noire en Europe et les pandémies de grippe de 1918, 1957 et 1968. Il ne s’agit pas d’un total historique d’épidémies et de maladies.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"Cet historique n'implique pas l'autorisation ou le soutien de l'ONU au QCF, ni une succession officielle au Projet Génome Humain.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"Ceci est un site Web en phase préparatoire. La fondation n'est pas encore enregistrée ; toutes les fonctionnalités disponibles du site Web peuvent être testées gratuitement. Les souscriptions et les dons ouvrent après inscription formelle et ouverture de compte bancaire. Un abonnement nécessite que l'utilisateur choisisse et confirme le prix et les conditions ; les tests ne deviennent jamais automatiquement un forfait payant.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"C'est le principe que nous visons à mettre en pratique grâce à une technologie validée, des opérations responsables et une surveillance continue.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"Cette page décrit une contre-mesure médicale potentielle en cas de radiolésion. L’approche publiée n’est pas équivalente à un vaccin. Si le « vaccin radiologique » proposé est un candidat différent, sa définition technique et son dossier de preuves nécessitent une documentation distincte.","This preview":"Cet aperçu","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"QKD à fibre passive à trois utilisateurs a exploré des architectures multi-nœuds plus simples.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"À établir à Zoug, Suisse ; actuellement en préparation et pas encore enregistré. Fondatrice : Jessica Sage (ID de civilisation 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"Les sujets incluent la civilisation et les sciences humaines, les sciences de la vie, la recherche quantique et énergétique, l'IA et la technologie, l'action d'intérêt public et la coopération internationale.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"La confiance grâce aux preuves.<br>La gestion par la transparence.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"Essayez de créer un identifiant de civilisation","Try the Civilization ID flow":"Essayez le flux Civilization ID","Tuberculosis · global annual":"Tuberculose · annuel mondial","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"L'UNESCO a adopté la Déclaration universelle sur le génome humain et les droits de l'homme le 11 novembre 1997 ; l'Assemblée générale des Nations Unies l'a entériné par la résolution 53/152 du 9 décembre 1998. Cette histoire offre une référence éthique : la science doit être au service du bien-être humain, et les individus ne doivent pas être réduits à leurs caractéristiques génétiques.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"Compte historique du Département américain de l'énergie, couvrant la période 1931-1945 ; une estimation, pas un registre unifié. D'autres institutions diffèrent. Les entrées de pays/événements de la Seconde Guerre mondiale ci-dessous ne doivent pas être ajoutées à nouveau.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"Identifiants vérifiés","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"Vérifiez les entités partenaires, les mandats, la propriété intellectuelle et les preuves de recherche.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"Chiffre d'Anciens Combattants Canada pour le personnel militaire; exclut les autres pays.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"Liés à la guerre du Vietnam · Dossiers militaires américains","View all civilization briefs →":"Voir toutes les brèves civilisation →","View all publications →":"Voir toutes les publications →","Visa":"Visa","Vote":"Votez","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"Estimation annuelle OMS 2024, incluant 150 000 personnes séropositives ; non cumulatif et chevauche l’entrée VIH.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"Données OMS 2024 : intervalle d'estimation 37,6–53,4 millions. Chiffre cumulé à long terme ; chevauche des affections telles que la tuberculose.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"Bilan de l'OMS Europe : estimation pour la première année ; les autres modèles/coupures diffèrent. Ce n’est pas un total absolu.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"Intervalle d'estimation de l'OMS : 13,3 à 16,6 millions ; effets directs et indirects de la pandémie, décès non confirmés ou toutes les années de pandémie.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"Estimation historique de l'OMS, pas de décès individuels signalés.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"La page de l'OMS sur l'épidémie rapporte le total, y compris les pays touchés en dehors de l'Afrique de l'Ouest ; l’épidémie a pris fin en juin 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"Les victimes de guerre ne sont pas automatiquement des morts ; les cas de maladie et les taux de létalité ne constituent pas des chiffres de décès. La valeur d’une vie n’est pas déterminée par la nationalité, l’origine ethnique ou l’identité.","War remembrance":"Souvenir de guerre","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"Nous préconisons une recherche qui empêche une utilisation répétée sans consentement éclairé adéquat, respecte le choix individuel et reconnaît les contributions à la science. Gardons ensemble le bien-être humain.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"Notre objectif est de transformer la compréhension scientifique en opportunités de santé que les gens peuvent comprendre, choisir et dont ils peuvent bénéficier. Notre vision à long terme est un accès équitable à la santé génomique ; la première étape consiste en une recherche ciblée d’intérêt public et des projets pilotes de dépistage volontaire avec des résultats interprétables et des soins de suivi.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"Nous ne sommes pas des spectateurs. Nous sommes co-constructeurs. Co-construire et co-créer une civilisation – pour offrir un monde meilleur à la prochaine génération.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"Nous invitons les citoyens, les cryptographes, les ingénieurs d'identité, les experts juridiques, les développeurs et les familles philanthropiques à co-créer un avenir dans lequel les gens contrôlent leur identité numérique et choisissent ce qu'ils laissent derrière eux.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"Nous préservons l'histoire de la science et assumons la responsabilité de l'avenir de la vie. Nous recherchons une recherche transfrontalière qui soit au service des individus, une utilisation des données qui respecte les choix individuels et une civilisation soutenue par la coopération et l’attention.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"Nous nous souvenons pour que davantage de vies aient un avenir.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"Nous partageons une seule Terre et la responsabilité de l’avenir de la civilisation. Laissez la technologie servir la vie, les connaissances passer entre les générations et chaque acte de gentillesse contribue à construire notre civilisation commune.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"Nous passons notre vie à créer des actifs numériques, des empreintes, des connaissances, des souvenirs et des entreprises. Si nous vieillissons, perdons nos capacités ou décédons, nos proches sauront-ils ce qui existe ? Tout ce que nous avons construit devrait-il simplement disparaître ?","WeChat Pay":"Paiement WeChat","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"Les fonctionnalités du site Web peuvent être testées gratuitement avant que la fondation ne soit officiellement enregistrée. Les services d'abonnement commenceront après l'inscription, avec des avantages spéciaux prévus pour les premiers envoyés de civilisation ; l’éligibilité et les détails seront annoncés.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"Weiwen Deng et la recherche sur les radiolésions","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, a travaillé dans les domaines de la cytogénétique, des cellules souches et de la thérapie génique. Le CV 2023 fourni à QCF fait état d'un diplôme de médecine en 1990, d'une maîtrise en microbiologie et immunologie en 1993 et ​​d'un doctorat Tulane en biologie moléculaire et cellulaire en 2004, ainsi que de recherches antérieures et de direction de laboratoire de cellules souches mésenchymateuses à l'hôpital pour enfants Helen DeVos.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng : publications, brevets et statut","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"Bienvenue, Co-constructeur de Civilisation","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"Épidémie d'Ebola en Afrique de l'Ouest et pays touchés","What did the studies find?":"Qu'ont trouvé les études ?","What do the two papers establish?":"Qu'établissent les deux journaux ?","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"À la fin de la vie, notre monde numérique disparaît-il – ou perdure-t-il ?","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"Pourquoi Civilization ID et la protection des données de santé sont importants","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"Population mondiale · estimation mi-2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"Vous n'avez pas encore d'identifiant de civilisation","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"Votre identité. Votre souveraineté. Votre héritage.","Your informed choice":"Votre choix éclairé","next":"suivant","opens after registration":"ouvre après inscription","spent by co-builder vote":"dépensé par vote co-constructeur","← Life sciences":"← Sciences de la vie","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69 000 000"},"it":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · Due diligence","02 · Independent review":"02 · Recensione indipendente","03 · Pilot design":"03 · Progettazione pilota","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · Rendicontazione sullo stato di avanzamento","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"Intreccio atomo-fotone da 1530 nm e rete quantistica avanzata in banda di telecomunicazioni QKD in fibra da 50 km.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"Simulazione di atomi neutri da 180 qubit: la natura ha riportato esperimenti di dinamica quantistica non in equilibrio.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997–1998: progresso scientifico e dignità umana","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"Iniziativa preparatoria 2026 · Le informazioni sono ora disponibili. Questo sito Web non raccoglie DNA né accetta file genomici.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6% è il totale combinato dei quattro servizi. Il processo di scissione, custodia e antiriciclaggio deve essere confermato dal legale svizzero prima della registrazione.","72,000,000+":"72.000.000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"Il nome di un inviato della civiltà","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"Un Civilization ID è un'identità contributiva all'interno di QCF, non un passaporto, una cittadinanza o un documento di identità legale.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"Un'impresa scientifica oltre confine","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"Uno studio separato ha studiato un vaccino peptidico COVID-19 combinato con il vaccino contro il tetano nei cavalli. Non dimostra un vaccino contro le radiazioni o l’efficacia sull’uomo.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"Un piano volontario per collegare i dati genomici personali con un ID di civiltà","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia influenzale A(H1N1) · globale","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia influenzale A(H2N2) · globale","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia influenzale A(H3N2) · globale","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"Abdel-Mageed et al., con Weiwen Deng come coautore. Argomento: cellule staminali mesenchimali geneticamente modificate e sopravvivenza dei topi irradiati. Prova: ricerca sugli animali; sezione del diario: Corrispondenza.","About":"Chi siamo","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"Le proposte accettate possono essere riconosciute in base alle regole di contributo pubblicate. I punti test non diventano automaticamente premi ufficiali. Non includere informazioni sulla salute personale o sul genoma senza consenso.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"Accettato tramite un fornitore con licenza svizzera, convertito in CHF al tasso di ricezione, con ricevuta di donazione emessa.","Account":"Conto","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"Contare separatamente la ricerca di pubblica utilità, la traduzione commerciale dei farmaci e gli investimenti nelle infrastrutture. Divulgare le transazioni con parti correlate, gli accordi sulla proprietà intellettuale e i conflitti, con ricusazione e revisione indipendente.","Alipay":"Alipay","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"Tutte le funzionalità disponibili del sito Web possono essere testate gratuitamente prima che la fondazione venga formalmente registrata. I servizi in abbonamento iniziano dopo la registrazione; il piano attuale è di 20 CHF/USD/EUR al mese, con servizi e termini di pagamento indicati chiaramente prima della sottoscrizione.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"Tutti i pulsanti di pagamento per ora sono disabilitati. Consentono, dopo la registrazione formale, l'apertura del conto bancario e l'onboarding del sistema di pagamento. Le donazioni potrebbero richiedere controlli AML/KYC applicabili. Non è richiesto alcun trattamento fiscale o deducibilità.","All publications":"Tutte le pubblicazioni","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"Un team IonQ ha segnalato un entanglement eterogeneo su scala kilohertz.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"Qualsiasi co-costruttore con un Civilization ID può lanciare un'iniziativa su qualsiasi argomento.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"Chiunque può lanciare un'Iniziativa di Civilizzazione","Apple Pay":"Apple Pay","Apply to become a payment partner":"Candidati per diventare partner dei pagamenti","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"A partire dalla revisione delle fonti pubbliche del 10 novembre 2026, non è stata identificata alcuna registrazione per la sperimentazione umana o approvazione normativa per questa indicazione di radiazioni MSC ingegnerizzate con EC-SOD. Restano necessari identificatori di registro e documenti di autorizzazione verificabili. Sperimentazioni su altre formulazioni SOD, mimetici o cellule per altre malattie non convalidano questo candidato.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"Valutare gli approcci candidati alla prevenzione o al trattamento delle lesioni da radiazioni per la protezione civile e la preparazione in materia di sanità pubblica. La documentazione e la revisione scientifica sono in attesa; la sicurezza e l’efficacia non sono stabilite.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"Al momento della revisione, QCF non ha ricevuto un numero di registrazione della sperimentazione umana, un'autorizzazione normativa o prove di approvazione all'immissione in commercio per questo candidato. Restano da documentare i progressi sperimentali aggiornati, la replicazione indipendente, la qualità della produzione e il percorso di sviluppo clinico.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"Bombardamento atomico di Hiroshima · Giappone","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"BTQ × Kaia ha annunciato una collaborazione con una rete stablecoin a sicurezza quantistica.","Back to Civilization ID":"Torniamo a Civilization ID","Back to Life Sciences":"Ritorno alle scienze della vita","Back to population figures":"Torniamo ai dati demografici","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"Diventa un co-costruttore di civiltà","Become a co-builder":"Diventa co-costruttore","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"Diventa il prossimo co-costruttore di civiltà","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"Prima del consenso spiegare lo scopo, il destinatario, l'ambito della ricerca, il periodo di conservazione e i rischi. Valutare separatamente i nuovi usi, compreso qualsiasi utilizzo per l'addestramento sull'intelligenza artificiale.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"Dietro ogni numero c'è una persona, una vita e una famiglia. Ricordare le vite perse rende la pace, la salute pubblica e la salvaguardia della vita una responsabilità condivisa.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"Dietro ogni numero c'era un nome, una famiglia e una vita rimasta incompiuta. Registriamo le perdite per preservare la vita di oggi e sosteniamo la scienza per proteggere la vita di domani.","Bilingual PDF":"PDF bilingue","Bitcoin BTC":"Bitcoin BTC","Black Death · Europe":"Morte Nera · Europa","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"Vincolato da prove peer-reviewed e verificabili","Browse published briefs":"Sfoglia i brief pubblicati","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"Di Civilization Architect Jessica Sage<br>Pubblicato il 5 novembre 2026 · Notizie sulla natura: 4 novembre 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · ACCESSO ALL'ARCHIVIO PDF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"ID CIVILTÀ × NU-KEY","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · INIZIATIVA DI RICERCA GLOBALE","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"Eccesso di mortalità associato al COVID-19 · globale","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"Panoramica del Museo Canadese della Guerra; solo personale militare/di servizio, non tutte le morti civili. Le voci nazionali sotto si sovrappongono.","Cards & wallets":"Carte e portafogli","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"Cellule come fabbriche di proteine antiossidanti: la ricerca di Weiwen Deng sulle lesioni da radiazioni","Check in":"Check-in","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"Scegli un nuovo nome di Inviato della Civiltà. La tua identità originale può rimanere nascosta: mostra solo il tuo numero ID o il tuo nuovo nome.","Choose an amount":"Scegli un importo","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"Stima della città fino alla fine del 1945; effetti combinati di esplosioni, termici e radiazioni, non morti dovute solo a radiazioni o il prezzo totale a lungo termine.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"Architetto della civiltà Jessica Sage | 10 novembre 2026 | Commento alla ricerca","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"Nome dell'inviato della civiltà (facoltativo)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"Gli inviati della civiltà sono invitati a contribuire con articoli originali, approfondimenti di ricerca e resoconti di azioni di beneficio pubblico. Il lavoro accettato può essere registrato come contributo collegato a un Civilization ID e a punti Quantum Q.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"Gli inviati della civiltà sono invitati a contribuire. Condividi un lavoro che sia veritiero, chiaro e verificabile: conoscenza al servizio della vita e azione che connette le persone.","Civilization ID":"Identificativo della civiltà","Civilization ID and privacy":"Identificazione della civiltà e privacy","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"Civilization ID rimane attualmente un record di test gratuito del browser locale, quindi si tratta di un test gate piuttosto che di un'identità verificata centralmente. Una volta che il sistema centrale Civilization ID sarà online, l'accesso ai PDF verrà aggiornato all'autorizzazione attendibile lato server.","Civilization ID goal":"Obiettivo ID civiltà","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Civilization ID è attualmente una dimostrazione front-end. L'archiviazione dei dati sanitari clinici e le funzioni di governance complete qui descritte non vengono implementate. Questo sito web non raccoglie dati genomici personali.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"Civilization ID è concepito come un collegamento tra contributi volontari e autorizzazioni esplicite. L’identità, i dati di partecipazione e i dati sanitari sensibili dovrebbero essere separati; Per partecipare non è richiesto il DNA. La crittografia deve funzionare insieme a limiti di scopo, controlli di accesso, governance indipendente e revoca di autorizzazioni future. Un documento d'identità da solo non può garantire la privacy.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"Civilization ID supporta la partecipazione volontaria e la registrazione dei contributi; non è un'identità legale. Per ottenere un documento d'identità non sono necessari dati relativi al DNA o alla salute. Gli attuali test gratuiti non costituiscono un servizio di identità centrale attivo.","Civilization ID · free testing":"Civilization ID · test gratuito","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"Identificativo della civiltà: partecipazione e autorizzazione","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"Gli ID civiltà e Q attualmente utilizzano i record archiviati in questo browser per i test. La registrazione centrale, l'accettazione delle iscrizioni e i premi esaminati verranno collegati. Il test è gratuito e non avvia mai automaticamente un abbonamento.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"La civiltà inizia da chiunque scelga di iniziare","Claim my Civilization ID":"Richiedi il mio ID di civiltà","Claim your Civilization ID":"Richiedi il tuo ID Civiltà","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"Trasmissione cluster-stato su 29 km di ingegneria di rete avanzata in fibra parzialmente dispiegata.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"Brief sulla Civiltà di Co-costruzione","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"Voto co-costruttore · Servizi della Fondazione","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"Co-costruire civiltà.<br>Salvaguardare la vita.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"Co-creare civiltà. Apprezzare ogni vita.","Coming soon":"Prossimamente","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"Valutazione preclinica completa della sicurezza di biodistribuzione, persistenza, risposte immunitarie, rischio trombotico, vettore residuo e crescita anormale dei tessuti. Le applicazioni della radioterapia richiedono anche la valutazione degli effetti sul controllo del tumore.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"Collega ogni contributo confermato al tuo ID tramite Quantum Q. Durante i test gratuiti, i punti di test del browser rimangono separati dai record dei contributi ufficiali.","Contact":"Contatto","Contact the preparatory team":"Contatta il team preparatorio","Contribute to civilization":"Contribuisci alla civiltà","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"Contribuisci alla nostra memoria condivisa →","Contribution history":"Cronologia dei contributi","Contribution points Q":"Contributo punti Q","Contributions return to your ID":"I contributi ritornano sul tuo ID","Controller":"Controllore","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"Le cellule che secernono una proteina antiossidante potrebbero aiutare a mitigare il danno tissutale dopo le radiazioni? Il lavoro pubblicato da Weiwen Deng e colleghi fornisce prove su topi e cellule umane in vitro. Si tratta di un approccio preclinico che richiede ulteriori test; non è un trattamento umano approvato.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"La copertura sarà aggiornata dalla ricerca originale tracciabile, con i limiti delle prove chiariti.","Create a local test ID":"Crea un ID test locale","Create an ID · free testing":"Crea un ID · test gratuito","Crypto":"Cripto","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"Fase attuale: preparazione, due diligence dei partner e revisione scientifica. Gli studi clinici, lo screening pubblico e la raccolta di donazioni nell'ambito di questo programma non sono ancora iniziati.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"DARPA QBI Stage C validazione ingegneristica indipendente avanzata.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"Il DNA non identifica direttamente la lingua parlata da qualcuno. I modelli genetici devono essere interpretati insieme all’archeologia e alla linguistica, e il cambiamento linguistico non deve necessariamente accompagnare la sostituzione della popolazione. Questi risultati aiutano a testare ipotesi storiche; non decodificano il linguaggio antico.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"BOZZA · in attesa di revisione legale","Daily births · estimate":"Nascite giornaliere · stima","Daily check-in":"Check-in giornaliero","Daily deaths · estimate":"Decessi giornalieri · stima","Dates / reporting period":"Date/periodo di riferimento","Dates, lives lost and source records":"Date, vite perdute e documenti di origine","Deaths / fatality records":"Record di decessi/decessi","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"Decessi nella sintesi dei casi probabili dell’OMS; le date si riferiscono al periodo di insorgenza della malattia.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"Definire un prodotto riproducibile di cellule umane: fonte, identità, attività EC-SOD e durata dell'espressione, variazione del donatore, consistenza del lotto, crioconservazione e produzione scalabile.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"Definire beneficiari, istituti di erogazione, budget, tappe fondamentali e risultati misurabili.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"Definire i protocolli, le approvazioni applicabili e i requisiti etici prima dell'inizio della ricerca. Distinguere il lavoro esplorativo, i risultati convalidati e il marketing; segnalare incertezza e risultati negativi.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"Demo: tocca per provare a lanciare un'iniziativa e ricevere 100 Q.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"Demo: la tua email rimane in questo browser; non viene inviata alcuna vera e-mail.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"Deng et al.: mitigazione dei danni da radiazioni nei topi utilizzando cellule staminali mesenchimali modificate che secernono ECSOD. Weiwen Deng è elencato come primo autore corrispondente. Evidenza: ricerca preclinica.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"Sviluppare ricerche mirate di beneficio pubblico e progetti pilota di screening con condizioni, popolazioni e cure di follow-up definite. L'ambito verrà stabilito dopo l'autorizzazione del partner, la revisione etica e la verifica del protocollo.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"Lo sviluppo delle lesioni acute da radiazioni può esplorare percorsi applicabili come la FDA Animal Rule. In condizioni specifiche, consente studi adeguati e controllati sull’efficacia sugli animali per supportare l’approvazione, pur mantenendo i requisiti di sicurezza umana e di qualità del prodotto. L'ammissibilità e l'approvazione non sono garantite. I farmaci esistenti contro le radiazioni dovrebbero informare il bisogno insoddisfatto e la strategia di confronto.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"Prevenzione delle malattie, NAD⁺ e meccanismi di invecchiamento, ricerca unicellulare e rigenerativa, genomica dell'intelligenza artificiale ed epigenetica sono aree di continua copertura. I brief del QCF distingueranno gli studi su cellule e animali dalle sperimentazioni umane e dalle prove cliniche. Un cambiamento nell’indicatore dell’età biologica non è una prova di una vita più lunga.","Disease remembrance":"Ricordo della malattia","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"La raccolta donazioni e le iscrizioni automatiche non sono aperte. La richiesta proposta per la prima fase prevede 100 milioni di franchi, non i fondi raccolti, impegnati o approvati. Budget e commissioni dettagliati richiedono la due diligence e la revisione della governance applicabile.","Donations":"Donazioni","Donations received":"Donazioni ricevute","Download bilingual PDF":"Scarica PDF bilingue","Download submission template":"Scarica il modello di presentazione","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"Nota editoriale: questo è un riassunto e un commento del QCF scritto in modo indipendente, non una riproduzione o una traduzione ufficiale dell'articolo di Nature. L'autore originale della notizia è Ewen Callaway; il credito di ricerca appartiene agli autori e alle istituzioni degli articoli. L'accesso all'intero articolo di notizie su Nature potrebbe richiedere un abbonamento.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"Revisione editoriale: 2 novembre 2026. Queste organizzazioni sono citate come fonti; non è implicita alcuna partnership, autorizzazione o approvazione di QCF.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"Email: [da impostare, es. contact@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"Identità criptata","Encryption and key control":"Crittografia e controllo delle chiavi","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"Coinvolgere le autorità di regolamentazione e i comitati etici per stabilire la classificazione dei prodotti, gli standard di qualità, il percorso di sviluppo e i prerequisiti per la ricerca umana. Solo dopo le necessarie autorizzazioni si potranno prendere in considerazione i primi studi sull’uomo incentrati sulla sicurezza, la tollerabilità e l’attività biologica misurabile.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"Intervallo di stima nella revisione storica dell'OMS.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"Intervallo di stima nella revisione storica dell'OMS; le stime variano tra le pubblicazioni.","Ethereum ETH":"Ethereum ETH","Event and population":"Evento e popolazione","Every action is remembered by civilization":"Ogni azione è ricordata dalla civiltà","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"Ogni giorno accediamo. Ai nostri telefoni, e-mail, banche, servizi sanitari, portali governativi e account cloud. Oltre i confini, ripetiamo password, codici e controlli di identità. Le nostre vite sono frammentate attraverso centinaia di porte digitali.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"Ogni vita merita dignità e ricordo.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"Ogni vita merita rispetto. Ogni utilizzo dei dati personali necessita di confini chiari.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"Ogni nuova vita merita un dolce benvenuto.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"Ogni spesa del 94% viene decisa dal voto del co-costruttore.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"Prove revisionate: 2 novembre 2026 | Preparazione del programma e due diligence","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"Esplora NU-Key e l'eredità digitale","Explore Phase One →":"Esplora la Fase Uno →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"Esplora la collaborazione tra innovatori farmaceutici cinesi e partner europei di ricerca, clinici e industriali. La ricerca di pubblica utilità, l’accesso dei pazienti e la traduzione commerciale richiedono obiettivi, budget e diritti separati.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"Esplora il ricordo e le fonti della malattia →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"Esplora la storia genomica e la visione della fase uno","Explore the life-sciences programme":"Esplora il programma di scienze della vita","Explore the phase-one programme":"Esplora il programma della fase uno","Explore the principles":"Esplora i principi","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"Esplora la memoria e le fonti della guerra →","First World War · Australia":"Prima Guerra Mondiale · Australia","First World War · British military":"Prima Guerra Mondiale · Esercito britannico","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Prima Guerra Mondiale · Canada e Terranova","First World War · global military":"Prima Guerra Mondiale · militare globale","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"Set di dati della prima edizione · Revisionato e aggiornato il repository: 2 novembre 2026 · Statistiche non in tempo reale","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"Per me il valore di questa ricerca sta nel connettere le discipline. Le scienze della vita mettono in luce i movimenti del passato; l'archeologia e la linguistica ci aiutano a interpretare quegli incontri. Le lingue e le culture che conosciamo oggi meritano di essere comprese all’interno di una più lunga storia di scambi umani.","Founder":"Fondatore","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"Quattro pandemie storiche selezionate · Somma delle stime inferiori","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"Quattordici miliardi di anni fa l'universo ebbe inizio da un unico punto. Quattro miliardi di anni fa, la vita si copiò per la prima volta nell’oceano. Oggi otto miliardi di persone condividono un unico pianeta blu, ancora diviso da confini, colori, lingua e credenze.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"Il lavoro di magnetometria del diamante NV di Fraunhofer è diventato un candidato per un PoC di monitoraggio energetico.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"Test gratuito · I record attualmente rimangono in questo browser. Non si tratta dell'emissione centralizzata dell'ID o della verifica dell'e-mail. Gli account reali e i record cross-device verranno aperti quando il servizio di registrazione sarà connesso.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"Dal 1990 al 2003, il Progetto Genoma Umano ha creato una fondazione per il genoma umano di riferimento. NIH e il Dipartimento dell'Energia hanno sostenuto lo sforzo degli Stati Uniti; gli istituti di sequenziamento provenivano da Stati Uniti, Regno Unito, Francia, Germania, Giappone e Cina. Ha dimostrato il potere della collaborazione internazionale e della conoscenza condivisa.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"Dalla lezione di HeLa alla responsabilità di Civilization ID","From first login to a lasting legacy":"Dal primo accesso a un'eredità duratura","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"Dal laboratorio alla clinica: le prossime domande di ricerca","From one idea to a civilization in action":"Da un'idea a una civiltà in azione","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"Dalla lettura del genoma alla salvaguardia della vita","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"Dalle evidenze della ricerca alla salvaguardia della vita","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"Dalla comprensione dei genomi alla salvaguardia di ogni persona","From vision to verifiable action":"Dalla visione all'azione verificabile","Fund management":"Gestione fondi","Funding and oversight":"Finanziamenti e controlli","Funding during preparation":"Finanziamenti in fase di preparazione","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"Riunisci co-costruttori di civiltà in tutto il mondo per co-costruire, registrare, tramandare e salvaguardare la civiltà umana.","Genomic health research":"Ricerca sulla salute genomica","Get Civilization ID":"Crea un ID di civiltà","Get your ID":"Ottieni la tua carta d'identità","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniziativa dei co-costruttori di civiltà globale","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"Iniziativa Global Civilization Co-builders · Fase preparatoria","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"Brief globali sulla tecnologia quantistica e sull'ecosistema energetico","Google Pay":"Google Pay","Governance":"Governance","Governance and funding principles":"Principi di governance e finanziamento","Governance service":"Servizio di governance","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"Decessi correlati all'HIV · cumulativo globale","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"HeLa ci ricorda che preservare la conoscenza richiede anche il rispetto per ogni persona che c'è dietro. Civilization ID è concepito come un punto di accesso per la partecipazione volontaria e i registri dei permessi, senza esporre DNA, cartelle cliniche o rapporti familiari. La protezione richiede crittografia, separazione dell'identità e dei dati, autorizzazioni specifiche per lo scopo e controllo degli accessi.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"Aiutaci a costruire una civiltà digitale incentrata sull'uomo","Help safeguard life":"Aiutaci a salvaguardare la vita","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"Qui potresti prendere un nuovo nome: il nome del tuo Inviato della Civiltà. Puoi lasciare il passato nascosto e apparire solo come ID o nuovo nome. Ti unisci per libero arbitrio e vai avanti con il contributo volontario. Ogni condivisione, ogni iniziativa, ogni azione diventa una Q quantica d'oro, che ritorna nel tuo ID.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"Nascondi la mia identità originale; mostra solo il mio ID o il nome dell'inviato","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"Totale cumulativo storico: nessuna cifra affidabile a livello mondiale","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"Stima storica citata dall'OMS, solo Europa; registrazione dei casi non contemporanea. Nessuna data esatta di inizio/fine in questa fonte.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"Figura storica nella guida alla ricerca degli Archivi nazionali del Regno Unito; non un totale mondiale.","History and our genomic-health vision":"La storia e la nostra visione genomico-sanitaria","Home":"Home","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"Come i genomi antichi aiutano a tracciare la diffusione delle lingue germaniche e celtiche","How initiatives work":"Come funzionano le iniziative","Human research and regulatory evidence":"Ricerca umana ed evidenze normative","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"Ho letto la <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> e i <a class=gold href=terms.html>Termini</a> e capisco che questa è una demo; le tariffe si aprono dopo la registrazione","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"IBM × ORNL × AMD ha lanciato una piattaforma di co-design per la correzione degli errori; Chicago System Two sostiene anche la ricerca sull’ottimizzazione della rete.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"I titolari di carta d'identità possono lanciare iniziative su qualsiasi argomento; i sostenitori danno volontariamente. Il 94% dei fondi viene assegnato tramite voto del co-costruttore; QCF addebita una commissione del 6% sulla piattaforma e sulla governance.","IDs registered":"Identità registrate","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 ha incorporato ML-DSA nell'identità sicura del dispositivo.","Impressum":"Impressum","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"L'emulazione classica migliorata rafforza la necessità delle attuali linee di base classiche.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"Nel 1951, i campioni tumorali di Henrietta Lacks, che era in cura per il cancro cervicale, furono utilizzati per la ricerca a sua insaputa o senza il suo consenso. La linea cellulare HeLa risultante ha dato un contributo importante alla medicina, sollevando al contempo domande durature sul consenso, sulla privacy e sull’equa condivisione dei benefici.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"Nel 2013, l'NIH e la famiglia Lacks hanno raggiunto un accordo sull'accesso controllato ai dati rilevanti sull'intero genoma HeLa. “Immortale” descrive la capacità della linea cellulare di continuare a dividersi in condizioni di laboratorio adeguate, non l’immortalità della stessa Henrietta Lacks.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"Nel 2026, QCF prevede di sviluppare un'iniziativa per un accesso più equo al sequenziamento del genoma. Insieme a specialisti della ricerca, della sanità e dell’etica, miriamo ad aiutare le persone a comprendere le proprie informazioni genomiche attraverso una scelta informata e un adeguato supporto professionale. In un futuro sistema sicuro, gli individui potrebbero scegliere di collegare i record genomici a un ID di civiltà rilasciato in modo indipendente.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"Nell'articolo di ricerca del Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy del 2015, Deng è il primo autore corrispondente. Rivisita i precedenti risultati di sopravvivenza e riporta il follow-up tra i topi sopravvissuti: è stata segnalata un'estensione della durata della vita di 207 giorni e un ritardo di 39 giorni nella formazione della cataratta. Nessun tumore è stato osservato nel gruppo trattato, mentre è stato osservato un tumore addominale nel gruppo trattato con soluzione salina. La dimensione della coorte, la selezione dei sopravvissuti, la patologia del tumore e la replicazione indipendente richiedono un esame accurato. Queste osservazioni non stabiliscono la prevenzione generale del cancro o l’estensione della durata della vita. I documenti descrivono lavori correlati, non due repliche indipendenti.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniziativa QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Iniziativa dei co-costruttori di civiltà globale","Initiatives":"Iniziative","Initiator":"Iniziatore","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"Gli iniziatori pubblicano costi e spese mentre agiscono.","International drug-research collaboration":"Collaborazione internazionale per la ricerca sui farmaci","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"Il suo valore pubblico risiede in un approccio verificabile alla medicina d'emergenza dovuta alle radiazioni. Non è né un trattamento radioattivo completo né un vaccino validato. Gli esperimenti riproducibili devono collegare il concetto a qualsiasi beneficio futuro per il paziente.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"Jessica Sage (fondatrice). Indirizzo: [da aggiungere]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"Partecipa al testing gratuito: prova la registrazione, il check-in e la condivisione. I premi per i contributi ufficiali dipendono da documenti esaminati e confermati.","LATEST ISSUED":"ULTIMA EMISSIONE","Launch":"Lancio","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"Lancia un'iniziativa di civiltà","Launch initiative":"Lancio iniziativa","Launch initiative (demo)":"Iniziativa di lancio (demo)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"Lancia con il tuo ID: obiettivo, budget, traguardi. +100 Q","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"Lanciato nel 1990, il Progetto Genoma Umano ha riunito istituti di ricerca attraverso l'International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. Nel 2003, ha consegnato la sequenza del genoma umano di riferimento, una base per comprendere la vita, piuttosto che sequenziare ogni persona.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"Imparare dalla storia di HeLa","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"Lascia che il tuo contributo diventi parte della nostra storia condivisa","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"Istituti di pagamento autorizzati, portafogli e fornitori di criptovalute conformi sono invitati a diventare partner di co-costruzione di civiltà e aiutare a costruire binari di donazione globali.","Life Sciences":"Scienze della vita","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"Scienze della vita e salvaguardia della vita","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"Scienze della vita | La natura riporta una nuova ricerca sul DNA antico ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Scienze della Vita | L'esperimento biotecnologico individuale: intelligenza artificiale, robotica e scoperta di farmaci ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"La vita ha una fine. La civiltà deve andare avanti.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"Le scienze della vita sono la nostra priorità nella prima fase. L’energia e l’informatica, insieme all’educazione alla civilizzazione, rimangono direzioni di ricerca e collaborazione a lungo termine.","Life-science directions we will follow":"Indicazioni di scienze della vita che seguiremo","Life-sciences news":"Novità dalle scienze della vita","Life-sciences programme":"Programma di scienze della vita","Link my DNA":"Collega il mio DNA","Live version (planned)":"Versione live (prevista)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"Vite perse in guerra · Stima","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"Vite perse a causa di epidemie e malattie · Stima","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"Obiettivo a lungo termine: 1.000.000 di ID di civiltà. Richiesta proposta per la prima fase nel settore delle scienze della vita: 100 000 000 franchi; non fondi raccolti o impegnati.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"La perdita di coscienza non è la morte. Un segnale respiratorio o un evento biometrico non devono mai innescare in modo autonomo un trasferimento irreversibile di beni. La delega d'emergenza e l'eredità richiedono garanzie separate, consenso documentato, verifica indipendente e revisione legale. Civilization ID non sostituisce i passaporti, l'e-ID nazionale o il KYC bancario.","Manage future permissions":"Gestisci le autorizzazioni future","Mastercard":"Mastercard","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"Metodo: proiezioni 2026; le nascite e le morti sono medie giornaliere annuali arrotondate, non i conteggi delle vite umane per oggi.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"Metodo: questi riepiloghi dei record selezionati sono stati compilati da QCF, non pubblicati come totali combinati dalle organizzazioni di origine. Non sono conteggi in tempo reale. Le due categorie possono sovrapporsi e non devono essere sommate. Verificato e repository aggiornato: 2026-11-02.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"Indizi di migrazione, interpretati insieme alle prove linguistiche","Mission":"Missione","My ID":"Il mio ID","My contribution":"Il mio contributo","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"Estratto NARA del 29 aprile 2008. Le date degli incidenti/morti registrati vanno dal 1956 al 2006, non durante la guerra. Morti ostili e non ostili; non l'intero bilancio della guerra.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"NIST IR 8547 ha stabilito una tabella di marcia per la transizione alla crittografia post-quantistica.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"Il PQC del NIST era pronto per l'implementazione; il rilevamento e la metrologia sono diventati candidati per dati affidabili a lungo termine.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"Il lavoro del pettine di frequenza ottico su scala chip del NIST punta verso una metrologia di precisione compatta.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"Massacro di Nanchino · Cina","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"La natura riporta una nuova ricerca sul DNA antico","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"L'orologio nucleare del torio-229 della Natura studia la metrologia quantistica avanzata e la temporizzazione di precisione.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"L'interfaccia spin-fotone a singola molecola della natura e la coesistenza di fibre quantistiche/classiche sono entrate nel radar della ricerca.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"Il notiziario Nature's di Ewen Callaway, pubblicato il 4 novembre 2026, esamina nuove prove genetiche rilevanti per la storia della lingua europea. Questo brief QCF si basa su tale rapporto, un abstract di ricerca e l'annuncio dell'università partecipante.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"Prossimo ID civiltà da emettere","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"Non è implicita alcuna affiliazione o approvazione da parte delle Nazioni Unite.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"Non viene inviata alcuna email e la proprietà dell'email non è verificata.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"Nessuna serie di mortalità globale copre tutte le malattie dall'emergere della civiltà. Questa edizione contiene dieci registrazioni storiche di epidemie, cumulative e annuali fornite dall'OMS, principalmente malattie infettive. Non è esaustivo. I dati pre-OMS sono stime storiche citate dall’OMS.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"Nessun registro armonizzato copre ogni guerra e ogni paese dall'emergere della civiltà. Questa edizione contiene nove documenti di guerra, nazionali ed eventi, concentrati nella storia moderna. I conflitti antichi e medievali e molte regioni non sono ancora coperti. Le voci mancanti non significano zero morti.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"Non sono necessarie informazioni sulla nazionalità, sulla razza o sulle convinzioni personali. Utilizza un'e-mail di esempio per il test gratuito; non sono richiesti dettagli di identità reali.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"Non viene fornita alcuna dichiarazione circa il trattamento fiscale di eventuali donazioni.","No tax claims":"Nessuna pretesa fiscale","No use without clear authorization":"Divieto di utilizzo senza chiara autorizzazione","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"Gli orologi nucleari, l'entanglement eterogeneo e il benchmarking indipendente guidano la settimana","Of every 100 donated":"Su 100 donati","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"Un essere umano. Un ID civiltà. Un'eredità digitale. Esplora un gateway di identità universale e un futuro in cui le risorse digitali, le impronte e i ricordi possono essere conservati, cancellati o trasmessi legalmente per scelta.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"Una voce di donazione. Gli importi sono in franchi svizzeri (CHF). I pagamenti verranno aperti dopo la registrazione formale della fondazione e il completamento dell'onboarding della conformità.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"Una persona. Un ID civiltà.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"Apertura archivio breve QCF-E →","Open my ID":"Apri il mio ID","Opens after formal registration":"Apre dopo la registrazione formale","Operator":"Operatore","Optional DNA linking":"Collegamento DNA opzionale","Original papers and further reading":"Documenti originali e approfondimenti","Original work and sources":"Opera originale e fonti","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"La nostra missione a lungo termine · Tre pilastri","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"Oxford ha dimostrato l'entanglement remoto di specie miste e un'archiviazione quantistica di circa 10 secondi.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"PQC entra nell'infrastruttura delle risorse digitali mentre la rete si sposta nella fibra distribuita","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"PQC passa dagli standard degli algoritmi alla migrazione e all'identità del dispositivo","Participation without DNA":"Partecipazione senza DNA","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"Le istituzioni partner e i consulenti scientifici saranno pubblicati dopo l'autorizzazione e la verifica.","Partner seat open":"Sede partner aperta","Patent publications and rights verification":"Pubblicazioni brevetti e verifica diritti","PayPal":"PayPal","Payment Partners":"Partner di pagamento","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"Le persone possono creare un ID, contribuire con articoli e ottenere il riconoscimento del contributo senza fornire DNA. I premi contributivi e i benefici speciali non devono dipendere dalla fornitura di dati genomici o dal consenso alla ricerca genomica.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"Obiettivo fase 1: CHF 100.000.000. Le fasi successive non sono mostrate in questa pagina.","Phase-1 goals":"Obiettivi della fase-1","Phase-one funding ambition":"Ambizione di finanziamento della fase uno","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"Pianifica budget e record di progetto separati con revisioni delle tappe fondamentali. Dichiarare i costi amministrativi, l'utilizzo dei fondi e la supervisione; pubblicare l'entità ricevente e l'account una volta pronti.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"Sistema centrale pianificato: un ID civiltà di 10 cifre (prefisso dell'onda di 4 cifre + sequenza di 6 cifre): l'onda Genesis del 2026 emette 2026000001 in poi uno per uno; dopo il 999999 l'onda 2029 inizia al 2029000001 con codice di verifica e chiave di identità, firmati digitalmente dalla fondazione e verificabili pubblicamente.","Platform use":"Utilizzo della piattaforma","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"Si prega di includere l'evento, le date, il luogo, la popolazione, la stima della mortalità e il collegamento alla fonte originale. I contributi verranno esaminati prima dell'inclusione. Non fornire dati personali relativi alla salute o all'identità senza autorizzazione.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"Metrologia di precisione, reti eterogenee e benchmark classici avanzano insieme","Preparatory stage":"Fase preparatoria","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"Sito web della fase preparatoria. La fondazione avrà sede a Zugo, in Svizzera e non è ancora registrata; le funzionalità disponibili del sito Web possono essere testate gratuitamente prima della registrazione. Le iscrizioni e le donazioni si aprono previa registrazione formale; i test non si convertono mai automaticamente in un piano a pagamento. Q è un punto di contribuzione non trasferibile, non una criptovaluta, senza valore monetario e non commerciabile. Non è richiesta alcuna deducibilità fiscale.","Prepare a contribution":"Prepara un contributo","Prepare a reviewable submission":"Preparare una presentazione revisionabile","Privacy":"Privacy","Privacy Policy":"Informativa sulla privacy","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"Procedere per fasi una volta soddisfatti i prerequisiti; divulgare risultati, limitazioni e utilizzo dei fondi.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"Richiesta di donazione proposta · Non sono stati raccolti fondi · Non è un impegno di finanziamento","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"Proteggi la privacy mentre cresci. Navigare l'identità oltre i confini. Gestisci l'accesso al business e agli agenti AI. Preparare delegati fidati man mano che invecchiamo. Conservare, eliminare o trasmettere risorse digitali selezionate secondo i nostri desideri e la legge applicabile.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"Fornire il nome dell'autore o dell'inviato e collegamenti a documenti originali, annunci istituzionali o fonti verificabili. Autorizzazione sicura per materiale citato, immagini e co-paternità ove necessario.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"Beneficio pubblico e interessi commerciali","Publications and journal records":"Pubblicazioni e atti giornalistici","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"Q è un punto di contribuzione registrato sotto un ID civiltà. Non è trasferibile, non è negoziabile, non è una criptovaluta o uno strumento finanziario, non ha valore monetario e non può essere convertito in denaro.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q è un punto di contribuzione non trasferibile: non è una criptovaluta, non ha valore monetario, non è commerciabile.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"Q è un record di contributo, non di denaro.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q è l'iniziale di Quantum e di QCF. L'anello d'oro contiene un campo di stelle: ogni punto di luce all'interno è un co-costruttore di civiltà, disposto in una spirale ad angolo d'oro - l'ordine naturale condiviso da girasoli e galassie, ogni punto unico ma parte di un tutto. La luce più brillante al centro è la luce della genesi, il primo co-costruttore. La coda è una particella in transizione: la singola azione che inizia con una persona e cambia il tutto.","Q issued today":"Q emessa oggi","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"Q rimane con il tuo ID Civiltà: non trasferibile, non commerciabile, senza valore monetario. I dati demo risiedono solo in questo browser.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF SCIENZE DELLA VITA · BRIEF DI RICERCA","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"QCF mira a supportare la preparazione medica civile attraverso registrazioni riproducibili, revisione indipendente e sviluppo graduale soggetto a requisiti etici, normativi e di qualità. La salvaguardia della civiltà inizia con il rispetto per la vita, i partecipanti alla ricerca e le prove scientifiche.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"Valutazione QCF: dare priorità alle infrastrutture energetiche a sicurezza quantistica.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"QCF unisce le persone per costruire, preservare e salvaguardare la civiltà umana. La nostra prima fase si concentra sulla collaborazione internazionale nel campo delle scienze della vita: ricerca verificabile, innovazione responsabile e conoscenza condivisa per rafforzare la resilienza alle principali crisi sanitarie e di sanità pubblica.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"QCF monitora continuamente i principali sviluppi nel campo dell'informatica quantistica, del rilevamento, delle comunicazioni, della crittografia post-quantistica, delle reti e della metrologia, valutando la rilevanza pratica per la misurazione dell'energia, dati affidabili, comunicazioni sicure, RWA e infrastrutture. Questa pagina conserva solo titoli e riassunti concisi; I PDF bilingue cinese-inglese sono conservati come archivi di ricerca QCF a lungo termine.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"Base di implementazione QCF: informatica, rilevamento, comunicazioni, PQC e metrologia","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"Valutazione editoriale QCF: è garantita una valutazione scientifica graduale. Gli specialisti competenti dovrebbero esaminare i dati originali, i metodi statistici e la replica indipendente, insieme alla potenza, alla sicurezza e alla qualità della produzione delle cellule umane, prima di giudicare la fattibilità clinica. Ulteriori ricerche richiedono inoltre una proprietà, autorizzazioni e responsabilità chiare per l’utilizzo dei dati.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"QCF stabilito: misurazione affidabile → comunicazione sicura → verifica oracolo → RWA/regolamento del registro.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"QCF invita gli storici, gli operatori sanitari, gli archivi e tutti i co-costruttori di civiltà a contribuire con registrazioni verificabili delle vite perdute. Insieme possiamo portare alla luce storie trascurate, preservare conoscenze affidabili e trasformare la cura e il sostegno in azioni per salvaguardare la vita.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"QCF è destinata ad essere stabilita a Zugo, in Svizzera ed è attualmente in preparazione, non ancora registrata. Questa pagina descrive i principi proposti; ciò non implica che tutti i meccanismi siano operativi.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"Prospettiva QCF: una documentazione condivisa della vita umana","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"QCF propone Civilization ID × NU-Key: una visione di ricerca aperta per identità digitale autocontrollata, credenziali verificabili, accesso sicuro, un inventario delle risorse digitali e un'eredità digitale legittima. Una chiave universale non è una password principale che bypassa ogni piattaforma. È un gateway controllato dall'utente che coordina credenziali e autorizzazioni separate.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"QCF cerca di rendere la conoscenza verificabile più accessibile, incoraggiando la curiosità verso le origini umane e la cura per la diversità culturale. La ricerca sul nostro passato condiviso non dovrebbe mai essere utilizzata per classificare le comunità attuali o prescriverne le identità. Preservare la conoscenza è un modo per prendersi cura delle generazioni che seguiranno.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"Visione QCF: accesso più equo alla salute genomica","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E non promuove affermazioni non verificate sull'\"energia quantistica\". Si distinguono esperimenti, prototipi, annunci aziendali e speculazioni; le tecnologie quantistiche inseriscono le dichiarazioni di capacità QCF solo dopo una validazione riproducibile in un caso d'uso definito.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"Il prossimo passo di QCF: due diligence scientifica graduale","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"Quantinuum Helios ha riportato progressi nella correzione degli errori della memoria logica.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"Fondazione Civiltà Quantistica (in formazione). Da stabilirsi nel Cantone di Zugo, Svizzera; non ancora iscritto nel registro delle imprese e senza personalità giuridica.","Quantum Civilization University":"Università della Civiltà Quantistica","Quantum Q · free testing":"Quantum Q · test gratuito","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"Tecnologia quantistica per l'energia della Terra ⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"Il calcolo quantistico converge con l'HPC; progresso nelle comunicazioni e nella produzione di dispositivi","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"Il rilevamento quantistico diventa un candidato prioritario per la validazione energetica del QCF","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"Scienze della vita guidate dai quanti","RMB stablecoin":"Stablecoin RMB","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"Preparazione medica in caso di lesioni da radiazioni","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"Leggi di HeLa e la protezione dei dati sanitari","Read our life-sciences brief":"Leggi il nostro brief sulle scienze della vita","Read our mission":"Leggi la nostra mission","Read the civilization brief":"Leggi il brief di civiltà","Reading and extending this record":"Leggere e ampliare questo disco","Ready to launch yours?":"Pronti a lanciare il vostro?","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"Registra la civiltà · Salvaguarda la vita · Costruisci insieme la civiltà","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"Registrare, salvaguardare e costruire insieme la civiltà","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"Registrare la civiltà significa preservare conoscenze, contributi e ricerche tracciabili. Salvaguardare la civiltà significa proteggere la vita e le scelte individuali. Costruire insieme la civiltà significa condividere i benefici della cooperazione internazionale.","Register a Civilization ID":"Registra un ID civiltà","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"Rimanendo all'obiettivo della Fase 1 (CHF)","Remembering lives lost in war":"Ricordare le vite perse in guerra","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"Ricordare le vite perse a causa di epidemie e malattie","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"Replicare l'efficacia sugli animali in modo indipendente, utilizzando controlli appropriati, randomizzazione e valutazione in cieco per esaminare la sopravvivenza, la risposta alla dose e la finestra di trattamento post-esposizione.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"Reporting dell'architetto Civilization Jessica Sage · Aggiornato settimanalmente","Research approach and evidence status":"Approccio della ricerca e stato delle evidenze","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"Solo concetto di ricerca: NU-Key, accesso multipiattaforma ed eredità digitale automatica non sono attualmente servizi operativi. Non viene offerto l'accesso ad account di terze parti o il trasferimento di risorse.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"Istituti di ricerca, specialisti clinici, esperti di etica e governance dei dati e sostenitori filantropici sono invitati a iniziare una conversazione. Si prega di condividere una introduzione istituzionale e una sintesi non confidenziale; non inviare tramite e-mail dati genomici personali, cartelle cliniche o dettagli di brevetti non pubblicati.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"Ricercatore e fondazione scientifica","Reset demo":"Ripristina demo","Responsible person":"Persona responsabile","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"Ripensare l'umanità: sovranità dei dati sulla salute umana e condivisione equa dei benefici ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"Ripensare l'umanità: la fisica quantistica sta ridefinendo la nostra comprensione della realtà","Review and recognition":"Recensione e riconoscimento","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"Albo d'Onore fino al 31 marzo 1921; la cifra più ristretta dal 4 agosto 1914 all'11 novembre 1918 è 59.357. Non aggiungerli.","SARS · global":"SARS · globale","Sample initiative":"Iniziativa campione","Science and ethics":"Scienza ed etica","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"La scienza al servizio della vita.<br>Collaborazione oltre confine.","Scope and limitations":"Ambito e limitazioni","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"Scorri orizzontalmente per la tabella completa. Aprire ciascuna fonte per il record originale; leggere date e cifre insieme alla loro portata.","Seat 1":"Posto 1","Seat 2":"Posto 2","Seat 3":"Posto 3","Seat 4":"Posto 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"I posti sono segnaposto. Le partnership formali richiedono la due diligence e un accordo scritto. Contatta l'e-mail in attesa del go-live della fondazione.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Seconda Guerra Mondiale · Canada e Terranova","Second World War · global estimate":"Seconda Guerra Mondiale · stima globale","Security verification":"Verifica di sicurezza","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"Vedi Impressum. Ai sensi della legge federale svizzera sulla protezione dei dati (nDSG) e del GDPR, ove applicabile.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"Cercare competenze indipendenti pertinenti per esaminare prove, etica e fattibilità della ricerca.","Selected":"Selezionato","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"Documenti selezionati di due guerre mondiali · Popolazioni parziali","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"Morti in servizio, comprese ferite e malattie; la scadenza commemorativa si estende al 31 agosto 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"Condividi un link (max 10/giorno)","Share link":"Condividi link","Source":"Fonte","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"Priorità di fonte: archivi nazionali, statistiche ufficiali e istituzioni di pubblica memoria; OMS per i dati sulle malattie. I resoconti storici ufficiali possono essi stessi utilizzare stime. Le aggiunte devono identificare il periodo, la geografia, la popolazione, il tipo di figura e la versione della fonte; le definizioni contrastanti vengono spiegate anziché combinate in un totale preciso.","Sources and further reading":"Fonti e approfondimenti","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"Le fonti documentano la storia e le ricerche; la citazione non implica partnership, finanziamento o approvazione di QCF.","Stablecoins":"Stablecoin","Start free testing":"Inizia i test gratuiti","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"Ripartire come istituto e corsi aperti (visione): registrare, studiare, tramandare e co-costruire la civiltà. I titoli di studio richiedono l'accreditamento applicabile.","Status":"Stato","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"Stato: preparazione e due diligence | Aggiornato: 2 novembre 2026","Support":"Supporto","Support (opening soon)":"Assistenza (di prossima apertura)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Sostieni l'iniziativa Global Civilization Co-builders","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"I sostenitori donano volontariamente (si apre dopo la registrazione).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"Sostenere l'uso dell'informatica quantistica, del rilevamento quantistico e dell'intelligenza artificiale nella scoperta di farmaci, nella medicina di precisione e nella ricerca sulla longevità, nell'ambito della scienza sottoposta a revisione paritaria. Nessun consiglio medico o indicazione sulla salute.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"Sostenere applicazioni verificabili di calcolo quantistico, rilevamento, comunicazioni, PQC e metrologia nella ricerca energetica. I titoli e i riassunti settimanali sono pubblicati apertamente; I PDF bilingui vengono archiviati in modo permanente per l'accesso a Civilization Co-builders/Civilization ID.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"Stablecoin in franchi svizzeri","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"L'infrastruttura quantistica svizzera, la pianificazione della griglia quantistica del DOE e EuroQCI hanno formato la lista di controllo iniziale.","TWINT":"TWINT","Terms":"Termini","Terms of Use":"Termini di utilizzo","Test email:":"Email di prova:","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"Il test è gratuito prima della registrazione formale. I servizi in abbonamento e i vantaggi speciali per i primi Envoys seguiranno le regole annunciate in quel momento. Il test non attiva mai addebiti automatici.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"La corrispondenza di sangue del 2009 di Abdel-Mageed e colleghi elenca Deng come autore corrispondente. Un vettore adenovirale è stato utilizzato per esprimere la superossido dismutasi extracellulare, EC-SOD (SOD3), nelle cellule mesenchimali stromali/staminali (MSC) del midollo osseo di topo. I topi hanno ricevuto 500.000 cellule ingegnerizzate per via endovenosa 24 ore dopo un'irradiazione totale del corpo di 9 Gy. La sopravvivenza a 35 giorni riportata è stata del 52%, rispetto al 10% per la soluzione salina e al 9% per le cellule modificate con il gene reporter. Questi risultati riguardano un modello murino specifico e non possono essere convertiti in benefici umani attesi.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"Il documento del 2015 dimostra anche la trasduzione adenovirale e la secrezione di EC-SOD biologicamente attive da parte di MSC del midollo osseo umano in vitro. Gli esperimenti su cellule umane non sono studi clinici sull’uomo. La rivista è Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, che non deve essere confusa con riviste con nomi simili.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"Il CV del 2023 elenca separatamente US7.547.545 e la domanda 18/199.975 riguardante la differenziazione cellulare e il miglioramento della risposta immunitaria del vaccino. Non stabiliscono la concessione del brevetto o l'efficacia per il candidato alla radiazione.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"Il 6% descritto nella pagina delle iniziative è una proposta di servizi di piattaforma esistente. Il programma sulle scienze della vita avrà un proprio budget dichiarato. I punti di contributo o i voti del pubblico non sostituiscono il giudizio scientifico o etico.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"Il CV elenca il ruolo di direttore della citogenetica presso LabCorp Integrated Oncology dal 2017; questa non è la conferma di un appuntamento attuale per il 2026. I ruoli attuali, l'autorizzazione istituzionale e le responsabilità del QCF richiedono una verifica aggiornata. Le pubblicazioni e i registri dei brevetti riportati di seguito possono essere consultati in modo indipendente.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"L'ID della civiltà Genesis","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"L'esperimento biotecnologico individuale: intelligenza artificiale, robotica e scoperta di farmaci ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"La Quantum Civilization Foundation ritiene che la nostra più vera identità condivisa sia semplicemente questa: un membro della civiltà umana. A tutti coloro che lo scelgono, rilasciamo un ID civiltà: non ti chiede mai da dove vieni, registra solo ciò che porti alla civiltà.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"L'amministrazione degli archivi di Stato presenta un'indagine d'archivio di Nanchino del febbraio 1946 che registra oltre 300.000. Indagine storica; un sottoinsieme di morti durante la guerra in Cina.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"L'Università di Göteborg riporta l'analisi del DNA di più di 4.500 individui antichi, inclusi 712 genomi appena sequenziati. I ricercatori suggeriscono che i migranti che entrarono in Scandinavia circa 4.000 anni fa potrebbero aver trasportato un antenato delle lingue germaniche. Una migrazione successiva, diversi secoli prima dell'era vichinga, coincise con l'emergere dell'antico norvegese.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"La domanda e il bilancio per fasi sono in preparazione. L'utilizzo dei fondi, i costi amministrativi, la selezione dei progetti e la supervisione saranno definiti dopo la due diligence. Questa pagina non raccoglie pagamenti.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"Il sottotitolo identifica il commento editoriale di QCF. La ricerca originale appartiene ai suoi autori e ai relativi titolari dei diritti. La citazione non implica alcuna approvazione istituzionale o licenza tecnologica.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"Lo studio Celtico complementare analizza i dati dell'intero genoma di 4.587 individui antichi. Confrontando i modelli migratori, i suoi autori ritengono che la spiegazione più parsimoniosa della dispersione celtica sia un’espansione verso ovest dall’Europa centro-orientale avvenuta circa 3.000 anni fa. I conteggi dei campioni negli studi non devono essere sommati come se rappresentassero individui separati.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"I risultati forniscono un punto di partenza per la ricerca traslazionale. Lo sviluppo deve innanzitutto distinguere il trattamento di emergenza delle lesioni acute da radiazioni dalla protezione contro le lesioni dei tessuti normali correlate alla radioterapia. Queste impostazioni coinvolgono popolazioni, finestre di trattamento, endpoint e considerazioni rischio-beneficio diverse. Quella che segue è l’analisi di QCF, non un protocollo clinico avviato o autorizzato.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"Il primo ID civiltà, 2026000001, appartiene alla fondatrice, Jessica Sage. L’Iniziativa Global Civilization Co-builders inizia qui.","The golden Q: a quantum":"La Q d'oro: un quanto","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"La versione live raccoglierà le e-mail solo per emettere e verificare gli ID di civiltà; nessuna nazionalità, razza, religione o altri dati sensibili. È possibile richiedere l'accesso, la correzione e la cancellazione.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"Il piano include la visibilità su scopi, destinatari e record di accesso, e un modo per ritirare le autorizzazioni future. I limiti relativi alle analisi completate, ai risultati pubblicati e alla conservazione richiesta devono essere spiegati al momento del consenso.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"La prospettiva QCF precedente è un commento editoriale di Jessica Sage, separato dai risultati della ricerca.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"Il team del progetto intende esplorare la collaborazione con potenziali partner tra cui Beijing Nuosai Gene. Le persone giuridiche, le autorizzazioni, i protocolli e le disposizioni etiche saranno pubblicati dopo la due diligence; ciò non indica una partnership firmata o un lancio di campionamento globale.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"Il progetto proposto combina crittografia consolidata, gestione delle chiavi, accesso con ambito e registrazioni di audit. L’intelligenza artificiale può supportare la ricerca e il rilevamento di anomalie; non sostituisce la crittografia, il consenso informato o la revisione degli esperti.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"L'aggregatore pubblico etichetta entrambe le applicazioni statunitensi come Abbandonate. Questo non è un parere legale. Lo stato attuale, altri diritti familiari nazionali, la proprietà e qualsiasi licenza per QCF richiedono la verifica di documenti ufficiali e di accordi scritti. Nominare un inventore non stabilisce la proprietà di QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"Il lavoro pubblicato esplora le cellule staminali mesenchimali che esprimono la superossido dismutasi extracellulare (ECSOD). Gli studi su cellule e topi elencati forniscono una base per ulteriori valutazioni, senza stabilire la sicurezza umana, l’efficacia o la protezione contro tutti i danni in un conflitto nucleare.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"Le pubblicazioni di brevetti relativi alle radiazioni riguardano cellule staminali mesenchimali modificate. Gli inventori nominati includono Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed e Anthony J. Senagore. Si tratta di identificatori di domanda/pubblicazione, non di prova di un brevetto concesso e applicabile.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"La sequenza di riferimento combinava il DNA di più donatori. I ricercatori di Buffalo hanno reclutato volontari attraverso annunci pubblici e hanno raccolto il sangue dopo il consenso informato. Non si trattava di uno screening su tutta la popolazione, né della prova di un programma di campionamento globale gestito dalle Nazioni Unite o da tutti e cinque i membri permanenti del Consiglio di Sicurezza.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"Il canale di immissione delle iscrizioni è in fase di collegamento. Scarica subito il modello per preparare il testo e le fonti. Il download di un modello non comporta l'invio di un contributo o di punti premio.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"Il modello non richiede DNA, numeri di documenti d'identità o cartelle cliniche. È possibile aggiungere un ID civiltà dopo l'emissione di un numero formale.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"L'identificativo univoco è l'ID di Civiltà registrato in modo indipendente, con un collegamento di autorizzazione volontario. DNA non è un numero identificativo pubblico o una password di accesso. L’identità non può essere ridotta alla genetica; i gemelli identici mostrano anche perché il DNA da solo non può stabilire un’identità unica per ogni persona.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Questi sono obiettivi di progettazione e governance. L'attuale Civilization ID è una dimostrazione front-end, senza alcun sistema completo di dati sanitari implementato; questo sito web non raccoglie dati genomici personali.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"Questi record non vengono sommati: i totali a livello di guerra si sovrappongono ai sottoinsiemi nazionali e cittadini; la mortalità cumulativa, annuale ed in eccesso misurano cose diverse e le morti per guerra e per malattia possono sovrapporsi. Vengono mantenuti valori, intervalli e qualificatori \"più di\" approssimativi.","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"Questa anteprima del design non invia dati a nessun server. L'e-mail, il nome dell'inviato e la cronologia dei contributi rimangono nell'archivio locale del tuo browser e possono essere cancellati in qualsiasi momento. Nessun cookie, analisi o risorse di terze parti.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"Questa prima edizione comprende nove record di guerra, nazionali e di eventi. La cifra arrotondata combina oltre 9 milioni di morti militari durante la prima guerra mondiale e circa 60 milioni di morti globali durante la seconda guerra mondiale. I sottoinsiemi nazionali e urbani non vengono aggiunti nuovamente. Non si tratta di un totale di tutte le guerre o di tutta la storia.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"Questa prima edizione include dieci record forniti dall'OMS. La cifra somma le stime storiche più basse per la peste nera in Europa e le pandemie influenzali del 1918, 1957 e 1968. Non si tratta del totale assoluto di epidemie e malattie.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"Questa storia non implica l'autorizzazione o il sostegno delle Nazioni Unite al QCF, né una successione ufficiale al Progetto Genoma Umano.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"Questo è un sito web in fase preparatoria. La fondazione non è ancora registrata; tutte le funzionalità disponibili del sito Web possono essere testate gratuitamente. Le iscrizioni e le donazioni si aprono dopo la registrazione formale e l'apertura del conto bancario. Un abbonamento richiede che l'utente scelga e confermi il prezzo e i termini; i test non diventano mai automaticamente un piano a pagamento.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"Questo è il principio che miriamo a mettere in pratica attraverso una tecnologia convalidata, operazioni responsabili e una supervisione continua.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"Questa pagina descrive una possibile contromisura medica per le lesioni da radiazioni. L’approccio pubblicato non è equivalente a un vaccino. Se il “vaccino contro le radiazioni” proposto è un candidato diverso, la sua definizione tecnica e il dossier delle prove necessitano di una documentazione separata.","This preview":"Questa l'anteprima","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"QKD a fibra passiva per tre utenti ha esplorato architetture multinodo più semplici.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"Da stabilirsi a Zugo, Svizzera; attualmente preparatorio e non ancora registrato. Fondatrice: Jessica Sage (ID Civilization 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"Gli argomenti includono civiltà e discipline umanistiche, scienze della vita, ricerca quantistica ed energetica, intelligenza artificiale e tecnologia, azioni di pubblica utilità e cooperazione internazionale.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"Fiducia attraverso l'evidenza.<br>Gestione attraverso la trasparenza.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"Prova a creare un ID civiltà","Try the Civilization ID flow":"Prova il flusso Civilization ID","Tuberculosis · global annual":"Tubercolosi · globale annuale","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"L'UNESCO ha adottato la Dichiarazione universale sul genoma umano e i diritti umani l'11 novembre 1997; l’Assemblea Generale delle Nazioni Unite lo ha approvato con la risoluzione 53/152 del 9 dicembre 1998. Questa storia offre un riferimento etico: la scienza dovrebbe essere al servizio del benessere umano e le persone non devono essere ridotte alle loro caratteristiche genetiche.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"Resoconto storico del Dipartimento dell'Energia degli Stati Uniti, che copre il periodo 1931-1945; una stima, non un registro unificato. Altre istituzioni differiscono. Le voci di paesi/eventi della Seconda Guerra Mondiale riportate di seguito non devono essere aggiunte nuovamente.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"ID verificati","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"Verifica entità partner, mandati, proprietà intellettuale e prove di ricerca.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"Figura del Veterans Affairs Canada per il personale di servizio; esclude altri paesi.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"Relativi alla guerra del Vietnam · Documenti militari statunitensi","View all civilization briefs →":"Visualizza tutti i riassunti della civiltà →","View all publications →":"Visualizza tutte le pubblicazioni →","Visa":"Visto","Vote":"Vota","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"Stima annuale OMS 2024, incluse 150.000 persone con HIV; non cumulativo e si sovrappone alla voce HIV.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"Dati OMS 2024: intervallo di stima 37,6–53,4 milioni. Cifra cumulativa a lungo termine; si sovrappone a condizioni come la tubercolosi.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"Revisione OMS Europa: stima primo anno; altri modelli/cut-off differiscono. Non un totale di tutti i tempi.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"Intervallo di stima dell'OMS 13,3–16,6 milioni; effetti pandemici diretti e indiretti, decessi non confermati o tutti gli anni di pandemia.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"Stima storica dell'OMS, non decessi segnalati da singoli individui.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"Il totale riportato nella pagina dell'epidemia dell'OMS include i paesi colpiti al di fuori dell'Africa occidentale; l’epidemia è terminata a giugno 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"Le vittime della guerra non sono automaticamente morti; i casi di malattia e i tassi di mortalità non contano i decessi. Il valore di una vita non è determinato dalla nazionalità, dall’etnia o dall’identità.","War remembrance":"Ricordo di guerra","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"Sosteniamo la ricerca che prevenga la ripetizione dell'uso senza un adeguato consenso informato, rispetti la scelta individuale e riconosca i contributi alla scienza. Salvaguardiamo insieme il benessere umano.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"Il nostro obiettivo è trasformare la conoscenza scientifica in opportunità di salute che le persone possano comprendere, scegliere e da cui trarre beneficio. La nostra visione a lungo termine è un accesso equo alla salute genomica; il primo passo è la ricerca mirata al beneficio pubblico e progetti pilota di screening volontario con risultati interpretabili e cure di follow-up.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"Non siamo spettatori. Siamo co-costruttori. Co-costruzione e co-creazione di civiltà: per consegnare un mondo migliore alla prossima generazione.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"Invitiamo cittadini, crittografi, ingegneri dell'identità, esperti legali, sviluppatori e famiglie filantropiche a co-creare un futuro in cui le persone controllano la propria identità digitale e scelgono ciò che lasciano dietro di sé.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"Preserviamo la storia della scienza e ci assumiamo la responsabilità del futuro della vita. Cerchiamo una ricerca oltre confine al servizio delle persone, un utilizzo dei dati che rispetti le scelte individuali e una civiltà sostenuta attraverso la cooperazione e la cura.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"Ricordiamo affinché più vite abbiano un futuro.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"Condividiamo un'unica Terra e la responsabilità per il futuro della civiltà. Lasciamo che la tecnologia sia al servizio della vita, che la conoscenza passi da una generazione all’altra e che ogni atto di gentilezza aiuti a costruire la nostra civiltà condivisa.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"Trascorriamo la vita a creare risorse digitali, impronte, conoscenze, ricordi e imprese. Se invecchiamo, perdiamo capacità o moriamo, i nostri cari sapranno cosa esiste? Tutto ciò che abbiamo costruito dovrebbe semplicemente svanire?","WeChat Pay":"WeChat Pay","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"Le funzionalità del sito web possono essere testate gratuitamente prima che la fondazione venga formalmente registrata. I servizi di abbonamento inizieranno dopo la registrazione, con vantaggi speciali previsti per i primi Civilization Envoys; l'idoneità e i dettagli saranno annunciati.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"Weiwen Deng e la ricerca sulle lesioni da radiazioni","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, ha lavorato nel campo della citogenetica, delle cellule staminali e della terapia genica. Il CV del 2023 fornito a QCF registra una laurea in medicina nel 1990, un master in microbiologia e immunologia nel 1993 e un dottorato di ricerca a Tulane in biologia molecolare e cellulare nel 2004, insieme a precedenti ricerche e leadership nel laboratorio di cellule staminali mesenchimali presso l'ospedale pediatrico Helen DeVos.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng: pubblicazioni, brevetti e status","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"Benvenuto, Co-costruttore di Civiltà","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"Epidemia di Ebola nell'Africa occidentale e paesi colpiti","What did the studies find?":"Cosa hanno scoperto gli studi?","What do the two papers establish?":"Cosa stabiliscono le due carte?","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"Quando la vita finisce, il nostro mondo digitale scompare o continua a vivere?","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"Perché l'ID della civiltà e la protezione dei dati sanitari sono importanti","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"Popolazione mondiale · stima metà 2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"Non hai ancora un ID civiltà","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"La tua identità. La tua sovranità. La tua eredità.","Your informed choice":"La tua scelta consapevole","next":"avanti","opens after registration":"apre dopo la registrazione","spent by co-builder vote":"speso per voto co-costruttore","← Life sciences":"← Scienze della vita","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69.000.000"},"es":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · Debida diligencia","02 · Independent review":"02 · Revisión independiente","03 · Pilot design":"03 · Diseño piloto","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · Informe de progreso","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"Entrelazamiento átomo-fotón de 1530 nm y red cuántica avanzada de banda de telecomunicaciones QKD de fibra de 50 km.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"Simulación de átomo neutro de 180 qubit: Nature informó sobre experimentos en dinámica cuántica de desequilibrio.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997–1998: progreso científico y dignidad humana","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"Iniciativa preparatoria 2026 · La información ya está disponible. Este sitio web no recopila ADN ni acepta archivos genómicos.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6% es el total combinado de los cuatro servicios. El proceso de división, custodia y ALD será confirmado por un abogado suizo antes del registro.","72,000,000+":"72.000.000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"El nombre de un enviado de civilización","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"Una identificación de Civilization es una identidad de contribución dentro de QCF, no un pasaporte, ciudadanía o documento de identidad legal.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"Un esfuerzo científico que traspasa fronteras","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"Un estudio independiente investigó una vacuna peptídica contra el COVID-19 combinada con una vacuna contra el tétanos en caballos. No demuestra una vacuna contra la radiación ni eficacia humana.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"Un plan voluntario para vincular datos genómicos personales con una identificación de Civilization","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H1N1) · mundial","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H2N2) · global","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H3N2) · mundial","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"Abdel-Mageed et al., con Weiwen Deng como coautor. Tema: células madre mesenquimales genéticamente modificadas y supervivencia de ratones irradiados. Evidencia: investigación con animales; sección de la revista: Correspondencia.","About":"Acerca de","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"Los envíos aceptados pueden reconocerse según las reglas de contribución publicadas. Los puntos de prueba no se convierten automáticamente en recompensas oficiales. No incluya información personal de salud o genómica sin consentimiento.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"Aceptado a través de un proveedor con licencia suiza, convertido a CHF al tipo de cambio en el momento de la recepción, con recibo de donación emitido.","Account":"Cuenta","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"Cuenta por separado para la investigación de beneficio público, la traducción de medicamentos comerciales y la inversión en infraestructura. Divulgar transacciones con partes relacionadas, acuerdos de propiedad intelectual y conflictos, con recusación y revisión independiente.","Alipay":"Alipay","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"Todas las funciones disponibles del sitio web se pueden probar de forma gratuita antes de que la fundación se registre formalmente. Los servicios de suscripción comienzan después del registro; El plan actual es de 20 CHF / USD / EUR por mes, y los servicios y condiciones de pago se muestran claramente antes de suscribirse.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"Todos los botones de pago están deshabilitados por ahora. Permiten después del registro formal, la apertura de una cuenta bancaria y la incorporación del sistema de pago. Las donaciones pueden requerir controles AML/KYC aplicables. No se reclama ningún tratamiento fiscal ni deducibilidad.","All publications":"Todas las publicaciones","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"Un equipo de IonQ informó sobre un entrelazamiento heterogéneo en la escala de kilohercios.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"Cualquier cocreador con un ID de Civilization puede lanzar una iniciativa sobre cualquier tema.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"Cualquiera puede lanzar una Iniciativa de Civilización","Apple Pay":"Apple Pay","Apply to become a payment partner":"Solicite convertirse en socio de pagos","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"A partir de la revisión de fuente pública del 10 de noviembre de 2026, no se identificó ningún registro de ensayo en humanos ni aprobación regulatoria para esta indicación de radiación MSC diseñada por EC-SOD. Siguen siendo necesarios identificadores de registro y documentos de autorización verificables. Los ensayos de otras formulaciones de SOD, miméticos o células para otras enfermedades no validan este candidato.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"Evaluar enfoques candidatos para prevenir o tratar lesiones por radiación para la protección civil y la preparación de la salud pública. La documentación y la revisión científica están pendientes; La seguridad y eficacia no están establecidas.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"En esta revisión, QCF no ha recibido un número de registro de ensayo en humanos, autorización regulatoria ni evidencia de aprobación de comercialización para este candidato. Quedan por documentar el progreso experimental actualizado, la replicación independiente, la calidad de fabricación y la vía de desarrollo clínico.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"Bombardeo atómico de Hiroshima · Japón","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"BTQ × Kaia anunció una colaboración de red de moneda estable con seguridad cuántica.","Back to Civilization ID":"Volver a ID de Civilización","Back to Life Sciences":"Regresar a Ciencias de la Vida","Back to population figures":"Volver a cifras de población","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"Conviértete en un co-constructor de civilización","Become a co-builder":"Conviértete en co-constructor","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"Conviértete en el próximo co-constructor de Civilization","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"Antes del consentimiento, explique el propósito, el destinatario, el alcance de la investigación, el período de retención y los riesgos. Evaluar nuevos usos por separado, incluido cualquier uso para el entrenamiento de IA.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"Detrás de cada número hay una persona, una vida y una familia. Recordar las vidas perdidas hace que la paz, la salud pública y la salvaguardia de la vida sean una responsabilidad compartida.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"Detrás de cada número había un nombre, una familia y una vida que quedó inconclusa. Registramos las pérdidas para valorar la vida hoy y apoyamos la ciencia para proteger la vida mañana.","Bilingual PDF":"PDF bilingüe","Bitcoin BTC":"Bitcoin BTC","Black Death · Europe":"Peste Negra · Europa","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"Limitado por evidencia verificable y revisada por pares","Browse published briefs":"Explorar resúmenes publicados","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"Por Civilization Architect Jessica Sage<br>Publicado el 5 de noviembre de 2026 · Informe de noticias de la naturaleza: 4 de noviembre de 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"COCONSTRUCTOR DE CIVILIZACIÓN · ACCESO AL ARCHIVO PDF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"ID DE CIVILIZACIÓN × NU-KEY","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · INICIATIVA GLOBAL DE INVESTIGACIÓN","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"Exceso de mortalidad asociada a COVID-19 · global","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"Descripción general del Museo Canadiense de la Guerra; Sólo personal militar/de servicio, no todas las muertes de civiles. Las entradas nacionales a continuación se superponen.","Cards & wallets":"Tarjetas y billeteras","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"Las células como fábricas de proteínas antioxidantes: la investigación de Weiwen Deng sobre las lesiones por radiación","Check in":"Regístrese","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"Elige un nuevo nombre de Civilization Envoy. Su identidad original puede permanecer oculta: muestre solo su número de identificación o su nuevo nombre.","Choose an amount":"Elige una cantidad","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"Estimación de la ciudad hasta finales de 1945; los efectos combinados de la explosión, la temperatura y la radiación, no las muertes debidas únicamente a la radiación ni el costo total a largo plazo.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"Arquitecto de civilización Jessica Sage | 10 de noviembre de 2026 | Comentario de investigación","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"Nombre del enviado de civilización (opcional)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"Se invita a los Enviados de Civilización a contribuir con artículos originales, conocimientos de investigación y relatos de acciones de beneficio público. El trabajo aceptado se puede registrar como una contribución vinculada a un Civilization ID y puntos Quantum Q.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"Se invita a los enviados de la civilización a contribuir. Compartir un trabajo que sea veraz, claro y verificable: conocimiento al servicio de la vida y acción que conecte a las personas.","Civilization ID":"Identificación de civilización","Civilization ID and privacy":"Identificación de civilización y privacidad","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"Actualmente, Civilization ID sigue siendo un registro de prueba gratuito para el navegador local, por lo que se trata de una puerta de prueba en lugar de una identidad central verificada. Una vez que el sistema central de Civilization ID esté en línea, el acceso a PDF se actualizará a una autorización confiable del lado del servidor.","Civilization ID goal":"Objetivo de identificación de civilización","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Civilization ID es actualmente una demostración frontal. El almacenamiento de datos de salud clínica y las funciones de gobernanza completas que se describen aquí no se implementan. Este sitio web no recopila datos genómicos personales.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"Civilization ID se concibe como un vínculo entre las contribuciones voluntarias y los permisos explícitos. Se deben separar la identidad, los registros de participación y los datos de salud sensibles; No se requiere ADN para participar. El cifrado debe funcionar junto con límites de propósito, auditorías de acceso, gobernanza independiente y retirada de permisos futuros. Una identificación por sí sola no puede garantizar la privacidad.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"Civilization ID admite registros de participación y contribución voluntaria; no es una identidad legal. No se requieren datos de ADN ni de salud para obtener una identificación. Las pruebas gratuitas actuales no constituyen un servicio de identidad central en vivo.","Civilization ID · free testing":"Civilization ID · prueba gratuita","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"Civilization ID: participación y permiso","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"Los ID y Q de Civilization actualmente utilizan registros almacenados en este navegador para realizar pruebas. Se están conectando el registro central, la admisión de envíos y las recompensas revisadas. La prueba es gratuita y nunca inicia una suscripción automáticamente.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"La civilización comienza con todo aquel que elige comenzar.","Claim my Civilization ID":"Reclama mi ID de Civilization","Claim your Civilization ID":"Reclama tu ID de Civilization","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"Transmisión en estado de clúster a lo largo de 29 km de ingeniería de red avanzada de fibra parcialmente desplegada.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"Resumen de co-construcción de civilización","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"Voto co-constructor · Servicios de fundación","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"Co-construyendo civilización.<br>Salvaguardando la vida.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"Co-creando civilización. Apreciando cada vida.","Coming soon":"Próximamente","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"Evaluación preclínica completa de seguridad de biodistribución, persistencia, respuestas inmunes, riesgo trombótico, vector residual y crecimiento anormal de tejido. Las aplicaciones de radioterapia también requieren una evaluación de los efectos sobre el control de tumores.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"Conecte cada contribución confirmada a su ID a través de Quantum Q. Durante las pruebas gratuitas, los puntos de prueba del navegador permanecen separados de los registros de contribución oficiales.","Contact":"Contacto","Contact the preparatory team":"Contacta con el equipo preparatorio","Contribute to civilization":"Contribuir a la civilización","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"Contribuye a nuestra memoria compartida →","Contribution history":"Historial de contribuciones","Contribution points Q":"Puntos de aporte Q","Contributions return to your ID":"Los aportes regresan a tu DNI","Controller":"Controlador","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"¿Podrían las células que secretan una proteína antioxidante ayudar a mitigar el daño tisular después de la radiación? El trabajo publicado por Weiwen Deng y sus colegas proporciona evidencia de ratones y células humanas in vitro. Es un enfoque preclínico que justifica más pruebas; No es un tratamiento humano aprobado.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"La cobertura se actualizará a partir de investigaciones originales rastreables, dejando claros los límites de la evidencia.","Create a local test ID":"Crear una identificación de prueba local","Create an ID · free testing":"Crea una identificación · prueba gratuita","Crypto":"Cripto","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"Etapa actual: preparación, due diligence de socios y revisión científica. Los ensayos clínicos, las pruebas de detección públicas y la recolección de donaciones bajo este programa no han comenzado.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"Validación de ingeniería independiente avanzada de DARPA QBI Stage C.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"El ADN no identifica directamente el idioma que alguien habló. Los patrones genéticos deben interpretarse junto con la arqueología y la lingüística, y el cambio de idioma no tiene por qué acompañar al reemplazo de la población. Estos hallazgos ayudan a probar hipótesis históricas; no decodifican el habla antigua.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"BORRADOR · pendiente de revisión legal","Daily births · estimate":"Nacimientos diarios · estimación","Daily check-in":"Registro diario","Daily deaths · estimate":"Muertes diarias · estimación","Dates / reporting period":"Fechas/período de informe","Dates, lives lost and source records":"Fechas, vidas perdidas y registros de origen","Deaths / fatality records":"Registros de defunciones / fatalidades","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"Muertes en el resumen de casos probables de la OMS; las fechas se refieren al período de inicio de la enfermedad.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"Definir un producto de célula humana reproducible: fuente, identidad, actividad EC-SOD y duración de la expresión, variación del donante, consistencia del lote, criopreservación y producción escalable.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"Definir beneficiarios, instituciones de ejecución, presupuestos, hitos y resultados mensurables.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"Definir protocolos y aprobaciones aplicables y requisitos éticos antes de que comience la investigación. Distinguir el trabajo exploratorio, los hallazgos validados y el marketing; informar incertidumbre y resultados negativos.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"Demostración: toque para intentar lanzar una iniciativa y recibir 100 Q.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"Demostración: su correo electrónico permanece en este navegador; no se envía ningún correo electrónico real.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"Deng et al.: mitigación de lesiones por radiación en ratones usando células madre mesenquimales modificadas secretoras de ECSOD. Weiwen Deng figura como primer autor y autor correspondiente. Evidencia: investigación preclínica.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"Desarrollar investigaciones piloto de detección y beneficio público enfocadas con condiciones, poblaciones y atención de seguimiento definidas. El alcance se establecerá después de la autorización del socio, la revisión ética y la verificación del protocolo.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"El desarrollo de lesiones agudas por radiación puede explorar vías aplicables, como la Regla Animal de la FDA. En condiciones específicas, permite estudios adecuados y controlados de eficacia en animales para respaldar la aprobación, manteniendo al mismo tiempo los requisitos de seguridad humana y calidad del producto. La elegibilidad y aprobación no están aseguradas. Los medicamentos existentes para las lesiones por radiación deben informar sobre las necesidades insatisfechas y la estrategia de comparación.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"La prevención de enfermedades, NAD⁺ y los mecanismos de envejecimiento, la investigación unicelular y regenerativa, la genómica de la IA y la epigenética son áreas de cobertura continua. Los resúmenes del QCF distinguirán los estudios en células y animales de los ensayos en humanos y la evidencia clínica. Un cambio en un marcador de edad biológica no es prueba de una vida más larga.","Disease remembrance":"Recuerdo de enfermedades","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"La recogida de donaciones y las suscripciones automáticas no están abiertas. CHF 100 millones es la solicitud propuesta para la primera fase, no fondos recaudados, prometidos o aprobados. Los presupuestos y honorarios detallados requieren diligencia debida y revisión de la gobernanza aplicable.","Donations":"Donaciones","Donations received":"Donaciones recibidas","Download bilingual PDF":"Descargar PDF bilingüe","Download submission template":"Descargar plantilla de envío","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"Nota editorial: este es un resumen y comentario de QCF escrito de forma independiente, no una reproducción o traducción oficial del artículo de Nature. El autor original de la noticia es Ewen Callaway; El crédito de investigación pertenece a los autores e instituciones de los artículos. El acceso al artículo completo de Nature puede requerir una suscripción.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"Revisión editorial: 2 de noviembre de 2026. Estas organizaciones se citan como fuentes; no se implica ninguna asociación, autorización o respaldo de QCF.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"Correo electrónico: [para configurar, p.e. contacto@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"Identidad cifrada","Encryption and key control":"Cifrado y control de claves","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"Involucrar a reguladores y comités de ética para establecer la clasificación de productos, estándares de calidad, el camino de desarrollo y los requisitos previos para la investigación en humanos. Sólo después de las autorizaciones necesarias se podrán considerar los primeros estudios en humanos centrados en la seguridad, la tolerabilidad y la actividad biológica mensurable.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"Rango estimado en la revisión histórica de la OMS.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"Rango estimado en la revisión histórica de la OMS; Las estimaciones varían entre publicaciones.","Ethereum ETH":"Etereum ETH","Event and population":"Evento y población","Every action is remembered by civilization":"Cada acción es recordada por la civilización.","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"Todos los días iniciamos sesión. A nuestros teléfonos, correo electrónico, bancos, servicios de salud, portales gubernamentales y cuentas en la nube. Más allá de las fronteras, repetimos contraseñas, códigos y controles de identidad. Nuestras vidas están fragmentadas en cientos de puertas digitales.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"Cada vida merece dignidad y recuerdo.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"Cada vida merece respeto. Todo uso de datos personales necesita límites claros.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"Cada nueva vida merece una cálida bienvenida.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"Cada gasto del 94 % se decide mediante el voto del co-constructor.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"Evidencia revisada: 2 de noviembre de 2026 | Preparación del programa y debida diligencia","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"Explora NU-Key y el legado digital","Explore Phase One →":"Explora la Fase Uno →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"Explore la colaboración entre innovadores farmacéuticos chinos y socios europeos de investigación, clínica e industria. La investigación de beneficio público, el acceso de los pacientes y la traducción comercial requieren objetivos, presupuestos y derechos separados.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"Explore el recuerdo y las fuentes de enfermedades →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"Explora la historia genómica y la visión de la fase uno","Explore the life-sciences programme":"Explora el programa de ciencias biológicas","Explore the phase-one programme":"Explora el programa de la fase uno","Explore the principles":"Explora los principios","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"Explora los recuerdos y las fuentes de la guerra →","First World War · Australia":"Primera Guerra Mundial · Australia","First World War · British military":"Primera Guerra Mundial · Ejército británico","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Primera Guerra Mundial · Canadá y Terranova","First World War · global military":"Primera Guerra Mundial · militar global","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"Conjunto de datos de primera edición · Revisado y repositorio actualizado: 2 de noviembre de 2026 · No hay estadísticas activas","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"Para mí, el valor de esta investigación radica en conectar disciplinas. Las ciencias de la vida ponen de relieve los movimientos del pasado; la arqueología y la lingüística nos ayudan a interpretar esos encuentros. Los idiomas y culturas que conocemos hoy merecen ser comprendidos dentro de una historia más larga de intercambio humano.","Founder":"Fundador","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"Cuatro pandemias históricas seleccionadas · Suma de estimaciones inferiores","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"Hace catorce mil millones de años el universo comenzó a partir de un solo punto. Hace cuatro mil millones de años, la vida se copió por primera vez en el océano. Hoy en día, ocho mil millones de personas comparten un planeta azul, todavía dividido por fronteras, colores, idiomas y creencias.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"El trabajo de magnetometría de diamante NV de Fraunhofer se convirtió en candidato para una PoC de monitoreo de energía.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"Prueba gratuita · Los registros permanecen actualmente en este navegador. No se trata de una emisión de identificación centralizada ni de una verificación por correo electrónico. Las cuentas reales y los registros entre dispositivos se abrirán cuando el servicio de registro esté conectado.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"De 1990 a 2003, el Proyecto Genoma Humano estableció una base para el genoma humano de referencia. Los NIH y el Departamento de Energía apoyaron el esfuerzo estadounidense; Las instituciones de secuenciación provinieron de EE. UU., Reino Unido, Francia, Alemania, Japón y China. Demostró el poder de la colaboración internacional y el conocimiento compartido.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"De la lección de HeLa a la responsabilidad de Civilization ID","From first login to a lasting legacy":"Desde el primer inicio de sesión hasta un legado duradero","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"Del laboratorio a la clínica: las próximas preguntas de investigación","From one idea to a civilization in action":"De una idea a una civilización en acción","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"De la lectura del genoma a la salvaguardia de la vida","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"De la evidencia de la investigación a la salvaguardia de la vida","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"De comprender los genomas a salvaguardar a cada persona","From vision to verifiable action":"De la visión a la acción verificable","Fund management":"Gestión de fondos","Funding and oversight":"Financiamiento y supervisión","Funding during preparation":"Financiamiento durante la preparación","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"Reúne a co-constructores de civilizaciones de todo el mundo para co-construir, registrar, transmitir y salvaguardar la civilización humana.","Genomic health research":"Investigación genómica en salud","Get Civilization ID":"Crear ID de civilización","Get your ID":"Obtén tu DNI","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniciativa de Co-Constructores de Civilización Global","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"Iniciativa de Co-Constructores de Civilización Global · Etapa preparatoria","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"Resúmenes globales de tecnología cuántica y ecosistemas energéticos","Google Pay":"Google Pago","Governance":"Gobernanza","Governance and funding principles":"Principios de gobernanza y financiación","Governance service":"Servicio de gobernanza","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"Muertes relacionadas con el VIH · global acumulativo","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"HeLa nos recuerda que preservar el conocimiento también requiere respeto por cada persona que está detrás. Civilization ID se concibe como un punto de entrada para registros de permisos y participación voluntaria, sin exponer el ADN, los registros médicos o las relaciones familiares. La protección requiere cifrado, separación de identidad y datos, permisos específicos y auditoría de acceso.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"Ayude a construir una civilización digital centrada en el ser humano","Help safeguard life":"Ayuda a salvaguardar la vida","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"Aquí puedes tomar un nuevo nombre: tu nombre de Civilization Envoy. Puedes dejar el pasado oculto y aparecer sólo como tu ID o nuevo nombre. Te unes por libre albedrío y avanzas por aporte voluntario. Cada acción, cada iniciativa, cada acción se convierte en una Q cuántica dorada, que regresa a tu ID.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"Ocultar mi identidad original; mostrar solo mi identificación o nombre de enviado","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"Total acumulado histórico: no hay cifra mundial confiable","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"Estimación histórica citada por la OMS, solo en Europa; no registro de casos contemporáneo. No hay fechas exactas de inicio/finalización en esta fuente.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"Figura histórica en la guía de investigación de los Archivos Nacionales del Reino Unido; no es un total mundial.","History and our genomic-health vision":"Historia y nuestra visión genómica-salud","Home":"Inicio","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"Cómo los genomas antiguos ayudan a rastrear la propagación de las lenguas germánica y celta","How initiatives work":"Cómo funcionan las iniciativas","Human research and regulatory evidence":"Investigación en humanos y evidencia regulatoria","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"He leído los <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacidad</a> y los <a class=gold href=terms.html>Términos</a> y entiendo que esto es una demostración; tarifas abiertas después del registro","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"IBM × ORNL × AMD lanzó una plataforma de codiseño para corrección de errores; Chicago System Two también apoya la investigación sobre optimización de redes.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"Los titulares de documentos de identidad pueden lanzar iniciativas sobre cualquier tema; los partidarios dan voluntariamente. El 94% de los fondos se asignan mediante el voto de los co-constructores; QCF cobra una tarifa de plataforma y gobernanza del 6%.","IDs registered":"DNI registrados","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporó ML-DSA en la identidad segura del dispositivo.","Impressum":"Pie de imprenta","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"La emulación clásica mejorada refuerza la necesidad de contar con líneas de base clásicas actuales.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"En 1951, muestras de tumores de Henrietta Lacks, que estaba recibiendo tratamiento para el cáncer de cuello uterino, se utilizaron para investigaciones sin su conocimiento ni consentimiento. La línea celular HeLa resultante hizo importantes contribuciones a la medicina, al tiempo que planteó preguntas duraderas sobre el consentimiento, la privacidad y la participación equitativa en los beneficios.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"En 2013, los NIH y la familia Lacks llegaron a un acuerdo sobre el acceso controlado a datos relevantes del genoma completo de HeLa. \"Inmortal\" describe la capacidad de la línea celular para seguir dividiéndose en condiciones de laboratorio adecuadas, no la inmortalidad de la propia Henrietta Lacks.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"En 2026, QCF planea desarrollar una iniciativa para un acceso más equitativo a la secuenciación del genoma. Junto con especialistas en investigación, atención médica y ética, nuestro objetivo es ayudar a las personas a comprender su información genómica mediante elecciones informadas y apoyo profesional adecuado. En un futuro sistema seguro, las personas podrían optar por vincular los registros genómicos a una identificación de Civilization emitida de forma independiente.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"En el artículo de investigación del Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy de 2015, Deng es el primer autor y autor correspondiente. Revisa el resultado de supervivencia anterior e informa el seguimiento entre los ratones supervivientes: una extensión de la vida útil de 207 días y un retraso de 39 días en la formación de cataratas. No se observó ningún tumor en el grupo tratado, mientras que se observó un tumor abdominal en el grupo de solución salina. Es necesario examinar minuciosamente el tamaño de la cohorte, la selección de supervivientes, la patología tumoral y la replicación independiente. Estas observaciones no establecen la prevención general del cáncer ni la extensión de la esperanza de vida. Los artículos describen trabajos relacionados, no dos réplicas independientes.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniciativa QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Iniciativa de Coconstructores de Civilización Global","Initiatives":"Iniciativas","Initiator":"Iniciador","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"Los iniciadores publican costos y gastos a medida que actúan.","International drug-research collaboration":"Colaboración internacional en investigación de medicamentos","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"Su valor público radica en un enfoque comprobable de la medicina de emergencia radiológica. No es un tratamiento de radiación completo ni una vacuna validada. Los experimentos reproducibles deben conectar el concepto con cualquier beneficio futuro para el paciente.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"Jessica Sage (fundadora). Dirección: [para agregar]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"Únase a las pruebas gratuitas: pruebe registrarse, registrarse y compartir. Las recompensas por contribuciones oficiales dependen de registros revisados ​​y confirmados.","LATEST ISSUED":"ÚLTIMA EMISIÓN","Launch":"Lanzamiento","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"Lanzar una iniciativa de civilización","Launch initiative":"Iniciativa de lanzamiento","Launch initiative (demo)":"Iniciativa de lanzamiento (demostración)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"Lanza con tu ID: meta, presupuesto, hitos. +100Q","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"Lanzado en 1990, el Proyecto Genoma Humano reunió a instituciones de investigación a través del Consorcio Internacional de Secuenciación del Genoma Humano. En 2003, presentó su secuencia del genoma humano de referencia, una base para comprender la vida, en lugar de secuenciar a cada persona.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"Aprendiendo de la historia de HeLa","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"Deja que tu contribución sea parte de nuestra historia compartida","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"Se invita a las instituciones de pago con licencia, billeteras y proveedores de cifrado que cumplan con las normas a convertirse en socios de construcción conjunta de Civilization y ayudar a construir vías de donación globales.","Life Sciences":"Ciencias de la vida","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"Ciencias biológicas y protección de la vida","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"Ciencias de la Vida | Nature Reports Nueva investigación sobre ADN antiguo ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Ciencias de la Vida | El experimento biotecnológico unipersonal: IA, robótica y descubrimiento de fármacos ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"La vida tiene un fin. La civilización debe continuar.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"Las ciencias biológicas son nuestra prioridad en la primera fase. La energía y la informática, junto con la educación sobre la civilización, siguen siendo direcciones de investigación y colaboración a largo plazo.","Life-science directions we will follow":"Direcciones de ciencias biológicas que seguiremos","Life-sciences news":"Noticias de ciencias biológicas","Life-sciences programme":"Programa de ciencias biológicas","Link my DNA":"Vincula mi ADN","Live version (planned)":"Versión en vivo (planificada)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"Vidas perdidas en la guerra · Estimación","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"Vidas perdidas a causa de epidemias y enfermedades · Estimación","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"Objetivo a largo plazo: 1.000.000 de ID de Civilization. Solicitud propuesta para ciencias biológicas de la primera fase: CHF 100.000.000; no fondos recaudados o prometidos.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"La pérdida del conocimiento no es la muerte. Una señal respiratoria o un evento biométrico nunca debe desencadenar de forma independiente una transferencia irreversible de activos. La delegación de emergencia y la herencia requieren salvaguardias separadas, consentimiento documentado, verificación independiente y revisión legal. Civilization ID no reemplaza los pasaportes, la identificación electrónica nacional o el KYC bancario.","Manage future permissions":"Administrar permisos futuros","Mastercard":"Mastercard","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"Método: proyecciones 2026; los nacimientos y las muertes son promedios diarios anuales redondeados, no recuentos de personas vivas de hoy.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"Método: QCF compiló estos resúmenes de registros seleccionados y las organizaciones fuente no los publicaron como totales combinados. No son recuentos en vivo. Las dos categorías pueden superponerse y no deben sumarse. Verificado y repositorio actualizado: 2026-11-02.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"Pistas de migración, interpretadas junto con evidencia lingüística","Mission":"Misión","My ID":"Mi ID","My contribution":"Mi aporte","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"Extracto de NARA del 29 de abril de 2008. Las fechas registradas de incidentes/muertes abarcan entre 1956 y 2006, no la duración de la guerra. Muertes hostiles y no hostiles; no el número total de víctimas de la guerra.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"NIST IR 8547 estableció una hoja de ruta para la transición a la criptografía poscuántica.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"NIST PQC estaba listo para su implementación; la detección y la metrología se convirtieron en candidatos a datos confiables a largo plazo.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"El trabajo de peine de frecuencia óptica a escala de chip del NIST apunta hacia una metrología de precisión compacta.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"Masacre de Nanjing · China","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"Nature Reports Nueva investigación de ADN antiguo","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"El reloj nuclear Nature torio-229 estudia metrología cuántica avanzada y sincronización de precisión.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"La interfaz espín-fotón de una sola molécula de la naturaleza y la coexistencia de fibras cuánticas/clásicas entraron en el radar de la investigación.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"El informe de noticias de Nature escrito por Ewen Callaway, publicado el 4 de noviembre de 2026, examina nueva evidencia genética relevante para la historia de las lenguas europeas. Este resumen del QCF se basa en ese informe, un resumen de la investigación y el anuncio de la universidad participante.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"Próxima identificación de civilización que se emitirá","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"No se implica ninguna afiliación ni respaldo de las Naciones Unidas.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"No se envía ningún correo electrónico y no se verifica la propiedad del correo electrónico.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"Ninguna serie de mortalidad global cubre todas las enfermedades desde el surgimiento de la civilización. Esta edición contiene diez registros históricos, acumulativos y anuales de brotes, principalmente enfermedades infecciosas, obtenidos de la OMS. No es exhaustivo. Las cifras anteriores a la OMS son estimaciones históricas citadas por la OMS.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"Ningún registro armonizado cubre todas las guerras y países desde el surgimiento de la civilización. Esta edición contiene nueve registros de guerra, nacionales y de eventos, concentrados en la historia moderna. Los conflictos antiguos y medievales y muchas regiones aún no están cubiertos. Las entradas que faltan no significan cero muertes.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"No se necesita información de nacionalidad, raza o creencias. Utilice un correo electrónico de ejemplo para realizar pruebas gratuitas; No se requieren datos de identidad reales.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"No se realiza ninguna declaración sobre el tratamiento fiscal de cualquier donación.","No tax claims":"Sin reclamaciones de impuestos","No use without clear authorization":"No uso sin autorización clara","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"Relojes nucleares, entrelazamiento heterogéneo y evaluaciones comparativas independientes lideran la semana","Of every 100 donated":"De cada 100 donados","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"Un Humano. Una identificación de Civilización. Un legado digital. Explore una puerta de entrada de identidad universal y un futuro en el que los activos digitales, las huellas y los recuerdos puedan conservarse, eliminarse o transmitirse legalmente por elección propia.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"Una entrada de donación. Los importes están en francos suizos (CHF). Los pagos se abren después de que la fundación se registra formalmente y se completa la incorporación de cumplimiento.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"Una persona. Una identificación de Civilización.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"Abrir archivo breve de QCF-E →","Open my ID":"Abrir mi DNI","Opens after formal registration":"Abre después del registro formal","Operator":"Operador","Optional DNA linking":"Vinculación de ADN opcional","Original papers and further reading":"Artículos originales y lecturas adicionales.","Original work and sources":"Trabajo original y fuentes.","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"Nuestra misión a largo plazo · Tres pilares","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"Oxford demostró un entrelazamiento remoto de especies mixtas y un almacenamiento cuántico de aproximadamente 10 segundos.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"PQC ingresa a la infraestructura de activos digitales mientras que las redes pasan a la fibra implementada","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"PQC pasa de los estándares de algoritmos a la migración y la identidad del dispositivo","Participation without DNA":"Participación sin ADN","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"Las instituciones asociadas y los asesores científicos se publicarán después de la autorización y verificación.","Partner seat open":"Asiento de socio abierto","Patent publications and rights verification":"Publicaciones de patentes y verificación de derechos","PayPal":"PayPal","Payment Partners":"Socios de pago","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"Las personas pueden crear una identificación, contribuir con artículos y obtener reconocimiento de contribución sin proporcionar ADN. Las recompensas por contribuciones y los beneficios especiales no deben depender del suministro de datos genómicos o del consentimiento para la investigación genómica.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"Objetivo de la fase 1: 100.000.000 CHF. Las fases posteriores no se muestran en esta página.","Phase-1 goals":"Objetivos de la fase 1","Phase-one funding ambition":"Ambición de financiación de la primera fase","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"Planifique presupuestos y registros de proyectos separados con revisiones de hitos. Divulgar costos administrativos, uso de fondos y supervisión; publicar la entidad receptora y la cuenta una vez que estén listas.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"Sistema central planificado: una identificación de civilización de 10 dígitos (prefijo de onda de 4 dígitos + secuencia de 6 dígitos): la onda Génesis de 2026 emite 2026000001 en adelante uno por uno; después de 999999 comienza la ola 2029 en 2029000001 con código de verificación y clave de identidad, firmada digitalmente por la fundación y verificable públicamente.","Platform use":"Uso de la plataforma","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"Incluya el evento, las fechas, la ubicación, la población, la estimación de mortalidad y el enlace de la fuente original. Las contribuciones serán revisadas antes de su inclusión. No envíes datos personales de salud o identidad sin autorización.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"La metrología de precisión, las redes heterogéneas y los benchmarks clásicos avanzan juntos","Preparatory stage":"Etapa preparatoria","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"Sitio web de la etapa preparatoria. La fundación se establecerá en Zug, Suiza y aún no está registrada; Las funciones disponibles del sitio web se pueden probar de forma gratuita antes de registrarse. Las suscripciones y donaciones se abren después del registro formal; las pruebas nunca se convierten automáticamente a un plan pago. Q es un punto de contribución intransferible: no es una criptomoneda, no tiene valor monetario y no es negociable. No se reclama ninguna deducibilidad fiscal.","Prepare a contribution":"Prepara un aporte","Prepare a reviewable submission":"Prepare un envío revisable","Privacy":"Privacidad","Privacy Policy":"Política de privacidad","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"Proceda por etapas una vez que se cumplan los requisitos previos; divulgar resultados, limitaciones y uso de fondos.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"Solicitud de donación propuesta · No se recaudaron fondos · No es un compromiso de financiación","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"Protege la privacidad mientras creces. Navegar la identidad a través de las fronteras. Gobierna el acceso a las empresas y a los agentes de IA. Prepare delegados de confianza a medida que envejecemos. Preservar, eliminar o transmitir activos digitales seleccionados de acuerdo con nuestros deseos y la ley aplicable.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"Proporcione el nombre del autor o enviado y enlaces a artículos originales, anuncios institucionales o fuentes verificables. Obtenga permiso para el material citado, imágenes y coautoría cuando sea necesario.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"Beneficio público e intereses comerciales","Publications and journal records":"Publicaciones y registros de revistas","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"Q es un punto de contribución registrado con un ID de Civilization. No es transferible, no negociable, no es una criptomoneda ni un instrumento financiero, no tiene valor monetario y no puede canjearse por dinero.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q es un punto de contribución intransferible: no es una criptomoneda, no tiene valor monetario ni es negociable.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"Q es un registro de aporte, no de dinero.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q es la inicial de Quantum y de QCF. El anillo dorado contiene un campo de estrellas: cada punto de luz en su interior es un co-constructor de la civilización, dispuesto en una espiral de ángulo dorado: el orden natural compartido por los girasoles y las galaxias, cada punto es único pero parte de un todo. La luz más brillante en el centro es la luz génesis, el primer co-constructor. La cola es una partícula en transición: la acción única que comienza con una persona y cambia el todo.","Q issued today":"Q emitida hoy","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"Q se queda con tu Civilization ID: intransferible, no transable, sin valor monetario. Los datos de demostración solo se encuentran en este navegador.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF CIENCIAS DE LA VIDA · RESUMEN DE INVESTIGACIÓN","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"QCF tiene como objetivo apoyar la preparación médica civil a través de registros reproducibles, revisión independiente y desarrollo por etapas sujeto a requisitos éticos, regulatorios y de calidad. La salvaguardia de la civilización comienza con el respeto por la vida, los participantes en la investigación y la evidencia científica.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"Evaluación QCF: priorizar la infraestructura energética cuánticamente segura.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"QCF reúne a personas para construir, preservar y salvaguardar la civilización humana. Nuestra primera fase se centra en la colaboración internacional en ciencias de la vida: investigación verificable, innovación responsable y conocimiento compartido para fortalecer la resiliencia ante las principales crisis de salud y de salud pública.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"QCF rastrea continuamente los principales desarrollos en computación cuántica, detección, comunicaciones, criptografía poscuántica, redes y metrología, evaluando la relevancia práctica para la medición de energía, datos confiables, comunicaciones seguras, RWA e infraestructura. Esta página contiene sólo titulares y resúmenes concisos; Los archivos PDF bilingües chino-inglés se conservan como archivos de investigación QCF a largo plazo.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"Línea base de implementación de QCF: informática, detección, comunicaciones, PQC y metrología","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"Evaluación editorial del QCF: se justifica una evaluación científica por etapas. Los especialistas pertinentes deben revisar los datos originales, los métodos estadísticos y la replicación independiente, junto con la potencia, la seguridad y la calidad de fabricación de las células humanas, antes de juzgar la viabilidad clínica. Una mayor investigación también requiere una propiedad clara, permisos de uso de datos y responsabilidades.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"QCF establecido: medición confiable → comunicación segura → verificación de Oracle → RWA / liquidación del libro mayor.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"QCF invita a historiadores, profesionales de la salud, archivos y todos los co-constructores de civilizaciones a contribuir con registros verificables de las vidas perdidas. Juntos, podemos sacar a la luz historias pasadas por alto, preservar conocimientos confiables y convertir la atención y el apoyo en acciones para salvaguardar la vida.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"QCF está previsto que se establezca en Zug, Suiza y actualmente está en preparación, aún no registrado. Esta página describe los principios propuestos; no implica que todos los mecanismos estén operativos.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"Perspectiva QCF: un registro compartido de la vida humana","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"QCF propone Civilization ID × NU-Key: una visión de investigación abierta para una identidad digital autocontrolada, credenciales verificables, acceso seguro, un inventario de activos digitales y herencia digital legal. Una clave universal no es una contraseña maestra que pasa por alto todas las plataformas. Es una puerta de enlace controlada por el usuario que coordina credenciales y permisos separados.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"QCF busca hacer más accesible el conocimiento verificable, fomentando la curiosidad por los orígenes humanos y el cuidado de la diversidad cultural. La investigación sobre nuestro pasado compartido nunca debería utilizarse para clasificar a las comunidades actuales o prescribir sus identidades. Preservar el conocimiento es una manera de cuidar de las generaciones venideras.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"Visión QCF: acceso más justo a la salud genómica","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E no promueve afirmaciones de 'energía cuántica' no verificadas. Se distinguen experimentos, prototipos, anuncios de empresas y especulaciones; Las tecnologías cuánticas ingresan declaraciones de capacidad QCF solo después de una validación reproducible en un caso de uso definido.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"El siguiente paso de QCF: debida diligencia científica por etapas","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"Quantinuum Helios informó avances en la corrección de errores de memoria lógica.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"Fundación Civilización Cuántica (en formación). Establecerse en el Cantón de Zug, Suiza; aún no inscrito en el registro mercantil y sin personalidad jurídica.","Quantum Civilization University":"Universidad de la Civilización Cuántica","Quantum Q · free testing":"Quantum Q · prueba gratuita","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"Tecnología Cuántica para la Energía de la Tierra ⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"La computación cuántica converge con la HPC; Avance en las comunicaciones y la fabricación de dispositivos.","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"La detección cuántica se convierte en un candidato prioritario para la validación de energía QCF","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"Ciencias biológicas impulsadas por lo cuántico","RMB stablecoin":"Moneda estable RMB","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"Preparación médica para lesiones por radiación","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"Lea sobre HeLa y la protección de datos sanitarios","Read our life-sciences brief":"Lea nuestro resumen de ciencias biológicas","Read our mission":"Lee nuestra misión","Read the civilization brief":"Lea el resumen de civilización","Reading and extending this record":"Leyendo y ampliando este registro","Ready to launch yours?":"¿Listo para lanzar el tuyo?","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"Registrar civilización · Salvaguardar la vida · Construir civilización juntos","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"Registrar, salvaguardar y construir juntos la civilización","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"Registrar la civilización significa preservar el conocimiento, las contribuciones y las investigaciones rastreables. Salvaguardar la civilización significa proteger la vida y las elecciones individuales. Construir la civilización juntos significa compartir los beneficios de la cooperación internacional.","Register a Civilization ID":"Registre una identificación de Civilization","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"Restante del objetivo de la fase 1 (CHF)","Remembering lives lost in war":"Recordando vidas perdidas en la guerra","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"Recordando las vidas perdidas por epidemias y enfermedades","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"Replicar la eficacia animal de forma independiente, utilizando controles apropiados, aleatorización y evaluación ciega para examinar la supervivencia, la respuesta a la dosis y la ventana de tratamiento posterior a la exposición.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"Informe de la arquitecta de Civilization Jessica Sage · Actualizado semanalmente","Research approach and evidence status":"Enfoque de investigación y estado de la evidencia","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"Solo concepto de investigación: NU-Key, el inicio de sesión multiplataforma y la herencia digital automática no son servicios operativos actualmente. No se ofrece acceso a cuentas de terceros ni transferencia de activos.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"Instituciones de investigación, especialistas clínicos, expertos en ética y gobernanza de datos y patrocinadores filantrópicos son bienvenidos a iniciar una conversación. Comparta una introducción institucional y un resumen no confidencial; no envíe por correo electrónico datos genómicos personales, registros médicos o detalles de patentes no publicados.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"Investigador y fundación científica","Reset demo":"Restablecer demostración","Responsible person":"Persona responsable","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"Repensar la humanidad: soberanía de los datos de salud humana y distribución equitativa de beneficios ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"Repensar la humanidad: la física cuántica está redefiniendo nuestra comprensión de la realidad","Review and recognition":"Revisión y reconocimiento","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"Cuadro de Honor hasta el 31 de marzo de 1921; la cifra más estrecha del 4 de agosto de 1914 al 11 de noviembre de 1918 es 59.357. No los agregues.","SARS · global":"SARS · global","Sample initiative":"Ejemplo de iniciativa","Science and ethics":"Ciencia y ética","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"La ciencia al servicio de la vida.<br>Colaboración transfronteriza.","Scope and limitations":"Alcance y limitaciones","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"Desplácese horizontalmente para ver la tabla completa. Abra cada fuente para obtener el registro original; leer fechas y cifras junto con su alcance.","Seat 1":"Asiento 1","Seat 2":"Asiento 2","Seat 3":"Asiento 3","Seat 4":"Asiento 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"Los asientos son marcadores de posición. Las asociaciones formales requieren la debida diligencia y un acuerdo escrito. Correo electrónico de contacto pendiente de entrada en funcionamiento de la fundación.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Segunda Guerra Mundial · Canadá y Terranova","Second World War · global estimate":"Segunda Guerra Mundial · estimación global","Security verification":"Verificación de seguridad","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"Ver Pie de imprenta. Según la Ley federal suiza de protección de datos (nDSG) y el RGPD, cuando corresponda.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"Busque experiencia independiente relevante para revisar la evidencia, la ética y la viabilidad de la investigación.","Selected":"Seleccionado","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"Registros seleccionados de dos guerras mundiales · Poblaciones parciales","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"Muertes en servicio, incluidas heridas y enfermedades; El corte conmemorativo se extiende hasta el 31 de agosto de 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"Comparte un enlace (máximo 10/día)","Share link":"Compartir enlace","Source":"Fuente","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"Prioridad de fuente: archivos nacionales, estadísticas oficiales e instituciones de memoria pública; OMS para datos sobre enfermedades. Los propios resúmenes históricos oficiales pueden utilizar estimaciones. Las adiciones deben identificar el período, la geografía, la población, el tipo de figura y la versión fuente; Las definiciones contradictorias se explican en lugar de combinarse en un total preciso.","Sources and further reading":"Fuentes y lecturas adicionales","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"Las fuentes documentan la historia y la investigación; La cita no implica asociación, financiación o respaldo de QCF.","Stablecoins":"Monedas estables","Start free testing":"Inicie la prueba gratuita","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"Comenzar como instituto y cursos abiertos (visión): registrar, estudiar, transmitir y coconstruir la civilización. Las titulaciones requieren la acreditación aplicable.","Status":"Estado","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"Estado: preparación y debida diligencia | Actualizado: 2 de noviembre de 2026","Support":"Soporte","Support (opening soon)":"Soporte (próxima apertura)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Apoye la Iniciativa de Co-Constructores de Civilización Global","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"Los seguidores donan voluntariamente (se abre después del registro).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"Apoyar el uso de la computación cuántica, la detección cuántica y la inteligencia artificial en el descubrimiento de fármacos, la medicina de precisión y la investigación sobre la longevidad saludable, dentro de los límites de la ciencia revisada por pares. Sin consejos médicos ni afirmaciones de salud.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"Respaldamos aplicaciones verificables de computación cuántica, detección, comunicaciones, PQC y metrología en la investigación energética. Los titulares y resúmenes semanales se publican abiertamente; Los archivos PDF bilingües se archivan permanentemente para el acceso de Civilization Co-builders/Civilization ID.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"Moneda estable del franco suizo","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"La infraestructura cuántica suiza, la planificación de la red cuántica del DOE y EuroQCI formaron la lista de vigilancia inicial.","TWINT":"GEMELO","Terms":"Términos","Terms of Use":"Condiciones de uso","Test email:":"Correo electrónico de prueba:","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"La prueba es gratuita antes del registro formal. Los servicios de suscripción y los beneficios especiales para los primeros Envoys seguirán las reglas anunciadas en ese momento. Las pruebas nunca activan cargos automáticos.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"La correspondencia de sangre de 2009 de Abdel-Mageed y sus colegas incluye a Deng como autor correspondiente. Se utilizó un vector adenoviral para expresar la superóxido dismutasa extracelular, EC-SOD (SOD3), en células madre/estromales mesenquimales (MSC) de médula ósea de ratón. Los ratones recibieron 500.000 células modificadas por vía intravenosa 24 horas después de una irradiación corporal total de 9 Gy. La supervivencia informada a 35 días fue del 52 %, en comparación con el 10 % para la solución salina y el 9 % para las células modificadas con el gen informador. Estos resultados se refieren a un modelo de ratón específico y no se pueden convertir en el beneficio humano esperado.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"El artículo de 2015 también demuestra la transducción adenoviral y la secreción de EC-SOD biológicamente activa por MSC de médula ósea humana in vitro. Los experimentos con células humanas no son ensayos clínicos en humanos. La revista es Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, que no debe confundirse con revistas con nombres similares.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"El CV de 2023 enumera por separado US7,547,545 y la solicitud 18/199,975 sobre diferenciación celular y mejora de la respuesta inmune de las vacunas. No establecen la concesión de patente ni la eficacia del candidato a radiación.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"El 6% descrito en la página de iniciativas es una propuesta de plataforma-servicios existente. El programa de ciencias biológicas tendrá su propio presupuesto divulgado. Los puntos de contribución o los votos públicos no reemplazan el juicio científico o ético.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"El CV enumera un puesto de director de citogenética en LabCorp Integrated Oncology desde 2017; Esta no es una confirmación de un nombramiento actual para 2026. Las funciones actuales, la autorización institucional y las responsabilidades del QCF requieren una verificación actualizada. Las publicaciones y registros de patentes que aparecen a continuación se pueden consultar de forma independiente.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"La identificación de la civilización Génesis","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"El experimento biotecnológico unipersonal: IA, robótica y descubrimiento de fármacos ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"La Quantum Civilization Foundation cree que nuestra verdadera identidad compartida es simplemente esta: un miembro de la civilización humana. A todos los que eligen, les emitimos una identificación de Civilization: nunca pregunta de dónde vienes, solo registra lo que aportas a la civilización.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"La Administración de Archivos del Estado presenta una investigación de archivos de Nanjing de febrero de 1946 que registra más de 300.000. Investigación histórica; un subconjunto de muertes durante la guerra en China.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"La Universidad de Gotemburgo informa sobre análisis de ADN de más de 4.500 individuos antiguos, incluidos 712 genomas recientemente secuenciados. Los investigadores sugieren que los inmigrantes que llegaron a Escandinavia hace unos 4.000 años pueden haber llevado un ancestro temprano de las lenguas germánicas. Una migración posterior, varios siglos antes de la era vikinga, coincidió con la aparición del nórdico antiguo.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"La solicitud y el presupuesto escalonado están en preparación. El uso de los fondos, los costos administrativos, la selección y supervisión de los proyectos se definirán luego de la debida diligencia. Esta página no cobra pagos.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"La firma identifica el comentario editorial de QCF. La investigación original pertenece a sus autores y titulares de derechos relevantes. La cita no implica respaldo institucional ni licencia de tecnología.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"El estudio celta complementario analiza datos de todo el genoma de 4.587 individuos antiguos. Al comparar los modelos de migración, sus autores favorecen una expansión hacia el oeste desde el centro-este de Europa hace unos 3.000 años como la explicación más parsimoniosa de la dispersión celta. Los recuentos de muestras de los estudios no deben agregarse como si representaran a individuos separados.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"Los hallazgos proporcionan un punto de partida para la investigación traslacional. En primer lugar, el desarrollo debe distinguir el tratamiento de emergencia de las lesiones agudas por radiación de la protección contra las lesiones de los tejidos normales relacionadas con la radioterapia. Estos entornos involucran diferentes poblaciones, ventanas de tratamiento, criterios de valoración y consideraciones de riesgo-beneficio. El siguiente es un análisis de QCF, no un protocolo clínico iniciado o autorizado.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"El primer ID de Civilization, 2026000001, pertenece a la fundadora, Jessica Sage. La Iniciativa de Co-constructores de la Civilización Global comienza aquí.","The golden Q: a quantum":"La Q dorada: un cuanto","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"La versión en vivo recopilará correos electrónicos solo para emitir y verificar ID de Civilization; sin nacionalidad, raza, religión u otros datos sensibles. Podrá solicitar acceso, rectificación y supresión.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"El plan incluye visibilidad de propósitos, destinatarios y registros de acceso, y una forma de retirar permisos futuros. Los límites relacionados con los análisis completados, los hallazgos publicados y la retención requerida deben explicarse en el momento del consentimiento.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"La perspectiva QCF anterior es un comentario editorial de Jessica Sage, independiente de los resultados de la investigación.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"El equipo del proyecto tiene la intención de explorar la colaboración con socios potenciales, incluido Beijing Nuosai Gene. Las personas jurídicas, las autorizaciones, los protocolos y los acuerdos éticos se publicarán después de la debida diligencia; Esto no indica una asociación firmada ni un lanzamiento de muestra global.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"El diseño propuesto combina criptografía establecida, gestión de claves, acceso con alcance y registros de auditoría. La IA puede respaldar la investigación y la detección de anomalías; no reemplaza el cifrado, el consentimiento informado o la revisión de expertos.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"El agregador público etiqueta ambas aplicaciones estadounidenses como abandonadas. Esta no es una opinión legal. El estado actual, otros derechos familiares nacionales, la propiedad y cualquier licencia para QCF requieren verificación de registros oficiales y acuerdos por escrito. Nombrar a un inventor no establece la propiedad del QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"El trabajo publicado explora las células madre mesenquimales que expresan superóxido dismutasa extracelular (ECSOD). Los estudios enumerados en células y ratones proporcionan una base para evaluaciones adicionales, sin establecer la seguridad, eficacia o protección humana contra todos los daños en un conflicto nuclear.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"Las publicaciones de patentes relacionadas con la radiación se refieren a células madre mesenquimales modificadas. Los inventores nombrados incluyen a Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed y Anthony J. Senagore. Estos son identificadores de solicitud/publicación, no prueba de una patente concedida y ejecutable.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"La secuencia de referencia combinó ADN de múltiples donantes. Los investigadores de Buffalo reclutaron voluntarios a través de anuncios públicos y recolectaron sangre después del consentimiento informado. No se trataba de un análisis de toda la población, ni de pruebas de un programa de muestreo global dirigido por la ONU o los cinco miembros permanentes del Consejo de Seguridad.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"El canal de admisión de envíos se está conectando. Descargue la plantilla ahora para preparar su texto y fuentes. Descargar una plantilla no envía una contribución ni otorga puntos.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"La plantilla no solicita ADN, números de documentos de identidad ni registros médicos. Se puede agregar una identificación de Civilization después de emitir un número formal.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"El identificador único es el Civilization ID registrado de forma independiente, con un enlace de autorización voluntaria. El ADN no es un número de identificación público ni una contraseña de inicio de sesión. La identidad no puede reducirse a la genética; Los gemelos idénticos también muestran por qué el ADN por sí solo no puede establecer una identidad única para cada persona.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Estos son objetivos de diseño y gobernanza. El Civilization ID actual es una demostración frontal, sin un sistema completo de datos de salud implementado; Este sitio web no recopila datos genómicos personales.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"Estos registros no se suman: los totales de toda la guerra se superponen a los subconjuntos nacionales y urbanos; La mortalidad acumulada, anual y excesiva miden cosas diferentes, y las muertes por guerras y enfermedades pueden superponerse. Se conservan los valores aproximados, rangos y calificadores de “más que”.","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"Esta vista previa del diseño no envía datos a ningún servidor. El correo electrónico, el nombre del enviado y el historial de contribuciones permanecen en el almacenamiento local de su navegador y se pueden borrar en cualquier momento. Sin cookies, análisis ni recursos de terceros.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"Esta primera edición incluye nueve registros bélicos, nacionales y de eventos. La cifra redondeada combina más de 9 millones de muertes militares en la Primera Guerra Mundial y aproximadamente 60 millones de muertes globales en la Segunda Guerra Mundial. Los subconjuntos nacionales y de ciudades no se vuelven a agregar. No es un total de toda la guerra ni de toda la historia.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"Esta primera edición incluye diez registros obtenidos de la OMS. La cifra resume las estimaciones históricas más bajas de la peste negra en Europa y las pandemias de influenza de 1918, 1957 y 1968. No es un total histórico de epidemias y enfermedades.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"Esta historia no implica autorización o apoyo de la ONU para QCF, ni una sucesión oficial al Proyecto Genoma Humano.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"Este es un sitio web en etapa preparatoria. La fundación aún no está registrada; Todas las funciones disponibles del sitio web se pueden probar de forma gratuita. Las suscripciones y donaciones se abren después del registro formal y la apertura de la cuenta bancaria. Una suscripción requiere que el usuario elija y confirme el precio y los términos; Las pruebas nunca se convierten automáticamente en un plan pago.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"Este es el principio que pretendemos poner en práctica a través de tecnología validada, operaciones responsables y supervisión continua.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"Esta página describe una contramedida médica candidata para las lesiones por radiación. El enfoque publicado no es equivalente a una vacuna. Si la “vacuna contra la radiación” propuesta es un candidato diferente, su definición técnica y su expediente de evidencia necesitarán documentación separada.","This preview":"Este avance","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"QKD de fibra pasiva para tres usuarios exploró arquitecturas de múltiples nodos más simples.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"Se establecerá en Zug, Suiza; Actualmente preparatorio y aún no registrado. Fundadora: Jessica Sage (ID de Civilización 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"Los temas incluyen civilización y humanidades, ciencias biológicas, investigación cuántica y energética, inteligencia artificial y tecnología, acciones de beneficio público y cooperación internacional.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"Confianza a través de la evidencia.<br>Responsabilidad a través de la transparencia.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"Intente crear una ID de Civilization","Try the Civilization ID flow":"Prueba el flujo de Civilization ID","Tuberculosis · global annual":"Tuberculosis · anual global","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"La UNESCO adoptó la Declaración Universal sobre el Genoma Humano y los Derechos Humanos el 11 de noviembre de 1997; la Asamblea General de las Naciones Unidas lo aprobó mediante la resolución 53/152 del 9 de diciembre de 1998. Esta historia ofrece una referencia ética: la ciencia debe servir al bienestar humano y las personas no deben reducirse a sus características genéticas.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"Cuenta histórica del Departamento de Energía de EE. UU., que abarca el período 1931-1945; una estimación, no un registro unificado. Otras instituciones difieren. Las entradas de países/eventos de la Segunda Guerra Mundial que aparecen a continuación no se deben volver a agregar.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"ID verificadas","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"Verificar entidades asociadas, mandatos, propiedad intelectual y evidencia de investigación.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"Cifra de Asuntos de Veteranos de Canadá para el personal de servicio; excluye a otros países.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"Relacionado con la guerra de Vietnam · Registros militares de EE. UU.","View all civilization briefs →":"Ver todos los resúmenes de civilización →","View all publications →":"Ver todas las publicaciones →","Visa":"Visa","Vote":"Votar","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"Estimación anual de la OMS para 2024, incluidas 150.000 personas con VIH; no es acumulativo y se superpone a la entrada del VIH.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"Datos de la OMS de 2024: intervalo estimado entre 37,6 y 53,4 millones. Cifra acumulada de largo plazo; se superpone con enfermedades como la tuberculosis.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"Revisión de la OMS en Europa: estimación del primer año; otros modelos/cortes difieren. No es un total de todos los tiempos.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"Intervalo de estimación de la OMS: 13,3 a 16,6 millones; efectos pandémicos directos e indirectos, muertes no confirmadas o todos los años de pandemia.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"Estimación histórica de la OMS, no muertes individuales reportadas.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"La página de brotes de la OMS informó el total, incluidos los países afectados fuera de África occidental; El brote terminó en junio de 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"Las bajas de guerra no son automáticamente muertes; los casos de enfermedad y las tasas de letalidad no son recuentos de muertes. El valor de una vida no está determinado por la nacionalidad, la etnia o la identidad.","War remembrance":"Recuerdo de guerra","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"Abogamos por la investigación que evite la repetición del uso sin el consentimiento informado adecuado, respete la elección individual y reconozca las contribuciones a la ciencia. Salvaguardemos juntos el bienestar humano.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"Nuestro objetivo es convertir el conocimiento científico en oportunidades de salud que las personas puedan comprender, elegir y de las que beneficiarse. Nuestra visión a largo plazo es el acceso equitativo a la salud genómica; El primer paso es una investigación centrada en el beneficio público y pruebas piloto de detección voluntaria con resultados interpretables y atención de seguimiento.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"No somos espectadores. Somos co-constructores. Co-construir y co-crear civilización: para entregar un mundo mejor a la próxima generación.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"Invitamos a ciudadanos, criptógrafos, ingenieros de identidad, expertos legales, desarrolladores y familias filantrópicas a co-crear un futuro en el que las personas controlen su identidad digital y elijan lo que dejan atrás.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"Preservamos la historia de la ciencia y asumimos la responsabilidad del futuro de la vida. Buscamos una investigación transfronteriza que sirva a las personas, un uso de datos que respete la elección individual y una civilización sostenida a través de la cooperación y el cuidado.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"Recordamos para que más vidas tengan futuro.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"Compartimos una Tierra y la responsabilidad del futuro de la civilización. Dejemos que la tecnología sirva a la vida, que el conocimiento pase de generación en generación y que cada acto de bondad ayude a construir nuestra civilización compartida.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"Pasamos toda la vida creando activos digitales, huellas, conocimientos, recuerdos y negocios. Si envejecemos, perdemos capacidad o fallecemos, ¿sabrán nuestros seres queridos lo que existe? ¿Debería simplemente desaparecer todo lo que construimos?","WeChat Pay":"Pago WeChat","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"Las funciones del sitio web se pueden probar de forma gratuita antes de que la fundación se registre formalmente. Los servicios de suscripción comenzarán después del registro, con beneficios especiales planeados para los primeros Civilization Envoys; Se anunciarán la elegibilidad y los detalles.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"Weiwen Deng y la investigación de las lesiones por radiación","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, ha trabajado en citogenética, células madre y terapia génica. El CV 2023 proporcionado a QCF registra un título de médico en 1990, una maestría en microbiología e inmunología en 1993 y un doctorado en Tulane en biología molecular y celular en 2004, junto con investigaciones previas y liderazgo en el laboratorio de células madre mesenquimales en el Hospital Infantil Helen DeVos.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng: publicaciones, patentes y estado","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"Bienvenido, co-constructor de Civilization","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"Brote de Ébola en África occidental y países afectados","What did the studies find?":"¿Qué encontraron los estudios?","What do the two papers establish?":"¿Qué establecen los dos papeles?","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"Cuando la vida termina, ¿desaparece nuestro mundo digital o sigue vivo?","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"Por qué son importantes la identificación de Civilization y la protección de datos de salud","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"Población mundial · estimación de mediados de 2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"Aún no tienes un ID de Civilization","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"Tu identidad. Tu soberanía. Tu legado.","Your informed choice":"Tu elección informada","next":"siguiente","opens after registration":"se abre después del registro","spent by co-builder vote":"gastado por voto de co-constructor","← Life sciences":"← Ciencias de la vida","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69.000.000"},"pt":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · Devida diligência","02 · Independent review":"02 · Revisão independente","03 · Pilot design":"03 · Projeto piloto","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · Relatórios de progresso","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"Emaranhamento átomo-fóton de 1530 nm e rede quântica avançada de banda de telecomunicações QKD de fibra de 50 km.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"Simulação de átomo neutro de 180 qubits: a natureza relatou experimentos em dinâmica quântica de desequilíbrio.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997–1998: progresso científico e dignidade humana","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"Iniciativa preparatória 2026 · Informações já disponíveis. Este site não coleta DNA nem aceita arquivos genômicos.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6% é o total combinado dos quatro serviços. O processo de divisão, custódia e AML deve ser confirmado por um advogado suíço antes do registro.","72,000,000+":"72.000.000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"Nome de Enviado da Civilização","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"Um ID de Civilização é uma identidade de contribuição dentro do QCF, não um passaporte, cidadania ou documento de identidade legal.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"Um empreendimento científico além-fronteiras","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"Um estudo separado investigou uma vacina peptídica COVID-19 combinada com vacina contra tétano em cavalos. Não demonstra uma vacina contra radiação ou eficácia humana.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"Um plano voluntário para vincular dados genômicos pessoais a uma ID de civilização","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H1N1) · global","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H2N2) · global","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"Pandemia de gripe A(H3N2) · global","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"Abdel-Mageed et al., com Weiwen Deng como coautor. Tópico: células-tronco mesenquimais geneticamente modificadas e sobrevivência de camundongos irradiados. Evidências: pesquisa animal; seção do jornal: Correspondência.","About":"Sobre nós","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"Os envios aceitos podem ser reconhecidos de acordo com as regras de contribuição publicadas. Os pontos de teste não se tornam automaticamente recompensas oficiais. Não inclua informações pessoais de saúde ou genômicas sem consentimento.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"Aceito por meio de um provedor licenciado na Suíça, convertido para CHF à taxa no recebimento, com emissão de recibo de doação.","Account":"Conta","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"Conta separadamente para pesquisa de benefício público, tradução comercial de medicamentos e investimento em infraestrutura. Divulgue transações com partes relacionadas, acordos de PI e conflitos, com recusa e revisão independente.","Alipay":"Alipay","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"Todos os recursos disponíveis do site podem ser testados gratuitamente antes que a fundação seja formalmente registrada. Os serviços de assinatura começam após o registro; o plano atual é de 20 CHF/USD/EUR por mês, com serviços e condições de pagamento mostrados claramente antes da assinatura.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"Todos os botões de pagamento estão desativados por enquanto. Eles permitem, após registro formal, abertura de conta bancária e integração de pagamento. As doações podem exigir verificações AML/KYC aplicáveis. Nenhum tratamento fiscal ou dedutibilidade é reivindicado.","All publications":"Todas as publicações","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"Uma equipe IonQ relatou emaranhamento heterogêneo na escala de quilohertz.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"Qualquer co-construtor com Civilization ID pode lançar uma iniciativa sobre qualquer assunto.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"Qualquer pessoa pode lançar uma Iniciativa de Civilização","Apple Pay":"Apple Pay","Apply to become a payment partner":"Inscreva-se para se tornar um parceiro de pagamento","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"A partir da revisão de fonte pública em 10 de novembro de 2026, nenhum registro de teste em humanos ou aprovação regulatória foi identificado para esta indicação de radiação MSC projetada por EC-SOD. Continuam a ser necessários identificadores de registo verificáveis ​​e documentos de autorização. Ensaios com outras formulações de SOD, miméticos ou células para outras doenças não validam este candidato.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"Avalie as abordagens candidatas para prevenir ou tratar lesões por radiação para proteção civil e preparação para a saúde pública. A documentação e a revisão científica estão pendentes; segurança e eficácia não estão estabelecidas.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"Nesta revisão, o QCF não recebeu um número de registro de teste em humanos, autorização regulatória ou evidência de aprovação de marketing para este candidato. O progresso experimental atualizado, a replicação independente, a qualidade de fabricação e o caminho do desenvolvimento clínico ainda precisam ser documentados.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"Bombardeio atômico de Hiroshima · Japão","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"BTQ × Kaia anunciou uma colaboração de rede stablecoin com segurança quântica.","Back to Civilization ID":"Voltar para ID da Civilização","Back to Life Sciences":"De volta às Ciências da Vida","Back to population figures":"Voltar aos números populacionais","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"Torne-se um coconstrutor da civilização","Become a co-builder":"Torne-se um coconstrutor","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"Torne-se o próximo coconstrutor da civilização","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"Antes do consentimento, explique a finalidade, destinatário, escopo da pesquisa, período de retenção e riscos. Avalie novos usos separadamente, incluindo qualquer uso para treinamento em IA.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"Por trás de cada número está uma pessoa, uma vida e uma família. Recordar as vidas perdidas faz da paz, da saúde pública e da salvaguarda da vida uma responsabilidade partilhada.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"Atrás de cada número havia um nome, uma família e uma vida inacabada. Registramos perdas para valorizar a vida hoje e apoiamos a ciência para proteger a vida amanhã.","Bilingual PDF":"PDF bilíngue","Bitcoin BTC":"Bitcoin BTC","Black Death · Europe":"Peste Negra · Europa","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"Delimitado por evidências revisadas por pares e verificáveis","Browse published briefs":"Navegue pelos resumos publicados","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"Pela arquiteta da civilização Jessica Sage<br>Publicado em 5 de novembro de 2026 · Reportagem de notícias da Nature: 4 de novembro de 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"CO-CONSTRUTOR DE CIVILIZAÇÃO · ACESSO A ARQUIVO PDF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"ID DE CIVILIZAÇÃO × NU-KEY","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"ID DE CIVILIZAÇÃO × NU-KEY · INICIATIVA DE PESQUISA GLOBAL","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"Excesso de mortalidade associada à COVID-19 · global","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"Visão geral do Museu Canadense da Guerra; apenas pessoal militar/em serviço, nem todas as mortes de civis. As entradas nacionais abaixo se sobrepõem.","Cards & wallets":"Cartões e carteiras","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"Células como fábricas de proteínas antioxidantes: a pesquisa de lesões por radiação de Weiwen Deng","Check in":"Check-in","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"Escolha um novo nome de Enviado da Civilização. Sua identidade original pode permanecer oculta – mostre apenas seu número de identificação ou seu novo nome.","Choose an amount":"Escolha um valor","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"Estimativa da cidade até o final de 1945; efeitos combinados de explosão, calor e radiação, e não mortes apenas por radiação ou o custo total a longo prazo.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"Arquiteta da Civilização Jessica Sage | 10 de novembro de 2026 | Comentário de pesquisa","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"Nome do Enviado da Civilização (opcional)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"Os Enviados da Civilização são convidados a contribuir com artigos originais, insights de pesquisas e relatos de ações de benefício público. O trabalho aceito pode ser registrado como uma contribuição vinculada a um Civilization ID e pontos Quantum Q.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"Os Enviados da Civilização estão convidados a contribuir. Compartilhe trabalhos que sejam verdadeiros, claros e verificáveis ​​– conhecimento a serviço da vida e ações que conectem as pessoas.","Civilization ID":"ID da civilização","Civilization ID and privacy":"ID da civilização e privacidade","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"O Civilization ID atualmente continua sendo um registro de teste gratuito do navegador local, portanto, este é um portão de teste em vez de uma identidade verificada centralmente. Assim que o sistema central de Civilization ID estiver online, o acesso ao PDF será atualizado para autorização confiável do lado do servidor.","Civilization ID goal":"Objetivo de identificação da civilização","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Civilization ID é atualmente uma demonstração de front-end. O armazenamento de dados clínicos de saúde e as funções completas de governança aqui descritas não são implementadas. Este site não coleta dados genômicos pessoais.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"O Civilization ID é concebido como um elo entre contribuições voluntárias e permissões explícitas. A identidade, os registos de participação e os dados de saúde sensíveis devem ser separados; O DNA não é necessário para participar. A criptografia deve funcionar em conjunto com limites de finalidade, auditorias de acesso, governança independente e retirada de permissões futuras. Um ID por si só não pode garantir a privacidade.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"Civilization ID apoia participação voluntária e registros de contribuição; não é uma identidade legal. Dados de DNA ou de saúde não são necessários para obter uma identificação. Os testes gratuitos atuais não constituem um serviço de identidade central ativo.","Civilization ID · free testing":"ID da Civilização · teste gratuito","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"ID da Civilização: participação e permissão","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"Civilization IDs e Q atualmente usam registros armazenados neste navegador para testes. O registro central, o recebimento de envios e as recompensas revisadas estão sendo conectados. O teste é gratuito e nunca inicia uma assinatura automaticamente.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"A civilização começa com todos que escolhem começar","Claim my Civilization ID":"Reivindicar minha ID de civilização","Claim your Civilization ID":"Solicite sua ID de civilização","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"Transmissão em estado de cluster ao longo de 29 km de engenharia de rede avançada de fibra parcialmente implantada.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"Resumo da Co-Construção da Civilização","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"Voto do co-construtor · Serviços de fundação","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"Co-construindo a civilização.<br>Salvaguardando a vida.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"Co-criando a civilização. Valorizando cada vida.","Coming soon":"Em breve","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"Avaliação de segurança pré-clínica completa de biodistribuição, persistência, respostas imunológicas, risco trombótico, vetor residual e crescimento anormal de tecido. As aplicações de radioterapia também requerem avaliação dos efeitos no controle do tumor.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"Conecte cada contribuição confirmada ao seu ID por meio do Quantum Q. Durante o teste gratuito, os pontos de teste do navegador permanecem separados dos registros oficiais de contribuição.","Contact":"Contato","Contact the preparatory team":"Entre em contato com a equipe preparatória","Contribute to civilization":"Contribua para a civilização","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"Contribua para nossa lembrança compartilhada →","Contribution history":"Histórico de contribuições","Contribution points Q":"Pontos de contribuição Q","Contributions return to your ID":"As contribuições retornam para o seu ID","Controller":"Controlador","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"As células que secretam uma proteína antioxidante poderiam ajudar a mitigar os danos aos tecidos após a radiação? O trabalho publicado por Weiwen Deng e colegas fornece evidências de ratos e células humanas in vitro. É uma abordagem pré-clínica que justifica mais testes; não é um tratamento humano aprovado.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"A cobertura será atualizada a partir de pesquisas originais rastreáveis, com os limites das evidências esclarecidos.","Create a local test ID":"Crie um ID de teste local","Create an ID · free testing":"Crie um ID · teste gratuito","Crypto":"Criptografia","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"Estágio atual: preparação, due diligence do parceiro e revisão científica. Os ensaios clínicos, a triagem pública e a coleta de doações no âmbito deste programa ainda não começaram.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"DARPA QBI Estágio C validação avançada de engenharia independente.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"O DNA não identifica diretamente o idioma que alguém falou. Os padrões genéticos devem ser interpretados juntamente com a arqueologia e a linguística, e a mudança linguística não precisa de acompanhar a substituição populacional. Estas descobertas ajudam a testar hipóteses históricas; eles não decodificam a fala antiga.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"PROJETO · revisão legal pendente","Daily births · estimate":"Nascimentos diários · estimativa","Daily check-in":"Check-in diário","Daily deaths · estimate":"Mortes diárias · estimativa","Dates / reporting period":"Datas/período do relatório","Dates, lives lost and source records":"Datas, vidas perdidas e registros de origem","Deaths / fatality records":"Registros de mortes/fatalidades","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"Mortes no resumo de casos prováveis da OMS; as datas referem-se ao período de início da doença.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"Defina um produto de célula humana reproduzível: fonte, identidade, atividade EC-SOD e duração da expressão, variação do doador, consistência do lote, criopreservação e produção escalonável.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"Defina beneficiários, instituições de entrega, orçamentos, marcos e resultados mensuráveis.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"Defina protocolos e aprovações aplicáveis ​​e requisitos éticos antes do início da pesquisa. Distinguir trabalho exploratório, resultados validados e marketing; reportar incerteza e resultados negativos.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"Demonstração: toque para tentar lançar uma iniciativa e receba 100 Q.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"Demo: seu e-mail fica neste navegador; nenhum e-mail real é enviado.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"Deng et al.: mitigação de lesões por radiação em camundongos usando células-tronco mesenquimais modificadas secretoras de ECSOD. Weiwen Deng está listado como primeiro e autor correspondente. Evidência: pesquisa pré-clínica.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"Desenvolver pesquisas com foco em benefício público e pilotos de triagem com condições, populações e cuidados de acompanhamento definidos. O escopo será definido após autorização do parceiro, revisão ética e verificação do protocolo.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"O desenvolvimento para lesões agudas por radiação pode explorar caminhos aplicáveis, como a regra animal da FDA. Sob condições específicas, permite estudos adequados e controlados de eficácia em animais para apoiar a aprovação, mantendo ao mesmo tempo os requisitos de segurança humana e de qualidade do produto. A elegibilidade e a aprovação não são garantidas. Os medicamentos existentes contra lesões por radiação devem informar a necessidade não atendida e a estratégia de comparação.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"Prevenção de doenças, NAD⁺ e mecanismos de envelhecimento, pesquisa unicelular e regenerativa, genômica de IA e epigenética são áreas para cobertura contínua. Os resumos do QCF distinguirão os estudos em células e animais dos ensaios em humanos e evidências clínicas. Uma mudança num marcador de idade biológica não é prova de uma vida mais longa.","Disease remembrance":"Lembrança de doenças","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"A coleta de doações e assinaturas automáticas não estão abertas. CHF 100 milhões é o pedido proposto para a primeira fase, e não fundos arrecadados, prometidos ou aprovados. Orçamentos e taxas detalhados exigem a devida diligência e a revisão da governança aplicável.","Donations":"Doações","Donations received":"Doações recebidas","Download bilingual PDF":"Baixe PDF bilíngue","Download submission template":"Baixe o modelo de envio","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"Nota editorial: este é um resumo e comentário QCF escrito de forma independente, não uma reprodução ou tradução oficial do artigo da Nature. A autora original da notícia é Ewen Callaway; o crédito da pesquisa pertence aos autores e instituições dos artigos. O acesso ao artigo completo da Nature pode exigir uma assinatura.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"Revisão editorial: 2 de novembro de 2026. Essas organizações são citadas como fontes; nenhuma parceria, autorização ou endosso do QCF está implícita.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"E-mail: [a ser configurado, por ex. contact@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"Identidade criptografada","Encryption and key control":"Criptografia e controle de chave","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"Envolver reguladores e comitês de ética para estabelecer a classificação de produtos, padrões de qualidade, o caminho de desenvolvimento e pré-requisitos para pesquisas em seres humanos. Somente após as autorizações necessárias poderiam ser considerados os primeiros estudos em humanos centrados na segurança, tolerabilidade e atividade biológica mensurável.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"Faixa estimada na revisão histórica da OMS.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"Faixa estimada na revisão histórica da OMS; as estimativas variam entre as publicações.","Ethereum ETH":"Ethereum ETH","Event and population":"Evento e população","Every action is remembered by civilization":"Cada ação é lembrada pela civilização","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"Todos os dias fazemos login. Em nossos telefones, e-mail, bancos, serviços de saúde, portais governamentais e contas na nuvem. Além das fronteiras, repetimos senhas, códigos e verificações de identidade. Nossas vidas estão fragmentadas em centenas de portas digitais.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"Toda vida merece dignidade e lembrança.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"Toda vida merece respeito. Cada utilização de dados pessoais necessita de limites claros.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"Cada nova vida merece uma recepção gentil.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"Cada gasto dos 94% é decidido pelo voto do co-construtor.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"Evidência revisada: 2 de novembro de 2026 | Preparação do programa e due diligence","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"Explore NU-Key e legado digital","Explore Phase One →":"Explore a Fase Um →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"Explore a colaboração entre inovadores de medicamentos chineses e parceiros europeus de pesquisa, clínicos e industriais. A investigação de utilidade pública, o acesso dos pacientes e a tradução comercial exigem objectivos, orçamentos e direitos separados.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"Explore lembranças e fontes de doenças →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"Explore a história genômica e a visão da primeira fase","Explore the life-sciences programme":"Explore o programa de ciências biológicas","Explore the phase-one programme":"Explore o programa da primeira fase","Explore the principles":"Explore os princípios","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"Explore lembranças e fontes da guerra →","First World War · Australia":"Primeira Guerra Mundial · Austrália","First World War · British military":"Primeira Guerra Mundial · Militar britânico","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Primeira Guerra Mundial · Canadá e Terra Nova","First World War · global military":"Primeira Guerra Mundial · militar global","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"Conjunto de dados da primeira edição · Revisado e repositório atualizado: 2 de novembro de 2026 · Não são estatísticas ao vivo","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"Para mim, o valor desta pesquisa está em conectar disciplinas. As ciências da vida trazem à tona movimentos passados; a arqueologia e a linguística nos ajudam a interpretar esses encontros. As línguas e culturas que conhecemos hoje merecem ser compreendidas dentro de uma história mais longa de intercâmbio humano.","Founder":"Fundador","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"Quatro pandemias históricas selecionadas · Soma das estimativas mais baixas","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"Quatorze bilhões de anos atrás o universo começou a partir de um único ponto. Há quatro mil milhões de anos, a vida copiou-se pela primeira vez no oceano. Hoje, oito mil milhões de pessoas partilham um planeta azul — ainda dividido por fronteiras, cor, língua e crenças.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"O trabalho de magnetometria de diamante NV de Fraunhofer tornou-se candidato a um PoC de monitoramento de energia.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"Testes gratuitos · Os registros atualmente ficam neste navegador. Esta não é uma emissão central de identificação ou verificação de e-mail. Contas reais e registros entre dispositivos serão abertos quando o serviço de registro estiver conectado.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"De 1990 a 2003, o Projeto Genoma Humano estabeleceu uma base para o genoma humano de referência. O NIH e o Departamento de Energia apoiaram o esforço dos EUA; instituições de sequenciamento vieram dos EUA, Reino Unido, França, Alemanha, Japão e China. Demonstrou o poder da colaboração internacional e do conhecimento partilhado.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"Da lição de HeLa à responsabilidade do Civilization ID","From first login to a lasting legacy":"Do primeiro login a um legado duradouro","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"Do laboratório à clínica: as próximas questões de pesquisa","From one idea to a civilization in action":"De uma ideia a uma civilização em ação","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"Da leitura do genoma à salvaguarda da vida","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"Das evidências de pesquisa à salvaguarda da vida","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"Da compreensão dos genomas à proteção de cada pessoa","From vision to verifiable action":"Da visão à ação verificável","Fund management":"Gestão de fundos","Funding and oversight":"Financiamento e supervisão","Funding during preparation":"Financiamento durante a preparação","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"Reúna co-construtores da civilização em todo o mundo para co-construir, registrar, transmitir e salvaguardar a civilização humana.","Genomic health research":"Pesquisa genômica em saúde","Get Civilization ID":"Criar ID de civilização","Get your ID":"Obtenha sua identificação","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniciativa de Coconstrutores da Civilização Global","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"Iniciativa de Co-construtores da Civilização Global · Estágio preparatório","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"Resumos globais sobre tecnologia quântica e ecossistema de energia","Google Pay":"Google Pay","Governance":"Governação","Governance and funding principles":"Princípios de governança e financiamento","Governance service":"Serviço de governança","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"Mortes relacionadas ao HIV · cumulativo global","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"HeLa nos lembra que preservar o conhecimento também requer respeito por cada pessoa por trás dele. O Civilization ID é concebido como um ponto de entrada para participação voluntária e registros de permissão, sem expor DNA, registros médicos ou relações familiares. A proteção requer criptografia, separação de identidade e dados, permissão específica para fins e auditoria de acesso.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"Ajude a construir uma civilização digital centrada no ser humano","Help safeguard life":"Ajude a salvaguardar vidas","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"Aqui você pode usar um novo nome: o nome do seu Enviado da Civilização. Você pode deixar o passado oculto e aparecer apenas como seu ID ou novo nome. Você adere por livre arbítrio e avança por contribuição voluntária. Cada compartilhamento, cada iniciativa, cada ação se torna um Q quântico dourado, retornando ao seu ID.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"Esconder minha identidade original; mostrar apenas meu ID ou nome de enviado","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"Total acumulado histórico: nenhum número mundial confiável","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"Estimativa histórica citada pela OMS, apenas na Europa; não registro de caso contemporâneo. Não há datas exatas de início/término nesta fonte.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"Figura histórica no guia de pesquisa dos Arquivos Nacionais do Reino Unido; não um total mundial.","History and our genomic-health vision":"História e nossa visão genômica-saúde","Home":"Início","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"Como os genomas antigos ajudam a rastrear a disseminação das línguas germânicas e celtas","How initiatives work":"Como funcionam as iniciativas","Human research and regulatory evidence":"Pesquisa humana e evidências regulatórias","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"Li os <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacidade</a> e os <a class=gold href=terms.html>Termos</a> e entendo que esta é uma demonstração; taxas abertas após inscrição","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"IBM × ORNL × AMD lançou uma plataforma de co-design para correção de erros; O Chicago System Two também apoia pesquisas de otimização de rede.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"Portadores de carteira de identidade podem lançar iniciativas sobre qualquer tema; apoiadores doam voluntariamente. 94% dos fundos são atribuídos por voto dos co-construtores; O QCF cobra uma taxa de plataforma e governança de 6%.","IDs registered":"IDs registrados","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporou ML-DSA na identidade segura do dispositivo.","Impressum":"Impressão","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"A emulação clássica aprimorada reforça a necessidade de linhas de base clássicas atuais.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"Em 1951, amostras de tumores de Henrietta Lacks, que estava recebendo tratamento para câncer cervical, foram usadas para pesquisas sem seu conhecimento ou consentimento. A linha celular HeLa resultante fez grandes contribuições para a medicina, ao mesmo tempo que levantou questões persistentes sobre consentimento, privacidade e partilha equitativa de benefícios.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"Em 2013, o NIH e a família Lacks chegaram a um acordo sobre o acesso controlado a dados relevantes do genoma completo de HeLa. “Imortal” descreve a capacidade da linhagem celular de continuar se dividindo em condições laboratoriais adequadas, e não a imortalidade da própria Henrietta Lacks.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"Em 2026, o QCF planeja desenvolver uma iniciativa para um acesso mais equitativo ao sequenciamento do genoma. Juntamente com especialistas em investigação, cuidados de saúde e ética, pretendemos ajudar as pessoas a compreender a sua informação genómica através de uma escolha informada e de apoio profissional adequado. Num futuro sistema seguro, os indivíduos poderiam optar por vincular os registos genómicos a uma Civilization ID emitida de forma independente.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"No artigo de pesquisa do Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy de 2015, Deng é o primeiro e autor correspondente. Ele revisita o resultado anterior de sobrevivência e relata o acompanhamento entre os ratos sobreviventes: uma extensão relatada de 207 dias de vida e um atraso de 39 dias na formação de catarata. Nenhum tumor foi observado no grupo tratado, enquanto um tumor abdominal foi observado no grupo solução salina. O tamanho da coorte, a seleção dos sobreviventes, a patologia tumoral e a replicação independente requerem um exame minucioso. Estas observações não estabelecem a prevenção geral do cancro ou o prolongamento da vida. Os artigos descrevem trabalhos relacionados, não duas replicações independentes.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Iniciativa QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Iniciativa de Co-construtores da Civilização Global","Initiatives":"Iniciativas","Initiator":"Iniciador","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"Os iniciadores publicam custos e gastos à medida que agem.","International drug-research collaboration":"Colaboração internacional em pesquisa de drogas","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"Seu valor público reside em uma abordagem testável para a medicina de emergência com radiação. Não é um tratamento de radiação completo nem uma vacina validada. Experimentos reproduzíveis devem conectar o conceito a qualquer benefício futuro para o paciente.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"Jessica Sage (fundadora). Endereço: [a ser adicionado]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"Participe do teste gratuito: experimente cadastro, check-in e compartilhamento. As recompensas oficiais das contribuições dependem de registros revisados ​​e confirmados.","LATEST ISSUED":"ÚLTIMA EDIÇÃO","Launch":"Lançamento","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"Lançar uma Iniciativa de Civilização","Launch initiative":"Iniciativa de lançamento","Launch initiative (demo)":"Iniciativa de lançamento (demonstração)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"Lance com seu ID: meta, orçamento, marcos. +100Q","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"Lançado em 1990, o Projeto Genoma Humano reuniu instituições de pesquisa por meio do Consórcio Internacional de Sequenciamento do Genoma Humano. Em 2003, entregou a sua sequência do genoma humano de referência – uma base para a compreensão da vida, em vez de sequenciar cada pessoa.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"Aprendendo com a história da HeLa","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"Deixe sua contribuição fazer parte de nossa história compartilhada","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"Instituições de pagamento licenciadas, carteiras e provedores de criptografia compatíveis são convidados a se tornarem parceiros de co-construção da civilização e ajudarem a construir trilhos de doações globais.","Life Sciences":"Ciências da vida","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"Ciências Biológicas e Proteção da Vida","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"Ciências da Vida | Nature relata nova pesquisa de DNA antigo ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"Ciências da Vida | O experimento de biotecnologia individual: IA, robótica e descoberta de medicamentos ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"A vida tem fim. A civilização deve continuar.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"Ciências da vida são nossa prioridade de primeira fase. A energia e a computação, juntamente com a educação para a civilização, continuam a ser direções de investigação e colaboração a longo prazo.","Life-science directions we will follow":"Orientações sobre ciências biológicas que seguiremos","Life-sciences news":"Notícias sobre ciências biológicas","Life-sciences programme":"Programa de ciências biológicas","Link my DNA":"Vincule meu DNA","Live version (planned)":"Versão ao vivo (planejado)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"Vidas perdidas na guerra · Estimativa","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"Vidas perdidas devido a epidemias e doenças · Estimativa","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"Meta de longo prazo: 1.000.000 de IDs de Civilização. Solicitação proposta para a primeira fase de ciências da vida: CHF 100.000.000; não fundos arrecadados ou prometidos.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"Perda de consciência não é morte. Um sinal de respiração ou evento biométrico nunca deve desencadear de forma independente uma transferência irreversível de ativos. A delegação e a herança de emergência exigem salvaguardas separadas, consentimento documentado, verificação independente e revisão legal. O Civilization ID não substitui passaportes, identidade eletrônica nacional ou banco KYC.","Manage future permissions":"Gerenciar permissões futuras","Mastercard":"Mastercard","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"Método: projeções para 2026; nascimentos e mortes são médias diárias anuais arredondadas, e não contagens de vidas para hoje.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"Método: esses resumos de registros selecionados foram compilados pelo QCF, e não publicados como totais combinados pelas organizações de origem. Eles não são contagens ao vivo. As duas categorias podem se sobrepor e não devem ser somadas. Verificado e repositório atualizado: 2026-11-02.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"Pistas de migração, interpretadas juntamente com evidências linguísticas","Mission":"Missão","My ID":"O meu ID","My contribution":"Minha contribuição","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"Extrato NARA de 29 de abril de 2008. As datas registradas de incidentes/mortes vão de 1956 a 2006, não a duração da guerra. Mortes hostis e não hostis; não todo o custo da guerra.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"NIST IR 8547 estabeleceu um roteiro de transição para criptografia pós-quântica.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"O NIST PQC estava pronto para implementação; detecção e metrologia tornaram-se candidatos a dados confiáveis ​​de longo prazo.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"O trabalho do pente de frequência óptica em escala de chip NIST aponta para uma metrologia compacta de precisão.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"Massacre de Nanjing · China","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"Nature relata nova pesquisa de DNA antigo","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"O relógio nuclear Nature Thorium-229 estuda metrologia quântica avançada e tempo de precisão.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"A interface spin-fóton de molécula única da natureza e a coexistência de fibra quântica/clássica entraram no radar da pesquisa.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"A reportagem da Nature’s, de Ewen Callaway, publicada em 4 de novembro de 2026, examina novas evidências genéticas relevantes para a história da língua europeia. Este resumo do QCF baseia-se nesse relatório, em um resumo de pesquisa e no anúncio da universidade participante.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"Próxima identificação de civilização a ser emitida","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"Nenhuma afiliação ou endosso das Nações Unidas está implícita.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"Nenhum e-mail é enviado e a propriedade do e-mail não é verificada.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"Nenhuma série de mortalidade global cobre todas as doenças desde o surgimento da civilização. Esta edição contém dez surtos históricos, registros cumulativos e anuais provenientes da OMS, principalmente doenças infecciosas. Não é exaustivo. Os números pré-OMS são estimativas históricas citadas pela OMS.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"Nenhum registo harmonizado abrange todas as guerras e países desde o surgimento da civilização. Esta edição contém nove registros de guerra, nacionais e de eventos, concentrados na história moderna. Conflitos antigos e medievais e muitas regiões ainda não estão cobertos. Entradas faltantes não significam zero mortes.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"Nenhuma informação de nacionalidade, raça ou crença é necessária. Use um exemplo de e-mail para teste gratuito; detalhes de identidade reais não são necessários.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"Nenhuma declaração é feita sobre o tratamento tributário de qualquer doação.","No tax claims":"Sem reclamações fiscais","No use without clear authorization":"Não use sem autorização clara","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"Relógios nucleares, emaranhamento heterogêneo e benchmarking independente lideram a semana","Of every 100 donated":"De cada 100 doados","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"Um Humano. Uma identificação de civilização. Um legado digital. Explore um portal de identidade universal e um futuro onde os ativos digitais, pegadas e memórias podem ser preservados, eliminados ou transmitidos legalmente por opção.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"Uma entrada de doação. Os valores estão em francos suíços (CHF). Os pagamentos são abertos depois que a fundação é formalmente registrada e a integração da conformidade é concluída.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"Uma pessoa. Uma identificação de civilização.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"Abra o arquivo breve do QCF-E →","Open my ID":"Abra meu ID","Opens after formal registration":"Abre após registro formal","Operator":"Operador","Optional DNA linking":"Vinculação de DNA opcional","Original papers and further reading":"Artigos originais e leituras adicionais","Original work and sources":"Trabalho original e fontes","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"Nossa missão de longo prazo · Três pilares","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"Oxford demonstrou emaranhamento remoto de espécies mistas e armazenamento quântico de aproximadamente 10 segundos.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"PQC entra na infraestrutura de ativos digitais enquanto a rede passa para fibra implantada","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"PQC passa dos padrões de algoritmo para migração e identidade de dispositivo","Participation without DNA":"Participação sem DNA","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"Instituições parceiras e consultores científicos serão publicados após autorização e verificação.","Partner seat open":"Vaga de parceiro aberta","Patent publications and rights verification":"Publicações de patentes e verificação de direitos","PayPal":"PayPal","Payment Partners":"Parceiros de pagamento","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"As pessoas podem criar um ID, contribuir com artigos e obter reconhecimento de contribuição sem fornecer DNA. As recompensas de contribuição e os benefícios especiais não devem depender do fornecimento de dados genómicos ou do consentimento para a investigação genómica.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"Meta da fase 1: CHF 100.000.000. As fases posteriores não são mostradas nesta página.","Phase-1 goals":"Gols da Fase 1","Phase-one funding ambition":"Ambição de financiamento da primeira fase","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"Planeje orçamentos e registros de projetos separados com revisões de marcos. Divulgar custos administrativos, utilização de recursos e fiscalização; publicar a entidade receptora e a conta assim que estiver pronta.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"Sistema central planejado: um ID de civilização de 10 dígitos (prefixo de onda de 4 dígitos + sequência de 6 dígitos): a onda Gênesis de 2026 emite 2026000001 em diante, um por um; depois de 999999, a onda 2029 começa em 2029000001 com código de verificação e chave de identidade, assinados digitalmente pela fundação e verificáveis ​​publicamente.","Platform use":"Uso da plataforma","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"Inclua o evento, datas, local, população, estimativa de mortalidade e link da fonte original. As contribuições serão revisadas antes da inclusão. Não envie dados pessoais de saúde ou de identidade sem autorização.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"Metrologia de precisão, redes heterogêneas e benchmarks clássicos avançam juntos","Preparatory stage":"Estágio preparatório","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"Site da fase preparatória. A fundação será estabelecida em Zug, na Suíça, e ainda não está registrada; os recursos disponíveis do site podem ser testados gratuitamente antes do registro. Assinaturas e doações abertas após registro formal; o teste nunca é convertido automaticamente em um plano pago. Q é um ponto de contribuição intransferível – não é uma criptomoeda, não tem valor monetário e não é negociável. Nenhuma dedutibilidade fiscal é reivindicada.","Prepare a contribution":"Prepare uma contribuição","Prepare a reviewable submission":"Prepare um envio revisável","Privacy":"Privacidade","Privacy Policy":"Política de Privacidade","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"Proceda em etapas assim que os pré-requisitos forem atendidos; divulgar resultados, limitações e uso de recursos.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"Solicitação de doação proposta · Não é fundos arrecadados · Não é um compromisso de financiamento","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"Proteja a privacidade enquanto cresce. Navegue pela identidade através das fronteiras. Governe o acesso dos negócios e dos agentes de IA. Prepare delegados de confiança à medida que envelhecemos. Preservar, excluir ou repassar ativos digitais selecionados de acordo com nossos desejos e a lei aplicável.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"Forneça o nome do autor ou enviado e links para artigos originais, anúncios institucionais ou fontes verificáveis. Obtenha permissão para material citado, imagens e coautoria quando necessário.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"Benefício público e interesses comerciais","Publications and journal records":"Publicações e registros de periódicos","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"Q é um ponto de contribuição registrado em um ID de Civilização. É intransferível, não negociável, não é uma criptomoeda ou instrumento financeiro, não tem valor monetário e não pode ser trocado por dinheiro.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q é um ponto de contribuição intransferível – não é uma criptomoeda, não tem valor monetário, não é negociável.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"Q é um registro de contribuição, não de dinheiro.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q é a inicial de Quantum e de QCF. O anel dourado contém um campo de estrelas: cada ponto de luz no seu interior é um Co-construtor da Civilização, organizado numa espiral de ângulo dourado - a ordem natural partilhada por girassóis e galáxias, cada ponto único, mas parte de um todo. A luz mais brilhante no centro é a luz do Gênesis, o primeiro co-construtor. A cauda é uma partícula em transição: a ação única que começa com uma pessoa e muda o todo.","Q issued today":"Q emitido hoje","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"Q fica com seu ID de Civilização: intransferível, não negociável, sem valor monetário. Os dados de demonstração residem apenas neste navegador.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF LIFE CIENCES · RESUMO DE PESQUISA","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"O QCF visa apoiar a preparação médica civil por meio de registros reproduzíveis, revisão independente e desenvolvimento gradual sujeito a requisitos éticos, regulatórios e de qualidade. A salvaguarda da civilização começa com o respeito pela vida, pelos participantes na investigação e pelas provas científicas.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"Avaliação QCF: priorize infraestrutura energética quântica segura.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"QCF une as pessoas para construir, preservar e salvaguardar a civilização humana. A nossa primeira fase centra-se na colaboração internacional nas ciências da vida: investigação verificável, inovação responsável e conhecimento partilhado para reforçar a resiliência às principais crises de saúde e de saúde pública.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"O QCF acompanha continuamente os principais desenvolvimentos em computação quântica, detecção, comunicações, criptografia pós-quântica, redes e metrologia, avaliando a relevância prática para medição de energia, dados confiáveis, comunicações seguras, RWA e infraestrutura. Esta página mantém apenas manchetes e resumos concisos; PDFs bilíngues chinês-inglês são preservados como arquivos de pesquisa QCF de longo prazo.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"Linha de base de implantação do QCF: computação, detecção, comunicações, PQC e metrologia","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"Avaliação editorial do QCF: a avaliação científica encenada é garantida. Os especialistas relevantes devem rever os dados originais, os métodos estatísticos e a replicação independente, juntamente com a potência, a segurança e a qualidade de fabrico das células humanas, antes de julgarem a viabilidade clínica. Mais pesquisas também exigem propriedade clara, permissões e responsabilidades de uso de dados.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"QCF estabelecido: medição confiável → comunicação segura → verificação oracle → RWA / liquidação contábil.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"O QCF convida historiadores, profissionais de saúde, arquivos e todos os co-construtores da civilização a contribuir com registros verificáveis ​​de vidas perdidas. Juntos, podemos trazer à luz histórias negligenciadas, preservar conhecimentos fiáveis ​​e transformar o cuidado e o apoio em ações para salvaguardar a vida.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"O QCF pretende ser estabelecido em Zug, Suíça e está atualmente em preparação, ainda não registrado. Esta página descreve os princípios propostos; isso não significa que todos os mecanismos estejam operacionais.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"Perspectiva QCF: um registro compartilhado da vida humana","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"QCF propõe Civilization ID × NU-Key: uma visão de pesquisa aberta para identidade digital autocontrolada, credenciais verificáveis, acesso seguro, um inventário de ativos digitais e herança digital legal. Uma chave universal não é uma senha mestra que ignora todas as plataformas. É um gateway controlado pelo usuário que coordena credenciais e permissões separadas.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"O QCF busca tornar o conhecimento verificável mais acessível, estimulando a curiosidade sobre as origens humanas e o cuidado com a diversidade cultural. A investigação sobre o nosso passado partilhado nunca deve ser utilizada para classificar as comunidades actuais ou prescrever as suas identidades. Preservar o conhecimento é uma forma de cuidar das gerações seguintes.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"Visão QCF: acesso mais justo à saúde genômica","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E não promove alegações não verificadas de 'energia quântica'. Distinguem-se experimentos, protótipos, anúncios de empresas e especulações; as tecnologias quânticas inserem declarações de capacidade QCF somente após validação reproduzível em um caso de uso definido.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"Próxima etapa do QCF: due diligence científica encenada","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"Quantinuum Helios relatou progresso na correção de erros de memória lógica.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"Fundação da Civilização Quântica (em formação). Estabelecido no Cantão de Zug, Suíça; ainda não inscrito no registo comercial e sem personalidade jurídica.","Quantum Civilization University":"Universidade da Civilização Quântica","Quantum Q · free testing":"Quantum Q · teste gratuito","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"Tecnologia Quântica para a Energia da Terra ⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"A computação quântica converge com HPC; avanço nas comunicações e na fabricação de dispositivos","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"A detecção quântica torna-se um candidato prioritário para validação de energia QCF","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"Ciências da Vida Orientadas pela Quântica","RMB stablecoin":"Moeda estável RMB","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"Preparação médica para lesões por radiação","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"Leia sobre HeLa e proteção de dados de saúde","Read our life-sciences brief":"Leia nosso resumo de ciências da vida","Read our mission":"Leia nossa missão","Read the civilization brief":"Leia o resumo da civilização","Reading and extending this record":"Lendo e ampliando este registro","Ready to launch yours?":"Pronto para lançar o seu?","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"Registrar a civilização · Salvaguardar a vida · Construir a civilização juntos","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"Registrar, salvaguardar e construir a civilização juntos","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"Registrar a civilização significa preservar conhecimentos, contribuições e pesquisas rastreáveis. Salvaguardar a civilização significa proteger a vida e a escolha individual. Construir a civilização em conjunto significa partilhar os benefícios da cooperação internacional.","Register a Civilization ID":"Registre uma ID de Civilização","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"Restante para a meta da Fase 1 (CHF)","Remembering lives lost in war":"Relembrando vidas perdidas na guerra","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"Relembrando vidas perdidas em epidemias e doenças","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"Replicar a eficácia do animal de forma independente, usando controles apropriados, randomização e avaliação cega para examinar a sobrevivência, a resposta à dose e a janela de tratamento pós-exposição.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"Reportagem da Arquiteta da Civilização Jessica Sage · Atualizado semanalmente","Research approach and evidence status":"Abordagem de pesquisa e status de evidência","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"Apenas conceito de pesquisa: NU-Key, login entre plataformas e herança digital automática não são serviços operacionais atualmente. Nenhum acesso a contas de terceiros ou transferência de ativos é oferecido.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"Instituições de pesquisa, especialistas clínicos, especialistas em ética e governança de dados e apoiadores filantrópicos são bem-vindos para iniciar uma conversa. Por favor, compartilhe uma introdução institucional e um resumo não confidencial; não envie por e-mail dados genômicos pessoais, registros médicos ou detalhes de patentes não publicados.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"Pesquisador e fundação científica","Reset demo":"Redefinir demonstração","Responsible person":"Pessoa responsável","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"Repensando a humanidade: soberania dos dados de saúde humana e repartição equitativa de benefícios ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"Repensando a humanidade: a física quântica está redefinindo nossa compreensão da realidade","Review and recognition":"Avaliação e reconhecimento","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"Lista de Honra até 31 de março de 1921; o número mais restrito de 4 de agosto de 1914 a 11 de novembro de 1918 é 59.357. Não os adicione.","SARS · global":"SARS · global","Sample initiative":"Exemplo de iniciativa","Science and ethics":"Ciência e ética","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"Ciência a serviço da vida.<br>Colaboração além-fronteiras.","Scope and limitations":"Escopo e limitações","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"Role horizontalmente para ver a tabela completa. Abra cada fonte do registro original; leia datas e números juntamente com seu escopo.","Seat 1":"Assento 1","Seat 2":"Assento 2","Seat 3":"Assento 3","Seat 4":"Assento 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"Os assentos são espaços reservados. Parcerias formais exigem a devida diligência e um acordo por escrito. E-mail de contato aguardando a entrada em operação da fundação.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"Segunda Guerra Mundial · Canadá e Terra Nova","Second World War · global estimate":"Segunda Guerra Mundial · estimativa global","Security verification":"Verificação de segurança","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"Veja Impressum. De acordo com a Lei Federal Suíça de Proteção de Dados (nDSG) e o GDPR, quando aplicável.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"Busque especialistas independentes relevantes para revisar evidências, ética e viabilidade de pesquisa.","Selected":"Selecionado","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"Registros selecionados de duas guerras mundiais · Populações parciais","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"Mortes em serviço, incluindo ferimentos e doenças; o corte comemorativo estende-se até 31 de agosto de 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"Compartilhar um link (máximo 10/dia)","Share link":"Compartilhar link","Source":"Fonte","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"Prioridade de fonte: arquivos nacionais, estatísticas oficiais e instituições de memória pública; OMS para dados de doenças. Os próprios resumos históricos oficiais podem utilizar estimativas. Os acréscimos devem identificar período, geografia, população, tipo de figura e versão fonte; definições conflitantes são explicadas em vez de combinadas em um total preciso.","Sources and further reading":"Fontes e leituras adicionais","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"Fontes documentam história e pesquisa; a citação não implica parceria, financiamento ou endosso do QCF.","Stablecoins":"Moedas Estáveis","Start free testing":"Iniciar testes gratuitos","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"Começar como instituto e cursos livres (visão): registrar, estudar, repassar e coconstruir a civilização. Os graus exigem o credenciamento aplicável.","Status":"Estado","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"Situação: preparação e due diligence | Atualizado: 2 de novembro de 2026","Support":"Suporte","Support (opening soon)":"Suporte (abertura em breve)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"Apoiar a Iniciativa de Co-construtores da Civilização Global","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"Apoiadores doam voluntariamente (abre após inscrição).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"Apoiar o uso da computação quântica, da detecção quântica e da IA ​​na descoberta de medicamentos, na medicina de precisão e na pesquisa sobre longevidade saudável, dentro dos limites da ciência revisada por pares. Nenhum conselho médico ou alegações de saúde.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"Apoiar aplicações verificáveis ​​de computação quântica, detecção, comunicações, PQC e metrologia em pesquisa energética. As manchetes e resumos semanais são publicados abertamente; PDFs bilíngues são arquivados permanentemente para acesso de Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"Stablecoin do franco suíço","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"A infraestrutura quântica suíça, o planejamento da rede quântica DOE e o EuroQCI formaram a lista de observação inicial.","TWINT":"TWINT","Terms":"Termos","Terms of Use":"Termos de Uso","Test email:":"E-mail de teste:","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"O teste é gratuito antes do registro formal. Os serviços de assinatura e benefícios especiais para os primeiros Envoys seguirão as regras anunciadas naquele momento. O teste nunca aciona cobranças automáticas.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"A correspondência de sangue de 2009, de Abdel-Mageed e colegas, lista Deng como autor correspondente. Um vetor adenoviral foi usado para expressar superóxido dismutase extracelular, EC-SOD (SOD3), em células estromais/tronco mesenquimais de medula óssea de camundongo (MSCs). Os ratos receberam 500.000 células modificadas por via intravenosa 24 horas após irradiação corporal total de 9 Gy. A sobrevida relatada em 35 dias foi de 52%, em comparação com 10% para solução salina e 9% para células modificadas pelo gene repórter. Estes resultados dizem respeito a um modelo específico de ratinho e não podem ser convertidos no benefício humano esperado.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"O artigo de 2015 também demonstra a transdução adenoviral e a secreção de EC-SOD biologicamente ativo por MSCs de medula óssea humana in vitro. Experimentos com células humanas não são ensaios clínicos em humanos. A revista é Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, que não deve ser confundida com revistas com nomes semelhantes.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"O CV de 2023 lista separadamente US7.547.545 e o pedido 18/199.975 relativos à diferenciação celular e ao aumento da resposta imunológica à vacina. Eles não estabelecem concessão de patente ou eficácia para a radiação candidata.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"Os 6% descritos na página de iniciativas é uma proposta de plataforma de serviços existente. O programa de ciências da vida terá o seu próprio orçamento divulgado. Os pontos de contribuição ou os votos do público não substituem o julgamento científico ou ético.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"O currículo lista a função de diretor de citogenética no LabCorp Integrated Oncology desde 2017; esta não é a confirmação de uma nomeação atual para 2026. As funções atuais, a autorização institucional e as responsabilidades do QCF exigem verificação atualizada. As publicações e registros de patentes abaixo podem ser consultados de forma independente.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"O ID da Civilização Gênesis","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"O experimento de biotecnologia individual: IA, robótica e descoberta de medicamentos ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"A Quantum Civilization Foundation acredita que nossa verdadeira identidade compartilhada é simplesmente esta: um membro da civilização humana. Para todos que escolherem, emitimos uma ID de Civilização – ela nunca pergunta de onde você vem, apenas registra o que você traz para a civilização.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"A Administração de Arquivos do Estado apresenta uma investigação arquivística de Nanjing de fevereiro de 1946, registrando mais de 300.000. Investigação histórica; um subconjunto de mortes durante a guerra na China.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"A Universidade de Gotemburgo relata análises de DNA de mais de 4.500 indivíduos antigos, incluindo 712 genomas recentemente sequenciados. Os investigadores sugerem que os migrantes que entraram na Escandinávia há cerca de 4.000 anos podem ter carregado um ancestral das línguas germânicas. Uma migração posterior, vários séculos antes da Era Viking, coincidiu com o surgimento do nórdico antigo.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"A candidatura e o orçamento faseado estão em preparação. A utilização dos fundos, os custos administrativos, a seleção dos projetos e a supervisão serão definidos após a devida diligência. Esta página não coleta pagamentos.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"A assinatura identifica o comentário editorial do QCF. A pesquisa original pertence aos seus autores e detentores de direitos relevantes. A citação não implica endosso institucional ou licença de tecnologia.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"O estudo celta complementar analisa dados do genoma de 4.587 indivíduos antigos. Comparando os modelos de migração, os seus autores defendem uma expansão para oeste a partir do centro-leste da Europa há cerca de 3.000 anos como a explicação mais parcimoniosa para a dispersão celta. As contagens de amostras nos estudos não devem ser adicionadas como se representassem indivíduos separados.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"As descobertas fornecem um ponto de partida para a pesquisa translacional. O desenvolvimento deve primeiro distinguir o tratamento de emergência de lesões agudas por radiação da proteção contra lesões de tecidos normais relacionadas à radioterapia. Esses ambientes envolvem diferentes populações, janelas de tratamento, desfechos e considerações de risco-benefício. O que se segue é a análise do QCF, não um protocolo clínico iniciado ou autorizado.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"O primeiro ID da Civilização, 2026000001, pertence à fundadora, Jessica Sage. A Iniciativa de Co-construtores da Civilização Global começa aqui.","The golden Q: a quantum":"O Q dourado: um quantum","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"A versão live coletará e-mails apenas para emitir e verificar IDs de Civilização; sem nacionalidade, raça, religião ou outros dados sensíveis. Você pode solicitar acesso, correção e exclusão.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"O plano inclui visibilidade das finalidades, destinatários e registros de acesso, além de uma forma de retirar permissões futuras. Os limites relativos às análises concluídas, resultados publicados e retenção necessária devem ser explicados no consentimento.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"A perspectiva QCF anterior é um comentário editorial de Jessica Sage, separado dos resultados da pesquisa.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"A equipe do projeto pretende explorar a colaboração com potenciais parceiros, incluindo Beijing Nuosai Gene. Pessoas jurídicas, autorizações, protocolos e acordos éticos serão publicados após a devida diligência; isso não indica uma parceria assinada ou um lançamento de amostragem global.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"O design proposto combina criptografia estabelecida, gerenciamento de chaves, acesso com escopo e registros de auditoria. A IA pode apoiar a investigação e a deteção de anomalias; não substitui a criptografia, o consentimento informado ou a revisão especializada.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"O agregador público rotula ambos os aplicativos dos EUA como Abandonados. Esta não é uma opinião jurídica. A situação atual, outros direitos familiares nacionais, propriedade e qualquer licença para QCF exigem verificação de registro oficial e acordo por escrito. Nomear um inventor não estabelece a propriedade do QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"O trabalho publicado explora células-tronco mesenquimais que expressam superóxido dismutase extracelular (ECSOD). Os estudos listados em células e ratos fornecem uma base para uma avaliação mais aprofundada, sem estabelecer a segurança, eficácia ou protecção humana contra todos os ferimentos num conflito nuclear.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"As publicações de patentes relacionadas à radiação referem-se a células-tronco mesenquimais modificadas. Os inventores nomeados incluem Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed e Anthony J. Senagore. Estes são identificadores de aplicação/publicação, e não prova de uma patente concedida e executável.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"A sequência de referência combinou DNA de vários doadores. Pesquisadores em Buffalo recrutaram voluntários por meio de anúncios públicos e coletaram sangue após consentimento informado. Não se tratou de um rastreio de toda a população, nem de uma prova de um programa de amostragem global gerido pela ONU ou por todos os cinco membros permanentes do Conselho de Segurança.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"O canal de recebimento de envios está sendo conectado. Baixe o modelo agora para preparar seu texto e fontes. Baixar um modelo não envia uma contribuição nem concede pontos.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"O modelo não solicita DNA, números de documentos de identidade ou prontuários médicos. Uma ID de civilização pode ser adicionada após a emissão de um número formal.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"O identificador exclusivo é o Civilization ID registrado de forma independente, com um link de autorização voluntária. DNA não é um número de identificação público ou uma senha de login. A identidade não pode ser reduzida à genética; gêmeos idênticos também mostram por que o DNA por si só não consegue estabelecer uma identidade única para cada pessoa.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"Esses são objetivos de design e governança. O atual Civilization ID é uma demonstração inicial, sem nenhum sistema completo de dados de saúde implantado; este site não coleta dados genômicos pessoais.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"Esses registros não são somados: os totais de toda a guerra se sobrepõem aos subconjuntos nacionais e municipais; a mortalidade cumulativa, anual e excessiva mede coisas diferentes, e as mortes por guerra e doenças podem sobrepor-se. Valores aproximados, intervalos e qualificadores “mais que” são mantidos.","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"Esta visualização do design não envia dados para nenhum servidor. O e-mail, o nome do enviado e o histórico de contribuições permanecem no armazenamento local do seu navegador e podem ser apagados a qualquer momento. Sem cookies, análises ou recursos de terceiros.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"Esta primeira edição inclui nove recordes de guerra, nacionais e de eventos. O número arredondado combina mais de 9 milhões de mortes militares na Primeira Guerra Mundial e aproximadamente 60 milhões de mortes globais na Segunda Guerra Mundial. Os subconjuntos nacionais e municipais não são adicionados novamente. Não é um total de toda a guerra ou de toda a história.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"Esta primeira edição inclui dez registros provenientes da OMS. A figura resume as estimativas históricas mais baixas para a Peste Negra na Europa e as pandemias de gripe de 1918, 1957 e 1968. Não é um total histórico de epidemias e doenças.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"Esta história não implica autorização ou apoio da ONU ao QCF, ou uma sucessão oficial ao Projeto Genoma Humano.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"Este é um site de fase preparatória. A fundação ainda não está registada; todos os recursos disponíveis do site podem ser testados gratuitamente. Assinaturas e doações abrem após registro formal e abertura de conta bancária. Uma assinatura exige que o usuário escolha e confirme o preço e os termos; o teste nunca se torna automaticamente um plano pago.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"Este é o princípio que pretendemos colocar em prática através de tecnologia validada, operações responsáveis ​​e supervisão contínua.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"Esta página descreve uma contramedida médica candidata para lesões por radiação. A abordagem publicada não é equivalente a uma vacina. Se a “vacina contra radiação” proposta for uma candidata diferente, a sua definição técnica e o dossiê de provas necessitam de documentação separada.","This preview":"Esta prévia","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"QKD de fibra passiva de três usuários explorou arquiteturas mais simples de vários nós.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"A ser estabelecido em Zug, Suíça; atualmente preparatório e ainda não registrado. Fundadora: Jessica Sage (Civilização ID 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"Os tópicos incluem civilização e humanidades, ciências da vida, pesquisa quântica e energética, IA e tecnologia, ações de benefício público e cooperação internacional.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"Confiança por meio de evidências.<br>Administração por meio de transparência.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"Tente criar um ID de civilização","Try the Civilization ID flow":"Experimente o fluxo Civilization ID","Tuberculosis · global annual":"Tuberculose · anual global","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"A UNESCO adotou a Declaração Universal sobre o Genoma Humano e os Direitos Humanos em 11 de novembro de 1997; a Assembleia Geral da ONU aprovou-a através da resolução 53/152 de 9 de Dezembro de 1998. Esta história oferece uma referência ética: a ciência deve servir o bem-estar humano e as pessoas não devem ser reduzidas às suas características genéticas.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"Relato histórico do Departamento de Energia dos EUA, cobrindo 1931–1945; uma estimativa, não um registro unificado. Outras instituições diferem. As entradas de países/eventos da Segunda Guerra Mundial abaixo não devem ser adicionadas novamente.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"IDs verificados","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"Verifique entidades parceiras, mandatos, propriedade intelectual e evidências de pesquisa.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"Figura do Veterans Affairs Canada para pessoal de serviço; exclui outros países.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"Relacionado à Guerra do Vietnã · Registros militares dos EUA","View all civilization briefs →":"Veja todos os resumos da civilização →","View all publications →":"Ver todas as publicações →","Visa":"Visto","Vote":"Votar","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"Estimativa anual da OMS para 2024, incluindo 150.000 pessoas com HIV; não é cumulativo e se sobrepõe à entrada do HIV.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"Dados da OMS 2024: intervalo estimado 37,6–53,4 milhões. Valor acumulado de longo prazo; sobrepõe-se a condições como a tuberculose.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"Revisão da OMS Europa: estimativa para o primeiro ano; outros modelos/cortes são diferentes. Não é um total de todos os tempos.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"Intervalo estimado pela OMS 13,3–16,6 milhões; efeitos pandêmicos diretos e indiretos, mortes não confirmadas ou todos os anos pandêmicos.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"Estimativa histórica da OMS, não mortes individuais relatadas.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"A página do surto da OMS relatou o total, incluindo países afetados fora da África Ocidental; surto terminou em junho de 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"As baixas de guerra não são automaticamente mortes; os casos de doenças e as taxas de letalidade não são contagens de mortes. O valor de uma vida não é determinado pela nacionalidade, etnia ou identidade.","War remembrance":"Lembrança da guerra","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"Defendemos pesquisas que evitem a repetição do uso sem o consentimento informado adequado, respeitem a escolha individual e reconheçam as contribuições para a ciência. Vamos salvaguardar juntos o bem-estar humano.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"Nosso objetivo é transformar a compreensão científica em oportunidades de saúde que as pessoas possam compreender, escolher e das quais se beneficiar. A nossa visão a longo prazo é o acesso equitativo à saúde genómica; o primeiro passo é a pesquisa focada em benefício público e testes-piloto voluntários com resultados interpretáveis ​​e cuidados de acompanhamento.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"Não somos espectadores. Somos co-construtores. Co-construir e co-criar a civilização – para entregar um mundo melhor à próxima geração.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"Convidamos cidadãos, criptógrafos, engenheiros de identidade, especialistas jurídicos, desenvolvedores e famílias filantrópicas para co-criar um futuro em que as pessoas controlem sua identidade digital e escolham o que deixam para trás.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"Preservamos a história da ciência e assumimos a responsabilidade pelo futuro da vida. Procuramos investigação além-fronteiras que sirva as pessoas, utilização de dados que respeite a escolha individual e uma civilização sustentada através da cooperação e do cuidado.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"Lembramos para que mais vidas tenham futuro.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"Compartilhamos uma Terra e a responsabilidade pelo futuro da civilização. Deixemos que a tecnologia sirva a vida, que o conhecimento passe entre gerações e que cada ato de bondade ajude a construir a nossa civilização partilhada.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"Passamos a vida inteira criando ativos digitais, pegadas, conhecimento, memórias e negócios. Se envelhecermos, perdermos capacidade ou falecermos, será que nossos entes queridos saberão o que existe? Deveria tudo o que construímos simplesmente desaparecer?","WeChat Pay":"WeChat Pay","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"Os recursos do site podem ser testados gratuitamente antes que a fundação seja formalmente registrada. Os serviços de assinatura começarão após o registro, com benefícios especiais planejados para os primeiros Enviados da Civilização; elegibilidade e detalhes serão anunciados.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"Weiwen Deng e a pesquisa sobre lesões por radiação","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, trabalhou em citogenética, células-tronco e terapia genética. O currículo de 2023 fornecido ao QCF registra um diploma de medicina em 1990, um mestrado em microbiologia e imunologia em 1993 e um doutorado em Tulane em biologia molecular e celular em 2004, juntamente com pesquisas anteriores e liderança em laboratório de células-tronco mesenquimais no Hospital Infantil Helen DeVos.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng: publicações, patentes e status","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"Bem-vindo, Co-construtor da Civilização","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"Surto de Ebola na África Ocidental e países afetados","What did the studies find?":"O que os estudos descobriram?","What do the two papers establish?":"O que os dois artigos estabelecem?","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"Quando a vida termina, nosso mundo digital desaparece – ou continua vivo?","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"Por que a identificação da civilização e a proteção de dados de saúde são importantes","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"População mundial · estimativa de meados de 2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"Você ainda não tem uma ID de civilização","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"Sua identidade. Sua soberania. Seu legado.","Your informed choice":"Sua escolha informada","next":"próximo","opens after registration":"abre após registro","spent by co-builder vote":"gasto por votação do co-construtor","← Life sciences":"← Ciências da vida","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69.000.000"},"ar":{"${e}":"${e}","01 · Due diligence":"01 · العناية الواجبة","02 · Independent review":"02 · المراجعة المستقلة","03 · Pilot design":"03 · التصميم التجريبي","04 · Progress reporting":"04 · التقارير المرحلية","1530 nm atom-photon entanglement and 50 km fibre QKD advanced telecom-band quantum networking.":"1530 نانومتر تشابك ذري-فوتون و50 كيلومترًا من الألياف QKD شبكة كمومية متقدمة لنطاق الاتصالات.","180-qubit neutral-atom simulation: Nature reported experiments in non-equilibrium quantum dynamics.":"محاكاة الذرة المحايدة 180 كيوبت: تجارب ذكرتها الطبيعة في ديناميكيات الكم غير المتوازنة.","1997–1998: scientific progress and human dignity":"1997–1998: التقدم العلمي والكرامة الإنسانية","2026 preparatory initiative · Information is available now. This website does not collect DNA or accept genomic files.":"مبادرة 2026 الإعدادية · المعلومات متاحة الآن. هذا الموقع لا يجمع الحمض النووي ولا يقبل الملفات الجينومية.","6% is the combined total of the four services. Split, custody and AML process to be confirmed by Swiss counsel before registration.":"6% هو مجموع الخدمات الأربع مجتمعة. يتم تأكيد عملية التقسيم والحضانة ومكافحة غسل الأموال من قبل المحامي السويسري قبل التسجيل.","72,000,000+":"72,000,000+","A Civilization Envoy name":"اسم مبعوث الحضارة","A Civilization ID is a contribution identity within QCF, not a passport, citizenship or legal identity document.":"بطاقة الحضارة هي هوية مساهمة ضمن QCF، وليست جواز سفر أو جنسية أو وثيقة هوية قانونية.","A scientific endeavour across borders":"مسعى علمي عابر للحدود","A separate study investigated a COVID-19 peptide vaccine combined with tetanus vaccine in horses. It does not demonstrate a radiation vaccine or human efficacy.":"بحثت دراسة منفصلة في لقاح الببتيد COVID-19 مع لقاح الكزاز في الخيول. ولا يُثبت وجود لقاح إشعاعي أو فعالية بشرية.","A voluntary plan to link personal genomic data with a Civilization ID":"خطة تطوعية لربط البيانات الجينومية الشخصية بالهوية الحضارية","A(H1N1) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H1N1) جائحة الأنفلونزا · عالمي","A(H2N2) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H2N2) جائحة الأنفلونزا · عالمي","A(H3N2) influenza pandemic · global":"A(H3N2) جائحة الأنفلونزا · عالمي","Abdel-Mageed et al., with Weiwen Deng as coauthor. Topic: genetically modified mesenchymal stem cells and survival of irradiated mice. Evidence: animal research; journal section: Correspondence.":"عبد المجيد وآخرون، مع ويوين دينغ كمؤلف مشارك. الموضوع: الخلايا الجذعية الوسيطة المعدلة وراثيا وبقاء الفئران المشععة. الأدلة: البحوث الحيوانية؛ قسم المجلة: المراسلات.","About":"من نحن","Accepted submissions can be recognized under published contribution rules. Test points do not automatically become official rewards. Do not include personal health or genomic information without consent.":"يمكن التعرف على المشاركات المقبولة بموجب قواعد المساهمة المنشورة. لا تصبح نقاط الاختبار مكافآت رسمية تلقائيًا. لا تقم بتضمين المعلومات الصحية الشخصية أو الجينومية دون موافقة.","Accepted via a Swiss-licensed provider, converted to CHF at the rate on receipt, with a donation receipt issued.":"يتم قبوله عبر مقدم خدمة مرخص من سويسرا، ويتم تحويله إلى الفرنك السويسري بالسعر عند الاستلام، مع إصدار إيصال التبرع.","Account":"الحساب","Account separately for public-benefit research, commercial drug translation and infrastructure investment. Disclose related-party transactions, IP arrangements and conflicts, with recusal and independent review.":"حساب منفصل لأبحاث المنفعة العامة وترجمة الأدوية التجارية والاستثمار في البنية التحتية. الكشف عن المعاملات مع الأطراف ذات الصلة، وترتيبات الملكية الفكرية والصراعات، مع التنحي والمراجعة المستقلة.","Alipay":"عليباي","All available website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services begin after registration; the current plan is 20 CHF / USD / EUR per month, with services and payment terms shown clearly before subscribing.":"جميع ميزات الموقع المتاحة قابلة للاختبار مجانًا قبل تسجيل المؤسسة رسميًا. تبدأ خدمات الاشتراك بعد التسجيل؛ الخطة الحالية هي 20 فرنك سويسري / دولار أمريكي / يورو شهريًا، مع إظهار الخدمات وشروط الدفع بوضوح قبل الاشتراك.","All pay buttons are disabled for now. They enable after formal registration, bank account opening and payment-rail onboarding. Donations may require applicable AML/KYC checks. No tax treatment or deductibility is claimed.":"جميع أزرار الدفع معطلة حاليًا. أنها تمكن بعد التسجيل الرسمي، وفتح الحساب المصرفي والتأهيل للدفع. قد تتطلب التبرعات فحوصات مكافحة غسل الأموال/اعرف عميلك (AML/KYC) المعمول بها. لا تتم المطالبة بالمعاملة الضريبية أو الخصم.","All publications":"جميع المنشورات","An IonQ team reported kilohertz-scale heterogeneous entanglement.":"أبلغ فريق IonQ عن تشابك غير متجانس بمقياس كيلوهرتز.","Any co-builder with a Civilization ID can launch an initiative on any topic.":"يمكن لأي مشارك في البناء يحمل هوية حضارة أن يطلق مبادرة في أي موضوع.","Anyone can launch a Civilization Initiative":"يمكن لأي شخص أن يطلق مبادرة حضارية","Apple Pay":"ابل باي","Apply to become a payment partner":"تقدم بطلب لتصبح شريك الدفع","As of the public-source review on 10 November 2026, no human-trial registration or regulatory approval was identified for this EC-SOD-engineered MSC radiation indication. Verifiable registry identifiers and authorisation documents remain necessary. Trials of other SOD formulations, mimetics or cells for other diseases do not validate this candidate.":"اعتبارًا من مراجعة المصدر العام في 10 نوفمبر 2026، لم يتم تحديد أي تسجيل للتجارب البشرية أو موافقة تنظيمية لمؤشر إشعاع MSC المصمم من قبل EC-SOD. تظل معرفات التسجيل ووثائق التفويض التي يمكن التحقق منها ضرورية. إن تجارب تركيبات SOD أو مقلدات أو خلايا أخرى لأمراض أخرى لا تؤكد صحة هذا المرشح.","Assess candidate approaches to preventing or treating radiation injury for civilian protection and public-health preparedness. Documentation and scientific review are pending; safety and efficacy are not established.":"تقييم الأساليب المرشحة لمنع أو علاج الإصابات الإشعاعية لحماية المدنيين والاستعداد للصحة العامة. التوثيق والمراجعة العلمية في انتظاركم؛ لم يتم تأسيس السلامة والفعالية.","At this review, QCF has not received a human-trial registration number, regulatory authorisation or marketing-approval evidence for this candidate. Updated experimental progress, independent replication, manufacturing quality and the clinical development pathway remain to be documented.":"في هذه المراجعة، لم تتلق QCF رقم تسجيل للتجربة البشرية أو ترخيصًا تنظيميًا أو دليل موافقة على التسويق لهذا المرشح. لا يزال يتعين توثيق التقدم التجريبي المحدث والتكرار المستقل وجودة التصنيع ومسار التطوير السريري.","Atomic bombing of Hiroshima · Japan":"القصف الذري على هيروشيما · اليابان","BTQ × Kaia announced a quantum-secure stablecoin-network collaboration.":"أعلنت BTQ × Kaia عن تعاون في شبكة العملات المستقرة والآمنة الكميًا.","Back to Civilization ID":"العودة إلى معرف الحضارة","Back to Life Sciences":"العودة إلى علوم الحياة","Back to population figures":"العودة إلى أرقام السكان","Become a Civilization Co-Builder":"كن منشئًا مشاركًا للحضارة","Become a co-builder":"كن منشئًا مشاركًا","Become the next Civilization Co-builder":"كن المشارك التالي في بناء الحضارة","Before consent, explain the purpose, recipient, research scope, retention period and risks. Assess new uses separately, including any use for AI training.":"قبل الموافقة، اشرح الغرض والمتلقي ونطاق البحث وفترة الاحتفاظ والمخاطر. قم بتقييم الاستخدامات الجديدة بشكل منفصل، بما في ذلك أي استخدام لتدريب الذكاء الاصطناعي.","Behind every number is a person, a life and a family. Remembering lives lost makes peace, public health and safeguarding life a shared responsibility.":"وراء كل رقم شخص وحياة وعائلة. إن تذكر الأرواح المفقودة يجعل السلام والصحة العامة وحماية الحياة مسؤولية مشتركة.","Behind every number was a name, a family and a life left unfinished. We record loss to cherish life today, and support science to protect life tomorrow.":"وراء كل رقم اسم وعائلة وحياة لم تكتمل. نحن نسجل الخسارة لنعتز بها اليوم، وندعم العلم لحماية الحياة غدًا.","Bilingual PDF":"PDF ثنائي اللغة","Bitcoin BTC":"بيتكوين بي تي سي","Black Death · Europe":"الموت الأسود · أوروبا","Bounded by peer-reviewed and verifiable evidence":"مقيد بالأدلة التي تمت مراجعتها من قبل النظراء والتي يمكن التحقق منها","Browse published briefs":"تصفح الملخصات المنشورة","By Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage<br>Published 5 November 2026 · Nature news report: 4 November 2026":"بقلم المهندسة المعمارية جيسيكا سيج<br>تم النشر في 5 نوفمبر 2026 · تقرير إخباري عن الطبيعة: 4 نوفمبر 2026","CIVILIZATION CO-BUILDER · PDF ARCHIVE ACCESS":"شريك في بناء الحضارة · الوصول إلى أرشيف PDF","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY":"معرف الحضارة × NU-KEY","CIVILIZATION ID × NU-KEY · GLOBAL RESEARCH INITIATIVE":"معرف الحضارة × NU-KEY · مبادرة الأبحاث العالمية","COVID-19-associated excess mortality · global":"الوفيات الزائدة المرتبطة بفيروس كورونا · عالميًا","Canadian War Museum overview; military/service personnel only, not all civilian deaths. National entries below overlap.":"نظرة عامة على المتحف الحربي الكندي؛ الأفراد العسكريون/الخدمة فقط، وليس جميع الوفيات بين المدنيين. الإدخالات الوطنية أدناه تتداخل.","Cards & wallets":"البطاقات والمحافظ","Cells as antioxidant protein factories: Weiwen Deng’s radiation-injury research":"الخلايا كمصانع بروتينية مضادة للأكسدة: بحث ويوين دينج عن الإصابة بالإشعاع","Check in":"تسجيل الدخول","Choose a new Civilization Envoy name. Your original identity can stay hidden — show only your ID number or your new name.":"اختر اسمًا جديدًا لمبعوث الحضارة. يمكن أن تظل هويتك الأصلية مخفية — أظهر فقط رقم هويتك أو اسمك الجديد.","Choose an amount":"اختر المبلغ","City estimate through end-1945; combined blast, thermal and radiation effects, not radiation-only deaths or the full long-term toll.":"تقدير المدينة حتى نهاية عام 1945؛ التأثيرات المجمعة للانفجارات والحرارة والإشعاع، وليس الوفيات الناجمة عن الإشعاع فقط أو الخسائر الكاملة على المدى الطويل.","Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage | 10 November 2026 | Research commentary":"المهندسة الحضارية جيسيكا سيج | 10 نوفمبر 2026 | تعليق البحوث","Civilization Envoy name (optional)":"اسم مبعوث الحضارة (اختياري)","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute original articles, research insights and accounts of public-benefit action. Accepted work can be recorded as a contribution linked to a Civilization ID and Quantum Q points.":"مبعوثو الحضارة مدعوون للمساهمة بالمقالات الأصلية والرؤى البحثية وحسابات العمل المنفعة العامة. يمكن تسجيل العمل المقبول كمساهمة مرتبطة بمعرف الحضارة ونقاط Quantum Q.","Civilization Envoys are invited to contribute. Share work that is truthful, clear and verifiable—knowledge in service of life, and action that connects people.":"مبعوثو الحضارة مدعوون للمساهمة. شارك العمل الصادق والواضح والقابل للتحقق - المعرفة في خدمة الحياة، والعمل الذي يربط بين الناس.","Civilization ID":"معرف الحضارة","Civilization ID and privacy":"الهوية الحضارية والخصوصية","Civilization ID currently remains a free local-browser test record, so this is a test gate rather than central verified identity. Once the central Civilization ID system is online, PDF access will be upgraded to server-side trusted authorization.":"يظل معرف الحضارة حاليًا سجل اختبار متصفح محلي مجاني، لذا فهذه بوابة اختبار وليست هوية مركزية تم التحقق منها. بمجرد اتصال نظام معرف الحضارة المركزي بالإنترنت، ستتم ترقية الوصول إلى PDF إلى ترخيص موثوق به من جانب الخادم.","Civilization ID goal":"هدف الهوية الحضارية","Civilization ID is currently a front-end demonstration. Clinical health-data storage and the complete governance functions described here are not deployed. This website does not collect personal genomic data.":"معرف الحضارة حاليا هو عرض للواجهة الأمامية. لم يتم نشر تخزين بيانات الصحة السريرية ووظائف الإدارة الكاملة الموضحة هنا. هذا الموقع لا يجمع البيانات الجينومية الشخصية.","Civilization ID is envisioned as a link between voluntary contributions and explicit permissions. Identity, participation records and sensitive health data should be separated; DNA is not required to participate. Encryption must work alongside purpose limits, access audits, independent governance and withdrawal of future permission. An ID alone cannot guarantee privacy.":"يُنظر إلى معرف الحضارة كحلقة وصل بين المساهمات التطوعية والأذونات الصريحة. ينبغي فصل الهوية وسجلات المشاركة والبيانات الصحية الحساسة؛ الحمض النووي غير مطلوب للمشاركة. يجب أن يعمل التشفير جنبًا إلى جنب مع حدود الغرض وعمليات تدقيق الوصول والحوكمة المستقلة وسحب الإذن المستقبلي. لا يمكن للهوية وحدها أن تضمن الخصوصية.","Civilization ID supports voluntary participation and contribution records; it is not a legal identity. DNA or health data are not required to obtain an ID. Current free testing does not constitute a live central identity service.":"معرف الحضارة يدعم المشاركة التطوعية وسجلات المساهمة؛ إنها ليست هوية قانونية. الحمض النووي أو البيانات الصحية ليست مطلوبة للحصول على بطاقة هوية. لا يشكل الاختبار المجاني الحالي خدمة هوية مركزية حية.","Civilization ID · free testing":"البطاقة الحضارية · الاختبار مجاني","Civilization ID: participation and permission":"معرف الحضارة: المشاركة والإذن","Civilization IDs and Q currently use records stored in this browser for testing. Central registration, submission intake and reviewed rewards are being connected. Testing is free and never starts a subscription automatically.":"تستخدم معرفات الحضارة وQ حاليًا السجلات المخزنة في هذا المتصفح للاختبار. يتم ربط التسجيل المركزي وتناول التقديم والمكافآت التي تمت مراجعتها. الاختبار مجاني ولا يبدأ الاشتراك تلقائيًا أبدًا.","Civilization begins with everyone who chooses to begin":"الحضارة تبدأ مع كل من يختار أن يبدأ","Claim my Civilization ID":"احصل على هويتي الحضارية","Claim your Civilization ID":"احصل على هويتك الحضارية","Cluster-state transmission over 29 km of partially deployed fibre advanced network engineering.":"نقل حالة الكتلة على مسافة تزيد عن 29 كم من هندسة الشبكات المتقدمة للألياف المنتشرة جزئيًا.","Co-Building Civilization Brief":"نبذة عن المشاركة في بناء الحضارة","Co-builder vote · Foundation services":"تصويت البناء المشارك · خدمات المؤسسة","Co-building civilisation.<br>Safeguarding life.":"المشاركة في بناء الحضارة.<br>صون الحياة.","Co-creating civilization. Cherishing every life.":"المشاركة في خلق الحضارة. الاعتزاز بكل حياة.","Coming soon":"قريبا","Complete preclinical safety assessment of biodistribution, persistence, immune responses, thrombotic risk, residual vector and abnormal tissue growth. Radiotherapy applications also require assessment of effects on tumour control.":"تقييم السلامة قبل السريرية الكامل للتوزيع الحيوي، والثبات، والاستجابات المناعية، ومخاطر التخثر، والنواقل المتبقية ونمو الأنسجة غير الطبيعي. تتطلب تطبيقات العلاج الإشعاعي أيضًا تقييم التأثيرات على السيطرة على الورم.","Connect each confirmed contribution to your ID through Quantum Q. During free testing, browser test points remain separate from official contribution records.":"قم بربط كل مساهمة مؤكدة بمعرفك من خلال Quantum Q. أثناء الاختبار المجاني، تظل نقاط اختبار المتصفح منفصلة عن سجلات المساهمة الرسمية.","Contact":"للتواصل","Contact the preparatory team":"التواصل مع الفريق التحضيري","Contribute to civilization":"ساهم في الحضارة","Contribute to our shared remembrance →":"ساهم في ذكرنا المشترك →","Contribution history":"تاريخ المساهمة","Contribution points Q":"نقاط المساهمة س","Contributions return to your ID":"تعود الاشتراكات إلى هويتك","Controller":"جهاز التحكم","Could cells that secrete an antioxidant protein help mitigate tissue damage after radiation? Published work by Weiwen Deng and colleagues provides evidence from mice and human cells in vitro. It is a preclinical approach warranting further testing; it is not an approved human treatment.":"هل يمكن للخلايا التي تفرز بروتينًا مضادًا للأكسدة أن تساعد في تخفيف تلف الأنسجة بعد الإشعاع؟ يقدم العمل المنشور الذي أجراه Weiwen Deng وزملاؤه أدلة من الفئران والخلايا البشرية في المختبر. وهو نهج ما قبل السريرية يستدعي المزيد من الاختبارات؛ إنه ليس علاجًا بشريًا معتمدًا.","Coverage will be updated from traceable original research, with the limits of the evidence made clear.":"سيتم تحديث التغطية من الأبحاث الأصلية التي يمكن تتبعها، مع توضيح حدود الأدلة.","Create a local test ID":"إنشاء معرف اختبار محلي","Create an ID · free testing":"إنشاء هوية · اختبار مجاني","Crypto":"التشفير","Current stage: preparation, partner due diligence and scientific review. Clinical trials, public screening and donation collection under this programme have not begun.":"المرحلة الحالية: الإعداد والعناية الواجبة للشريك والمراجعة العلمية. لم تبدأ التجارب السريرية والفحص العام وجمع التبرعات في إطار هذا البرنامج.","DARPA QBI Stage C advanced independent engineering validation.":"DARPA QBI Stage C التحقق الهندسي المستقل المتقدم.","DNA does not directly identify the language someone spoke. Genetic patterns must be interpreted alongside archaeology and linguistics, and language change need not accompany population replacement. These findings help test historical hypotheses; they do not decode ancient speech.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"الحمض النووي لا يحدد بشكل مباشر اللغة التي يتحدث بها الشخص. يجب تفسير الأنماط الجينية جنبًا إلى جنب مع علم الآثار واللغويات، ولا يلزم أن يصاحب تغير اللغة استبدال السكان. تساعد هذه النتائج في اختبار الفرضيات التاريخية؛ فهي لا تفك رموز الكلام القديم.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","DRAFT · pending legal review":"مسودة · في انتظار المراجعة القانونية","Daily births · estimate":"الولادات اليومية · تقدير","Daily check-in":"تسجيل الدخول يوميا","Daily deaths · estimate":"الوفيات اليومية · تقدير","Dates / reporting period":"التواريخ/فترة التقرير","Dates, lives lost and source records":"التواريخ والأرواح المفقودة وسجلات المصدر","Deaths / fatality records":"سجلات الوفيات/الوفيات","Deaths in WHO’s probable-case summary; dates refer to the onset-of-illness period.":"الوفيات في ملخص الحالات المحتملة لمنظمة الصحة العالمية؛ تشير التواريخ إلى فترة بداية المرض.","Define a reproducible human-cell product: source, identity, EC-SOD activity and expression duration, donor variation, batch consistency, cryopreservation and scalable production.":"تحديد منتج خلايا بشرية قابل للتكرار: المصدر، الهوية، نشاط EC-SOD ومدة التعبير، تنوع المتبرع، اتساق الدفعة، الحفظ بالتبريد والإنتاج القابل للتطوير.","Define beneficiaries, delivery institutions, budgets, milestones and measurable outcomes.":"تحديد المستفيدين ومؤسسات التسليم والميزانيات والمعالم والنتائج القابلة للقياس.","Define protocols and applicable approvals and ethics requirements before research begins. Distinguish exploratory work, validated findings and marketing; report uncertainty and negative results.":"تحديد البروتوكولات والموافقات المعمول بها والمتطلبات الأخلاقية قبل بدء البحث. تمييز العمل الاستكشافي والنتائج المصادق عليها والتسويق؛ الإبلاغ عن عدم اليقين والنتائج السلبية.","Demo: tap to try launching an initiative and receive 100 Q.":"العرض التوضيحي: اضغط لتجربة إطلاق مبادرة واحصل على 100 ق.","Demo: your email stays in this browser; no real email is sent.":"تجريبي: بريدك الإلكتروني يبقى في هذا المتصفح؛ لا يتم إرسال أي بريد إلكتروني حقيقي.","Deng et al.: mitigation of radiation injuries in mice using ECSOD-secreting modified mesenchymal stem cells. Weiwen Deng is listed as first and corresponding author. Evidence: preclinical research.":"دنغ وآخرون: التخفيف من الإصابات الإشعاعية في الفئران باستخدام الخلايا الجذعية الوسيطة المعدلة التي تفرز ECSOD. تم إدراج Weiwen Deng باعتباره المؤلف الأول والمراسل. الأدلة: البحوث قبل السريرية.","Develop focused public-benefit research and screening pilots with defined conditions, populations and follow-up care. Scope will be set after partner authorisation, ethics review and protocol verification.":"تطوير أبحاث مركزة ذات منفعة عامة وفحص الطيارين مع ظروف محددة وسكان ورعاية متابعة. سيتم تحديد النطاق بعد ترخيص الشريك ومراجعة الأخلاقيات والتحقق من البروتوكول.","Development for acute radiation injury may explore applicable pathways such as the FDA Animal Rule. Under specific conditions, it permits adequate, controlled animal efficacy studies to support approval, while retaining human safety and product-quality requirements. Eligibility and approval are not assured. Existing radiation-injury medicines should inform the unmet need and comparator strategy.":"قد يستكشف تطوير الإصابة الإشعاعية الحادة المسارات القابلة للتطبيق مثل قاعدة FDA الخاصة بالحيوانات. وفي ظل ظروف محددة، يسمح بإجراء دراسات كافية ومراقبة لفعالية الحيوانات لدعم الموافقة، مع الحفاظ على متطلبات السلامة البشرية وجودة المنتج. الأهلية والموافقة ليست مضمونة. ينبغي لأدوية الإصابة الإشعاعية الموجودة أن توجه الاحتياجات غير الملباة واستراتيجية المقارنة.","Disease prevention, NAD⁺ and aging mechanisms, single-cell and regenerative research, AI genomics, and epigenetics are areas for continued coverage. QCF briefs will distinguish cell and animal studies from human trials and clinical evidence. A change in a biological-age marker is not proof of longer life.":"تعتبر الوقاية من الأمراض، وآليات NAD⁺ والشيخوخة، والأبحاث التجديدية والخلية المفردة، وعلم جينوم الذكاء الاصطناعي، وعلم الوراثة اللاجينية مجالات للتغطية المستمرة. سوف تميز ملخصات QCF الدراسات الخلوية والحيوانية عن التجارب البشرية والأدلة السريرية. إن التغير في علامة العمر البيولوجي ليس دليلاً على حياة أطول.","Disease remembrance":"تذكر المرض","Donation collection and automatic subscriptions are not open. CHF 100 million is the proposed phase-one request, not funds raised, pledged or approved. Detailed budgets and fees require due diligence and applicable governance review.":"جمع التبرعات والاشتراكات التلقائية غير مفتوحة. إن مبلغ 100 مليون فرنك سويسري هو طلب المرحلة الأولى المقترح، وليس الأموال التي تم جمعها أو التعهد بها أو الموافقة عليها. تتطلب الميزانيات والرسوم التفصيلية العناية الواجبة ومراجعة الحوكمة المعمول بها.","Donations":"التبرعات","Donations received":"تم استلام التبرعات","Download bilingual PDF":"تنزيل ملف PDF ثنائي اللغة","Download submission template":"تنزيل قالب التقديم","Editorial note: this is an independently written QCF summary and commentary, not a reproduction or official translation of Nature’s article. The original news author is Ewen Callaway; research credit belongs to the papers’ authors and institutions. Access to the full Nature news article may require a subscription.":"ملاحظة تحريرية: هذا ملخص وتعليق لـ QCF مكتوب بشكل مستقل، وليس نسخة أو ترجمة رسمية لمقالة Nature. مؤلف الأخبار الأصلي هو إوين كالاواي. يعود الفضل في البحث إلى مؤلفي الأوراق البحثية ومؤسساتها. قد يتطلب الوصول إلى مقالة Nature الإخبارية الكاملة الاشتراك.","Editorial review: 2 November 2026. These organizations are cited as sources; no partnership, authorization or endorsement of QCF is implied.":"المراجعة التحريرية: 2 نوفمبر 2026. تم الاستشهاد بهذه المنظمات كمصادر؛ لا يتضمن ذلك أي شراكة أو ترخيص أو تأييد لـ QCF.","Email: [to be set up, e.g. contact@qcf.org.cn]":"البريد الإلكتروني: [للإعداد، على سبيل المثال. contact@qcf.org.cn]","Encrypted identity":"الهوية المشفرة","Encryption and key control":"التشفير والتحكم في المفاتيح","Engage regulators and ethics committees to establish product classification, quality standards, the development pathway and prerequisites for human research. Only after necessary authorisations could early human studies focused on safety, tolerability and measurable biological activity be considered.":"إشراك الجهات التنظيمية ولجان الأخلاقيات في وضع تصنيف المنتج ومعايير الجودة ومسار التطوير والمتطلبات الأساسية للأبحاث البشرية. ولا يمكن النظر في الدراسات البشرية المبكرة التي ركزت على السلامة والتحمل والنشاط البيولوجي القابل للقياس إلا بعد الحصول على التراخيص اللازمة.","Estimate range in WHO historical review.":"نطاق التقدير في المراجعة التاريخية لمنظمة الصحة العالمية.","Estimate range in WHO historical review; estimates vary between publications.":"النطاق التقديري في المراجعة التاريخية لمنظمة الصحة العالمية؛ تختلف التقديرات بين المنشورات.","Ethereum ETH":"ايثريوم ETH","Event and population":"الحدث والسكان","Every action is remembered by civilization":"كل عمل تذكره الحضارة","Every day we log in. To our phones, email, banks, health services, government portals and cloud accounts. Across borders, we repeat passwords, codes and identity checks. Our lives are fragmented across hundreds of digital doors.":"نقوم كل يوم بتسجيل الدخول. إلى هواتفنا وبريدنا الإلكتروني والبنوك والخدمات الصحية والبوابات الحكومية والحسابات السحابية. وعبر الحدود، نكرر كلمات المرور والرموز وعمليات التحقق من الهوية. حياتنا مجزأة عبر مئات الأبواب الرقمية.","Every life deserves dignity and remembrance.":"كل حياة تستحق الكرامة والذكرى.","Every life deserves respect. Every use of personal data needs clear boundaries.":"كل حياة تستحق الاحترام. يحتاج كل استخدام للبيانات الشخصية إلى حدود واضحة.","Every new life deserves a gentle welcome.":"كل حياة جديدة تستحق الترحيب اللطيف.","Every spend from the 94% is decided by co-builder vote.":"يتم تحديد كل إنفاق من 94% من خلال تصويت البناء المشارك.","Evidence reviewed: 2 November 2026 | Programme preparation and due diligence":"تمت مراجعة الأدلة: 2 نوفمبر 2026 | إعداد البرنامج والعناية الواجبة","Explore NU-Key & Digital Legacy":"اكتشف NU-Key والإرث الرقمي","Explore Phase One →":"اكتشف المرحلة الأولى →","Explore collaboration between Chinese drug innovators and European research, clinical and industry partners. Public-benefit research, patient access and commercial translation require separate objectives, budgets and rights.":"استكشف التعاون بين مبتكري الأدوية الصينيين والشركاء الأوروبيين في مجال الأبحاث والسريرية والصناعة. تتطلب أبحاث المنفعة العامة ووصول المرضى والترجمة التجارية أهدافًا وميزانيات وحقوقًا منفصلة.","Explore disease remembrance and sources →":"استكشاف أذكار الأمراض ومصادرها →","Explore genomic history and the phase-one vision":"اكتشف تاريخ الجينوم ورؤية المرحلة الأولى","Explore the life-sciences programme":"اكتشف برنامج العلوم الحياتية","Explore the phase-one programme":"اكتشف برنامج المرحلة الأولى","Explore the principles":"اكتشف المبادئ","Explore war remembrance and sources →":"اكتشف أذكار الحرب ومصادرها →","First World War · Australia":"الحرب العالمية الأولى · أستراليا","First World War · British military":"الحرب العالمية الأولى · الجيش البريطاني","First World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"الحرب العالمية الأولى · كندا ونيوفاوندلاند","First World War · global military":"الحرب العالمية الأولى · العسكرية العالمية","First-edition dataset · Reviewed and repository updated: 2 November 2026 · Not live statistics":"مجموعة بيانات الإصدار الأول · تمت المراجعة والتحديث في المستودع: 2 نوفمبر 2026 · إحصائيات غير مباشرة","For me, the value of this research lies in connecting disciplines. Life sciences bring past movements into view; archaeology and linguistics help us interpret those encounters. The languages and cultures we know today deserve to be understood within a longer history of human exchange.":"بالنسبة لي، قيمة هذا البحث تكمن في ربط التخصصات. علوم الحياة تضع الحركات الماضية في الاعتبار؛ يساعدنا علم الآثار واللغويات في تفسير تلك اللقاءات. إن اللغات والثقافات التي نعرفها اليوم تستحق أن تُفهم ضمن تاريخ أطول من التبادل البشري.","Founder":"المؤسس","Four selected historical pandemics · Sum of lower estimates":"أربع أوبئة تاريخية مختارة · مجموع التقديرات الأدنى","Fourteen billion years ago the universe began from a single point. Four billion years ago, life first copied itself in the ocean. Today eight billion people share one blue planet — still divided by borders, colour, language and belief.":"منذ أربعة عشر مليار سنة بدأ الكون من نقطة واحدة. قبل أربعة مليارات سنة، نسخت الحياة نفسها لأول مرة في المحيط. اليوم، يتشارك ثمانية مليارات شخص في كوكب أزرق واحد، ولا يزالون مقسمين حسب الحدود واللون واللغة والمعتقد.","Fraunhofer's NV-diamond magnetometry work became a candidate for an energy-monitoring PoC.":"أصبح عمل Fraunhofer في مجال قياس مغناطيسية الألماس NV مرشحًا لـ PoC لمراقبة الطاقة.","Free testing · Records currently stay in this browser. This is not central ID issuance or email verification. Real accounts and cross-device records will open when the registration service is connected.":"اختبار مجاني · تبقى السجلات حاليًا في هذا المتصفح. هذا ليس إصدار معرف مركزي أو التحقق من البريد الإلكتروني. سيتم فتح الحسابات الحقيقية والسجلات عبر الأجهزة عند اتصال خدمة التسجيل.","From 1990 to 2003, the Human Genome Project established a foundation for the human reference genome. NIH and the Department of Energy supported the US effort; sequencing institutions came from the US, UK, France, Germany, Japan and China. It demonstrated the power of international collaboration and shared knowledge.":"من عام 1990 إلى عام 2003، أنشأ مشروع الجينوم البشري أساسًا للجينوم المرجعي البشري. ودعمت المعاهد الوطنية للصحة ووزارة الطاقة الجهود الأميركية؛ جاءت مؤسسات التسلسل من الولايات المتحدة والمملكة المتحدة وفرنسا وألمانيا واليابان والصين. لقد أظهر قوة التعاون الدولي والمعرفة المشتركة.","From HeLa’s lesson to Civilization ID’s responsibility":"من درس هيلا إلى مسؤولية هوية الحضارة","From first login to a lasting legacy":"من أول تسجيل دخول إلى إرث دائم","From laboratory to clinic: the next research questions":"من المختبر إلى العيادة: الأسئلة البحثية القادمة","From one idea to a civilization in action":"من فكرة واحدة إلى حضارة في العمل","From reading the genome to safeguarding life":"من قراءة الجينوم إلى حماية الحياة","From research evidence to safeguarding life":"من الأدلة البحثية إلى الحفاظ على الحياة","From understanding genomes to safeguarding every person":"من فهم الجينوم إلى حماية كل شخص","From vision to verifiable action":"من الرؤية إلى العمل القابل للتحقق","Fund management":"إدارة الصندوق","Funding and oversight":"التمويل والإشراف","Funding during preparation":"التمويل أثناء التحضير","Gather Civilization Co-builders worldwide to co-build, record, pass on and safeguard human civilization.":"اجمع بناة الحضارة في جميع أنحاء العالم للمشاركة في بناء الحضارة الإنسانية وتسجيلها ونقلها وحمايتها.","Genomic health research":"أبحاث الصحة الجينومية","Get Civilization ID":"إنشاء هوية الحضارة","Get your ID":"احصل على هويتك","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"مبادرة شركاء بناء الحضارة العالمية","Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative · Preparatory stage":"مبادرة شركاء بناء الحضارة العالمية · المرحلة الإعدادية","Global Quantum Technology & Energy Ecosystem Briefs":"ملخصات عن تكنولوجيا الكم العالمية والنظام البيئي للطاقة","Google Pay":"جوجل باي","Governance":"الحوكمة","Governance and funding principles":"مبادئ الحوكمة والتمويل","Governance service":"خدمة الحوكمة","HIV-related deaths · global cumulative":"الوفيات المرتبطة بفيروس نقص المناعة البشرية · التراكمي العالمي","HeLa reminds us that preserving knowledge also requires respect for every person behind it. Civilization ID is envisioned as an entry point for voluntary participation and permission records, without exposing DNA, medical records or family relationships. Protection requires encryption, separation of identity and data, purpose-specific permission and access auditing.":"تذكرنا هيلا بأن الحفاظ على المعرفة يتطلب أيضًا احترام كل من يقف خلفها. يتم تصور معرف الحضارة كنقطة دخول للمشاركة التطوعية وسجلات الأذونات، دون الكشف عن الحمض النووي أو السجلات الطبية أو العلاقات الأسرية. تتطلب الحماية التشفير وفصل الهوية والبيانات والإذن الخاص بالغرض وتدقيق الوصول.","Help build a human-centred digital civilization":"ساعد في بناء حضارة رقمية محورها الإنسان","Help safeguard life":"ساعد في الحفاظ على الحياة","Here you may take a new name: your Civilization Envoy name. You may leave the past hidden and appear only as your ID or new name. You join by free will and move forward by voluntary contribution. Every share, every initiative, every action becomes a golden quantum Q, returning to your ID.":"هنا يمكنك أن تأخذ اسمًا جديدًا: اسم مبعوث الحضارة الخاص بك. يمكنك ترك الماضي مخفيًا والظهور فقط كمعرفك أو اسمك الجديد. أنت تنضم بإرادتك الحرة وتتقدم للأمام من خلال المساهمة التطوعية. كل مشاركة، كل مبادرة، كل إجراء يصبح بمثابة الكم الذهبي Q، الذي يعود إلى هويتك.","Hide my original identity; show only my ID or envoy name":"إخفاء هويتي الأصلية؛ أظهر فقط هويتي أو اسم المبعوث","Historical cumulative total: no reliable worldwide figure":"المجموع التراكمي التاريخي: لا يوجد رقم عالمي موثوق","Historical estimate cited by WHO, Europe only; not contemporary case registration. No exact start/end dates in this source.":"التقدير التاريخي الذي ذكرته منظمة الصحة العالمية، أوروبا فقط؛ ليس تسجيل الحالات المعاصرة. لا توجد تواريخ بدء/انتهاء محددة في هذا المصدر.","Historical figure in the UK National Archives research guide; not a worldwide total.":"شخصية تاريخية في دليل أبحاث الأرشيف الوطني بالمملكة المتحدة؛ ليس المجموع العالمي.","History and our genomic-health vision":"التاريخ ورؤيتنا للصحة الجينومية","Home":"الرئيسية","How ancient genomes help trace the spread of Germanic and Celtic languages":"كيف تساعد الجينومات القديمة في تتبع انتشار اللغتين الجرمانية والسلتية","How initiatives work":"كيف تعمل المبادرات","Human research and regulatory evidence":"الأبحاث البشرية والأدلة التنظيمية","I have read the <a class=gold href=privacy.html>Privacy</a> and <a class=gold href=terms.html>Terms</a> and understand this is a demo; fees open after registration":"لقد قرأت <a class=gold href=privacy.html>الخصوصية</a> و<a class=gold href=terms.html>الشروط</a> وأدركت أن هذا عرض توضيحي؛ الرسوم مفتوحة بعد التسجيل","IBM × ORNL × AMD launched a co-design platform for error correction; Chicago System Two also supports grid-optimisation research.":"أطلقت شركة IBM × ORNL × AMD منصة للتصميم المشترك لتصحيح الأخطاء؛ يدعم Chicago System Two أيضًا أبحاث تحسين الشبكة.","ID holders can launch initiatives on any topic; supporters give voluntarily. 94% of funds are allocated by co-builder vote; QCF charges a 6% platform and governance fee.":"يمكن لحاملي الهوية إطلاق مبادرات في أي موضوع؛ المؤيدون يتبرعون طوعا. يتم تخصيص 94% من الأموال من خلال تصويت البناء المشارك؛ تفرض QCF رسومًا على النظام الأساسي والحوكمة بنسبة 6%.","IDs registered":"الهويات المسجلة","IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 incorporated ML-DSA into secure device identity.":"قام IEEE 802.1AReg-2026 بدمج ML-DSA في هوية الجهاز الآمنة.","Impressum":"اعجاب","Improved classical emulation reinforces the need for current classical baselines.":"تعزز المحاكاة الكلاسيكية المحسنة الحاجة إلى خطوط الأساس الكلاسيكية الحالية.","In 1951, tumor samples from Henrietta Lacks, who was receiving treatment for cervical cancer, were used for research without her knowledge or consent. The resulting HeLa cell line made major contributions to medicine, while raising enduring questions about consent, privacy and equitable benefit sharing.":"في عام 1951، تم استخدام عينات الورم من هنريتا لاكس، التي كانت تتلقى العلاج من سرطان عنق الرحم، للبحث دون علمها أو موافقتها. وقد ساهم خط خلايا هيلا الناتج بشكل كبير في الطب، بينما أثار أسئلة مستمرة حول الموافقة والخصوصية والتقاسم العادل للمنافع.","In 2013, the NIH and the Lacks family reached an agreement on controlled access to relevant HeLa whole-genome data. “Immortal” describes the cell line’s ability to keep dividing under suitable laboratory conditions, not the immortality of Henrietta Lacks herself.":"في عام 2013، توصلت المعاهد الوطنية للصحة وعائلة لاكس إلى اتفاق بشأن الوصول الخاضع للرقابة إلى بيانات الجينوم الكامل لـ HeLa ذات الصلة. تصف كلمة \"خالد\" قدرة خط الخلية على الاستمرار في الانقسام في ظل ظروف معملية مناسبة، وليس خلود هنريتا لاكس نفسها.","In 2026, QCF plans to develop an initiative for more equitable access to genome sequencing. Together with research, healthcare and ethics specialists, we aim to help people understand their genomic information through informed choice and appropriate professional support. In a future secure system, individuals could choose to link genomic records to an independently issued Civilization ID.":"في عام 2026، تخطط مؤسسة قطر الخيرية لتطوير مبادرة للوصول بشكل أكثر إنصافًا إلى تسلسل الجينوم. بالتعاون مع المتخصصين في الأبحاث والرعاية الصحية والأخلاقيات، نهدف إلى مساعدة الأشخاص على فهم معلوماتهم الجينية من خلال الاختيار المستنير والدعم المهني المناسب. في نظام آمن مستقبلي، يمكن للأفراد اختيار ربط السجلات الجينومية بمعرف الحضارة الصادر بشكل مستقل.","In the 2015 Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy research article, Deng is first and corresponding author. It revisits the earlier survival result and reports follow-up among surviving mice: a reported 207-day lifespan extension and a 39-day delay in cataract formation. No tumour was observed in the treated group, while an abdominal tumour was observed in the saline group. Cohort size, survivor selection, tumour pathology and independent replication require scrutiny. These observations do not establish general cancer prevention or lifespan extension. The papers describe related work, not two independent replications.":"في المقالة البحثية الصادرة في مجلة أبحاث الخلايا الجذعية والعلاج لعام 2015، كان دينغ هو المؤلف الأول والمراسل. إنه يعيد النظر في نتيجة البقاء السابقة ويفيد بالمتابعة بين الفئران الباقية على قيد الحياة: تم الإبلاغ عن تمديد العمر لمدة 207 يومًا وتأخير لمدة 39 يومًا في تكوين إعتام عدسة العين. ولم يلاحظ أي ورم في المجموعة المعالجة، في حين لوحظ ورم في البطن في المجموعة المالحة. يتطلب حجم الفوج، واختيار الناجين، وأمراض الورم، والتكاثر المستقل التدقيق. هذه الملاحظات لا تثبت الوقاية العامة من السرطان أو إطالة العمر. تصف الأوراق الأعمال ذات الصلة، وليس نسختين مستقلتين.","Initiative QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"مبادرة QCF-INIT-CB-20261003-001 · مبادرة بناة الحضارة العالمية","Initiatives":"المبادرات","Initiator":"المبادر","Initiators publish costs and spending as they act.":"المبادرون ينشرون التكاليف والإنفاق أثناء تصرفهم.","International drug-research collaboration":"التعاون الدولي في أبحاث المخدرات","Its public value lies in a testable approach to radiation-emergency medicine. It is neither a completed radiation treatment nor a validated vaccine. Reproducible experiments must connect the concept to any future patient benefit.":"تكمن قيمته العامة في اتباع نهج قابل للاختبار في طب الطوارئ الإشعاعي. إنه ليس علاجًا إشعاعيًا مكتملًا ولا لقاحًا معتمدًا. يجب أن تربط التجارب القابلة للتكرار هذا المفهوم بأي فائدة للمريض في المستقبل.","Jessica Sage (founder). Address: [to be added]":"جيسيكا سيج (مؤسسه). العنوان: [يضاف]","Join free testing: try registration, check-in and sharing. Official contribution rewards depend on reviewed, confirmed records.":"انضم إلى الاختبار المجاني: حاول التسجيل وتسجيل الوصول والمشاركة. تعتمد مكافآت المساهمة الرسمية على السجلات المؤكدة والمراجعة.","LATEST ISSUED":"آخر إصدار","Launch":"الانطلاق","Launch a Civilization Initiative":"إطلاق مبادرة حضارية","Launch initiative":"مبادرة إطلاق","Launch initiative (demo)":"إطلاق مبادرة (تجريبي)","Launch with your ID: goal, budget, milestones. +100 Q":"انطلق بالهوية الخاصة بك: الهدف، الميزانية، المعالم. +100 س","Launched in 1990, the Human Genome Project brought research institutions together through the International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium. In 2003, it delivered its human reference genome sequence—a foundation for understanding life, rather than sequencing every person.":"تم إطلاق مشروع الجينوم البشري في عام 1990، حيث قام بجمع المؤسسات البحثية معًا من خلال الاتحاد الدولي لتسلسل الجينوم البشري. وفي عام 2003، قدمت تسلسل الجينوم البشري المرجعي الخاص بها، وهو أساس لفهم الحياة، بدلاً من تحديد تسلسل كل شخص.","Learning from the history of HeLa":"التعلم من تاريخ هيلا","Let your contribution become part of our shared story":"دع مساهمتك تصبح جزءًا من قصتنا المشتركة","Licensed payment institutions, wallets and compliant crypto providers are invited to become Civilization Co-building Partners and help build global donation rails.":"إن مؤسسات الدفع المرخصة والمحافظ وموفري العملات المشفرة المتوافقين مدعوون ليصبحوا شركاء في بناء الحضارة والمساعدة في بناء مسارات التبرع العالمية.","Life Sciences":"علوم الحياة","Life Sciences & Safeguarding Life":"علوم الحياة وحماية الحياة","Life Sciences | Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research ↗":"علوم الحياة | تقارير الطبيعة عن أبحاث الحمض النووي القديمة الجديدة ↗","Life Sciences | The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"علوم الحياة | تجربة التكنولوجيا الحيوية لشخص واحد: الذكاء الاصطناعي والروبوتات واكتشاف الأدوية ↗","Life has an end. Civilization must go on.":"للحياة نهاية. الحضارة يجب أن تستمر.","Life sciences is our first-phase priority. Energy and computing, alongside civilisation education, remain long-term research and collaboration directions.":"علوم الحياة هي أولويتنا في المرحلة الأولى. تظل الطاقة والحوسبة، إلى جانب التعليم الحضاري، اتجاهات بحثية وتعاونية طويلة المدى.","Life-science directions we will follow":"توجيهات علوم الحياة سنتبعها","Life-sciences news":"أخبار العلوم الحياتية","Life-sciences programme":"برنامج العلوم الحياتية","Link my DNA":"لينك DNA الخاص بي","Live version (planned)":"النسخة المباشرة (مخطط لها)","Lives lost in war · Estimate":"الأرواح المفقودة في الحرب · تقدير","Lives lost to epidemics and disease · Estimate":"الأرواح المفقودة بسبب الأوبئة والأمراض · تقدير","Long-term goal: 1,000,000 Civilization IDs. Proposed phase-one life-sciences request: CHF 100,000,000; not funds raised or pledged.":"الهدف طويل المدى: 1,000,000 معرف حضاري. طلب علوم الحياة المقترح للمرحلة الأولى: 100,000,000 فرنك سويسري؛ لم يتم جمع الأموال أو التعهد بها.","Loss of consciousness is not death. A breathing signal or biometric event must never independently trigger irreversible asset transfer. Emergency delegation and inheritance require separate safeguards, documented consent, independent verification and legal review. Civilization ID does not replace passports, national e-ID or bank KYC.":"فقدان الوعي ليس موتاً. يجب ألا تؤدي إشارة التنفس أو الحدث البيومتري بشكل مستقل إلى تحويل الأصول بشكل لا رجعة فيه. يتطلب التفويض في حالات الطوارئ والميراث ضمانات منفصلة وموافقة موثقة وتحققًا مستقلاً ومراجعة قانونية. لا تحل بطاقة الهوية المدنية محل جوازات السفر أو بطاقة الهوية الإلكترونية الوطنية أو اعرف عميلك البنكي.","Manage future permissions":"إدارة الأذونات المستقبلية","Mastercard":"ماستركارد","Method: 2026 projections; births and deaths are rounded annual daily averages, not live counts for today.":"الطريقة: توقعات 2026؛ يتم تقريب الولادات والوفيات المتوسطات اليومية السنوية، وليس أعداد الأحياء لهذا اليوم.","Method: these selected-record summaries were compiled by QCF, not published as combined totals by the source organisations. They are not live counts. The two categories may overlap and must not be added together. Verified and repository updated: 2026-11-02.":"الطريقة: تم تجميع هذه الملخصات المحددة بواسطة QCF، ولم يتم نشرها كمجاميع مجمعة من قبل المنظمات المصدر. إنهم ليسوا تهمًا حية. قد تتداخل الفئتان ويجب عدم إضافتهما معًا. تم التحقق منه وتحديث المستودع: 2026-11-02.","Migration clues, interpreted alongside language evidence":"أدلة الهجرة مفسرة إلى جانب الأدلة اللغوية","Mission":"المهمة","My ID":"هويتي","My contribution":"مساهمتي","NARA extract as of 29 April 2008. Recorded incident/death dates span 1956–2006, not the war’s duration. Hostile and non-hostile deaths; not the entire war toll.":"مستخلص NARA اعتبارًا من 29 أبريل 2008. تواريخ الحوادث/الوفيات المسجلة تمتد من 1956 إلى 2006، وليس مدة الحرب. الوفيات العدائية وغير العدائية؛ وليس حصيلة الحرب بأكملها.","NIST IR 8547 set out a post-quantum cryptography transition roadmap.":"وضع NIST IR 8547 خارطة طريق لانتقال التشفير بعد الكم.","NIST PQC was implementation-ready; sensing and metrology became long-term trusted-data candidates.":"كان NIST PQC جاهزًا للتنفيذ؛ وأصبح الاستشعار والقياس مرشحين للبيانات الموثوقة على المدى الطويل.","NIST chip-scale optical frequency-comb work points toward compact precision metrology.":"يشير عمل مشط التردد البصري على نطاق رقاقة NIST نحو قياس الدقة المدمجة.","Nanjing Massacre · China":"مذبحة نانجينغ · الصين","Nature Reports New Ancient DNA Research":"Nature Reports بحث جديد في الحمض النووي القديم","Nature thorium-229 nuclear-clock studies advanced quantum metrology and precision timing.":"الثوريوم الطبيعي -229 يدرس الساعة النووية علم القياس الكمي المتقدم والتوقيت الدقيق.","Nature's single-molecule spin-photon interface and quantum/classical fibre coexistence entered the research radar.":"دخلت واجهة الفوتون المغزلي ذات الجزيء الواحد في الطبيعة وتعايش الألياف الكمومية/الكلاسيكية إلى رادار البحث.","Nature’s news report by Ewen Callaway, published on 4 November 2026, examines new genetic evidence relevant to European language history. This QCF brief draws on that report, a research abstract and the participating university’s announcement.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>":"تقرير مجلة Nature الإخباري بقلم إوين كالاواي، المنشور في 4 نوفمبر 2026، يفحص الأدلة الجينية الجديدة ذات الصلة بتاريخ اللغة الأوروبية. ويعتمد ملخص منتدى قطر الثقافي هذا على هذا التقرير وملخص البحث وإعلان الجامعة المشاركة.<sup><a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></sup>","Next Civilization ID to be issued":"سيتم إصدار الهوية الحضارية التالية","No affiliation with or endorsement by the United Nations is implied.":"لا يعني ذلك أي انتماء أو تأييد من قبل الأمم المتحدة.","No email is sent and email ownership is not verified.":"لا يتم إرسال أي بريد إلكتروني ولا يتم التحقق من ملكية البريد الإلكتروني.","No global mortality series covers every disease since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains ten WHO-sourced historical outbreak, cumulative and annual records, mainly infectious diseases. It is not exhaustive. Pre-WHO figures are historical estimates cited by WHO.":"لا توجد سلسلة وفيات عالمية تغطي كل مرض منذ ظهور الحضارة. تحتوي هذه الطبعة على عشرة حالات تفشي تاريخية من مصادر منظمة الصحة العالمية، وسجلات تراكمية وسنوية، وخاصة الأمراض المعدية. انها ليست شاملة. أرقام ما قبل منظمة الصحة العالمية هي تقديرات تاريخية استشهدت بها منظمة الصحة العالمية.","No harmonised register covers every war and country since the emergence of civilisation. This edition contains nine sourced war, national and event records, concentrated in modern history. Ancient and medieval conflicts and many regions are not yet covered. Missing entries do not mean zero deaths.":"لا يوجد سجل منسق يغطي كل حرب وبلد منذ ظهور الحضارة. تحتوي هذه الطبعة على تسعة سجلات حربية ووطنية وأحداثية من المصادر، مركزة في التاريخ الحديث. لم تتم تغطية الصراعات القديمة والعصور الوسطى والعديد من المناطق بعد. الإدخالات المفقودة لا تعني صفر وفيات.","No nationality, race or belief information is needed. Use an example email for free testing; real identity details are not required.":"ليست هناك حاجة إلى معلومات عن الجنسية أو العرق أو المعتقد. استخدم مثالاً للبريد الإلكتروني للاختبار المجاني؛ تفاصيل الهوية الحقيقية ليست مطلوبة.","No statement is made about the tax treatment of any donation.":"لا يوجد أي بيان حول المعاملة الضريبية لأي تبرع.","No tax claims":"لا يوجد مطالبات ضريبية","No use without clear authorization":"ممنوع الاستخدام بدون تصريح واضح","Nuclear clocks, heterogeneous entanglement and independent benchmarking lead the week":"الساعات النووية والتشابك غير المتجانس والمقارنات المستقلة تتصدر الأسبوع","Of every 100 donated":"من كل 100 متبرع","One Human. One Civilization ID. One Digital Legacy. Explore a universal identity gateway and a future where digital assets, footprints and memories can be preserved, deleted or lawfully passed on by choice.":"إنسان واحد. معرف الحضارة واحد. إرث رقمي واحد. استكشف بوابة الهوية العالمية والمستقبل حيث يمكن الحفاظ على الأصول الرقمية وآثار الأقدام والذكريات أو حذفها أو نقلها بشكل قانوني عن طريق الاختيار.","One donation entry. Amounts are in Swiss francs (CHF). Payments open after the foundation is formally registered and compliance onboarding is complete.":"مدخل تبرع واحد. المبالغ بالفرنك السويسري (CHF). يتم فتح الدفعات بعد تسجيل المؤسسة رسميًا واكتمال عملية الإعداد للامتثال.","One person. One Civilization ID.":"شخص واحد. معرف الحضارة واحد.","Open QCF-E brief archive →":"افتح أرشيف مختصر QCF-E →","Open my ID":"افتح هويتي","Opens after formal registration":"يفتح بعد التسجيل الرسمي","Operator":"المشغل","Optional DNA linking":"ربط DNA اختياري","Original papers and further reading":"الأوراق الأصلية ومزيد من القراءة","Original work and sources":"العمل والمصادر الأصلية","Our long-term mission · Three pillars":"مهمتنا طويلة الأمد · ثلاث ركائز","Oxford demonstrated mixed-species remote entanglement and roughly 10-second quantum storage.":"أثبتت أكسفورد التشابك عن بعد للأنواع المختلطة والتخزين الكمي لمدة 10 ثوانٍ تقريبًا.","PQC enters digital-asset infrastructure while networking moves into deployed fibre":"تدخل PQC البنية التحتية للأصول الرقمية بينما تنتقل الشبكات إلى الألياف المنتشرة","PQC moves from algorithm standards into migration and device identity":"ينتقل PQC من معايير الخوارزمية إلى الترحيل وهوية الجهاز","Participation without DNA":"المشاركة بدون DNA","Partner institutions and scientific advisers will be published after authorisation and verification.":"سيتم نشر المؤسسات الشريكة والمستشارين العلميين بعد الترخيص والتحقق.","Partner seat open":"مقعد الشريك مفتوح","Patent publications and rights verification":"منشورات براءات الاختراع والتحقق من الحقوق","PayPal":"باي بال","Payment Partners":"شركاء الدفع","People can create an ID, contribute articles and earn contribution recognition without providing DNA. Contribution rewards and special benefits must not depend on providing genomic data or consenting to genomic research.":"يمكن للأشخاص إنشاء معرف والمساهمة بالمقالات والحصول على تقدير المساهمة دون تقديم الحمض النووي. يجب ألا تعتمد مكافآت المساهمة والمزايا الخاصة على توفير البيانات الجينومية أو الموافقة على الأبحاث الجينومية.","Phase-1 goal: CHF 100,000,000. Later phases are not shown on this page.":"هدف المرحلة الأولى: 100,000,000 فرنك سويسري. لا يتم عرض المراحل اللاحقة على هذه الصفحة.","Phase-1 goals":"أهداف المرحلة الأولى","Phase-one funding ambition":"طموح التمويل المرحلة الأولى","Plan separate project budgets and records with milestone reviews. Disclose administrative costs, use of funds and oversight; publish the receiving entity and account once ready.":"قم بتخطيط ميزانيات وسجلات منفصلة للمشروع مع مراجعات هامة. الكشف عن التكاليف الإدارية واستخدام الأموال والرقابة؛ نشر الكيان المتلقي والحساب بمجرد أن يصبحا جاهزين.","Planned central system: a 10-digit Civilization ID (4-digit wave prefix + 6-digit sequence): the 2026 Genesis wave issues 2026000001 onward one by one; after 999999 the 2029 wave begins at 2029000001 with verification code and identity key, digitally signed by the foundation and publicly verifiable.":"النظام المركزي المخطط: معرف الحضارة المكون من 10 أرقام (بادئة موجة مكونة من 4 أرقام + تسلسل مكون من 6 أرقام): تصدر موجة التكوين 2026 2026000001 فصاعدًا واحدًا تلو الآخر؛ بعد 999999، تبدأ موجة 2029 عند 2029000001 برمز التحقق ومفتاح الهوية، موقعين رقميًا من قبل المؤسسة ويمكن التحقق منهما علنًا.","Platform use":"استخدام المنصة","Please include the event, dates, location, population, mortality estimate and original source link. Contributions will be reviewed before inclusion. Do not submit personal health or identity data without authorisation.":"يرجى إدراج الحدث والتواريخ والموقع وعدد السكان وتقدير الوفيات ورابط المصدر الأصلي. سيتم مراجعة المساهمات قبل إدراجها. لا تقم بتقديم البيانات الصحية أو بيانات الهوية الشخصية دون تصريح.","Precision metrology, heterogeneous networks and classical benchmarks advance together":"تتقدم القياسات الدقيقة والشبكات غير المتجانسة والمعايير الكلاسيكية معًا","Preparatory stage":"المرحلة الاعدادية","Preparatory-stage website. The foundation is to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is not yet registered; available website features are free to test before registration. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration; testing never converts automatically to a paid plan. Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, with no monetary value, and not tradable. No tax-deductibility is claimed.":"موقع المرحلة الإعدادية. من المقرر إنشاء المؤسسة في مدينة زوغ بسويسرا ولم يتم تسجيلها بعد؛ ميزات الموقع المتاحة مجانية للاختبار قبل التسجيل. يتم فتح الاشتراكات والتبرعات بعد التسجيل الرسمي؛ لا يتحول الاختبار تلقائيًا إلى خطة مدفوعة. Q هي نقطة مساهمة غير قابلة للتحويل — وليست عملة مشفرة، وليس لها قيمة نقدية، وغير قابلة للتداول. لا يتم المطالبة بالخصم الضريبي.","Prepare a contribution":"تحضير مساهمة","Prepare a reviewable submission":"قم بإعداد تقديم قابل للمراجعة","Privacy":"الخصوصية","Privacy Policy":"سياسة الخصوصية","Proceed in stages once prerequisites are met; disclose results, limitations and use of funds.":"المضي قدمًا على مراحل بمجرد استيفاء المتطلبات الأساسية؛ الكشف عن النتائج والقيود واستخدام الأموال.","Proposed donation request · Not funds raised · Not a funding commitment":"طلب التبرع المقترح · لم يتم جمع الأموال · ليس التزامًا بالتمويل","Protect privacy while growing up. Navigate identity across borders. Govern business and AI-agent access. Prepare trusted delegates as we age. Preserve, delete or pass on selected digital assets according to our wishes and applicable law.":"حماية الخصوصية أثناء النمو. التنقل عبر الهوية عبر الحدود. إدارة الأعمال والوصول إلى وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي. إعداد المندوبين الموثوق بهم مع تقدمنا ​​في السن. الحفاظ على الأصول الرقمية المحددة أو حذفها أو تمريرها وفقًا لرغباتنا والقانون المعمول به.","Provide an author or Envoy name and links to original papers, institutional announcements or verifiable sources. Secure permission for quoted material, images and coauthorship where needed.":"قم بتوفير اسم المؤلف أو المبعوث وروابط للأوراق الأصلية أو الإعلانات المؤسسية أو المصادر التي يمكن التحقق منها. الحصول على إذن آمن للمواد المقتبسة والصور والتأليف المشترك عند الحاجة.","Public benefit and commercial interests":"المنفعة العامة والمصالح التجارية","Publications and journal records":"المطبوعات وسجلات الدوريات","Q is a contribution point recorded under a Civilization ID. It is non-transferable, not tradable, not a cryptocurrency or financial instrument, has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.":"س هي نقطة مساهمة مسجلة تحت معرف الحضارة. إنها غير قابلة للتحويل، وغير قابلة للتداول، وليست عملة مشفرة أو أداة مالية، وليس لها قيمة نقدية ولا يمكن استبدالها بالمال.","Q is a non-transferable contribution point — not a cryptocurrency, no monetary value, not tradable.":"Q هي نقطة مساهمة غير قابلة للتحويل — وليست عملة مشفرة، ولا قيمة نقدية، وغير قابلة للتداول.","Q is a record of contribution, not money.":"س محضر مساهمة وليس مال.","Q is the initial of Quantum and of QCF. The golden ring holds a field of stars: every point of light inside is a Civilization Co-builder, arranged in a golden-angle spiral — the natural order shared by sunflowers and galaxies, each point unique yet part of one whole. The brightest light at the centre is the genesis light, the first co-builder. The tail is a particle in transition: the single action that starts with one person and changes the whole.":"Q هو الحرف الأولي من الكم وQCF. تحتوي الحلقة الذهبية على حقل من النجوم: كل نقطة ضوء بالداخل هي أحد مؤسسي الحضارة، مرتبة في دوامة ذات زاوية ذهبية - النظام الطبيعي الذي تتقاسمه عباد الشمس والمجرات، كل نقطة فريدة من نوعها ولكنها جزء من كل واحد. ألمع ضوء في المركز هو ضوء التكوين، أول شريك في البناء. الذيل هو جسيم في مرحلة انتقالية: الفعل الفردي الذي يبدأ بشخص واحد ويغير الكل.","Q issued today":"س صدر اليوم","Q stays with your Civilization ID: non-transferable, not tradable, no monetary value. Demo data lives only in this browser.":"س يبقى مع معرف الحضارة الخاص بك: غير قابل للتحويل، غير قابل للتداول، ليس له قيمة نقدية. البيانات التجريبية موجودة فقط في هذا المتصفح.","QCF LIFE SCIENCES · RESEARCH BRIEF":"QCF للعلوم الحياتية · ملخص البحث","QCF aims to support civilian medical preparedness through reproducible records, independent review and staged development subject to ethics, regulatory and quality requirements. Safeguarding civilisation begins with respect for life, research participants and scientific evidence.":"يهدف QCF إلى دعم الاستعداد الطبي المدني من خلال السجلات القابلة للاستنساخ والمراجعة المستقلة والتطوير المرحلي الخاضع للأخلاقيات والمتطلبات التنظيمية والجودة. إن حماية الحضارة تبدأ باحترام الحياة والمشاركين في الأبحاث والأدلة العلمية.","QCF assessment: prioritise quantum-safe energy infrastructure.":"تقييم QCF: إعطاء الأولوية للبنية التحتية للطاقة الآمنة الكم.","QCF brings people together to build, preserve and safeguard human civilisation. Our first phase focuses on international life-sciences collaboration: verifiable research, responsible innovation and shared knowledge to strengthen resilience to major health and public-health crises.":"مؤسسة قطر الخيرية تجمع الناس معًا لبناء الحضارة الإنسانية والحفاظ عليها وحمايتها. وتركز مرحلتنا الأولى على التعاون الدولي في علوم الحياة: البحوث التي يمكن التحقق منها، والابتكار المسؤول، والمعرفة المشتركة لتعزيز القدرة على الصمود في مواجهة الأزمات الصحية وأزمات الصحة العامة الكبرى.","QCF continuously tracks major developments in quantum computing, sensing, communications, post-quantum cryptography, networking and metrology, assessing practical relevance to energy measurement, trusted data, secure communications, RWA and infrastructure. This page keeps only headlines and concise summaries; bilingual Chinese-English PDFs are preserved as long-term QCF research archives.":"يتتبع QCF باستمرار التطورات الرئيسية في الحوسبة الكمومية والاستشعار والاتصالات والتشفير ما بعد الكم والشبكات والمقاييس، وتقييم الصلة العملية بقياس الطاقة والبيانات الموثوقة والاتصالات الآمنة وRWA والبنية التحتية. تحتفظ هذه الصفحة بالعناوين الرئيسية والملخصات المختصرة فقط؛ يتم الاحتفاظ بملفات PDF ثنائية اللغة الصينية-الإنجليزية كمحفوظات بحثية طويلة المدى لمؤسسة QCF.","QCF deployment baseline: computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology":"خط الأساس لنشر QCF: الحوسبة والاستشعار والاتصالات وPQC والمقاييس","QCF editorial assessment: staged scientific evaluation is warranted. Relevant specialists should review original data, statistical methods and independent replication, alongside human-cell potency, safety and manufacturing quality, before judging clinical feasibility. Further research also requires clear ownership, data-use permissions and responsibilities.":"التقييم التحريري لـ QCF: هناك ما يبرر التقييم العلمي المرحلي. ويجب على المتخصصين المعنيين مراجعة البيانات الأصلية، والأساليب الإحصائية، والتكرار المستقل، إلى جانب فعالية الخلايا البشرية، والسلامة، وجودة التصنيع، قبل الحكم على الجدوى السريرية. يتطلب المزيد من البحث أيضًا ملكية واضحة وأذونات ومسؤوليات استخدام البيانات.","QCF established: trusted measurement → secure communication → oracle verification → RWA / ledger settlement.":"إنشاء QCF: القياس الموثوق ← الاتصال الآمن ← التحقق من أوراكل ← RWA / تسوية دفتر الأستاذ.","QCF invites historians, health professionals, archives and all civilisation co-builders to contribute verifiable records of lives lost. Together, we can bring overlooked histories to light, preserve reliable knowledge and turn care and support into action to safeguard life.":"يدعو QCF المؤرخين والمهنيين الصحيين والمحفوظات وجميع بناة الحضارات للمساهمة في سجلات يمكن التحقق منها للأرواح المفقودة. معًا، يمكننا تسليط الضوء على التواريخ المهملة، والحفاظ على المعرفة الموثوقة، وتحويل الرعاية والدعم إلى عمل لحماية الحياة.","QCF is intended to be established in Zug, Switzerland and is currently in preparation, not yet registered. This page describes proposed principles; it does not imply that all mechanisms are operational.":"من المقرر إنشاء QCF في مدينة زوغ بسويسرا وهو قيد الإعداد حاليًا ولم يتم تسجيله بعد. تصف هذه الصفحة المبادئ المقترحة؛ ولا يعني ذلك أن جميع الآليات عاملة.","QCF perspective: a shared record of human life":"منظور QCF: سجل مشترك لحياة الإنسان","QCF proposes Civilization ID × NU-Key: an open research vision for self-controlled digital identity, verifiable credentials, secure access, an inventory of digital assets, and lawful digital inheritance. A universal key is not a master password that bypasses every platform. It is a user-controlled gateway that coordinates separate credentials and permissions.":"يقترح QCF معرف الحضارة × NU-Key: رؤية بحثية مفتوحة للهوية الرقمية التي يتم التحكم فيها ذاتيًا، وبيانات الاعتماد التي يمكن التحقق منها، والوصول الآمن، وجرد الأصول الرقمية، والميراث الرقمي القانوني. المفتاح العام ليس كلمة مرور رئيسية تتجاوز كل الأنظمة الأساسية. إنها بوابة يتحكم فيها المستخدم وتقوم بتنسيق بيانات الاعتماد والأذونات المنفصلة.","QCF seeks to make verifiable knowledge more accessible, encouraging curiosity about human origins and care for cultural diversity. Research into our shared past should never be used to rank present-day communities or prescribe their identities. Preserving knowledge is one way to care for the generations that follow.":"يسعى QCF إلى جعل المعرفة التي يمكن التحقق منها أكثر سهولة، وتشجيع الفضول حول أصول الإنسان ورعاية التنوع الثقافي. لا ينبغي أبدًا استخدام البحث في ماضينا المشترك لتصنيف المجتمعات الحالية أو تحديد هوياتها. إن الحفاظ على المعرفة هو إحدى طرق رعاية الأجيال القادمة.","QCF vision: fairer access to genomic health":"رؤية QCF: وصول أكثر عدالة إلى الصحة الجينومية","QCF-E does not promote unverified 'quantum energy' claims. Experiments, prototypes, company announcements and speculation are distinguished; quantum technologies enter QCF capability statements only after reproducible validation in a defined use case.":"QCF-E لا يروج لادعاءات \"الطاقة الكمومية\" التي لم يتم التحقق منها. وتتميز التجارب والنماذج الأولية وإعلانات الشركة والتكهنات؛ تدخل التقنيات الكمومية بيانات قدرة QCF فقط بعد التحقق من الصحة القابلة للتكرار في حالة استخدام محددة.","QCF’s next step: staged scientific due diligence":"الخطوة التالية لـ QCF: العناية العلمية الواجبة","Quantinuum Helios reported progress in logical-memory error correction.":"أبلغت شركة Quantinuum Helios عن تقدم في تصحيح أخطاء الذاكرة المنطقية.","Quantum Civilization Foundation (in formation). To be established in the Canton of Zug, Switzerland; not yet entered in the commercial register and without legal personality.":"مؤسسة حضارة الكم (قيد التكوين). سيتم إنشاؤها في كانتون زوغ، سويسرا؛ لم يتم قيده بعد في السجل التجاري وبدون شخصية اعتبارية.","Quantum Civilization University":"جامعة الحضارة الكم","Quantum Q · free testing":"كوانتم كيو · اختبار مجاني","Quantum Technology for Earth's Energy ⚡️":"تكنولوجيا الكم لطاقة الأرض⚡️","Quantum computing converges with HPC; communications and device manufacturing advance":"الحوسبة الكمومية تتقارب مع HPC؛ تقدم الاتصالات وتصنيع الأجهزة","Quantum sensing becomes a priority candidate for QCF energy validation":"يصبح الاستشعار الكمي مرشحًا ذا أولوية للتحقق من صحة طاقة QCF","Quantum-Driven Life Sciences":"علوم الحياة المعتمدة على الكم","RMB stablecoin":"عملة الرنمينبي المستقرة","Radiation-injury medical preparedness":"الاستعداد الطبي للإصابات الإشعاعية","Read about HeLa and health-data protection":"اقرأ عن HeLa وحماية البيانات الصحية","Read our life-sciences brief":"إقرأ مختصر علوم الحياة","Read our mission":"اقرأ مهمتنا","Read the civilization brief":"إقرأ مختصر الحضارة","Reading and extending this record":"قراءة وتوسيع هذا المحضر","Ready to launch yours?":"جاهزين لإطلاق منتجكم؟","Record civilisation · Safeguard life · Build civilisation together":"سجل الحضارة · حافظ على الحياة · نبني الحضارة معًا","Record, safeguard and build civilisation together":"سجلوا وصونوا وابنوا الحضارة معًا","Recording civilisation means preserving knowledge, contributions and traceable research. Safeguarding civilisation means protecting life and individual choice. Building civilisation together means sharing the benefits of international cooperation.":"تسجيل الحضارة يعني الحفاظ على المعرفة والمساهمات والأبحاث التي يمكن تتبعها. إن حماية الحضارة تعني حماية الحياة والاختيار الفردي. إن بناء الحضارة معًا يعني تقاسم فوائد التعاون الدولي.","Register a Civilization ID":"تسجيل هوية حضارية","Remaining to Phase-1 goal (CHF)":"المتبقي من هدف المرحلة الأولى (الفرنك السويسري)","Remembering lives lost in war":"استذكار الأرواح التي فقدت في الحرب","Remembering lives lost to epidemics and disease":"استذكار الأرواح التي فقدت بسبب الأوبئة والأمراض","Replicate animal efficacy independently, using appropriate controls, randomisation and blinded assessment to examine survival, dose response and the post-exposure treatment window.":"تكرار فعالية الحيوان بشكل مستقل، باستخدام الضوابط المناسبة، والعشوائية والتقييم الأعمى لفحص البقاء على قيد الحياة، والاستجابة للجرعة ونافذة العلاج بعد التعرض.","Reporting by Civilisation Architect Jessica Sage · Updated weekly":"تقرير المهندسة المعمارية جيسيكا سيج · يتم التحديث أسبوعيًا","Research approach and evidence status":"منهج البحث وحالة الأدلة","Research concept only: NU-Key, cross-platform sign-in and automatic digital inheritance are not currently operational services. No third-party account access or asset transfer is offered.":"مفهوم البحث فقط: NU-Key وتسجيل الدخول عبر الأنظمة الأساسية والميراث الرقمي التلقائي ليست خدمات تشغيلية حاليًا. لا يتم توفير الوصول إلى حساب طرف ثالث أو نقل الأصول.","Research institutions, clinical specialists, ethics and data-governance experts, and philanthropic supporters are welcome to begin a conversation. Please share an institutional introduction and non-confidential summary; do not email personal genomic data, medical records or unpublished patent details.":"نرحب بالمؤسسات البحثية والمتخصصين السريريين وخبراء الأخلاقيات وإدارة البيانات وداعمي الأعمال الخيرية لبدء المحادثة. يرجى مشاركة مقدمة مؤسسية وملخص غير سري؛ لا ترسل بالبريد الإلكتروني البيانات الجينومية الشخصية أو السجلات الطبية أو تفاصيل براءات الاختراع غير المنشورة.","Researcher and scientific foundation":"باحث ومؤسس علمي","Reset demo":"إعادة تعيين التجريبي","Responsible person":"الشخص المسؤول","Rethinking Humanity: Human Health Data Sovereignty & Equitable Benefit Sharing ↗":"إعادة التفكير في الإنسانية: سيادة بيانات الصحة البشرية والتقاسم العادل للمنافع ↗","Rethinking Humanity: Quantum Physics Is Redefining Our Understanding of Reality":"إعادة التفكير في الإنسانية: فيزياء الكم تعيد تعريف فهمنا للواقع","Review and recognition":"المراجعة والتقدير","Roll of Honour through 31 March 1921; the narrower 4 August 1914–11 November 1918 figure is 59,357. Do not add them.":"لائحة الشرف حتى 31 مارس 1921؛ الرقم الأضيق في الفترة من 4 أغسطس 1914 إلى 11 نوفمبر 1918 هو 59357. لا تضيفهم.","SARS · global":"سارس · عالمي","Sample initiative":"مبادرة عينة","Science and ethics":"العلم والأخلاق","Science in service of life.<br>Collaboration across borders.":"العلم في خدمة الحياة.<br>التعاون عبر الحدود.","Scope and limitations":"النطاق والقيود","Scroll horizontally for the full table. Open each source for the original record; read dates and figures together with their scope.":"قم بالتمرير أفقيًا للوصول إلى الجدول الكامل. افتح كل مصدر للسجل الأصلي؛ قراءة التواريخ والأرقام مع نطاقها.","Seat 1":"المقعد 1","Seat 2":"مقعد 2","Seat 3":"المقعد 3","Seat 4":"مقعد 4","Seats are placeholders. Formal partnerships require due diligence and a written agreement. Contact email pending foundation go-live.":"المقاعد عبارة عن عناصر نائبة. تتطلب الشراكات الرسمية العناية الواجبة واتفاقية مكتوبة. البريد الإلكتروني للاتصال في انتظار بدء التشغيل الأساسي.","Second World War · Canada and Newfoundland":"الحرب العالمية الثانية · كندا ونيوفاوندلاند","Second World War · global estimate":"الحرب العالمية الثانية · تقدير عالمي","Security verification":"التحقق الأمني","See Impressum. Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nDSG) and the GDPR where applicable.":"شوف امبرسوم. بموجب القانون الفيدرالي السويسري بشأن حماية البيانات (nDSG) واللائحة العامة لحماية البيانات حيثما ينطبق ذلك.","Seek relevant independent expertise to review evidence, ethics and research feasibility.":"ابحث عن الخبرة المستقلة ذات الصلة لمراجعة الأدلة والأخلاقيات وجدوى البحث.","Selected":"مختارة","Selected records from two world wars · Partial populations":"سجلات مختارة من الحربين العالميتين · التجمعات السكانية الجزئية","Service deaths, including wounds and illness; commemorative cut-off extends to 31 August 1921.":"الوفيات الخدمية، بما في ذلك الجروح والأمراض؛ يمتد القطع التذكاري إلى 31 أغسطس 1921.","Share a link (max 10/day)":"شارك الرابط (الحد الأقصى 10/اليوم)","Share link":"رابط المشاركة","Source":"المصدر","Source priority: national archives, official statistics and public remembrance institutions; WHO for disease data. Official historical summaries may themselves use estimates. Additions must identify period, geography, population, figure type and source version; conflicting definitions are explained rather than combined into a precise total.":"أولوية المصدر: الأرشيف الوطني والإحصاءات الرسمية ومؤسسات الذكرى العامة؛ منظمة الصحة العالمية لبيانات المرض. قد تستخدم الملخصات التاريخية الرسمية التقديرات نفسها. يجب أن تحدد الإضافات الفترة والجغرافيا والسكان ونوع الشكل وإصدار المصدر؛ يتم شرح التعريفات المتضاربة بدلاً من دمجها في إجمالي دقيق.","Sources and further reading":"المصادر ومزيد من القراءة","Sources document history and research; citation does not imply partnership, funding or endorsement of QCF.":"المصادر توثق التاريخ والأبحاث؛ لا يعني الاستشهاد وجود شراكة أو تمويل أو تأييد لـ QCF.","Stablecoins":"العملات المستقرة","Start free testing":"ابدأ الاختبار المجاني","Starting as an institute and open courses (vision): record, study, pass on and co-build civilization. Degrees require the applicable accreditation.":"البدء كمعهد ودورات مفتوحة (رؤية): سجل ودراسة وتمرير وشارك في بناء الحضارة. تتطلب الدرجات الاعتماد المعمول به.","Status":"الحالة","Status: preparation and due diligence | Updated: 2 November 2026":"الحالة: التحضير والعناية الواجبة | تم التحديث: 2 نوفمبر 2026","Support":"الدعم","Support (opening soon)":"الدعم (الافتتاح قريبا)","Support the Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative":"ادعم مبادرة بناة الحضارة العالمية","Supporters give voluntarily (opens after registration).":"المناصرون يتبرعون طوعا (يفتح بعد التسجيل).","Supporting the use of quantum computing, quantum sensing and AI in drug discovery, precision medicine and healthy-longevity research, within the bounds of peer-reviewed science. No medical advice or health claims.":"دعم استخدام الحوسبة الكمومية والاستشعار الكمي والذكاء الاصطناعي في اكتشاف الأدوية والطب الدقيق وأبحاث طول العمر الصحي، ضمن حدود العلوم التي يراجعها النظراء. لا توجد نصيحة طبية أو ادعاءات صحية.","Supporting verifiable applications of quantum computing, sensing, communications, PQC and metrology in energy research. Weekly headlines and summaries are published openly; bilingual PDFs are permanently archived for Civilization Co-builders / Civilization ID access.":"دعم التطبيقات التي يمكن التحقق منها للحوسبة الكمومية والاستشعار والاتصالات وPQC والمقاييس في أبحاث الطاقة. يتم نشر العناوين والملخصات الأسبوعية بشكل علني؛ تتم أرشفة ملفات PDF ثنائية اللغة بشكل دائم ليتمكن بناة الحضارة المشاركون / الوصول إلى معرف الحضارة.","Swiss franc stablecoin":"عملة مستقرة للفرنك السويسري","Swiss quantum infrastructure, DOE quantum grid planning and EuroQCI formed the initial watchlist.":"شكلت البنية التحتية الكمومية السويسرية وتخطيط شبكة الكم التابعة لوزارة الطاقة وEuroQCI قائمة المراقبة الأولية.","TWINT":"توينت","Terms":"الشروط","Terms of Use":"شروط الاستخدام","Test email:":"البريد الإلكتروني التجريبي:","Testing is free before formal registration. Subscription services and special benefits for early Envoys will follow the rules announced at that time. Testing never triggers automatic charges.":"الاختبار مجاني قبل التسجيل الرسمي. ستتبع خدمات الاشتراك والمزايا الخاصة للمبعوثين الأوائل القواعد المعلنة في ذلك الوقت. لا يؤدي الاختبار أبدًا إلى فرض رسوم تلقائية.","The 2009 Blood Correspondence by Abdel-Mageed and colleagues lists Deng as a corresponding author. An adenoviral vector was used to express extracellular superoxide dismutase, EC-SOD (SOD3), in mouse bone-marrow mesenchymal stromal/stem cells (MSCs). Mice received 500,000 engineered cells intravenously 24 hours after 9 Gy total-body irradiation. Reported 35-day survival was 52%, compared with 10% for saline and 9% for reporter-gene-modified cells. These results concern a specific mouse model and cannot be converted into expected human benefit.":"مراسلات الدم لعام 2009 التي كتبها عبد المجيد وزملاؤه تذكر دينغ كمؤلف مراسل. تم استخدام ناقل الفيروس الغداني للتعبير عن ديسموتاز فوق الأكسيد خارج الخلية، EC-SOD (SOD3)، في الخلايا اللحمية/الجذعية الوسيطة لنخاع عظم الفأر (MSCs). تلقت الفئران 500000 خلية مهندسة عن طريق الوريد بعد 24 ساعة من تشعيع كامل الجسم بـ 9 غراي. بلغت نسبة البقاء على قيد الحياة لمدة 35 يومًا 52%، مقارنة بـ 10% للخلايا المالحة و9% للخلايا المعدلة بالجينات المراسلة. تتعلق هذه النتائج بنموذج فأر محدد ولا يمكن تحويلها إلى فائدة بشرية متوقعة.","The 2015 paper also demonstrates adenoviral transduction and secretion of biologically active EC-SOD by human bone-marrow MSCs in vitro. Human-cell experiments are not human clinical trials. The journal is Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy, which should not be confused with similarly named journals.":"توضح ورقة عام 2015 أيضًا انتقال الفيروس الغداني وإفراز EC-SOD النشط بيولوجيًا بواسطة الخلايا الجذعية السرطانية في نخاع العظم البشري في المختبر. إن تجارب الخلايا البشرية ليست تجارب سريرية بشرية. المجلة هي Journal of Stem Cell Research & Therapy، والتي لا ينبغي الخلط بينها وبين المجلات ذات الأسماء المماثلة.","The 2023 CV separately lists US7,547,545 and application 18/199,975 concerning cell differentiation and vaccine immune-response enhancement. They do not establish patent grant or efficacy for the radiation candidate.":"تسرد السيرة الذاتية لعام 2023 بشكل منفصل 7,547,545 دولارًا أمريكيًا والتطبيق 18/199,975 فيما يتعلق بتمايز الخلايا وتعزيز الاستجابة المناعية للقاحات. فهي لا تحدد منحة براءة الاختراع أو الفعالية لمرشح الإشعاع.","The 6% described on the initiatives page is an existing platform-services proposal. The life-sciences programme will have its own disclosed budget. Contribution points or public votes do not replace scientific or ethical judgement.":"نسبة الـ 6% الموضحة في صفحة المبادرات هي مقترح خدمات منصة موجود. سيكون لبرنامج علوم الحياة ميزانيته المعلنة الخاصة. نقاط المساهمة أو الأصوات العامة لا تحل محل الحكم العلمي أو الأخلاقي.","The CV lists a cytogenetics director role at LabCorp Integrated Oncology from 2017; this is not confirmation of a current 2026 appointment. Current roles, institutional authorisation and QCF responsibilities require updated verification. The publications and patent records below can be independently consulted.":"تسرد السيرة الذاتية دور مدير علم الوراثة الخلوية في LabCorp Integrated Oncology منذ عام 2017؛ هذا ليس تأكيدًا لموعد 2026 الحالي. تتطلب الأدوار الحالية والترخيص المؤسسي ومسؤوليات QCF التحقق المحدث. يمكن الرجوع إلى المنشورات وسجلات براءات الاختراع أدناه بشكل مستقل.","The Genesis Civilization ID":"معرف حضارة التكوين","The One-Person Biotech Experiment: AI, Robotics and Drug Discovery ↗":"تجربة التكنولوجيا الحيوية لشخص واحد: الذكاء الاصطناعي والروبوتات واكتشاف الأدوية ↗","The Quantum Civilization Foundation believes our truest shared identity is simply this: a member of human civilization. To everyone who chooses, we issue a Civilization ID — it never asks where you come from, only records what you bring to civilization.":"تؤمن مؤسسة Quantum Civilization Foundation بأن هويتنا المشتركة الحقيقية هي ببساطة: عضو في الحضارة الإنسانية. لكل من يختار، نصدر معرف الحضارة - فهو لا يسألك أبدًا من أين أتيت، بل يسجل فقط ما تجلبه إلى الحضارة.","The State Archives Administration presents a February 1946 Nanjing archival investigation recording over 300,000. Historical investigation; a subset of deaths during the war in China.":"تقدم إدارة أرشيف الدولة تحقيقًا أرشيفيًا في نانجينغ في فبراير 1946 يسجل أكثر من 300000. التحقيق التاريخي. مجموعة فرعية من الوفيات خلال الحرب في الصين.","The University of Gothenburg reports analysis of DNA from more than 4,500 ancient individuals, including 712 newly sequenced genomes. The researchers suggest that migrants entering Scandinavia around 4,000 years ago may have carried an early ancestor of Germanic languages. A later migration, several centuries before the Viking Age, coincided with the emergence of Old Norse.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>":"أبلغت جامعة جوتنبرج عن تحليل الحمض النووي لأكثر من 4500 فرد قديم، بما في ذلك 712 جينومًا متسلسلًا حديثًا. ويشير الباحثون إلى أن المهاجرين الذين دخلوا الدول الاسكندنافية منذ حوالي 4000 عام ربما كانوا يحملون سلفًا مبكرًا للغات الجرمانية. وتزامنت هجرة لاحقة، قبل عدة قرون من عصر الفايكنج، مع ظهور اللغة الإسكندنافية القديمة.<sup><a href=\"#source-3\">[3]</a></sup>","The application and phased budget are in preparation. Use of funds, administrative costs, project selection and oversight will be defined following due diligence. This page does not collect payments.":"جاري تحضير التطبيق والميزانية المرحلية. سيتم تحديد استخدام الأموال والتكاليف الإدارية واختيار المشروع والإشراف عليه بعد بذل العناية الواجبة. هذه الصفحة لا تجمع المدفوعات.","The byline identifies QCF editorial commentary. Original research belongs to its authors and relevant rights holders. Citation implies no institutional endorsement or technology licence.":"يحدد الخط الثانوي التعليق التحريري لـ QCF. البحث الأصلي ينتمي إلى مؤلفيه وأصحاب الحقوق ذات الصلة. لا يعني الاقتباس أي تأييد مؤسسي أو ترخيص تكنولوجي.","The companion Celtic study analyses genome-wide data from 4,587 ancient individuals. Comparing migration models, its authors favour a westward expansion from eastern central Europe around 3,000 years ago as the most parsimonious explanation for Celtic dispersal. Sample counts across the studies should not be added as if they represented separate individuals.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>":"تحلل الدراسة السلتية المصاحبة البيانات على مستوى الجينوم من 4587 فردًا قديمًا. وبمقارنة نماذج الهجرة، يفضل مؤلفوها التوسع غربًا من شرق أوروبا الوسطى منذ حوالي 3000 عام، باعتباره التفسير الأكثر بخلا للتشتت السلتي. لا ينبغي إضافة أعداد العينات عبر الدراسات كما لو كانت تمثل أفرادًا منفصلين.<sup><a href=\"#source-2\">[2]</a></sup>","The findings provide a starting point for translational research. Development must first distinguish emergency treatment of acute radiation injury from protection against radiotherapy-related normal-tissue injury. These settings involve different populations, treatment windows, endpoints and benefit–risk considerations. The following is QCF’s analysis, not an initiated or authorised clinical protocol.":"توفر النتائج نقطة انطلاق للبحث الترجمي. يجب أن يميز التطوير أولاً بين العلاج الطارئ للإصابة الإشعاعية الحادة والحماية من إصابة الأنسجة الطبيعية المرتبطة بالعلاج الإشعاعي. تتضمن هذه الإعدادات مجموعات سكانية مختلفة، ونوافذ علاجية، ونقاط نهاية، واعتبارات تتعلق بالفوائد والمخاطر. ما يلي هو تحليل QCF، وليس بروتوكولًا سريريًا مبدئيًا أو معتمدًا.","The first Civilization ID, 2026000001, belongs to the founder, Jessica Sage. The Global Civilization Co-builders Initiative begins here.":"معرف الحضارة الأول 2026000001 يعود للمؤسسة جيسيكا سيج. تبدأ هنا مبادرة بناة الحضارة العالمية.","The golden Q: a quantum":"س الذهبي : الكم","The live version will collect email only to issue and verify Civilization IDs; no nationality, race, religion or other sensitive data. You may request access, correction and deletion.":"ستجمع النسخة المباشرة البريد الإلكتروني فقط لإصدار معرفات الحضارة والتحقق منها؛ لا جنسية أو عرق أو دين أو غيرها من البيانات الحساسة. يمكنك طلب الوصول والتصحيح والحذف.","The plan includes visibility into purposes, recipients and access records, and a way to withdraw future permissions. The limits relating to completed analyses, published findings and required retention must be explained at consent.":"تتضمن الخطة رؤية للأغراض والمستلمين وسجلات الوصول وطريقة لسحب الأذونات المستقبلية. يجب شرح الحدود المتعلقة بالتحليلات المكتملة والنتائج المنشورة والاحتفاظ المطلوب عند الموافقة.","The preceding QCF perspective is editorial commentary by Jessica Sage, separate from the research findings.":"منظور QCF السابق هو تعليق تحريري بقلم جيسيكا سيج، منفصل عن نتائج البحث.","The project team intends to explore collaboration with potential partners including Beijing Nuosai Gene. Legal entities, authorisation, protocols and ethics arrangements will be published after due diligence; this does not indicate a signed partnership or a global sampling launch.":"يعتزم فريق المشروع استكشاف التعاون مع الشركاء المحتملين بما في ذلك Beijing Nuosai Gene. سيتم نشر الكيانات القانونية والتراخيص والبروتوكولات والترتيبات الأخلاقية بعد بذل العناية الواجبة؛ وهذا لا يشير إلى وجود شراكة موقعة أو إطلاق عينات عالمية.","The proposed design combines established cryptography, key management, scoped access and audit records. AI may support research and anomaly detection; it does not replace encryption, informed consent or expert review.":"يجمع التصميم المقترح بين التشفير المعمول به وإدارة المفاتيح والوصول المحدد وسجلات التدقيق. قد يدعم الذكاء الاصطناعي البحث والكشف عن الحالات الشاذة؛ ولا يحل محل التشفير أو الموافقة المستنيرة أو مراجعة الخبراء.","The public aggregator labels both US applications Abandoned. This is not a legal opinion. Current status, other national family rights, ownership and any licence to QCF require official-record and written-agreement verification. Naming an inventor does not establish QCF ownership.":"يقوم المجمع العام بتصنيف كلا التطبيقين الأمريكيين على أنه مهجور. وهذا ليس رأيا قانونيا. يتطلب الوضع الحالي وحقوق الأسرة الوطنية الأخرى والملكية وأي ترخيص لـ QCF التحقق من السجل الرسمي والاتفاقية المكتوبة. تسمية المخترع لا تثبت ملكية QCF.","The published work explores mesenchymal stem cells expressing extracellular superoxide dismutase (ECSOD). The listed cell and mouse studies provide a basis for further assessment, without establishing human safety, efficacy or protection against all injuries in a nuclear conflict.":"يستكشف العمل المنشور الخلايا الجذعية الوسيطة التي تعبر عن ديسموتاز فوق الأكسيد خارج الخلية (ECSOD). توفر دراسات الخلايا والفأر المدرجة أساسًا لمزيد من التقييم، دون إثبات سلامة الإنسان أو فعاليته أو حمايته من جميع الإصابات في الصراع النووي.","The radiation-related patent publications concern modified mesenchymal stem cells. Named inventors include Weiwen Deng, Aly S. Abdel-Mageed and Anthony J. Senagore. These are application/publication identifiers, not proof of a granted, enforceable patent.":"منشورات براءات الاختراع المتعلقة بالإشعاع تتعلق بالخلايا الجذعية الوسيطة المعدلة. ومن بين المخترعين المذكورين أسماء ويوين دينج، وعلي س. عبد المجيد، وأنتوني جيه. سيناجور. هذه هي معرفات التطبيق/النشر، وليست دليلاً على براءة اختراع ممنوحة وقابلة للتنفيذ.","The reference sequence combined DNA from multiple donors. Researchers in Buffalo recruited volunteers through public advertisements and collected blood after informed consent. This was not population-wide screening, nor evidence of a global sampling programme run by the UN or all five permanent Security Council members.":"التسلسل المرجعي يجمع الحمض النووي من متبرعين متعددين. قام الباحثون في بوفالو بتجنيد متطوعين من خلال الإعلانات العامة وجمعوا الدم بعد موافقة مستنيرة. لم يكن هذا فحصًا على مستوى السكان، ولا دليلاً على وجود برنامج عالمي لأخذ العينات تديره الأمم المتحدة أو جميع الأعضاء الخمسة الدائمين في مجلس الأمن.","The submission intake channel is being connected. Download the template now to prepare your text and sources. Downloading a template does not submit a contribution or award points.":"جاري ربط قناة قبول التقديم. قم بتنزيل القالب الآن لإعداد النص والمصادر الخاصة بك. لا يؤدي تنزيل القالب إلى إرسال مساهمة أو نقاط جائزة.","The template does not request DNA, identity-document numbers or medical records. A Civilization ID can be added after a formal number is issued.":"القالب لا يطلب الحمض النووي أو أرقام وثائق الهوية أو السجلات الطبية. يمكن إضافة معرف الحضارة بعد إصدار رقم رسمي.","The unique identifier is the independently registered Civilization ID, with a voluntary authorization link. DNA is not a public ID number or a login password. Identity cannot be reduced to genetics; identical twins also show why DNA alone cannot establish a unique identity for every person.":"المعرف الفريد هو معرف الحضارة المسجل بشكل مستقل، مع رابط التفويض الطوعي. الحمض النووي ليس رقم معرف عام أو كلمة مرور لتسجيل الدخول. لا يمكن اختزال الهوية في علم الوراثة؛ تظهر التوائم المتطابقة أيضًا لماذا لا يستطيع الحمض النووي وحده تحديد هوية فريدة لكل شخص.","These are design and governance goals. The current Civilization ID is a front-end demonstration, with no complete health-data system deployed; this website does not collect personal genomic data.":"هذه هي أهداف التصميم والحوكمة. إن معرف الحضارة الحالي عبارة عن عرض توضيحي أمامي، مع عدم وجود نظام كامل للبيانات الصحية؛ هذا الموقع لا يجمع البيانات الجينومية الشخصية.","These records are not summed: war-wide totals overlap national and city subsets; cumulative, annual and excess mortality measure different things, and war and disease deaths can overlap. Approximate values, ranges and “more than” qualifiers are retained.":"لم يتم تلخيص هذه السجلات: تتداخل المجاميع على مستوى الحرب مع المجموعات الفرعية الوطنية ومجموعات المدن؛ تقيس الوفيات التراكمية والسنوية والمفرطة أشياء مختلفة، ويمكن أن تتداخل وفيات الحرب والمرض. يتم الاحتفاظ بالقيم التقريبية والنطاقات ومؤهلات \"أكثر من\".","This design preview sends no data to any server. Email, envoy name and contribution history stay in your browser’s localStorage and can be cleared at any time. No cookies, analytics or third-party resources.":"لا ترسل معاينة التصميم هذه أي بيانات إلى أي خادم. يظل البريد الإلكتروني واسم المبعوث وسجل المساهمة في وحدة التخزين المحلية بمتصفحك ويمكن محوها في أي وقت. لا توجد ملفات تعريف الارتباط أو التحليلات أو موارد الطرف الثالث.","This first edition includes nine war, national and event records. The rounded figure combines over 9 million military deaths in WWI and approximately 60 million global deaths in WWII. National and city subsets are not added again. It is not an all-war or all-history total.":"تتضمن هذه الطبعة الأولى تسعة سجلات حربية ووطنية وحدثية. يجمع الرقم التقريبي أكثر من 9 ملايين حالة وفاة عسكرية في الحرب العالمية الأولى وحوالي 60 مليون حالة وفاة عالمية في الحرب العالمية الثانية. لا تتم إضافة المجموعات الفرعية الوطنية والمدنية مرة أخرى. إنها ليست مجموع الحرب أو التاريخ كله.","This first edition includes ten WHO-sourced records. The figure sums the lower historical estimates for the Black Death in Europe and the 1918, 1957 and 1968 influenza pandemics. It is not an all-time total for epidemics and disease.":"تتضمن هذه الطبعة الأولى عشرة سجلات من مصادر منظمة الصحة العالمية. ويلخص هذا الرقم التقديرات التاريخية المنخفضة للموت الأسود في أوروبا وأوبئة الأنفلونزا في الأعوام 1918 و1957 و1968. إنه ليس إجماليًا للأوبئة والأمراض على الإطلاق.","This history does not imply UN authorisation or support for QCF, or an official succession to the Human Genome Project.":"هذا التاريخ لا يعني موافقة الأمم المتحدة أو دعمها لـ QCF، أو خلافة رسمية لمشروع الجينوم البشري.","This is a preparatory-stage website. The foundation is not yet registered; all available website features are free to test. Subscriptions and donations open after formal registration and bank account opening. A subscription requires the user to choose and confirm the price and terms; testing never automatically becomes a paid plan.":"هذا موقع للمرحلة الإعدادية. لم يتم تسجيل المؤسسة بعد؛ جميع ميزات الموقع المتاحة مجانية للاختبار. يتم فتح الاشتراكات والتبرعات بعد التسجيل الرسمي وفتح الحساب المصرفي. يتطلب الاشتراك من المستخدم اختيار وتأكيد السعر والشروط؛ لا يصبح الاختبار تلقائيًا خطة مدفوعة الأجر.","This is the principle we aim to put into practice through validated technology, responsible operations and continuing oversight.":"هذا هو المبدأ الذي نهدف إلى تطبيقه من خلال التكنولوجيا المعتمدة والعمليات المسؤولة والرقابة المستمرة.","This page describes a candidate medical countermeasure for radiation injury. The published approach is not equivalent to a vaccine. If the proposed “radiation vaccine” is a different candidate, its technical definition and evidence dossier need separate documentation.":"تصف هذه الصفحة الإجراء الطبي المضاد للإصابة الإشعاعية. النهج المنشور لا يعادل اللقاح. إذا كان \"اللقاح الإشعاعي\" المقترح مرشحًا مختلفًا، فإن تعريفه الفني وملف الأدلة يحتاج إلى وثائق منفصلة.","This preview":"هذه المعاينة","Three-user passive-fibre QKD explored simpler multi-node architectures.":"اكتشف QKD للألياف السلبية لثلاثة مستخدمين بنيات أبسط متعددة العقد.","To be established in Zug, Switzerland; currently preparatory and not yet registered. Founder: Jessica Sage (Civilization ID 2026000001).":"سيتم تأسيسها في مدينة زوغ بسويسرا؛ الإعدادية حاليا ولم يتم التسجيل بعد. المؤسس: جيسيكا سيج (معرف الحضارة 2026000001).","Topics include civilization and the humanities, life sciences, quantum and energy research, AI and technology, public-benefit action and international cooperation.":"تشمل المواضيع الحضارة والعلوم الإنسانية، وعلوم الحياة، وأبحاث الكم والطاقة، والذكاء الاصطناعي والتكنولوجيا، وعمل المنفعة العامة والتعاون الدولي.","Trust through evidence.<br>Stewardship through transparency.":"الثقة من خلال الأدلة.<br>الإدارة من خلال الشفافية.","Try creating a Civilization ID":"حاول إنشاء معرف الحضارة","Try the Civilization ID flow":"جرب تدفق معرف الحضارة","Tuberculosis · global annual":"مرض السل · السنوي العالمي","UNESCO adopted the Universal Declaration on the Human Genome and Human Rights on 11 November 1997; the UN General Assembly endorsed it through resolution 53/152 on 9 December 1998. This history offers an ethical reference: science should serve human well-being, and people must not be reduced to their genetic characteristics.":"اعتمدت اليونسكو الإعلان العالمي بشأن الجينوم البشري وحقوق الإنسان في 11 نوفمبر 1997؛ وقد أقرته الجمعية العامة للأمم المتحدة من خلال القرار 53/152 في 9 ديسمبر/كانون الأول 1998. ويقدم هذا التاريخ مرجعًا أخلاقيًا: فالعلم يجب أن يخدم رفاهية الإنسان، ويجب ألا يقتصر الناس على خصائصهم الجينية.","US Department of Energy historical account, covering 1931–1945; an estimate, not a unified register. Other institutions differ. WWII country/event entries below must not be added again.":"الحساب التاريخي لوزارة الطاقة الأمريكية، يغطي الفترة من 1931 إلى 1945؛ تقدير وليس سجل موحد. وتختلف المؤسسات الأخرى. لا يجب إضافة إدخالات الدولة/الحدث الخاصة بالحرب العالمية الثانية أدناه مرة أخرى.","USDC":"USDC","USDT":"USDT","Verified IDs":"الهويات المؤكدة","Verify partner entities, mandates, intellectual property and research evidence.":"التحقق من الكيانات الشريكة والولايات والملكية الفكرية والأدلة البحثية.","Veterans Affairs Canada figure for service personnel; excludes other countries.":"رقم شؤون المحاربين القدامى بكندا لموظفي الخدمة؛ يستثني الدول الأخرى.","Vietnam War-related · US military records":"متعلقة بحرب فيتنام · السجلات العسكرية الأمريكية","View all civilization briefs →":"عرض جميع ملخصات الحضارة →","View all publications →":"عرض جميع المنشورات →","Visa":"تأشيرة","Vote":"تصويت","WHO 2024 annual estimate, including 150,000 people with HIV; not cumulative and overlaps the HIV entry.":"التقدير السنوي لمنظمة الصحة العالمية لعام 2024، بما في ذلك 150.000 شخص مصاب بفيروس نقص المناعة البشرية؛ ليست تراكمية وتتداخل مع دخول فيروس نقص المناعة البشرية.","WHO 2024 data: estimate interval 37.6–53.4 million. Long-term cumulative figure; overlaps with conditions such as TB.":"بيانات منظمة الصحة العالمية لعام 2024: الفاصل التقديري 37.6-53.4 مليون. الرقم التراكمي طويل الأجل؛ يتداخل مع حالات مثل السل.","WHO Europe review: first-year estimate; other models/cut-offs differ. Not an all-time total.":"مراجعة منظمة الصحة العالمية في أوروبا: تقدير السنة الأولى؛ تختلف النماذج/القطع الأخرى. ليس المجموع في كل العصور.","WHO estimate interval 13.3–16.6 million; direct and indirect pandemic effects, not confirmed deaths or all pandemic years.":"الفاصل الزمني التقديري لمنظمة الصحة العالمية 13.3-16.6 مليون؛ آثار الجائحة المباشرة وغير المباشرة، وليس الوفيات المؤكدة أو جميع سنوات الجائحة.","WHO historical estimate, not individual reported deaths.":"التقدير التاريخي لمنظمة الصحة العالمية، وليس الوفيات المبلغ عنها بشكل فردي.","WHO outbreak-page reported total including affected countries outside West Africa; outbreak ended June 2016.":"تم الإبلاغ عن إجمالي صفحة تفشي المرض في منظمة الصحة العالمية بما في ذلك البلدان المتضررة خارج غرب أفريقيا؛ انتهى تفشي المرض في يونيو 2016.","War casualties are not automatically deaths; disease cases and case-fatality rates are not death counts. The value of a life is not determined by nationality, ethnicity or identity.":"ضحايا الحرب لا يعتبرون وفيات تلقائياً؛ حالات المرض ومعدلات الوفيات ليست أعداد الوفيات. إن قيمة الحياة لا تحددها الجنسية أو العرق أو الهوية.","War remembrance":"أذكار الحرب","We advocate research that prevents a repetition of use without adequate informed consent, respects individual choice and recognizes contributions to science. Let us safeguard human well-being together.":"نحن نؤيد البحث الذي يمنع تكرار الاستخدام دون موافقة مستنيرة كافية، ويحترم الاختيار الفردي ويعترف بالمساهمات في العلوم. فلنحافظ على رفاهية الإنسان معًا.","We aim to turn scientific understanding into health opportunities people can understand, choose and benefit from. Our long-term vision is equitable access to genomic health; the first step is focused public-benefit research and voluntary screening pilots with interpretable results and follow-up care.":"نهدف إلى تحويل الفهم العلمي إلى فرص صحية يمكن للناس فهمها واختيارها والاستفادة منها. رؤيتنا طويلة المدى هي الوصول العادل إلى الصحة الجينومية؛ تتمثل الخطوة الأولى في إجراء أبحاث مركزة على المنفعة العامة والفحص الطوعي للطيارين مع نتائج قابلة للتفسير ورعاية المتابعة.","We are not spectators. We are co-builders. Co-building and co-creating civilization — to hand a better world to the next generation.":"نحن لسنا متفرجين. نحن بناة مشاركين. المشاركة في بناء الحضارة وخلقها - لتسليم عالم أفضل للجيل القادم.","We invite citizens, cryptographers, identity engineers, legal experts, developers and philanthropic families to co-create a future in which people control their digital identity and choose what they leave behind.":"ندعو المواطنين ومتخصصي التشفير ومهندسي الهوية والخبراء القانونيين والمطورين والعائلات الخيرية للمشاركة في خلق مستقبل يتحكم فيه الأشخاص في هويتهم الرقمية ويختارون ما يتركونه وراءهم.","We preserve the history of science and take responsibility for the future of life. We seek research across borders that serves people, data use that respects individual choice, and a civilisation sustained through cooperation and care.":"نحافظ على تاريخ العلم ونتحمل مسؤولية مستقبل الحياة. نحن نسعى إلى إجراء أبحاث عبر الحدود تخدم الناس، واستخدام البيانات الذي يحترم الاختيار الفردي، وحضارة مستدامة من خلال التعاون والرعاية.","We remember so that more lives may have a future.":"نتذكر حتى يكون هناك مستقبل لمزيد من الأرواح.","We share one Earth and responsibility for civilization’s future. Let technology serve life, knowledge pass between generations, and every act of kindness help build our shared civilization.":"نحن نتقاسم الأرض الواحدة والمسؤولية عن مستقبل الحضارة. دع التكنولوجيا تخدم الحياة، والمعرفة تنتقل بين الأجيال، وكل عمل طيب يساعد في بناء حضارتنا المشتركة.","We spend a lifetime creating digital assets, footprints, knowledge, memories and businesses. If we grow old, lose capacity, or pass away, will our loved ones even know what exists? Should all that we built simply vanish?":"نقضي العمر في إنشاء الأصول الرقمية وآثار الأقدام والمعرفة والذكريات والأعمال التجارية. إذا كبرنا، أو فقدنا القدرة، أو توفينا، فهل سيعرف أحباؤنا ما هو موجود؟ هل يجب أن يختفي كل ما بنيناه ببساطة؟","WeChat Pay":"WeChat Pay","Website features are free to test before the foundation is formally registered. Subscription services will begin after registration, with special benefits planned for early Civilization Envoys; eligibility and details will be announced.":"ميزات الموقع قابلة للاختبار مجانًا قبل تسجيل المؤسسة رسميًا. ستبدأ خدمات الاشتراك بعد التسجيل، مع مزايا خاصة مخطط لها لمبعوثي الحضارة الأوائل؛ سيتم الإعلان عن الأهلية والتفاصيل.","Weiwen Deng and radiation-injury research":"ويوين دينغ وأبحاث الإصابة الإشعاعية","Weiwen Deng, MD, PhD, has worked in cytogenetics, stem cells and gene therapy. The 2023 CV supplied to QCF records a medical degree in 1990, a master’s degree in microbiology and immunology in 1993, and a Tulane PhD in molecular and cellular biology in 2004, together with previous research and mesenchymal-stem-cell laboratory leadership at Helen DeVos Children’s Hospital.":"الدكتور ويوين دينغ، حاصل على دكتوراه في الطب، عمل في علم الوراثة الخلوية والخلايا الجذعية والعلاج الجيني. تسجل السيرة الذاتية لعام 2023 المقدمة إلى مؤسسة قطر الخيرية شهادة الطب في عام 1990، ودرجة الماجستير في علم الأحياء الدقيقة والمناعة في عام 1993، ودكتوراه تولين في البيولوجيا الجزيئية والخلوية في عام 2004، إلى جانب الأبحاث السابقة وقيادة مختبر الخلايا الجذعية الوسيطة في مستشفى هيلين ديفوس للأطفال.","Weiwen Deng: publications, patents and status":"Weiwen Deng: المنشورات وبراءات الاختراع والحالة","Welcome, Civilization Co-builder":"أهلا بك يا بناة الحضارة","West African Ebola outbreak and affected countries":"تفشي فيروس إيبولا في غرب أفريقيا والدول المتضررة","What did the studies find?":"ماذا وجدت الدراسات؟","What do the two papers establish?":"ماذا تثبت الورقتان؟","When life ends, does our digital world disappear — or live on?":"عندما تنتهي الحياة، هل يختفي عالمنا الرقمي أم يستمر؟","Why Civilization ID and health-data protection matter":"ما أهمية معرف الحضارة وحماية البيانات الصحية","World population · mid-2026 estimate":"عدد سكان العالم · تقديرات منتصف عام 2026","You don’t have a Civilization ID yet":"ليس لديك هوية حضارة بعد","Your identity. Your sovereignty. Your legacy.":"هويتك. سيادتك. تراثك.","Your informed choice":"اختيارك المستنير","next":"التالي","opens after registration":"يفتح بعد التسجيل","spent by co-builder vote":"صرفها تصويت البناء المشترك","← Life sciences":"← علوم الحياة","≈ 69,000,000":"≈ 69,000,000"}};
